window.CT_LIB={"dust-motes":{"t":"Dust Motes","c":"atmosphere","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/dust-motes","d":["Dust motes are discrete particles hanging in a shaft of light, slow enough to read as time in still air. They are matter you can almost count; they live in the beam, not as a veil across the whole room.","尘粒是悬在光束中的离散微粒，慢得在静止空气中读作时间。它们是你几乎可以数清的实体；它们存在于光束中，而不是横贯整个房间的一层薄纱。"],"pi":["Dust motes hanging in a shaft of light around [Subject], slow particles, a room that has been closed, time made visible. Name the window or slat, the dark surround, and that particles are discrete, not a fog fill. For video, slow drift inside the beam only.","[主体] 周围的光柱里悬浮着尘埃，缓慢的微粒，一间久闭的房间，时间变得可见。写明是窗户还是百叶缝、四周要暗，以及微粒是一颗颗分明的，而不是用雾填满。用于动态时，只在光柱内部缓慢飘移。"],"cp":["Dust motes hanging in a shaft of light around [Subject], slow particles, a room that has been closed, time made visible.","[主体] 周围的光柱里悬浮着尘埃，缓慢的微粒，一间久闭的房间，时间变得可见。"],"hp":["dust motes hanging in a shaft of light around [Subject], slow particles, a room that has been closed, time made visible.","尘粒悬在[主体]周围的一束光中，缓慢的微粒，一间久闭的房间，时间变得可见。"],"fq":["Put specks in a shaft, not soup in a room. Example: dust motes hanging in a shaft of light around [Subject], slow particles, a room that has been closed. Dark surround, backlight, no fog fill.","把微粒放进光束里，不要满屋浓汤。示例：尘粒悬在[主体]周围的一束光中，缓慢的微粒，一间久闭的房间。暗环境，逆光，不要雾状填充。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/dust-motes/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Volumetric Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/volumetric-light.webp","Air has to be photographed, not just the subject."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"浮尘"},"dust-storm":{"t":"Dust and Sand","c":"atmosphere","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/dust-storm","d":["Dust and sand as weather is mineral grit driven by wind until the sun is a dull coin and figures become silhouettes. The land attacks: particles occupy near air, sting highlights, and erase the horizon that Atmospheric Haze would only pale.","作为天气的沙尘是风驱动的矿物砂砾，直到太阳变成一枚暗淡的硬币，人物变成剪影。土地在进攻：颗粒占据近处空气，刺入高光，并抹去地平线——而大气霾只会让地平线变淡。"],"pi":["Dust or sandstorm wrapping [Subject], sun as a dull coin, silhouettes, grit in the highlights. Name wind direction, reduced visibility, and dirty speculars on skin and metal. For video, horizontal grit, flapping cloth, no calm air, no sharp far town unless it is a brief hole in the storm.","风沙或沙尘暴包裹 [主体]，太阳像一枚暗淡的硬币，剪影化，高光里带着颗粒。写明风向、能见度下降，以及皮肤和金属上脏污的镜面反光。用于动态时，横向的沙粒、翻飞的布料，空气不能平静；除非是风暴中短暂的空隙，否则远处的城镇不要拍得清晰。"],"cp":["Dust or sandstorm wrapping [Subject], sun as a dull coin, silhouettes, grit in the highlights, Sicario weather.","[主体] 被风沙或沙尘暴包裹，太阳像一枚暗淡的硬币，剪影化，高光里带着颗粒，《边境杀手》式的天气。"],"hp":["dust or sandstorm wrapping [Subject], sun as a dull coin, silhouettes, grit in the highlights.","沙尘或沙暴裹住[主体]，太阳像一枚暗淡的硬币，剪影，高光中有砂砾。"],"fq":["Ask for wind-driven grit and a dull sun. Example: dust or sandstorm wrapping [Subject], sun as a dull coin, silhouettes, grit in the highlights. Demand dirty air at working distance.","要求风驱动的砂砾和暗淡的太阳。示例：沙尘或沙暴裹住[主体]，太阳像一枚暗淡的硬币，剪影，高光中有砂砾。要求在拍摄距离内有脏空气。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/dust-storm/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"风沙"},"fog":{"t":"Fog","c":"atmosphere","g":"haze","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/fog","d":["Fog is a dense local suspension of water droplets that collapses depth, turns lamps into globes, and delays the reveal of figures. The air is matter close to camera; geography hides until someone walks into the last few meters.","雾是局部密集悬浮的水滴，它压塌景深，把灯变成光球，并延迟人物显现。空气是靠近摄影机的物质；地理环境一直隐藏，直到有人走进最后几米。"],"pi":["Dense fog around [Subject], depth collapsing, lamps becoming globes, figures appearing late. Name density (visibility in meters), the practicals blooming, and what is hidden. For video, figures emerging from soup, no crisp far architecture. Do not describe a grey grade on a clear street.","浓雾围绕[主体]，景深塌缩，灯光变成光球，人物迟迟才出现。说明浓度（以米计的能见度）、实景光源泛光，以及被遮住的东西。视频中，人物从浓雾中浮现，远处建筑不清晰。不要描述一条清晰街道上的灰色调色。"],"cp":["Dense fog around [Subject], depth collapsing, lamps becoming globes, figures appearing late, horror or London grammar.","浓雾围绕[主体]，景深塌缩，灯光变成光球，人物迟迟才出现，恐怖片或伦敦语法。"],"hp":["dense fog around [Subject], depth collapsing, lamps becoming globes, figures appearing late, horror or London grammar.","浓雾围绕[主体]，景深塌缩，灯光变成光球，人物迟迟才出现，恐怖片或伦敦语法。"],"fq":["Name the soup and the bloom. Example: dense fog around [Subject], lamps becoming globes, figures appearing late. Give a short visibility distance and forbid crisp far detail.","说明浓雾和光晕。示例：浓雾围绕[主体]，灯光变成光球，人物迟迟才出现。给出很短的能见距离，禁止清晰的远处细节。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/fog/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Mist","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/mist","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mist.webp","Softer mystery than fog. Lyric, not monster."],["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"雾"},"haze":{"t":"Atmospheric Haze","c":"atmosphere","g":"haze","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","d":["Atmospheric haze is scattering over distance: far planes go paler and often cooler, so kilometers of air become the depth cue. The particles are too small to read as drops; the air is matter you measure in ridges, not in globes around a near lamp.","大气霾是随距离发生的散射：远处层面变得更淡、通常更冷，因此数公里的空气成为深度线索。颗粒小到读不出水滴感；空气是你用山脊来衡量的物质，而不是近处灯周围的光球。"],"pi":["Atmospheric haze stacking distance around [Subject], aerial perspective, far planes paler, depth as weather. Keep the near subject contrasty; name two or three receding planes. For video, stable long-distance paleness, not swirling soup around the lens. No globes on a foreground practical unless you also have local fog.","[主体] 周围由大气薄雾堆叠出距离感，空气透视，越远越淡，把天气当作纵深的度量。让近处的主体保持对比；写明两到三个逐层退远的层面。用于动态时，是稳定的远距离发白，而不是在镜头前翻滚的浓汤。除非同时有局部雾，否则不要在前景实景灯上套光晕球。"],"cp":["Atmospheric haze stacking distance around [Subject], aerial perspective, far planes paler, depth as weather.","[主体] 周围由大气薄雾堆叠出距离感，空气透视，越远越淡，把天气当作纵深的度量。"],"hp":["atmospheric haze stacking distance around [Subject], aerial perspective, far planes paler, depth as weather.","大气霾在[主体]周围堆叠出距离，空气透视，远处层面更淡，景深即天气。"],"fq":["Keep the subject sharp and pale the distance. Example: atmospheric haze stacking distance around [Subject], far planes paler. Name successive ridges or blocks of city, not a fog bank at the lens.","保持主体清晰，让远处变淡。示例：大气霾在[主体]周围堆叠出距离，远处层面更淡。说明连续的山脊或城市街区，而不是镜头前的雾墙。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/haze/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Volumetric Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/volumetric-light.webp","Air has to be photographed, not just the subject."],["Mist","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/mist","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mist.webp","Softer mystery than fog. Lyric, not monster."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"空气感薄雾"},"mist":{"t":"Mist","c":"atmosphere","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/mist","d":["Mist is a thinner water suspension than fog: pale layered air that still lets you read the next plane. Droplets are matter, but the veil is lyric, a morning or mountain breath rather than a wall.","薄雾是比雾更稀薄的水悬浮物：淡色层叠的空气，仍让你看清下一个层面。水滴是物质，但这层薄纱是抒情的，是清晨或山间的呼吸，而不是一堵墙。"],"pi":["Light mist around [Subject], softer than fog, morning or mountain breath, layers of pale air. Name near-subject readability, paler far planes, and a backlight or low sun. For video, slow drift of layers, no wall of white, no falling rain unless you add it.","薄雾围绕[主体]，比雾更柔和，清晨或山间的呼吸，层层淡色空气。说明主体近处仍可辨读、远处层面更淡，以及逆光或低角度太阳。视频中，层雾缓慢漂移，没有白色高墙，没有落雨，除非你加上它。"],"cp":["Light mist around [Subject], softer than fog, morning or mountain breath, layers of pale air.","薄雾围绕[主体]，比雾更柔和，清晨或山间的呼吸，层层淡色空气。"],"hp":["light mist around [Subject], softer than fog, morning or mountain breath, layers of pale air.","薄雾围绕[主体]，比雾更柔和，清晨或山间的呼吸，层层淡色空气。"],"fq":["Ask for layered pale air and a readable subject. Example: light mist around [Subject], softer than fog, morning or mountain breath. Specify backlight and forbid a white-out.","要求层叠的淡色空气和可辨读的主体。示例：薄雾围绕[主体]，比雾更柔和，清晨或山间的呼吸。指定逆光，禁止白茫茫一片。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/mist/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Fog","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/fog","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fog.webp","Hide geography. Delay the reveal."],["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"薄雾"},"ocean":{"t":"Ocean","c":"atmosphere","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/ocean","d":["Ocean cinematography treats the sea as the other actor: swell, a horizon, salt light, a person against water that does not care. The atmosphere is spray, haze over distance, and a moving floor; the camera is in air, on a hull, or on rocks, not yet in the lung of the sea.","海洋摄影把海当作另一个演员：涌浪、地平线、盐光、一个人面对不在乎的水。氛围是浪花、远处的霾，以及移动的地面；摄影机在空中、船壳上或岩石上，尚未进入海的肺腑。"],"pi":["Ocean world of [Subject], swell, horizon, salt light, a person against water that does not care. Name sea state, scale (small figure or small boat), backlight on spray, and a hard horizon. For video, real period in the swell, not a looping texture. Do not make the water a silk backdrop.","海洋世界中的[主体]，涌浪，地平线，盐光，一个人面对不在乎的水。说明海况、尺度（小小的人或小船）、浪花上的逆光，以及坚硬的地平线。视频中，涌浪要有真实周期，不要循环纹理。不要把水做成丝绸背景。"],"cp":["Ocean world of [Subject], swell, horizon, salt light, a person against water that does not care.","海洋世界中的[主体]，涌浪，地平线，盐光，一个人面对不在乎的水。"],"hp":["ocean world of [Subject], swell, horizon, salt light, a person against water that does not care.","海洋世界中的[主体]，涌浪，地平线，盐光，一个人面对不在乎的水。"],"fq":["Name swell, horizon, and scale. Example: ocean world of [Subject], swell, horizon, salt light, a person against water that does not care. Demand period in the waves and backlight on spray.","说明涌浪、地平线和尺度。示例：海洋世界中的[主体]，涌浪，地平线，盐光，一个人面对不在乎的水。要求海浪有周期，浪花有逆光。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/ocean-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ocean-ocean-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/ocean.jpg","r":[["Underwater","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/underwater","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/underwater-underwater-mini.webp","Leave air."],["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"海洋"},"rain":{"t":"Rain","c":"atmosphere","g":"haze","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","d":["Rain in film is falling water that makes air visible as streaks and turns the ground into a mirror. Drops are matter in the optical path; without backlight they vanish, and without a wet-down the street stays dry under a fake storm.","电影中的雨是落下的水，它让空气以雨丝变得可见，并把地面变成镜子。水滴是光路中的物质；没有逆光它们就会消失，没有湿化地面，街道在假风暴下仍是干的。"],"pi":["Heavy rain around [Subject], backlit drops, wet-down pavement, umbrellas, silver streaks, weather as percussion. Name the backlight (a streetlamp, a sign, a HMI behind the rain), the wet ground, and drop size. For video, falling streaks in depth, splashes, no dry asphalt. Do not write a mood word in place of the water.","[主体] 周围的大雨：逆光下的雨滴、打湿的路面、雨伞、银色雨丝，把天气当打击乐。写明逆光源（路灯、招牌、雨后的 HMI 灯）、湿地面和雨滴大小。用于动态时，要有纵深里下落的雨丝和水花，不能出现干燥的柏油路。不要用情绪词代替「水」。"],"cp":["Heavy cinematic rain around [Subject], backlit drops, wet-down pavement, umbrellas, silver streaks, weather as percussion.","[主体] 周围电影感的大雨，逆光雨滴，打湿的路面，雨伞，银色雨丝，天气如打击乐。"],"hp":["heavy rain around [Subject], backlit drops, wet-down pavement, umbrellas, silver streaks, weather as percussion.","大雨围绕[主体]，逆光水滴，湿透的路面，雨伞，银色雨丝，天气如打击乐。"],"fq":["Name backlit drops and wet ground. Example: heavy rain around [Subject], backlit drops, wet-down pavement, silver streaks. Specify the lamp behind the rain and forbid dry asphalt.","说明逆光水滴和湿地面。示例：大雨围绕[主体]，逆光水滴，湿透的路面，银色雨丝。指定雨幕背后的灯，禁止干燥沥青。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/rain/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Wet-Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/wet-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wet-down.webp","Night exteriors that must sparkle."],["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Fog","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/fog","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fog.webp","Hide geography. Delay the reveal."]],"z":"雨"},"smoke":{"t":"Smoke","c":"atmosphere","g":"haze","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/smoke","d":["Smoke is combustion particles with a source, a direction, and enough density to turn a room's air into a volume the light can strike. Unlike weather fog, it has a chimney, a cigarette, a tire, or a battlefield; backlight carves it into shafts and swirls.","烟是有来源、有方向、密度足以把室内空气变成光可击中的体积的燃烧颗粒。与天气雾不同，它来自烟囱、香烟、轮胎或战场；逆光把它雕成光束和旋涡。"],"pi":["Smoke around [Subject], cigarette, chimney, or battle, shafts of light catching it, volume in the room. Name the source, the backlight or side key, and the direction of the ribbon. For video, swirling volume, not a static fog plate, and a still-readable face.","[主体] 周围的烟雾：香烟、烟囱或战场，光柱照亮它，房间里有了体积。写明烟源、逆光还是侧主光，以及烟带的走向。用于动态时，要翻滚的体积感，而不是一张静止的雾片，同时脸依然可读。"],"cp":["Smoke around [Subject], cigarette, chimney, or battle, shafts of light catching it, volume in the room.","[主体] 周围的烟雾，香烟、烟囱或战场，光柱照亮它，房间里有了体积。"],"hp":["smoke around [Subject], cigarette, chimney, or battle, shafts of light catching it, volume in the room.","烟围绕[主体]，香烟、烟囱或战场，光束捕捉到它，房间里有体积感。"],"fq":["Name source and lighting. Example: smoke around [Subject], cigarette, chimney, or battle, shafts of light catching it. Demand a readable face and visible volume, not a grey grade.","说明来源和灯光。示例：烟围绕[主体]，香烟、烟囱或战场，光束捕捉到它。要求可辨读的脸和可见体积，不要灰色调色。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/smoke/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Volumetric Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/volumetric-light.webp","Air has to be photographed, not just the subject."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"烟"},"snow":{"t":"Snow","c":"atmosphere","g":"haze","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/snow","d":["Snow is ice falling and settling: large flakes in backlight, a muffled world, tracks that record who passed. The air holds crystals you can size; the ground accumulates; contrast goes soft because the world has been covered.","雪是落下并积起的冰：逆光中的大雪花，被闷住的世界，记录谁经过的足迹。空气里有大小可辨的晶体；地面在积累；因为世界被覆盖，反差变柔。"],"pi":["Falling snow around [Subject], large flakes in backlight, muffled world, tracks, winter silence you can see. Name flake size, a lamp or sun behind them, accumulation on shoulders and ground, and tracks if anyone has walked. For video, fall plus settle; no dry coats, no rain streaks.","落雪围绕[主体]，逆光中的大雪花，被闷住的世界，足迹，看得见的冬日寂静。说明雪花大小、它们背后的灯或太阳、肩膀和地面的积雪，以及是否有人走过留下足迹。视频中，既要飘落也要积落；不要干燥外套，不要雨丝。"],"cp":["Falling snow around [Subject], large flakes in backlight, muffled world, tracks, winter silence you can see.","落雪围绕[主体]，逆光中的大雪花，被闷住的世界，足迹，看得见的冬日寂静。"],"hp":["falling snow around [Subject], large flakes in backlight, muffled world, tracks, winter silence you can see.","落雪围绕[主体]，逆光中的大雪花，被闷住的世界，足迹，看得见的冬日寂静。"],"fq":["Specify large backlit flakes and settled white. Example: falling snow around [Subject], large flakes in backlight, muffled world, tracks. Demand accumulation on wool and ground.","指定逆光中的大雪花和积起的白色。示例：落雪围绕[主体]，逆光中的大雪花，被闷住的世界，足迹。要求毛料衣物和地面有积雪。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/snow/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Mist","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/mist","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mist.webp","Softer mystery than fog. Lyric, not monster."],["Blue Hour","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/blue-hour","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/blue-hour.webp","Day is gone but the sky still works."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"雪"},"sparks":{"t":"Sparks and Embers","c":"atmosphere","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/sparks","d":["Sparks and embers are incandescent particles thrown by welding, fire, grinding, or a cigarette: orange weather with short trajectories. They are burning matter; backlight is optional because they are their own small keys.","火花和余烬是焊接、火焰、打磨或香烟抛出的白热颗粒：带有短轨迹的橙色天气。它们是燃烧的物质；逆光可选，因为它们本身就是小主光。"],"pi":["Sparks or embers around [Subject], welding, fire, cigarettes, orange particles as weather. Name the source, color (white-orange to dull red), trajectory (fountain versus lofted drift), and a dark surround. For video, short-lived particles with gravity; no snow, no cigarette smoke unless you also want smoke.","火花或余烬围绕[主体]，焊接、火、香烟，橙色颗粒如天气。说明来源、颜色（白橙到暗红）、轨迹（喷泉式还是上扬漂移），以及暗环境。视频中，短寿命颗粒受重力影响；不要雪，不要香烟烟雾，除非你也想要烟。"],"cp":["Sparks or embers around [Subject], welding, fire, cigarettes, orange particles as weather.","火花或余烬围绕[主体]，焊接、火、香烟，橙色颗粒如天气。"],"hp":["sparks or embers around [Subject], welding, fire, cigarettes, orange particles as weather.","火花或余烬围绕[主体]，焊接、火、香烟，橙色颗粒如天气。"],"fq":["Name the hot source and the trajectories. Example: sparks or embers around [Subject], welding, fire, cigarettes, orange particles as weather. Dark surround, gravity, no snow.","说明灼热来源和轨迹。示例：火花或余烬围绕[主体]，焊接、火、香烟，橙色颗粒如天气。暗环境，重力，无雪。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/sparks/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Candlelight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/candlelight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/candlelight-066-candlelit-naturalism-mini.webp","Period night or ritual."],["Volumetric Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/volumetric-light.webp","Air has to be photographed, not just the subject."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"火花余烬"},"steam":{"t":"Steam","c":"atmosphere","g":"haze","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/steam","d":["Steam is water vapor released where heat meets colder air: trains, manholes, showers, a white veil that rises and thins. It is wet matter, not combustion; it billows, condenses on lens and wool, and has a thermal source.","蒸汽是热遇到较冷空气时释放的水汽：火车、井盖、淋浴，一层升起并变薄的白纱。它是湿润的物质，不是燃烧；它会翻涌，在镜头和羊毛上凝结，并且有热源。"],"pi":["Steam billowing around [Subject], trains, manholes, showers, a white veil, industrial or intimate heat. Name the hot source, the cold air, backlight, and rise. For video, billows that shear and thin, condensation, no grey cigarette ribbons unless you also have smoke.","蒸汽在[主体]周围翻涌，火车、井盖、淋浴，一层白纱，工业或私密的热。点明热源、冷空气、逆光和升腾。视频中，翻涌被拉扯并变薄，有凝结，除非你也有烟，否则不要灰色香烟状条带。"],"cp":["Steam billowing around [Subject], trains, manholes, showers, a white veil, industrial or intimate heat.","蒸汽在[主体]周围翻涌，火车、井盖、淋浴，一层白纱，工业或私密的热。"],"hp":["steam billowing around [Subject], trains, manholes, showers, a white veil, industrial or intimate heat.","蒸汽在[主体]周围翻涌，火车、井盖、淋浴，一层白纱，工业或私密的热。"],"fq":["Name the hot source and the white rise. Example: steam billowing around [Subject], trains, manholes, showers, a white veil. Backlight it and keep it wetter than smoke.","点明热源和白色升腾。示例：蒸汽在[主体]周围翻涌，火车、井盖、淋浴，一层白纱。用逆光打它，并让它比烟更湿。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/steam/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Smoke","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/smoke","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/smoke.webp","Photograph the air of a room."],["Fog","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/fog","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fog.webp","Hide geography. Delay the reveal."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"蒸汽"},"underwater":{"t":"Underwater","c":"atmosphere","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/underwater","d":["Underwater cinematography leaves air: the camera is in water, so caustics, buoyancy, and a missing horizon rewrite every edge. The medium is the matter; particles are silt and bubbles, and bodies move as if the world had gone slow without a slow-motion shutter.","水下摄影离开了空气：摄影机在水中，因此焦散、浮力和消失的地平线会重写每一条边缘。介质即物质；颗粒是泥沙和气泡，身体移动仿佛世界变慢，却没有慢动作快门。"],"pi":["Underwater of [Subject], caustics, muffled space, hair and cloth in slow water, a world without horizon. Name depth, the surface as ceiling or absence, floating wardrobe, silt or bubbles in backlight. For video, buoyancy and drag; no air-speed hair, no standing horizon unless looking up at the underside of the surface.","[主体]的水下，焦散，沉闷空间，头发与衣物在缓慢水流中，一个没有地平线的世界。点明深度、水面作为天花板或不存在，漂浮的服装，逆光中的泥沙或气泡。视频中，浮力与阻力；不要有空气中速度感的头发，不要固定地平线，除非向上看水面的下侧。"],"cp":["Underwater of [Subject], caustics, muffled space, hair and cloth in slow water, a world without horizon.","[主体]的水下，焦散，沉闷空间，头发与衣物在缓慢水流中，一个没有地平线的世界。"],"hp":["underwater of [Subject], caustics, muffled space, hair and cloth in slow water, a world without horizon.","[主体]的水下，焦散，沉闷空间，头发与衣物在缓慢水流中，一个没有地平线的世界。"],"fq":["Demand caustics, floating cloth, and no air horizon. Example: underwater of [Subject], caustics, muffled space, hair and cloth in slow water. Specify silt or bubbles in backlight.","要求焦散、漂浮的衣物，以及没有空气的地平线。示例：[主体]的水下，焦散，沉闷空间，头发与衣物在缓慢水流中。点明逆光中的泥沙或气泡。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/underwater-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/underwater-underwater-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/underwater.jpg","r":[["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."]],"z":"水下拍摄"},"wet-down":{"t":"Wet-Down","c":"atmosphere","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/wet-down","d":["A wet-down sprays pavement, asphalt, and cars so night lights double themselves in reflection, often with no rain in the air. The street is the effect; water is a surface treatment, not weather.","湿化处理会喷湿铺装路面、沥青和汽车，让夜景灯光在反射中加倍，空气中常常没有雨。街道就是效果；水是一种表面处理，不是天气。"],"pi":["Wet-down streets around [Subject], pavement sprayed for night, double the lights by reflection. Name the practicals, the sheeting water on asphalt, and empty air unless rain is also requested. For video, moving reflections, tire tracks in water, no falling streaks if you do not want rain.","[主体] 周围被打湿的街道，夜里为拍摄而喷湿的路面，灯光因反射而加倍。写明有哪些实景灯、柏油路上的水膜，以及如果没有要求下雨，空气要保持干净。用于动态时，要有移动的反光、水里的车辙；如果不想要雨，就不要下落的雨丝。"],"cp":["Wet-down streets around [Subject], pavement sprayed for night, double the lights by reflection, studio-night trick made beautiful.","[主体] 周围被打湿的街道，夜里为拍摄而喷湿的路面，灯光因反射而加倍，把棚拍的夜景技巧拍得漂亮。"],"hp":["wet-down streets around [Subject], pavement sprayed for night, double the lights by reflection.","湿化[主体]周围的街道，为夜景喷湿铺装路面，通过反射让灯光加倍。"],"fq":["Ask for sprayed pavement and reflected practicals. Example: wet-down streets around [Subject], pavement sprayed for night, double the lights by reflection. Specify empty air if you do not want rain.","要求喷湿的铺装路面和反射的实景光源。示例：湿化[主体]周围的街道，为夜景喷湿铺装路面，通过反射让灯光加倍。如果不想要雨，点明空气是空的。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/wet-down/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Rain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/rain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rain.webp","Make the air visible and the ground reflective."],["Neon Practicals","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neon-practical.webp","The city is the lighting department."],["Fog","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/fog","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fog.webp","Hide geography. Delay the reveal."]],"z":"地面打湿"},"birds-eye":{"t":"Bird's-Eye View","c":"camera-angles","g":"top down","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/birds-eye","d":["A bird's-eye view shot looks steeply or directly down from a great height so people and furniture become a map. Height, not just distance, is the point of view: life reads as a board game or a ritual seen from above.","鸟瞰镜头从极高处陡峭或垂直向下看，让人和家具变成一张地图。高度，而不只是距离，才是这个视角的关键：生活看起来像棋盘游戏或从上方看到的仪式。"],"pi":["Lock height and pitch. Quote: Bird's-eye view straight down on [Subject], camera over one seated person and a table, floor as a map, no extra limbs. Add: great height, steeply downward, people as pieces, not an oblique high angle, not a tabletop product flat-lay unless the scale is a room seen from the ceiling.","锁定高度与俯仰角。引用：鸟瞰垂直向下看[主体]，摄影机位于一个坐着的人与一张桌子上方，地板如地图，没有多余的肢体。添加：极高的高度，陡峭向下，人如棋子，不是斜角高机位，不是桌面产品平铺，除非尺度是从天花板看一个房间。"],"cp":["Bird's-eye view straight down on [Subject], camera over one seated person and a table, floor as a map, no extra limbs.","鸟瞰垂直向下看[主体]，摄影机位于一个坐着的人与一张桌子上方，地板如地图，没有多余的肢体。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/birds-eye-045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/birds-eye.jpg","r":[["Overhead Top-Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/overhead","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/overhead-overhead-mini.webp","Table, crime scene, or dance formation."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"鸟瞰"},"dutch-angle":{"t":"Dutch Angle","c":"camera-angles","g":"canted angle","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/dutch-angle","d":["A Dutch angle rolls the camera so verticals and the horizon appear tilted. The cant is usually static: gravity's down is no longer the bottom of the frame, which is why the world reads as off its axis.","荷兰角会滚转摄影机，使垂直线和地平线显得倾斜。这种倾斜通常是静态的：重力的下方不再是画面底部，因此世界看起来偏离了轴心。"],"pi":["Name the roll in degrees and keep the buildings straight. Quote: Dutch angle of [Subject], camera rolled 20 to 30 degrees, diagonal horizon, moral or mental tilt. Add: static cant, walls rigid, not a low angle, not a rolling camera. If the model warps anatomy, say natural body proportions, only the horizon is tilted.","用度数说明倾斜量，并让建筑保持笔直。照抄这句：荷兰角拍 [主体]，摄影机侧倾 20 到 30 度，地平线倾斜，道德或心理上的失衡。再补：静态倾斜，墙体笔直，不是低角度，也不是摄影机在滚动。如果生成模型容易把人拍变形，就写明「自然的人体比例，只有地平线是倾斜的」。"],"cp":["A tenant confronts a landlord in a narrow stairwell. Static camera canted fifteen degrees, strong diagonal banister, rigid walls and natural anatomy. Both actors remain grounded. No rolling camera, fisheye distortion or vibrating image; the tension comes from the tilted composition.","租客在狭窄楼梯间质问房东。摄影机静止并侧倾十五度，扶手形成强烈对角线，墙体笔直，人体比例自然。两人都站在地面上。不要滚动镜头、鱼眼变形或抖动的画面；紧张感来自倾斜的构图。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/161-dutch-angle-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-angle-161-dutch-angle-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dutch-angle.jpg","r":[["Dutch Roll","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dutch-roll","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-roll-dutch-roll-mini.webp","Unease that arrives in time, not as a still cant."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."]],"z":"荷兰角"},"eye-level":{"t":"Eye Level","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","d":["An eye-level shot places the camera at the subject's eye height with a horizontal sightline and a level horizon. It is the default equal relationship: height and tilt assign no rank until you leave this setup.","平视镜头把摄影机放在主体的眼睛高度，视线水平，地平线水平。这是默认的平等关系：在你离开这个设置之前，高度和俯仰不赋予等级。"],"pi":["Lead with height and pitch. Quote: Eye-level shot of [Subject], camera at their eye height, horizontal sightline, equal relationship, no power tilt. Name that the horizon is level. Add a 35mm or 50mm if you want human perspective. Do not write mood words in place of the height.","先说高度与俯仰。照抄这句：平视镜头拍 [主体]，摄影机位于其眼睛高度，视线水平，关系平等，不做权力倾斜。写明地平线是水平的。想要接近人眼视角就补上 35mm 或 50mm。不要用情绪词代替高度。"],"cp":["Eye-level shot of [Subject], camera at their eye height, horizontal sightline, equal relationship, no power tilt.","平视镜头拍 [主体]，摄影机位于其眼睛高度，视线水平，关系平等，不做权力倾斜。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/eye-level/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."],["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."],["Bird's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/birds-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/birds-eye-045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.webp","Turn life into a board game or a ritual."]],"z":"平视"},"first-person":{"t":"First-Person","c":"camera-angles","g":"FPV character","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/first-person","d":["A first-person camera makes the lens function as a character's bodily viewpoint, with a body that owns it: hands entering the frame, breath, tools, locomotion. It is subjective seeing as continuous embodiment, not a single optical insert.","第一人称摄影机让镜头充当角色的身体视角，并有一个拥有它的身体：手进入画面、呼吸、工具、移动。它是作为连续具身化的主观观看，而不是一个单独的光学插入镜头。"],"pi":["Require a body at the edges. Quote: First-person camera as [Subject] would see, hands entering frame, breath, a body that owns the lens. Video: First-person view moving as [Subject] moves, hands or tools entering the edges. Add: no owner's face except a reflection, eye height of that person, not a drone, not an OTS shoulder.","要求画面边缘有身体。照抄这句：第一人称摄影机呈现 [主体] 所见的画面，手从画面入镜，有呼吸，有一具拥有这枚镜头的身体。视频：第一人称视角随 [主体] 的动作移动，手或工具从画面边缘入画。再补：除了倒影不出现本人的脸，处于那个人的眼睛高度，不是无人机，也不是过肩镜头的肩膀。"],"cp":["First-person view moving as [Subject] moves, hands or tools entering the edges.","第一人称视角，随 [主体] 的动作一起移动，手或工具从画面边缘入画。"],"hp":["first-person camera as [Subject] would see, hands entering frame, breath, a body that owns the lens.","第一人称摄影机如[主体]所见，手进入画面，呼吸，一个拥有镜头的身体。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/first-person-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/first-person-first-person-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/first-person.jpg","r":[["Point of View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/pov","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pov-090-subjective-optical-pov-mini.webp","Force identification. The audience is the character."],["SnorriCam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/snorricam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/snorricam-018-body-mounted-face-camera-mini.webp","Trap the audience in a body that cannot get out."],["Object POV","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/object-pov","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/object-pov-object-pov-mini.webp","The prop has eyes."]],"z":"第一人称视角"},"fourth-wall":{"t":"Fourth Wall","c":"camera-angles","g":"Narration","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/fourth-wall","d":["A fourth-wall look aims the subject's eyes into the taking lens, so the scene admits an audience. The camera is no longer an invisible observer; it is a person in the room, or the spectator the character has decided to include.","打破第四面墙的注视让主体的眼睛看向拍摄镜头，于是场景承认有观众。摄影机不再是无形的观察者；它是房间里的一个人，或角色决定纳入的观众。"],"pi":["The eyeline is the law. Quote: Fourth-wall look from [Subject], eyes into the lens, the scene admitting an audience. Add: both eyes to camera, eye-level, not a profile, not looking just off-lens as in an interview. If they were in a scene with others, say the others do not look at camera unless that is the joke.","视线是法则。引用：来自[主体]的打破第四面墙注视，双眼看向镜头，场景承认有观众。添加：双眼看摄影机，平视，不是侧脸，不是像采访那样只看镜头旁。如果他们和其他人在同一场景里，说明其他人不看摄影机，除非那就是笑点。"],"cp":["A meticulous traveler narrates how carefully she plans every journey while the images show her repeatedly improvising: borrowing a map, following a stranger’s gesture and boarding at the last moment. Write restrained original narration that reveals self-image through contradiction rather than explaining visible actions.","一位一丝不苟的旅行者讲述她如何仔细规划每一段旅程，而画面却显示她一再即兴发挥：借一张地图，跟随陌生人的手势，在最后一刻上车。写克制、原创的旁白，通过矛盾揭示自我形象，而不是解释可见的动作。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/135-direct-address-and-fourth-wall-break-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fourth-wall-135-direct-address-and-fourth-wall-break-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/fourth-wall.jpg","r":[["Point of View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/pov","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pov-090-subjective-optical-pov-mini.webp","Force identification. The audience is the character."],["Interview","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/interview","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/interview.webp","Someone is answering a question we did not hear."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"打破第四面墙"},"ground-level":{"t":"Ground Level","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/ground-level","d":["A ground-level shot puts the lens almost on the floor, so boots, hems, wheels, and the dirt become actors. Height is the fact: the camera starts from the ground plane, whether it looks along the street or steeply up.","地面高度镜头把镜头几乎放在地板上，于是靴子、衣摆、轮子和尘土都成为演员。高度才是关键事实：摄影机从地平面开始，无论它是沿街看还是陡峭向上看。"],"pi":["Name the floor as foreground. Quote: Ground-level camera looking steeply up at [Subject], lens nearly on the floor, boots and trailing coat monumental. If you want the along-the-dirt variant, say looking along the ground, boots in the near field, horizon low, not straight up at the sky.","点明地板作为前景。引用：地面高度摄影机陡峭向上看[主体]，镜头几乎贴地，靴子和拖曳的外套显得宏伟。如果你想要沿地面的变体，说沿着地面看，靴子在前景，地平线低，不是直直向上看天空。"],"cp":["Ground-level camera looking steeply up at [Subject], lens nearly on the floor, boots and trailing coat monumental.","地面高度摄影机陡峭向上看[主体]，镜头几乎贴地，靴子和拖曳的外套显得宏伟。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/ground-level/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Worm's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/worms-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/worms-eye.webp","The subject is a tower. You are dust."],["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"贴地机位"},"high-angle":{"t":"High Angle","c":"camera-angles","g":"High angle shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","d":["A high-angle shot looks downward at the subject from above eye level, an oblique pitch rather than a straight drop. More floor enters the frame, the figure occupies less of the rectangle, and the viewpoint reads as observation from above.","高机位镜头从高于眼睛的高度向下看主体，是斜向俯仰，而不是垂直下落。更多地板进入画面，人物占据矩形画面的比例更小，视角读作从上方观察。"],"pi":["Name the look-down, not only camera up high. Quote: High-angle shot looking down on [Subject], the figure diminished, architecture or sky weighing on them. Add: oblique angle, face still readable, more floor than ceiling, horizon not level to the eyes. Forbid 90-degree top-down unless you actually want Overhead Top-Down .","写明「向下看」，而不只是「机位高」。照抄这句：高角度俯拍 [主体]，人物被压小，建筑或天空在压迫他。再补：斜俯视角，脸依然可读，画面里地板多于天花板，地平线不与眼睛齐平。除非你真的要正俯视，否则禁止 90 度垂直向下。"],"cp":["High oblique view of a lone cleaner crossing a vast empty railway hall after midnight. The architecture and floor pattern dominate. The cleaner pauses at a distant sound. Fixed elevated viewpoint, no drone swoop or zoom.","高角度斜俯视：午夜后，一名清洁工独自穿过空旷巨大的火车站大厅。建筑与地面图案占主导。清洁工被远处的声音惊得停下。固定的高机位视点，不要无人机式俯冲，也不要变焦。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/high-angle.jpg","r":[["Bird's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/birds-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/birds-eye-045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.webp","Turn life into a board game or a ritual."],["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"高角度"},"hip-level":{"t":"Hip Level","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/hip-level","d":["A hip-level shot sits the camera around belt or holster height so hands, gait, and weapons share the plane of focus. It is a height choice, usually with a level horizon: the hands will decide.","髋位镜头将摄影机放在腰带或枪套高度附近，使双手、步态和武器共享焦点平面。这是一个高度选择，通常地平线保持水平：双手将决定一切。"],"pi":["Name belt height, not low camera. Quote: Hip-level camera on [Subject], gunbelt height, Western stance, hands and holster in the plane of focus. Add: horizon through the hands, level roll, face still in the upper frame, not a worm's-eye, not mid-thigh crop unless you also want a cowboy size.","点明腰带高度，而非低机位。引用：髋位摄影机对准[主体]，枪带高度，西部持枪站姿，双手与枪套处于焦点平面。补充：地平线穿过双手，横滚水平，脸仍在画面上方，不是虫眼视角，不是大腿中部裁切，除非你也想要牛仔景别。"],"cp":["Hip-level camera on [Subject], gunbelt height, Western stance, hands and holster in the plane of focus.","髋位摄影机对准[主体]，枪带高度，西部持枪站姿，双手与枪套处于焦点平面。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/046-low-seated-viewpoint-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hip-level-046-low-seated-viewpoint-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/hip-level.jpg","r":[["Cowboy Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cowboy-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cowboy-shot.webp","Show hands, weapons, or stance without going full body."],["Ground Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/ground-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ground-level.webp","Start from the dirt."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"腰部机位"},"incline":{"t":"Incline","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/incline","d":["An incline is a slight camera roll, a gentle cant of the floor rather than a full Dutch angle. The horizon is a few degrees off true, enough to suggest slope or unease without declaring that the world has fallen over.","倾斜是轻微的摄影机横滚，是地面的轻微倾侧，而非完整的荷兰角。地平线偏离水平几度，足以暗示坡度或不安，而不至于宣告世界已经倾倒。"],"pi":["Give a small number. Quote: Inclined camera on [Subject], a gentle cant, not a full Dutch, the floor suggesting slope or unease. Add: rolled about 8 degrees, horizon slightly off, walls not warped, static, not 25 degrees. If the model still produces a comic lean, lower the number and say almost level.","给出一个小数字。引用：倾斜摄影机对准[主体]，轻微倾侧，不是完整荷兰角，地面暗示坡度或不安。补充：横滚约8度，地平线略微倾斜，墙面不变形，静止，不是25度。如果模型仍产生漫画式倾斜，降低度数并说几乎水平。"],"cp":["Inclined camera on [Subject], a gentle cant, not a full Dutch, the floor suggesting slope or unease.","倾斜摄影机对准[主体]，轻微倾侧，不是完整荷兰角，地面暗示坡度或不安。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/incline/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dutch Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/dutch-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-angle-161-dutch-angle-mini.webp","The world is off its axis. Do not use as decoration."],["Dutch Roll","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dutch-roll","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-roll-dutch-roll-mini.webp","Unease that arrives in time, not as a still cant."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"轻微倾斜"},"low-angle":{"t":"Low Angle","c":"camera-angles","g":"Low angle shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","d":["A low-angle shot looks upward at the subject from below eye level, so verticals converge and ceilings or sky take weight. The camera is not merely low; it is pitched up, and that pitch is what assigns monument or intimidation.","低角度镜头从低于视平线的位置向上看主体，因此垂直线汇聚，天花板或天空获得分量。摄影机不只是低；它向上仰拍，正是这种仰角赋予其纪念碑感或威吓感。"],"pi":["Name the look-up and the ceiling. Quote: Low-angle shot looking up at [Subject], converging verticals, heroic or oppressive height, Citizen Kane floor. Add: camera below their eyes, horizon low, ceiling or sky in frame, face still a portrait. Ban from the ground looking straight up unless you want Worm's-Eye View .","写明「仰视」和天花板。照抄这句：低角度仰拍 [主体]，垂直线向上收敛，崇高或压迫的高度感，《公民凯恩》式的低机位。再补：摄影机在眼睛以下，地平线偏低，天花板或天空入画，脸依然是一张肖像。除非你要的正是虫视角，否则禁止从地面笔直向上拍。"],"cp":["A quiet family conversation in a modest room, filmed from a low seated height with the camera level. Two adults sit beside a low table, doorways carefully balanced, no dramatic upward angle. Locked shot, small natural gestures, patient pauses.","在简朴房间里的一场安静家庭对话，从坐着时的低位高度、以水平视角拍摄。两名成年人坐在矮桌旁，门框在画面中平衡得当，不要夸张的上仰角度。固定镜头，细小的自然动作，耐心的停顿。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/low-angle.jpg","r":[["Worm's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/worms-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/worms-eye.webp","The subject is a tower. You are dust."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"低角度"},"object-pov":{"t":"Object POV","c":"camera-angles","g":"Vehicle-mounted perspective","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/object-pov","d":["An object-POV shot is the viewpoint of a tool, a ball, a bullet, a phone, or a vehicle: the prop has eyes. The camera is parented to that object, so the object stays stable in the frame while the world moves relative to it.","物体主观视角镜头是工具、球、子弹、手机或载具的视点：道具有了眼睛。摄影机被父级绑定到该物体，因此物体在画面中保持稳定，而世界相对它移动。"],"pi":["Name the object and keep it fixed in frame. Quote: Object POV as if [Subject] were seen from a tool, a ball, a bullet, a phone: the thing looking. Video: Viewpoint of an object moving toward or around [Subject]. Add: a visible piece of the anchor object locked in the foreground, rigid mount, world moving, no detached drone path.","点明物体，并让它固定在画面中。引用：物体主观视角，仿佛从工具、球、子弹、手机看[主体]：那个在看的东西。视频：一个物体朝向或绕着[主体]移动的视点。补充：锚定物体可见的一部分锁定在前景，刚性安装，世界在移动，没有分离式无人机路径。"],"cp":["Camera rigidly attached beside the front fork of an old bicycle, looking ahead. The fork stays fixed in the lower-left frame while cobblestones rush beneath and street corners swing with the steering. Real wheel rotation and restrained mechanical vibration; no detached drone movement.","摄影机刚性固定在旧自行车前叉旁，朝前看。前叉固定在画面左下方，鹅卵石在下方疾驰而过，街角随转向摆动。真实车轮旋转和克制的机械振动；没有分离式无人机运动。"],"hp":["object POV as if [Subject] were seen from a tool, a ball, a bullet, a phone: the thing looking.","物体主观视角，仿佛从工具、球、子弹、手机看[主体]：那个在看的东西。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/object-pov-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/object-pov-object-pov-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/object-pov.jpg","r":[["First-Person","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/first-person","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/first-person-first-person-mini.webp","The audience is the character."],["Point of View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/pov","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pov-090-subjective-optical-pov-mini.webp","Force identification. The audience is the character."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"物体视角"},"overhead":{"t":"Overhead Top-Down","c":"camera-angles","g":"Bird’s-eye tableau","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/overhead","d":["An overhead top-down shot looks nearly straight down at 90 degrees, flattening bodies and spaces into a graphic arrangement. Faces are scarce; silhouette, props, and the plan of the table or room do the talking.","正俯视顶拍镜头以90度几乎垂直向下看，将身体和空间压平成图形排列。面孔很少；剪影、道具以及桌子或房间的平面布局在说话。"],"pi":["Lock 90 degrees and the rectangle. Quote: Overhead top-down shot of [Subject] at 90 degrees, flat-lay or room plan, shadows as drawing. Add: camera straight down, tabletop or floor as a true rectangle, tops of heads, no three-quarter face. If the model tilts, say no perspective wedge on the table.","锁定90度和矩形。引用：正俯视顶拍[主体]，90度，平铺俯拍或房间平面图，阴影如绘图。补充：摄影机垂直向下，桌面或地面呈真正矩形，看到头顶，不要四分之三脸。如果模型倾斜，就说桌面上没有透视楔形。"],"cp":["Strict top-down locked shot of four people setting a long table, their hands passing plates in a coordinated pattern. The tabletop forms a clean rectangle, no perspective tilt, no camera rotation. One person stops and the system loses its rhythm.","严格锁定俯拍四个人布置长桌，他们的手以协调的模式传递盘子。桌面形成干净的矩形，没有透视倾斜，没有摄影机旋转。一个人停下，系统失去节奏。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/overhead-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/overhead-overhead-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/overhead.jpg","r":[["Bird's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/birds-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/birds-eye-045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.webp","Turn life into a board game or a ritual."],["Crane Over","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-over","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-over-crane-over-mini.webp","Turn a scene into a map without cutting."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"正顶俯拍"},"pov":{"t":"Point of View","c":"camera-angles","g":"subjective camera","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/pov","d":["A POV shot makes the camera function as a character's optical viewpoint: what they see at their eye height. The looker's head and shoulder stay out of the frame; we inhabit the look, not a seat behind it.","主观镜头让摄影机充当角色的光学视点：他们在自己眼睛高度看到的东西。观看者的头和肩留在画面外；我们栖居于观看之中，而不是其后的座位。"],"pi":["Describe the seen world, not the seer. Quote: What [Subject] sees: the world at their eye height, no back of a head, no shoulder of the looker in frame. Name whose eyes, the height, and the object of the look. For video, one motivated pan or walk as that person, still without their shoulder.","描述「被看到的世界」，而不是「看的人」。照抄这句：[主体] 所看到的：以他的眼睛高度呈现的世界，没有后脑勺，画面里也没有观看者的肩膀。写明是谁的眼睛、高度，以及看的对象。用于动态时，只做一次有动机的摇或走，仍然不出现他的肩膀。"],"cp":["At a crowded celebration, a character becomes overwhelmed. Keep the image continuous while voices lose clarity, room detail recedes and a small nearby glass movement becomes unusually prominent. Return gradually to the room when a friend touches her shoulder. Build the perceptual transition in sound post-production.","在拥挤的庆典上，一个角色逐渐招架不住。保持画面连续，同时让说话声变得模糊不清，房间细节退远，身旁一只玻璃杯的微小移动变得异常突出。当朋友碰到她肩膀时，再逐渐回到房间。这种知觉的过渡在声音后期里完成。"],"hp":["what [Subject] sees, world at their eye height, no back of a head, no shoulder of the looker.","[主体]看到的东西，世界处于其眼睛高度，没有后脑勺，没有观看者的肩膀。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/090-subjective-optical-pov-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pov-090-subjective-optical-pov-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pov.jpg","r":[["SnorriCam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/snorricam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/snorricam-018-body-mounted-face-camera-mini.webp","Trap the audience in a body that cannot get out."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."]],"z":"主观镜头"},"profile":{"t":"Profile","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/profile","d":["A profile shot places the camera at 90 degrees to the head so one ear, the jaw, and the nose read as architecture, with the look offscreen. It is a true side view, not a three-quarter face and not a stamped coin if the living head still breathes.","侧面镜头将摄影机放在与头部成90度的位置，使一只耳朵、下颌和鼻子呈现为结构，视线看向画外。它是真正的侧视，不是四分之三脸，也不是压印硬币——只要这活生生的头仍在呼吸。"],"pi":["Lock the yaw. Quote: True profile of [Subject], camera at 90 degrees to the head, one ear, the nose as architecture, looking offscreen. A human face, not a stamped portrait. Add: far eye hidden, horizon level unless you intend a cant, look-space in front of the nose.","锁定偏航角。引用：真正的[主体]侧面，摄影机与头部成90度，一只耳朵，鼻子成为结构，看向画外。一张人脸，不是盖章式肖像。补充：远侧眼睛被遮住，除非有意倾斜，否则地平线保持水平，鼻前留有视线空间。"],"cp":["True profile of [Subject], camera at 90 degrees to the head, one ear, the nose as architecture, looking offscreen. A human face, not a stamped portrait.","真正的[主体]侧面，摄影机与头部成90度，一只耳朵，鼻子成为结构，看向画外。一张人脸，不是盖章式肖像。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/profile/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Three-Quarter Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/three-quarter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-quarter.webp","Most flattering narrative portrait."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."]],"z":"侧面镜头"},"reverse-angle":{"t":"Reverse Angle","c":"camera-angles","g":"Delayed object of the look","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/reverse-angle","d":["A reverse-angle shot views the same spatial relationship from the opposing side, completing the axis of a look, a dialogue, or a standoff. Geography flips; the 180-degree line is respected so screen direction still matches.","反打镜头从相对一侧观看同一空间关系，补全一个视线、对话或对峙的轴线。空间关系翻转；尊重180度线，因此银幕方向仍然匹配。"],"pi":["Describe both poles even if you generate one still. Quote: Reverse angle on [Subject], the opposing view of a dialogue or standoff, 180-line respected, geography flipping. Add: matching size to the first angle, opposing eyeline, same room, camera on the other side of the axis. For a pair, specify who was in the outgoing shot.","即使只生成一张静帧，也要描述两极。引用：[主体]的反打，对话或对峙的相对视角，尊重180度线，空间关系翻转。补充：景别与第一个角度匹配，相对的视线，同一房间，摄影机在轴线另一侧。若是双人，说明上一个镜头中是谁。"],"cp":["Close-up of a caretaker opening a basement door just outside frame. Her expression changes as she sees something below, but hold on her face and the dark edge of the doorway. A quiet mechanical clicking comes from downstairs. Never cut to what she sees during this shot.","看管人打开地下室门的特写，门就在画面外。她看到下方某物时表情变化，但镜头保持在她脸上和门洞的暗边。楼下传来安静的机械咔嗒声。此镜头中绝不切到她看到的东西。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/098-withheld-reverse-angle-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reverse-angle-098-withheld-reverse-angle-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/reverse-angle.jpg","r":[["Over-the-Shoulder Coverage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/over-the-shoulder-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/over-the-shoulder-frame-088-over-the-shoulder-coverage-mini.webp","Default dialogue coverage with spatial glue."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."]],"z":"反打镜头"},"shoulder-level":{"t":"Shoulder Level","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/shoulder-level","d":["A shoulder-level camera sits slightly below the eyes, at the height of a walking companion. It is less formal than true Eye Level and less monumental than a Low Angle ; the face is still the target, seen from the deltoid rather than the pupil.","肩位摄影机略低于眼睛，处于同行行人的高度。它比真正的视平线更不正式，比低角度更不具纪念碑感；面孔仍是目标，从三角肌而不是瞳孔看到。"],"pi":["Separate height from move. Quote: Shoulder-level camera on [Subject], slightly below the eyes, a walking companion's view, less formal than true eye-level. Add: horizon nearly level, not a low-angle, no foreground shoulder unless you also want OTS. For video, one follow at that height, no tour.","将高度与运动分开。引用：肩位摄影机对准[主体]，略低于眼睛，同行行人的视角，比真正的视平线更不正式。补充：地平线接近水平，不是低角度，不要前景肩膀，除非你也想要过肩镜头。视频中，在该高度跟随一次，不要巡游。"],"cp":["Shoulder-level camera on [Subject], slightly below the eyes, a walking companion's view, less formal than true eye-level.","肩位摄影机对准[主体]，略低于眼睛，同行行人的视角，比真正的视平线更不正式。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/shoulder-level/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."],["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."]],"z":"肩高机位"},"three-quarter":{"t":"Three-Quarter Angle","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/three-quarter","d":["A three-quarter angle turns the face about 45 degrees to the camera so both eyes remain visible and the far cheek recedes. It is the standard narrative portrait angle: dimensionality without a full front or a true side.","四分之三角度将脸相对摄影机转约45度，使双眼仍然可见，远侧脸颊后退。它是标准的叙事肖像角度：有立体感，又不是完全正面或真正侧面。"],"pi":["Name the turn in degrees and keep both eyes. Quote: Three-quarter angle on [Subject], face turned about 45 degrees, classic portrait dimensionality. Add: both eyes visible, far cheek receding, not a true profile, not looking into the lens. Specify height separately (eye-level three-quarter, and so on).","点明转向角度，并保留双眼。引用：[主体]的四分之三角度，脸转约45度，经典肖像立体感。补充：双眼可见，远侧脸颊后退，不是真正侧面，不看向镜头。单独说明高度（视平线四分之三，等等）。"],"cp":["Three-quarter angle on [Subject], face turned about 45 degrees, classic portrait dimensionality.","[主体]的四分之三角度，脸转约45度，经典肖像立体感。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/three-quarter/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Profile","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/profile","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/profile.webp","Statue, secrecy, or a nose as architecture."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."],["High Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/high-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-angle-044-high-angle-vulnerability-mini.webp","Vulnerability, surveillance, or a map of a room."]],"z":"四分之三侧面"},"trunk-shot":{"t":"Trunk Shot","c":"camera-angles","g":"View from inside a container","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/trunk-shot","d":["A trunk shot places the camera inside a car trunk or similar confined pit, looking up at the people who open it, with the lid and rim framing their downward looks. It is a located low viewpoint, not a generic look-up in a parking lot.","后备箱镜头将摄影机放在汽车后备箱或类似封闭坑状空间内，向上仰拍打开它的人，箱盖与边缘框住他们向下的目光。它是一个有具体位置的低视点，不是停车场里泛泛的仰拍。"],"pi":["The rim is mandatory. Quote: Trunk shot looking up at [Subject] from inside a car trunk or similar confined pit, playful low-angle signature. Add: dark container edge framing the frame, lid or sky above, actors looking down into the lens, camera not rising out of the box.","边缘必须保留。引用：后备箱镜头，从汽车后备箱或类似封闭坑状空间内向上看 [主体]，俏皮的低角度标志性视角。添加：深色容器边缘构成画框，上方是箱盖或天空，演员向下看向镜头，摄影机不要从箱体中升起。"],"cp":["From inside an old wooden instrument case, look upward as two conservators open the lid and lean over it. The dark case rim frames their faces against a bright workshop ceiling. Clear lid movement, coherent downward eyelines, no camera rise or reveal of the observer.","从一只老旧木制乐器箱内部，向上看，两位修复师打开箱盖并俯身探向它。深色琴箱边缘将他们的脸框在明亮工作坊天花板前。箱盖动作清晰，连贯的向下视线，摄影机不升起，也不揭示观察者。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/162-trunk-point-of-view-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/trunk-shot-162-trunk-point-of-view-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/trunk-shot.jpg","r":[["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."],["Worm's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/worms-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/worms-eye.webp","The subject is a tower. You are dust."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"后备箱视角"},"worms-eye":{"t":"Worm's-Eye View","c":"camera-angles","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/worms-eye","d":["A worm's-eye view looks sharply upward from ground level or below the subject, an extreme low pitch that collapses verticals inward. The subject is a tower and the camera is dust.","虫眼视角从地面或主体下方锐利地向上看，是极度低机位，使垂直线向内汇聚。主体是塔，而摄影机是尘土。"],"pi":["Say straight up, not merely low. Quote: Worm's-eye view from ground level looking straight up at [Subject], extreme low, verticals collapsing inward, awe or terror. Add: lens on the dirt or in a pit, architecture towering, face foreshortened from below. Not a waist-height power tilt.","要写笔直向上，而不只是低。引用：虫眼视角，从地面高度笔直向上看 [主体]，极度低角度，垂直线向内汇聚，敬畏或恐惧。添加：镜头贴土或置于坑中，建筑高耸，脸部从下方透视压缩。不是齐腰高的权力感上下摇。"],"cp":["Worm's-eye view from ground level looking straight up at [Subject], extreme low, verticals collapsing inward, awe or terror.","虫眼视角，从地面高度笔直向上看 [主体]，极度低角度，垂直线向内汇聚，敬畏或恐惧。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/worms-eye/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."],["Ground Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/ground-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ground-level.webp","Start from the dirt."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."]],"z":"虫眼视角"},"3d-rotation":{"t":"3D Rotation","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/3d-rotation","d":["A 3d rotation camera treats the figure as a sculptural object on a virtual turntable of space. The world may be a cyc or a void; the point is every side, not a street orbit.","3D 旋转镜头把人物当作虚拟空间转台上的雕塑物体。环境可以是无缝背景或虚空；重点在于每一面，而不是街道环绕。"],"pi":["Turntable of space, figure as object. Still: 3D rotation around [Subject], a turntable of space, the figure as a sculptural object in orbit. Video: The camera rotates in 3D around [Subject] as if on a virtual turntable. Studio or void helps. One axis.","空间转台，人物作为物体。静帧：3D 旋转环绕 [主体]，空间转台，人物作为在轨道上运行的雕塑物体。视频：摄影机在 3D 中环绕 [主体] 旋转，仿佛在虚拟转台上。摄影棚或虚空有帮助。单轴。"],"cp":["The camera rotates in 3D around [Subject] as if on a virtual turntable.","摄影机在 3D 中环绕 [主体] 旋转，仿佛在虚拟转台上。"],"hp":["3D rotation around [Subject], a turntable of space, the figure as a sculptural object in orbit.","3D 旋转环绕 [主体]，空间转台，人物作为在轨道上运行的雕塑物体。"],"fq":["Write a virtual turntable and the figure as sculpture. Example: 3D rotation around [Subject], a turntable of space, the figure as a sculptural object in orbit.","写一个虚拟转台，并把人物写成雕塑。示例：3D 旋转环绕 [主体]，空间转台，人物作为在轨道上运行的雕塑物体。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/3d-rotation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/3d-rotation-3d-rotation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/3d-rotation.jpg","r":[["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Lazy Susan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/lazy-susan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lazy-susan-lazy-susan-mini.webp","Show an object or costume from every side."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"3D旋转"},"aerial":{"t":"Aerial","c":"camera-movement","g":"aerial shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial","d":["An aerial shot views a large area from a high flying camera so geography reads as a map, the figure small in land or city. Helicopter, drone, or a virtual path can carry it; altitude and a stable horizon are the facts.","航拍镜头从高空飞行摄影机俯瞰大片区域，使地理像地图一样可读，人物在陆地或城市中很小。直升机、无人机或虚拟路径都可以承载它；高度和稳定地平线是事实。"],"pi":["Name height, the map, and the small anchor. Still: Aerial of [Subject] from a high flying camera, geography readable as a map, scale first, the figure small in land or city. Video: The camera flies high over [Subject], revealing the true scale of the location. Keep the horizon stable. Do not add a snap zoom.","写出高度、地图感和微小锚点。静帧：从高空飞行摄影机航拍 [主体]，地理像地图一样可读，比例优先，人物在陆地或城市中很小。视频：摄影机高高飞越 [主体]，揭示地点的真实尺度。保持地平线稳定。不要添加急推变焦。"],"cp":["An aerial camera follows a small blue car along a winding mountain road, gradually gaining altitude as the road disappears into enormous dark forest. Smooth forward motion, stable horizon, realistic road continuity and vehicle speed, no cut.","航拍摄影机跟着一辆蓝色小车沿蜿蜒山路前进，随着道路消失在巨大黑暗森林中逐渐升高。平滑向前运动，稳定地平线，道路连续性与车速真实，不切镜。"],"hp":["Aerial of [Subject] from a high flying camera, geography readable as a map, scale first, the figure small in land or city.","从高空飞行摄影机航拍 [主体]，地理像地图一样可读，比例优先，人物在陆地或城市中很小。"],"fq":["Write a high flying camera, a stable horizon, and a small subject in a readable landscape. Example: Aerial of [Subject] from a high flying camera, geography readable as a map, scale first.","写一台高空飞行摄影机、稳定地平线，以及可读景观中的小主体。示例：从高空飞行摄影机航拍 [主体]，地理像地图一样可读，比例优先。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/012-aerial-pursuit-and-landscape-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-012-aerial-pursuit-and-landscape-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/aerial.jpg","r":[["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Aerial Push In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-push","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-push-aerial-push-mini.webp","Pick one human out of a system."],["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."]],"z":"航拍"},"aerial-pullback":{"t":"Aerial Pullback","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","d":["An aerial pullback rises and recedes until a person or building becomes a small mark in a landscape. The move hands the scene from a character to geography, from helicopter or high-drone height rather than from a ground crane.","航拍拉远会升高并后退，直到人物或建筑在景观中变成一个小标记。这一运动把场景从角色交给地理，从直升机或高空无人机高度进行，而不是从地面摇臂。"],"pi":["Aerial pullback from [Subject], camera rising and receding until the figure is a speck in geography, helicopter or high drone grammar, landscape taking the frame. For motion: the camera rises and pulls back from [Subject] until the surrounding landscape dominates.","航拍拉远，从 [主体] 拉远，摄影机升高并后退，直到人物在地理中成为一个小点，直升机或高空无人机语法，景观占据画面。运动：摄影机从 [主体] 升高并拉远，直到周围景观占据主导。"],"cp":["The camera rises and pulls back from [Subject] until the surrounding landscape dominates.","摄影机从 [主体] 升高并拉远，直到周围景观占据主导。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/aerial-pullback.jpg","r":[["Crane Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp","End a scene, reveal a city, or turn a person into landscape."],["Extreme Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-long-shot.webp","Scale is the emotion."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"航拍拉远"},"aerial-push":{"t":"Aerial Push In","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-push","d":["An aerial push in starts high and descends or tightens until a single figure reads in the map. It picks one human out of a city, crowd, or terrain from altitude.","航拍推近从高处开始，下降或收紧，直到单个身影在地图中可辨。它从高空把一个人从城市、人群或地形中挑出来。"],"pi":["Aerial push in toward [Subject] from high altitude, descending and tightening from map to person, a high view finding a face. For motion: the camera descends and pushes in from a high aerial toward [Subject].","航拍推近，朝 [主体] 从高空推近，从地图下降到人物并收紧，高视点找到一张脸。运动：摄影机从高空航拍下降并向 [主体] 推近。"],"cp":["The camera descends and pushes in from a high aerial toward [Subject].","摄影机从高空航拍下降并向 [主体] 推近。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/aerial-push-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-push-aerial-push-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/aerial-push.jpg","r":[["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Crane Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-down-011-crane-down-detail-reveal-mini.webp","Arrive from god-view into a person."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"航拍推近"},"arc":{"t":"Arc","c":"camera-movement","g":"arc shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc","d":["An arc shot moves the camera around the subject along part of a circle while the lens stays aimed at them. A quarter or half orbit is enough: the axis of the scene changes without a cut, and the background slides.","弧形镜头让摄影机沿圆周的一部分绕主体移动，同时镜头始终对准主体。四分之一或半圈环绕就够了：场景轴线不切镜就发生变化，背景滑动。"],"pi":["Name the curve, the facing, and how much of the circle. Still: Arc around [Subject], camera traveling a curve while facing them, background sliding, a quarter or half orbit. Video: The camera arcs around [Subject], always facing them, background sliding past. Say quarter or half. Forbid a pan from sticks.","写出曲线、朝向，以及绕圆多少。静帧：环绕 [主体] 做弧形运动，摄影机沿曲线移动并始终朝向主体，背景滑动，四分之一或半圈环绕。视频：摄影机环绕 [主体] 做弧形运动，始终朝向主体，背景滑过。说明四分之一或半圈。禁止用三脚架摇摄。"],"cp":["The camera arcs around [Subject], always facing them, background sliding past.","摄影机环绕 [主体] 做弧形运动，始终朝向主体，背景滑过。"],"hp":["Arc around [Subject], camera traveling a curve while facing them, background sliding, a quarter or half orbit.","环绕 [主体] 做弧形运动，摄影机沿曲线移动并始终朝向主体，背景滑动，四分之一或半圈环绕。"],"fq":["Write a curved travel that always faces the subject, and name a quarter or half orbit. Example: Arc around [Subject], camera traveling a curve while facing them, background sliding.","写一段始终朝向主体的曲线移动，并写明四分之一或半圈环绕。示例：环绕 [主体] 做弧形运动，摄影机沿曲线移动并始终朝向主体，背景滑动。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/arc-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-arc-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/arc.jpg","r":[["Arc Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-left-arc-left-mini.webp","Change the axis of a conversation or reveal the other half of a room."],["Arc Right","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-right","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-right-arc-right-mini.webp","Same as arc left, other side."],["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."]],"z":"弧形运镜"},"arc-left":{"t":"Arc Left","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-left","d":["An arc left is a curved dolly that travels partway around the subject while staying aimed at them. The camera's axis on the conversation or room changes without a cut, usually about a quarter-orbit.","左弧是一段弧形推轨，沿部分圆周绕主体移动，同时始终对准主体。摄影机在对话或房间中的轴线不切镜就发生变化，通常约为四分之一圈环绕。"],"pi":["90-degree arc left around [Subject], curved dolly, always facing the figure, background sliding, a quarter-orbit instead of a full spin. For motion: the camera arcs left about 90 degrees around [Subject], always facing them.","绕 [主体] 向左 90 度弧线环绕，弧形推轨，始终朝向人物，背景滑动，是四分之一环绕而不是整圈旋转。用于动态时：摄影机绕 [主体] 向左弧线环绕约 90 度，始终朝向对方。"],"cp":["The camera arcs left about 90 degrees around [Subject], always facing them.","摄影机绕 [主体] 向左弧线环绕约 90 度，始终朝向对方。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/arc-left-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-left-arc-left-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/arc-left.jpg","r":[["Arc Right","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-right","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-right-arc-right-mini.webp","Same as arc left, other side."],["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"左弧形运镜"},"arc-right":{"t":"Arc Right","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-right","d":["An arc right is a partial orbit to the right, usually about a quarter turn, with the lens remaining on the subject. Background slides while eyeline and distance stay roughly constant.","右弧是向右的部分环绕，通常约为四分之一圈，镜头始终留在主体上。背景滑动，而视线和距离大致保持不变。"],"pi":["90-degree arc right around [Subject], curved travel, continuous eyeline on the figure. For motion: the camera arcs right about 90 degrees around [Subject], always facing them.","向右 90 度弧形环绕 [主体]，曲线移动，视线持续锁在人物身上。运动：摄影机向右弧形环绕 [主体] 约 90 度，始终朝向主体。"],"cp":["The camera arcs right about 90 degrees around [Subject], always facing them.","摄影机向右弧形环绕 [主体] 约 90 度，始终朝向主体。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/arc-right-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-right-arc-right-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/arc-right.jpg","r":[["Arc Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-left-arc-left-mini.webp","Change the axis of a conversation or reveal the other half of a room."],["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"右弧形运镜"},"bolt-cam":{"t":"Bolt Cam","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/bolt-cam","d":["A bolt cam hurls an ultra-high-speed camera along a crash rig toward an impact, then freezes. The punch is physical translation on a rail or pneumatic throw, not a change of focal length.","Bolt-cam 沿撞击支架把超高速摄影机猛掷向撞击点，然后冻结。冲击力来自轨道上的物理平移或气动抛射，而不是焦距变化。"],"pi":["Name the strike, the rig, and the freeze. Still: Bolt-cam strike toward [Subject], ultra-high-speed camera on a crash rig, the lens hurled at an impact then freezing, sports and music-video violence. Video: Ultra-fast camera strike toward [Subject], then a sudden settle, impact energy. Say crash rig, not zoom.","写出冲击、支架和冻结。静帧：Bolt-cam 朝 [主体] 冲击，超高速摄影机装在撞击支架上，镜头被猛掷向撞击点然后冻结，体育和音乐视频式的暴力感。视频：超高速摄影机朝 [主体] 冲击，然后突然稳住，撞击能量。说明撞击支架，不是变焦。"],"cp":["Ultra-fast camera strike toward [Subject], then a sudden settle, impact energy.","超高速摄影机朝 [主体] 冲击，然后突然稳住，撞击能量。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Write a crash-rig strike and a freeze. Example: Bolt-cam strike toward [Subject], ultra-high-speed camera on a crash rig, the lens hurled at an impact then freezing.","写一次撞击支架冲击和一次冻结。示例：Bolt-cam 朝 [主体] 冲击，超高速摄影机装在撞击支架上，镜头被猛掷向撞击点然后冻结。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/bolt-cam-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bolt-cam-bolt-cam-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/bolt-cam.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"高速机械臂"},"buckle-up":{"t":"Buckle Up","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/buckle-up","d":["A buckle up camera straps the lens to the cabin with the subject, so the vehicle is the tripod and acceleration is the grammar. Interior stays sharp; the world streaks past the glass.","系紧安全带式摄影机把镜头和主体一起绑在车厢上，因此车辆就是三脚架，加速度就是语法。车内保持清晰；世界从玻璃外掠过。"],"pi":["Lock to the cabin. Still: Buckle-up camera with [Subject] in a vehicle, the lens strapped to the cabin, acceleration as the grammar, road rushing past. Video: Camera locked in the vehicle with [Subject], the world streaking past the glass. Interior sharp. Forbid an exterior beauty pass as the whole shot.","锁定到车厢。静帧：系紧安全带式摄影机，[主体]在车内，镜头绑在车厢上，加速度即语法，道路疾驰而过。视频：摄影机锁定在车内，[主体]在车里，世界从玻璃外掠过。车内清晰。禁止把外景美化镜次当作整个镜头。"],"cp":["Camera locked in the vehicle with [Subject], the world streaking past the glass.","摄影机锁定在车内，[主体]在车里，世界从玻璃外掠过。"],"hp":["Buckle-up camera with [Subject] in a vehicle, the lens strapped to the cabin, acceleration as the grammar, road rushing past.","系紧安全带式摄影机，[主体]在车内，镜头绑在车厢上，加速度即语法，道路疾驰而过。"],"fq":["Write a cabin lock and streaking glass. Example: Buckle-up camera with [Subject] in a vehicle, the lens strapped to the cabin, acceleration as the grammar, road rushing past.","写出车厢锁定与玻璃掠影。示例：系紧安全带式摄影机，[主体]在车内，镜头绑在车厢上，加速度即语法，道路疾驰而过。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/buckle-up-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/buckle-up-buckle-up-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/buckle-up.jpg","r":[["Car Grip","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/car-grip","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/car-grip-car-grip-mini.webp","Bolt the camera to the machine."],["Road Rush","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/road-rush","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/road-rush-road-rush-mini.webp","The road is the subject."],["Locked-On","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/locked-on","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/locked-on-020-object-locked-moving-camera-mini.webp","One thing is the only stable point in a moving world."]],"z":"绑身机位"},"camera-roll":{"t":"Camera Roll","c":"camera-movement","g":"Roll set","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/camera-roll","d":["A camera roll rotates the frame around the lens axis as if the world has lost its up, either by rolling the camera or by rotating a room around a weighted body. Gravity becomes optional, which is stronger than a small Dutch cant.","摄影机滚转围绕镜头轴旋转画面，仿佛世界失去了上下，既可以滚转摄影机，也可以围绕有重量的身体旋转房间。重力变成可选，这比轻微荷兰角倾斜更有力。"],"pi":["Full camera roll around [Subject], the frame rotating as if the world has lost its up, disorientation or dance-floor physics. For motion: the camera rolls continuously around its lens axis with [Subject] in frame.","围绕[主体]的完整摄影机滚转，画面旋转，仿佛世界失去了上下，制造迷失感或舞池物理。运动时：摄影机围绕自身镜头轴持续滚转，[主体]在画面内。"],"cp":["A rigid hotel corridor slowly rolls ninety degrees while a courier braces against a wall that becomes the floor. Maintain coherent gravity, body weight, cloth motion and contact. Previsualize the room rotation in 3D, then generate short connected beats from fixed endpoints. No bending walls or effortless floating.","一条刚性酒店走廊缓慢滚转九十度，同时一名快递员抵住一面变成地板的墙。保持重力、体重、布料运动和接触关系连贯。先在3D中预演房间旋转，再从固定端点生成短而连贯的节拍。墙壁不得弯曲，也不得轻松漂浮。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/016-camera-roll-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/camera-roll-016-camera-roll-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/camera-roll.jpg","r":[["Dutch Roll","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dutch-roll","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-roll-dutch-roll-mini.webp","Unease that arrives in time, not as a still cant."],["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"摄影机横滚"},"car-chasing":{"t":"Car Chasing","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/car-chasing","d":["Car chase cinematography covers pursuit from a second vehicle, matching speed, the road as the set. Two machines stay in a line of action; this is the hunter's lens, not a locked interior.","追车摄影从第二辆车拍摄追逐，速度匹配，道路即片场。两台机器保持同一动作轴线；这是猎手镜头，不是锁定车内。"],"pi":["Two vehicles, matched speed. Still: Car-chase coverage of [Subject], pursuit from a second vehicle, matching speed, road as the set. Video: Camera pursues [Subject] from another vehicle, matching speed, road parallax. Keep both machines in a relationship. Forbid a parking-lot still.","两辆车，速度匹配。静帧：追车分镜覆盖 [主体]，从第二辆车拍摄追逐，速度匹配，道路即片场。视频：摄影机从另一辆车追逐[主体]，速度匹配，道路视差。让两台机器保持关系。禁止停车场式静帧。"],"cp":["Camera pursues [Subject] from another vehicle, matching speed, road parallax.","摄影机从另一辆车追逐[主体]，速度匹配，道路视差。"],"hp":["Car-chase coverage of [Subject], pursuit from a second vehicle, matching speed, road as the set.","追车分镜覆盖 [主体]，从第二辆车拍摄追逐，速度匹配，道路即片场。"],"fq":["Write pursuit from a second vehicle and matching speed. Example: Car-chase coverage of [Subject], pursuit from a second vehicle, matching speed, road as the set.","写出从第二辆车拍摄追逐与速度匹配。示例：追车分镜覆盖 [主体]，从第二辆车拍摄追逐，速度匹配，道路即片场。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/car-chasing-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/car-chasing-car-chasing-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/car-chasing.jpg","r":[["Road Rush","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/road-rush","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/road-rush-road-rush-mini.webp","The road is the subject."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Buckle Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/buckle-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/buckle-up-buckle-up-mini.webp","The car is the tripod."]],"z":"追车镜头"},"car-grip":{"t":"Car Grip","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/car-grip","d":["A car mount camera bolts to hood, door, or bumper so bodywork sits in the near plane and asphalt slides underneath. Chrome and road share one rigid relationship because the rig is the machine.","车挂摄影机固定在引擎盖、车门或保险杠上，让车身位于近景平面，沥青从下方滑过。镀铬与道路共享一种刚性关系，因为支架就是机器。"],"pi":["Show the mount's privilege. Still: Car-grip mount on [Subject]'s vehicle, hood or door as the rig, chrome and asphalt in one plane. Video: Camera mounted to the car with [Subject], bodywork in the foreground, road sliding underneath. Wide. Dirt allowed.","展示车挂的优势。静帧：车挂安装在[主体]的车辆上，引擎盖或车门作为支架，镀铬与沥青在同一平面。视频：摄影机安装在车上，[主体]在车上，车身在前景，道路在下方滑动。广角。允许脏污。"],"cp":["Camera mounted to the car with [Subject], bodywork in the foreground, road sliding underneath.","摄影机安装在车上，[主体]在车上，车身在前景，道路在下方滑动。"],"hp":["Car-grip mount on [Subject]'s vehicle, hood or door as the rig, chrome and asphalt in one plane.","车挂安装在[主体]的车辆上，引擎盖或车门作为支架，镀铬与沥青在同一平面。"],"fq":["Write a mount on hood or door with bodywork in frame. Example: Car-grip mount on [Subject]'s vehicle, hood or door as the rig, chrome and asphalt in one plane.","写出引擎盖或车门上的安装，车身入画。示例：车挂安装在[主体]的车辆上，引擎盖或车门作为支架，镀铬与沥青在同一平面。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/car-grip-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/car-grip-car-grip-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/car-grip.jpg","r":[["Buckle Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/buckle-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/buckle-up-buckle-up-mini.webp","The car is the tripod."],["Locked-On","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/locked-on","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/locked-on-020-object-locked-moving-camera-mini.webp","One thing is the only stable point in a moving world."],["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."]],"z":"车载机位"},"choreo":{"t":"Choreo","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/choreo","d":["A choreographed camera times bodies and lens as one phrase of movement. The blocking is scored: steps, turns, and the support share a count, then the phrase ends.","编排摄影机让身体与镜头按同一个动作乐句计时。调度按拍子编排：步伐、转身和支撑共享同一拍数，然后乐句结束。"],"pi":["Name the shared phrase and stop there. Still: Choreographed camera with [Subject], bodies and lens timed together, one phrase of movement, dance-floor blocking. Video: Camera and [Subject] move as one choreography, a single phrase, no extra flourishes. Forbid a second unmotivated orbit after the stop.","点明共同的乐句，然后停在那里。静帧：编排摄影机与[主体]，身体与镜头同步计时，一个运动乐句，舞池调度。视频：摄影机与[主体]作为一个编排一起运动，单一乐句，没有多余花样。禁止停止后再来一次无动机环绕。"],"cp":["Camera and [Subject] move as one choreography, a single phrase, no extra flourishes.","摄影机与[主体]作为一个编排一起运动，单一乐句，没有多余花样。"],"hp":["Choreographed camera with [Subject], bodies and lens timed together, one phrase of movement, dance-floor blocking.","编排摄影机与[主体]，身体与镜头同步计时，一个运动乐句，舞池调度。"],"fq":["Write bodies and lens on one phrase, then stop. Example: Choreographed camera with [Subject], bodies and lens timed together, one phrase of movement, dance-floor blocking.","写出身体与镜头在同一乐句上，然后停止。示例：编排摄影机与[主体]，身体与镜头同步计时，一个运动乐句，舞池调度。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/choreo-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/choreo-choreo-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/choreo.jpg","r":[["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Oner","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/one-er","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-er-026-social-access-tracking-oner-mini.webp","The scene is a ride."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"编排运镜"},"conveyor":{"t":"Conveyor","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/conveyor","d":["A conveyor camera treats the world as a belt: relentless lateral travel at constant speed, factory or infinite product-line geometry. The subject can stand still while the line delivers the next unit past the frame.","传送带摄影机把世界当作一条传送带：以恒定速度无休止地横向平移，工厂或无限产品线几何。主体可以站着不动，而流水线把下一个单元送到画面旁。"],"pi":["Name the belt and the constant speed. Still: Conveyor move past [Subject], the world sliding on a belt, factory or infinite product line, relentless lateral travel. Video: The world slides past [Subject] as if on a conveyor, constant lateral speed. Forbid a halt in the middle unless the line jams on purpose.","点明传送带与恒定速度。静帧：传送带式运动经过[主体]，世界像在传送带上滑动，工厂或无限产品线，无休止的横向平移。视频：世界像在传送带上一样从[主体]旁滑过，恒定横向速度。禁止中途停顿，除非流水线故意卡住。"],"cp":["The world slides past [Subject] as if on a conveyor, constant lateral speed.","世界像在传送带上一样从[主体]旁滑过，恒定横向速度。"],"hp":["Conveyor move past [Subject], the world sliding on a belt, factory or infinite product line, relentless lateral travel.","传送带式运动经过[主体]，世界像在传送带上滑动，工厂或无限产品线，无休止的横向平移。"],"fq":["Write constant lateral speed and a belt or product line. Example: Conveyor move past [Subject], the world sliding on a belt, factory or infinite product line, relentless lateral travel.","写出恒定横向速度与传送带或产品线。示例：传送带式运动经过[主体]，世界像在传送带上滑动，工厂或无限产品线，无休止的横向平移。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/conveyor-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/conveyor-conveyor-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/conveyor.jpg","r":[["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Trucking","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/trucking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/trucking-trucking-mini.webp","Stay beside a walker."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"传送带运镜"},"crane-down":{"t":"Crane Down","c":"camera-movement","g":"jib down","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-down","d":["A crane down shot lowers the camera on an arm from a high wide view into a human-scale frame. The world collapses from map to face because the lens occupies new heights, not because it merely nods.","摇臂下降镜头用臂把摄影机从高处广角视图降到人体尺度画面。世界从地图坍缩为面孔，是因为镜头占据了新的高度，而不是因为它只是轻轻一点。"],"pi":["Crane down onto [Subject], starting high and descending into a human-scale frame, the world collapsing from map to face. For motion: the camera cranes down from a high wide view into a closer frame on [Subject].","摇臂下降至[主体]，从高处开始，下降到人体尺度画面，世界从地图坍缩为面孔。运动时：摄影机从高处的广角视图摇臂下降，进入[主体]的更近画面。"],"cp":["Begin high over a lively harbor market. Descend beside a woman unloading oranges, then continue at her shoulder as she walks between stalls. The high-to-ground movement feels continuous with no sudden speed or horizon change. Plan separate crane and walking sections joined at a foreground canopy if needed.","从热闹的港口市场上空开始。下降到一名正在卸橘子的女子身旁，然后在她走过摊位之间时继续跟在她肩旁。从高处到地面的运动感觉连贯，没有突然的速度或地平线变化。如有需要，把摇臂段与步行段分开规划，并用前景遮棚衔接。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/011-crane-down-detail-reveal-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-down-011-crane-down-detail-reveal-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/crane-down.jpg","r":[["Crane Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp","End a scene, reveal a city, or turn a person into landscape."],["Tilt Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-down-tilt-down-mini.webp","Land on a person or object after establishing scale above."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"摇臂下降"},"crane-over":{"t":"Crane Over","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-over","d":["A crane-over lifts and arcs the camera on a jib or crane until it looks down on the scene from above. Height and angle change together in one move, turning the floor into a map.","摇臂越过镜头用摇臂或升降臂把摄影机抬起并划弧，直到它从上方向下俯视场景。高度与角度在一个运动里同时改变，把地板变成地图。"],"pi":["Crane over [Subject], the arm rising and arcing forward until the camera looks nearly straight down, a continuous climb into overhead. For motion: the camera cranes up and over [Subject], finishing in a high downward angle.","摇臂越过[主体]，臂升起并向前划弧，直到摄影机几乎垂直向下，连续爬升至俯视。运动时：摄影机摇臂上升并越过[主体]，以高角度向下结束。"],"cp":["The camera cranes up and over [Subject], finishing in a high downward angle.","摄影机摇臂上升并越过[主体]，以高角度向下结束。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/crane-over-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-over-crane-over-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/crane-over.jpg","r":[["Overhead Top-Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/overhead","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/overhead-overhead-mini.webp","Table, crime scene, or dance formation."],["Crane Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp","End a scene, reveal a city, or turn a person into landscape."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"摇臂越过"},"crane-over-the-head":{"t":"Crane Over The Head","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-over-the-head","d":["A crane over the head rises on the arm until the camera looks nearly straight down, a person becoming a map. The end state is overhead, not a high three-quarter.","摇臂越过头顶镜头在臂上升起，直到摄影机几乎垂直向下，人变成地图。结束状态是俯视，而不是高位四分之三角度。"],"pi":["End almost overhead. Still: Crane over the head of [Subject], the arm rising until the camera looks nearly straight down, a person becoming a map. Video: The camera cranes up and over [Subject] until the view is almost overhead. Do not stop at a high three-quarter.","几乎以俯视结束。静帧：摇臂越过[主体]头顶，臂升起直到摄影机几乎垂直向下，人变成地图。视频：摄影机摇臂上升并越过[主体]，直到视角几乎为俯视。不要停在高位四分之三角度。"],"cp":["The camera cranes up and over [Subject] until the view is almost overhead.","摄影机摇臂上升并越过[主体]，直到视角几乎为俯视。"],"hp":["Crane over the head of [Subject], the arm rising until the camera looks nearly straight down, a person becoming a map.","摇臂越过[主体]头顶，臂升起直到摄影机几乎垂直向下，人变成地图。"],"fq":["Write a boom that ends almost straight down. Example: Crane over the head of [Subject], the arm rising until the camera looks nearly straight down, a person becoming a map.","写出一个几乎以垂直向下结束的摇臂。示例：摇臂越过[主体]头顶，臂升起直到摄影机几乎垂直向下，人变成地图。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/crane-over-the-head-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-over-the-head-crane-over-the-head-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/crane-over-the-head.jpg","r":[["Crane Over","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-over","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-over-crane-over-mini.webp","Turn a scene into a map without cutting."],["Overhead Top-Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/overhead","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/overhead-overhead-mini.webp","Table, crime scene, or dance formation."],["Bird's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/birds-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/birds-eye-045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.webp","Turn life into a board game or a ritual."]],"z":"摇臂越顶"},"crane-up":{"t":"Crane Up","c":"camera-movement","g":"jib up","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","d":["A crane shot lifts the camera on a jib or Technocrane, often easing backward at the same time, so the frame climbs from a human scale into a wider view of the location. Height change is the point, and a little boom-out keeps the subject from sliding off the bottom of the frame.","摇臂镜头用摇臂或Technocrane抬起摄影机，常常同时缓缓后退，因此画面从人体尺度升向更广的场景视野。高度变化才是重点，稍微向外移臂可防止主体滑出画面底部。"],"pi":["Majestic crane up from [Subject], camera rising and easing backward on a Technocrane, the individual becoming one figure inside a vast environment, golden or blue-hour air, 35mm Signature Prime. For motion: the camera cranes smoothly upward and slightly backward from shoulder height, rising above [Subject] to reveal the true surrounding scale. Slow 6-second crane up.","从[主体]处雄伟地摇臂上升，摄影机在Technocrane上升起并缓缓后退，个体变成广阔环境中的一个身影，黄金时刻或蓝调时刻的空气，35mm Signature Prime。运动时：摄影机从肩高平稳地向上并略微向后摇臂升起，升到[主体]上方，揭示真实的周围尺度。缓慢的6秒摇臂上升。"],"cp":["Begin at eye level beside one volunteer carrying water. Crane upward and backward to reveal hundreds of orderly relief tents across a dry valley. One continuous shot; the volunteer becomes small but remains trackable. Realistic scale and coherent tent spacing, no sudden aerial cut.","从一名搬运水的志愿者身旁、视线高度开始。摇臂向上并向后，揭示干涸山谷中数百顶整齐的救济帐篷。一个连续镜头；志愿者变得很小但仍可追踪。真实尺度与连贯的帐篷间距，不得突然航拍切换。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Name starting height, crane up and slightly back, and what is revealed. Example: camera cranes up and slightly back from shoulder height, revealing rooftops and the city beyond.","点明起始高度、摇臂上升并略微后退，以及揭示了什么。示例：摄影机从肩高摇臂上升并略微后退，揭示屋顶和远处的城市。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/crane-up.jpg","r":[["Crane Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-down-011-crane-down-detail-reveal-mini.webp","Arrive from god-view into a person."],["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Pull Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pull-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pull-out-pull-out-mini.webp","Show the container around a feeling."]],"z":"摇臂上升"},"crash-zoom-in":{"t":"Crash Zoom In","c":"camera-movement","g":"whip zoom","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","d":["A crash zoom is a rapid focal-length snap from a wider frame into a detail, usually without moving the camera. The punch is optical and conspicuous: size changes faster than a body can walk.","急推变焦是从较宽画面快速急推到细节的焦距突变，通常不移动摄影机。这种冲击是光学性的且显而易见：尺寸变化比身体走动还快。"],"pi":["Aggressive crash zoom into [Subject], snap optical punch-in under one second, radial motion blur, Shaw Brothers energy, then a hard hold on the tight frame. For motion: sudden crash zoom into [Subject] in under a second, then hold. Heavy zoom blur during the snap.","激进地急推变焦推入[主体]，一秒内光学急推，径向运动模糊，邵氏能量，然后在紧凑画面上硬停。动态：一秒钟内突然急推变焦推入[主体]，然后保持。急推过程中有强烈的变焦模糊。"],"cp":["A solemn auctioneer lifts a plain wooden box. Snap-zoom instantly from a medium shot to the tiny blinking light hidden under its lid. Fixed camera position, strong punchy zoom, immediate sharp landing, no forward dolly and no slow-motion.","一位严肃的拍卖师举起一个朴素的木盒。从中景瞬间急推变焦到藏在其盖子下的微小闪烁灯光。固定机位，强烈的冲击性变焦，立即锐利落定，不向前推轨，不用慢动作。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/014-crash-zoom-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/crash-zoom-in.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-out-03-crash-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp","Shock-reveal scale or undercut a close moment."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"急推变焦"},"crash-zoom-out":{"t":"Crash Zoom Out","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-out","d":["A crash zoom out is a sudden, fast widening of the lens from a tight frame into a much wider one, usually without moving the camera. It dumps the subject back into the environment in a fraction of a second.","急推变焦拉出是从紧凑画面突然快速拉宽镜头到更广画面，通常不移动摄影机。它在几分之一秒内把主体抛回环境中。"],"pi":["Sudden crash zoom out from [Subject], the environment exploding into view in a fraction of a second, then a locked wide hold. For motion: snap zoom out from [Subject] in under a second, revealing the wider scene, then hold.","从[主体]突然急推变焦拉出，环境在几分之一秒内爆入视野，然后锁定广角保持。动态：一秒钟内从[主体]急推变焦拉出，展现更广的场景，然后保持。"],"cp":["Snap zoom out from [Subject] in under a second, revealing the wider scene, then hold.","一秒钟内从[主体]急推变焦拉出，展现更广的场景，然后保持。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/03-crash-zoom-out-v2-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-out-03-crash-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/crash-zoom-out-03-crash-zoom-out-v2.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Pull Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pull-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pull-out-pull-out-mini.webp","Show the container around a feeling."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"急拉变焦"},"dolly":{"t":"Dolly","c":"camera-movement","g":"dolly shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly","d":["A dolly shot places the camera on a wheeled platform so the body translates through space: doorway dolly, Fisher, Chapman. Because the nodal point moves, foreground, mid-ground, and background change in parallax, which a zoom cannot do.","推轨镜头把摄影机放在带轮平台上，让机身穿越空间移动：门道推轨、Fisher、Chapman。因为节点移动，前景、中景和背景在视差中变化，这是变焦无法做到的。"],"pi":["Say the body travels. Still: Dolly toward or beside [Subject], camera body traveling on a smooth path, true parallax, not a zoom. Video: The camera dollies, physically traveling, parallax shifting around [Subject]. Name in, out, or beside. Ban the word zoom unless you mean a compound.","说明机身在移动。静帧：朝[主体]推轨或在其旁推轨，摄影机机身沿平滑路径移动，真实视差，不是变焦。视频：摄影机推轨，物理移动，视差围绕[主体]移动。明确说明推入、拉出或在旁。除非指复合运动，否则禁止使用“变焦”一词。"],"cp":["The camera dollies, physically traveling, parallax shifting around [Subject].","摄影机推轨，物理移动，视差围绕[主体]移动。"],"hp":["Dolly toward or beside [Subject], camera body traveling on a smooth path, true parallax, not a zoom.","朝[主体]推轨或在其旁推轨，摄影机机身沿平滑路径移动，真实视差，不是变焦。"],"fq":["Write a traveling camera body and true parallax. Example: Dolly toward or beside [Subject], camera body traveling on a smooth path, true parallax, not a zoom.","写一个移动的摄影机机身和真实视差。示例：朝[主体]推轨或在其旁推轨，摄影机机身沿平滑路径移动，真实视差，不是变焦。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/dolly-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-dolly-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly.jpg","r":[["Dolly In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-in-002-slow-dolly-in-mini.webp","Enter a mind, a room, or a threat. Geography changes because the camera walks."],["Dolly Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-out-04-dolly-out-v2-mini.webp","Leave someone behind, or show how small they are in the system."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."]],"z":"推轨镜头"},"dolly-in":{"t":"Dolly In","c":"camera-movement","g":"truck in","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-in","d":["A dolly in shot moves the entire camera through space on a wheeled or tracked support, advancing toward the subject at a measured pace. The nodal point walks, so foreground and background shift in parallax as the surroundings are progressively excluded.","推轨推入镜头让整个摄影机在带轮或轨道支撑上穿越空间移动，以受控速度朝主体推进。节点行走，因此随着周围环境逐渐被排除，前景和背景在视差中偏移。"],"pi":["Physical dolly in toward [Subject] on track, camera body gliding forward, parallax shifting foreground against background, 40mm spherical, buttery traction. For motion: the camera physically dollies forward toward [Subject] for 6 seconds. Foreground parallax, no optical zoom.","在轨道上向 [主体] 物理推轨，机身前移滑行，前后景产生视差位移，40mm 球面镜头，移动如黄油般顺滑。用于动态时：摄影机向 [主体] 物理前推 6 秒。保留前景视差，不要光学变焦。"],"cp":["An archivist sits at a desk and notices a familiar signature on an old letter. Begin in a medium-wide shot. Over eight seconds dolly slowly forward to a close-up, fixed lens, subtle foreground parallax, no zoom. Her eyes lift only at the end. Restrained daylight, no cut.","一位档案管理员坐在桌前，在一封旧信上认出熟悉的签名。以中远景起幅，八秒内缓慢推轨到特写，定焦镜头，轻微的前景视差，不变焦。她的目光直到最后才抬起。克制的日光，不切镜。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/002-slow-dolly-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-in-002-slow-dolly-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly-in.jpg","r":[["Push In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/push-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/push-in-push-in-mini.webp","A thought lands. Do not rush it."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."]],"z":"推轨推进"},"dolly-left":{"t":"Dolly Left","c":"camera-movement","g":"truck left","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-left","d":["A dolly left, also called a truck left, slides the whole camera sideways to the left on wheels or track. The lens stays aimed with the subject while background planes peel past in parallax.","推轨左移，也叫横向左平移，让整个摄影机在轮子或轨道上向左横向滑动。镜头始终对准主体，同时背景层面在视差中剥过。"],"pi":["Lateral dolly left across [Subject], camera sliding sideways on track, background planes peeling in parallax, subject tracked in frame. For motion: the camera slides left on a dolly, keeping [Subject] in frame, background parallax visible.","横向推轨左移穿过[主体]，摄影机在轨道上侧滑，背景层面在视差中剥开，主体被跟踪在画面内。动态：摄影机在推轨上向左滑动，让[主体]保持在画面内，背景视差可见。"],"cp":["The camera slides left on a dolly, keeping [Subject] in frame, background parallax visible.","摄影机在推轨上向左滑动，让[主体]保持在画面内，背景视差可见。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/05-dolly-left-v2-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-left-05-dolly-left-v2-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly-left-05-dolly-left-v2.jpg","r":[["Dolly Right","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-right","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-right-004-lateral-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Opposite of dolly left; pick the direction that reveals new information."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"推轨左移"},"dolly-out":{"t":"Dolly Out","c":"camera-movement","g":"truck out","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-out","d":["A dolly out shot withdraws the entire camera through space on a wheeled or tracked support. The world widens with true parallax, and the subject shrinks inside architecture because the station point has actually retreated.","推轨拉出镜头让整个摄影机在带轮或轨道支撑上穿越空间后退。世界以真实视差变宽，主体在建筑中缩小，因为机位点确实后退了。"],"pi":["Physical dolly out from [Subject], camera retreating on track, the world widening with true parallax, subject shrinking inside architecture. For motion: the camera physically dollies backward away from [Subject], revealing more environment with parallax.","从[主体]物理推轨拉出，摄影机在轨道上后退，世界以真实视差变宽，主体在建筑中缩小。动态：摄影机物理地向后推轨远离[主体]，以视差展现更多环境。"],"cp":["Start tightly on a calm pianist’s face. Pull the camera backward in one uninterrupted shot, fixed focal length, gradually revealing that the grand piano stands alone in a flooded ballroom. Keep the face natural and delay the water reveal until the middle of the shot.","从一位平静钢琴家的脸部特写开始。在一个不间断镜头中把摄影机向后拉，固定焦距，逐渐揭示出三角钢琴独自立在被水淹没的舞厅中。保持脸部自然，把水的揭示延迟到镜头中段。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/04-dolly-out-v2-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-out-04-dolly-out-v2-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly-out-04-dolly-out-v2.jpg","r":[["Pull Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pull-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pull-out-pull-out-mini.webp","Show the container around a feeling."],["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"推轨后拉"},"dolly-right":{"t":"Dolly Right","c":"camera-movement","g":"truck right","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-right","d":["A dolly right, or truck right, moves the camera body sideways to the right without panning. New space enters from one side of the frame while the other side exits, and layered parallax proves the translation.","推轨右移，或横向右平移，让摄影机机身向右横向移动而不摇镜。新空间从画面一侧进入，另一侧退出，分层视差证明这是平移。"],"pi":["Lateral dolly right across [Subject], smooth sideways travel, layered parallax, locked horizon. For motion: the camera slides right on a dolly, keeping [Subject] framed, smooth lateral parallax.","横向推轨右移穿过[主体]，平滑侧向移动，分层视差，地平线锁定。动态：摄影机在推轨上向右滑动，让[主体]保持在画面中，平滑横向视差。"],"cp":["The camera slides right on a dolly, keeping [Subject] framed, smooth lateral parallax.","摄影机在推轨上向右滑动，让[主体]保持在画面中，平滑横向视差。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/004-lateral-tracking-shot-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-right-004-lateral-tracking-shot-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly-right.jpg","r":[["Dolly Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-left-05-dolly-left-v2-mini.webp","Survey a space or stay with a walker without turning the camera."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"推轨右移"},"dolly-zoom":{"t":"Dolly Zoom","c":"camera-movement","g":"vertigo effect","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-zoom","d":["A dolly zoom combines camera movement and opposite zooming to preserve subject size while distorting perspective. It is not a zoom with a digital background stretch: translation and focal length work against each other.","推轨变焦结合摄影机运动和反向变焦，在扭曲透视的同时保持主体大小。它不是带数字背景拉伸的变焦：平移和焦距彼此对抗。"],"pi":["Dolly zoom on [Subject], camera dollies in while the lens zooms out so the figure stays the same size as the background warps, vertigo spatial contradiction, sickly perspective stretch. For motion: dolly zoom on [Subject]: the camera dollies while the lens counter-zooms so the subject size holds and the background warps.","对 [主体] 做变焦推拉：摄影机前推的同时镜头反向拉远，人物大小不变而背景发生扭曲，眩晕式的空间矛盾，令人不适的透视拉伸。用于动态时：对 [主体] 做变焦推拉——摄影机移动、镜头反向变焦，主体大小保持不变，背景被扭曲。"],"cp":["One continuous six-second shot of a station attendant realizing a train is missing. Dolly straight backward while optically zooming in at the compensating rate. Keep her head exactly the same height and centered; the long platform behind her appears to compress. She barely moves. Stable facial identity, rigid architecture, no cut, no ordinary push-in.","一个连续六秒的镜头：车站值班员意识到一趟列车不见了。摄影机笔直后拉，同时以补偿的比例光学变焦推近。让她的头保持在完全相同的高度并居中；她身后长长的站台看起来被压缩。她几乎不动。面部身份稳定，建筑笔直，不切镜，也不是普通的推近。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/001-dolly-zoom-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-zoom-001-dolly-zoom-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly-zoom.jpg","r":[["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."],["Dolly In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-in-002-slow-dolly-in-mini.webp","Enter a mind, a room, or a threat. Geography changes because the camera walks."],["Slow Zoom Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-out-02-slow-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp","Reveal context, isolation, or a joke that was off-screen."]],"z":"希区柯克变焦"},"dolly-zoom-in":{"t":"Dolly Zoom In","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-zoom-in","d":["A dolly zoom in approaches on wheels while the lens zooms out, so the figure holds or grows as the background warps inward. Counter-zoom is the point: size and space disagree.","推轨变焦推入在轮子上逼近，同时镜头变焦拉出，因此人物保持或变大，而背景向内扭曲。反向变焦是关键：大小和空间不一致。"],"pi":["Write both halves. Still: Dolly zoom in on [Subject], counter-zoom so the figure grows while the background warps inward, vertigo as approach. Video: Dolly in while zooming out on [Subject] so size holds or grows as space warps. Name both moves. Forbid a plain push.","写出两半。静帧：推轨变焦推入[主体]，反向变焦，让人物变大而背景向内扭曲，逼近时产生眩晕。视频：在推轨推入的同时对[主体]变焦拉出，让大小保持或变大而空间扭曲。明确说明两个运动。禁止普通推镜。"],"cp":["Dolly in while zooming out on [Subject] so size holds or grows as space warps.","在推轨推入的同时对[主体]变焦拉出，让大小保持或变大而空间扭曲。"],"hp":["Dolly zoom in on [Subject], counter-zoom so the figure grows while the background warps inward, vertigo as approach.","推轨变焦推入[主体]，反向变焦，让人物变大而背景向内扭曲，逼近时产生眩晕。"],"fq":["Write dolly in plus zoom out. Example: Dolly zoom in on [Subject], counter-zoom so the figure grows while the background warps inward.","写推轨推入加变焦拉出。示例：推轨变焦推入[主体]，反向变焦，让人物变大而背景向内扭曲。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/dolly-zoom-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-zoom-in-dolly-zoom-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly-zoom-in.jpg","r":[["Dolly Zoom","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-zoom","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-zoom-001-dolly-zoom-mini.webp","A realization that the ground is not stable. Use once."],["Push In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/push-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/push-in-push-in-mini.webp","A thought lands. Do not rush it."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"推轨变焦推入"},"dolly-zoom-out":{"t":"Dolly Zoom Out","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-zoom-out","d":["A dolly zoom out retreats on wheels while the lens zooms in, the figure shrinking or holding while space yawns. The background stretches away; the face can stay as the room leaves.","推轨变焦拉出在轮子上后退，同时镜头变焦推入，人物缩小或保持，而空间张开。背景拉伸远去；当房间离开时，脸部可以保持。"],"pi":["Dolly out, zoom in. Still: Dolly zoom out on [Subject], the figure shrinking or holding while space yawns, a retreat that stretches the room. Video: Dolly out while zooming in on [Subject], background stretching away. Both halves required.","后拉加推近。静帧：[主体] 的变焦拉远，人物缩小或保持大小而空间张开，一次把房间拉长的后退。视频：摄影机后拉的同时对 [主体] 变焦推近，背景被拉向远处。两个动作缺一不可。"],"cp":["Dolly out while zooming in on [Subject], background stretching away.","摄影机后拉的同时对 [主体] 变焦推近，背景被拉向远处。"],"hp":["Dolly zoom out on [Subject], the figure shrinking or holding while space yawns, a retreat that stretches the room.","推轨变焦拉出[主体]，人物缩小或保持，而空间张开，一种拉伸房间的后退。"],"fq":["Write dolly out plus zoom in. Example: Dolly zoom out on [Subject], the figure shrinking or holding while space yawns, a retreat that stretches the room.","写推轨拉出加变焦推入。示例：推轨变焦拉出[主体]，人物缩小或保持，而空间张开，一种拉伸房间的后退。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/dolly-zoom-out-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-zoom-out-dolly-zoom-out-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolly-zoom-out.jpg","r":[["Dolly Zoom","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-zoom","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-zoom-001-dolly-zoom-mini.webp","A realization that the ground is not stable. Use once."],["Pull Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pull-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pull-out-pull-out-mini.webp","Show the container around a feeling."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"推轨变焦拉出"},"double-dolly":{"t":"Double Dolly","c":"camera-movement","g":"Spike Lee float","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/double-dolly","d":["A double dolly shot moves performer and camera together on one rolling platform so their relative arrangement stays fixed. The actor appears to glide rather than walk: feet skating, weight transfer absent.","双推轨镜头让表演者与摄影机在同一移动平台上一起移动，因此二者的相对位置保持不变。演员看起来像滑行而非行走：双脚在滑，没有重心转移。"],"pi":["Double dolly on [Subject]: subject and camera share one rolling platform so the figure appears to glide, feet skating, Spike Lee floating grammar. For motion: [Subject] and the camera move together on the same dolly, creating a floating glide through the space.","对[主体]使用双推轨：[主体]与摄影机共享一个移动平台，让人物仿佛滑行，双脚像在滑冰，斯派克·李式的漂浮语法。运动时：[主体]与摄影机在同一推轨上一起移动，在空间中制造漂浮滑行感。"],"cp":["A detective stands completely still, feet planted, while she and the camera glide forward together down a long corridor. Her face stays the same size and position. Background moves smoothly backward. No walking cycle, no bobbing, no flying pose, solemn inevitability.","一名侦探完全静止站立，双脚钉住，而她与摄影机一起沿长走廊向前滑行。她的脸保持同样大小和位置。背景平稳向后移动。没有行走循环，没有上下晃动，没有飞行姿态，只有庄严的必然性。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/019-double-dolly-floating-shot-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-dolly-019-double-dolly-floating-shot-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/double-dolly.jpg","r":[["Dolly In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-in-002-slow-dolly-in-mini.webp","Enter a mind, a room, or a threat. Geography changes because the camera walks."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"双推轨"},"dutch-roll":{"t":"Dutch Roll","c":"camera-movement","g":"continuous roll","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dutch-roll","d":["A Dutch roll rotates the camera around the lens axis over time, so a level horizon becomes a canted one. Unease arrives as a move, not as a frozen Dutch still.","荷兰滚随时间让摄影机围绕镜头轴旋转，因此水平的地平线会变成倾斜的地平线。不安感以运动的方式到来，而不是一个冻结的荷兰角静帧。"],"pi":["Slow roll of the camera on its lens axis around [Subject], horizon rotating from level into a Dutch angle, the world itself tilting. For motion: the camera slowly rolls, tilting the horizon around [Subject] into a Dutch angle.","摄影机围绕[主体]沿镜头轴缓慢滚转，地平线从水平旋转为荷兰角，整个世界随之倾斜。运动时：摄影机缓慢滚转，围绕[主体]将地平线倾斜为荷兰角。"],"cp":["The camera slowly rolls, tilting the horizon around [Subject] into a Dutch angle.","摄影机缓慢滚转，围绕[主体]将地平线倾斜为荷兰角。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/dutch-roll-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-roll-dutch-roll-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dutch-roll.jpg","r":[["Dutch Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/dutch-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-angle-161-dutch-angle-mini.webp","The world is off its axis. Do not use as decoration."],["Camera Roll","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/camera-roll","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/camera-roll-016-camera-roll-mini.webp","Gravity is optional."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"荷兰角滚转"},"earth-zoom":{"t":"Earth Zoom","c":"camera-movement","g":"Powers-of-ten journey","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/earth-zoom","d":["An earth zoom is a continuous or apparently continuous rush from satellite scale down to a face, continent to street to person. Nested geography collapses along one axis; a smooth zoom is not proof of real travel speed.","地球变焦是一种从卫星尺度连续或看似连续地冲向一张脸的运动，从大陆到街道再到人。嵌套的地理沿一个轴线坍缩；平滑变焦并不能证明真实的移动速度。"],"pi":["Satellite to face, one axis. Still: Earth zoom into [Subject], satellite to street in one rush, the planet collapsing into a face. Video: A zoom from orbit down onto [Subject], continent to street to face. Ordered landmarks. No pan. Identity held.","卫星到面部，单一轴线。静帧：地球变焦推入[主体]，从卫星到街道一气呵成，行星坍缩成一张脸。视频：从轨道向下变焦到[主体]，从大陆到街道再到面部。地标有序。不要摇。保持身份一致。"],"cp":["Begin on a dew drop on one leaf. Pull backward continuously through the garden, neighborhood, coastline and cloud layer, ending above the planet. Keep one coherent outward axis, smooth logarithmic-feeling changes in scale and consistent daylight. Build as matched scale segments with composited handoffs; no random galaxy substitutions.","从一片叶子上的露珠开始。连续向后拉，穿过花园、街区、海岸线和云层，最终结束于行星上方。保持一条连贯的向外轴线、平滑且带有对数感的尺度变化和一致的日光。以匹配尺度的片段来构建，并用合成交接；不要随机替换成星系。"],"hp":["Earth zoom into [Subject], satellite to street in one rush, the planet collapsing into a face.","地球变焦推入[主体]，从卫星到街道一气呵成，行星坍缩成一张脸。"],"fq":["Write orbit to street to face on one axis. Example: Earth zoom into [Subject], satellite to street in one rush, the planet collapsing into a face.","写一个沿单一轴线从轨道到街道再到面部的运动。示例：地球变焦推入[主体]，从卫星到街道一气呵成，行星坍缩成一张脸。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/earth-zoom-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/earth-zoom-earth-zoom-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/earth-zoom.jpg","r":[["Aerial Push In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-push","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-push-aerial-push-mini.webp","Pick one human out of a system."],["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"地球变焦"},"eating-zoom":{"t":"Eating Zoom","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/eating-zoom","d":["An eating zoom is a crash into the bite, chopsticks or spoon as the last foreground, appetite as a punch-in. The move is optical and short; the dish should be nameable in the last frame.","进食变焦是急速推入那一口，筷子或勺子作为最后的前景，食欲如同猛推。该运动是光学变焦且短促；最后画面中的菜应该能被叫出名字。"],"pi":["Crash, food, hold. Still: Eating zoom on [Subject], a crash into the bite, chopsticks or spoon as the last foreground, appetite as a punch-in. Video: Crash zoom into [Subject] taking a bite, food and mouth filling the frame. Name the dish. Forbid a dolly.","急推、食物、停住。静帧：对[主体]使用进食变焦，急速推入那一口，筷子或勺子作为最后的前景，食欲如同猛推。视频：急推变焦到[主体]咬一口，食物和嘴充满画面。说出菜名。禁止推轨。"],"cp":["Crash zoom into [Subject] taking a bite, food and mouth filling the frame.","急推变焦到[主体]咬一口，食物和嘴充满画面。"],"hp":["Eating zoom on [Subject], a crash into the bite, chopsticks or spoon as the last foreground, appetite as a punch-in.","对[主体]使用进食变焦，急速推入那一口，筷子或勺子作为最后的前景，食欲如同猛推。"],"fq":["Write a snap into food meeting mouth. Example: Eating zoom on [Subject], a crash into the bite, chopsticks or spoon as the last foreground.","写一个猛推到食物接触嘴的镜头。示例：对[主体]使用进食变焦，急速推入那一口，筷子或勺子作为最后的前景。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/eating-zoom-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eating-zoom-eating-zoom-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/eating-zoom.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Mouth In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/mouth-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mouth-in-mouth-in-mini.webp","Speech or hunger is the scene."],["Macro","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/macro","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/macro-058-macro-insert-mini.webp","The plot is microscopic."]],"z":"吃播急推"},"eyes-in":{"t":"Eyes In","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/eyes-in","d":["An eyes in camera push travels into the gaze until the irises own the frame. It does not stop at a close-up; the portrait becomes an interior of sclera, iris, and catchlight.","眼睛推入镜头行进到凝视中，直到虹膜占据画面。它不会停在特写；肖像变成由巩膜、虹膜和眼神光构成的内部空间。"],"pi":["Name the travel and the end state. Still: Eyes-in push on [Subject], the camera traveling into the gaze until the irises own the frame, a portrait that becomes an interior. Video: The camera pushes into [Subject]'s eyes until the iris fills the frame. Keep catchlights. Forbid a cut to a new face.","说明运动方式和结束状态。静帧：对[主体]使用眼睛推入，摄影机行进到凝视中，直到虹膜占据画面，一幅肖像变成内部空间。视频：摄影机推入[主体]的眼睛，直到虹膜充满画面。保留眼神光。禁止切到一张新脸。"],"cp":["The camera pushes into [Subject]'s eyes until the iris fills the frame.","摄影机推入[主体]的眼睛，直到虹膜充满画面。"],"hp":["Eyes-in push on [Subject], the camera traveling into the gaze until the irises own the frame, a portrait that becomes an interior.","对[主体]使用眼睛推入，摄影机行进到凝视中，直到虹膜占据画面，一幅肖像变成内部空间。"],"fq":["Write a push that ends on an iris fill. Example: Eyes-in push on [Subject], the camera traveling into the gaze until the irises own the frame.","写一个以虹膜充满画面结束的推镜。示例：对[主体]使用眼睛推入，摄影机行进到凝视中，直到虹膜占据画面。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/eyes-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eyes-in-eyes-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/eyes-in.jpg","r":[["Push In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/push-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/push-in-push-in-mini.webp","A thought lands. Do not rush it."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Mouth In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/mouth-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mouth-in-mouth-in-mini.webp","Speech or hunger is the scene."]],"z":"推入眼睛"},"falling":{"t":"Falling","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/falling","d":["A falling camera drops the lens through air with weight and wind, a body or viewpoint in free fall. Gravity is the path: the ground rises, air rushes, and the horizon may not stay polite.","坠落摄影机让镜头带着重量和风穿过空气下落，一个身体或视点在自由落体。重力就是路径：地面上升，空气急速掠过，地平线可能不会保持端正。"],"pi":["Name the drop and the ground. Still: Falling camera with [Subject], the lens dropping through air, weight, and wind, a body or viewpoint in free fall. Video: The camera falls with [Subject], rushing air, ground rising, six seconds of drop. Forbid a gentle crane.","说明下落和地面。静帧：摄影机与[主体]一起坠落，镜头穿过空气、重量和风下落，一个身体或视点在自由落体。视频：摄影机与[主体]一起坠落，空气急速掠过，地面上升，下落六秒。禁止温和的摇臂。"],"cp":["The camera falls with [Subject], rushing air, ground rising, six seconds of drop.","摄影机与[主体]一起坠落，空气急速掠过，地面上升，下落六秒。"],"hp":["Falling camera with [Subject], the lens dropping through air, weight, and wind, a body or viewpoint in free fall. Video: six seconds of drop, rushing air, ground rising.","摄影机与[主体]一起坠落，镜头穿过空气、重量和风下落，一个身体或视点在自由落体。视频：下落六秒，空气急速掠过，地面上升。"],"fq":["Write a drop, rushing air, and ground rising. Example: Falling camera with [Subject], the lens dropping through air, weight, and wind, a body or viewpoint in free fall.","写一个下落、空气急速掠过和地面上升的镜头。示例：摄影机与[主体]一起坠落，镜头穿过空气、重量和风下落，一个身体或视点在自由落体。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/falling-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/falling-falling-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/falling.jpg","r":[["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."],["Ground Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/ground-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ground-level.webp","Start from the dirt."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"坠落镜头"},"fixed-cam":{"t":"Fixed Cam","c":"camera-movement","g":"locked camera","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fixed-cam","d":["A fixed camera locks position and tilt so all motion belongs to the world, not the operator. The mount does not pan, tilt, or travel; blocking has to finish the shot.","固定摄影机锁定位置和上下摇，因此所有运动都属于世界，而不是操作者。机位不摇、不上下摇、不移动；必须靠调度完成镜头。"],"pi":["Lock it. Still: Fixed camera on [Subject], locked position and tilt, all motion belonging to the world, not the operator. Video: Camera locked. Only [Subject] and the air move. Name the height. Forbid even a small pan.","锁住它。静帧：对[主体]使用固定摄影机，锁定位置和上下摇，所有运动都属于世界，而不是操作者。视频：摄影机锁定。只有[主体]和空气在动。说明高度。甚至禁止轻微摇。"],"cp":["Camera locked. Only [Subject] and the air move.","摄影机锁定。只有[主体]和空气在动。"],"hp":["Fixed camera on [Subject], locked position and tilt, all motion belonging to the world, not the operator.","对[主体]使用固定摄影机，锁定位置和上下摇，所有运动都属于世界，而不是操作者。"],"fq":["Write a locked position and tilt. Example: Fixed camera on [Subject], locked position and tilt, all motion belonging to the world, not the operator.","写一个锁定位置和上下摇的镜头。示例：对[主体]使用固定摄影机，锁定位置和上下摇，所有运动都属于世界，而不是操作者。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/fixed-cam-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fixed-cam-fixed-cam-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/fixed-cam.jpg","r":[["Static Locked-Off","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/static","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/static-022-locked-off-duration-mini.webp","Trust blocking and duration. Movement would be noise."],["Tableau","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/tableau","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tableau.webp","Hold the arrangement."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"固定摄影机"},"flying-cam-transition":{"t":"Flying Cam Transition","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/flying-cam-transition","d":["A flying cam transition is one continuous flight that punches a wall or window and lands in a new room. Architecture becomes a tunnel; the join is travel, not a hidden cut.","飞行摄影机转场是一次连续飞行，击穿墙壁或窗户并落在新房间。建筑变成隧道；连接处是运动，而不是隐藏剪辑。"],"pi":["Name the threshold and the landing. Still: Flying-cam transition through [Subject]'s world, one continuous flight that punches a wall or window and lands in a new room. Video: The camera flies through architecture around [Subject], passing a threshold into a new space. Show the hole. One move.","说明门槛和落点。静帧：飞行摄影机转场穿过[主体]的世界，一次连续飞行击穿墙壁或窗户并落在新房间。视频：摄影机飞过[主体]周围的建筑，穿过一个门槛进入新空间。展示洞口。一个运动。"],"cp":["The camera flies through architecture around [Subject], passing a threshold into a new space.","摄影机飞过[主体]周围的建筑，穿过一个门槛进入新空间。"],"hp":["Flying-cam transition through [Subject]'s world, one continuous flight that punches a wall or window and lands in a new room.","飞行摄影机转场穿过[主体]的世界，一次连续飞行击穿墙壁或窗户并落在新房间。"],"fq":["Write one flight through a named threshold into a new space. Example: Flying-cam transition through [Subject]'s world, one continuous flight that punches a wall or window and lands in a new room.","写一次飞过具名门槛进入新空间的飞行。示例：飞行摄影机转场穿过[主体]的世界，一次连续飞行击穿墙壁或窗户并落在新房间。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/flying-cam-transition-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/flying-cam-transition-flying-cam-transition-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/flying-cam-transition.jpg","r":[["Pass Through","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pass-through","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pass-through-pass-through-mini.webp","Cut the building, not the film."],["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."],["Set Transition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/set-transition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/set-transition-07-set-transition-mini.webp","Geography itself edits."]],"z":"飞行穿梭转场"},"follow":{"t":"Follow Shot","c":"camera-movement","g":"lead shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/follow","d":["A follow shot trails a moving subject at a fixed offset, usually from behind. The back of the head becomes foreground and the world opens ahead, so pursuit, haunting, or arrival is felt as walking into space.","跟随镜头以固定偏移尾随一个移动主体，通常从身后。后脑勺变成前景，世界在前方展开，因此追逐、萦绕或抵达被感受为走入空间。"],"pi":["Follow shot behind [Subject], camera trailing at a fixed offset, the back of the head as foreground, the world opening ahead. For motion: the camera follows behind [Subject], matching their movement through the space.","跟随镜头跟在[主体]身后，摄影机以固定偏移尾随，后脑勺作为前景，世界在前方展开。运动时：摄影机跟在[主体]身后，匹配他们穿过空间的运动。"],"cp":["The camera follows behind [Subject], matching their movement through the space.","摄影机跟在[主体]身后，匹配他们穿过空间的运动。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/005-rear-follow-tracking-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/follow-005-rear-follow-tracking-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/follow.jpg","r":[["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["SnorriCam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/snorricam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/snorricam-018-body-mounted-face-camera-mini.webp","Trap the audience in a body that cannot get out."]],"z":"跟随镜头"},"fpv-drone":{"t":"FPV Drone","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","d":["An FPV drone shot is first-person aerial flying: the camera banks, dives, and threads architecture at high speed. It is proximity and flight, a racing craft with a lens, not a slow crane and not a high establishing hover.","FPV无人机镜头是第一人称空中飞行：摄影机倾斜、俯冲，并高速穿行于建筑之间。它是贴近与飞行，一架带着镜头的竞速飞行器，而不是缓慢摇臂，也不是高空建立镜头的悬停。"],"pi":["FPV drone racing past [Subject], first-person flight, banking turns, proximity to architecture, motion blur on edges, extreme sports camera path. For motion: FPV drone flies past and around [Subject] with banking turns and proximity to structures.","FPV无人机从[主体]旁竞速掠过，第一人称飞行，倾斜转弯，贴近建筑，边缘运动模糊，极限运动摄影机路径。运动时：FPV无人机从[主体]旁飞过并环绕[主体]，带有倾斜转弯和贴近结构。"],"cp":["FPV drone flies past and around [Subject] with banking turns and proximity to structures.","FPV无人机从[主体]旁飞过并环绕[主体]，带有倾斜转弯和贴近结构。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/fpv-drone-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/fpv-drone.jpg","r":[["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"穿越机航拍"},"gimbal":{"t":"Gimbal Shot","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/gimbal","d":["A gimbal shot uses motorized stabilization for smooth handheld or vehicle-mounted movement. Electronic inertia damps roll and high-frequency shake while a human still carries the camera, freer than a dolly and cleaner than raw handheld.","稳定器镜头使用电动稳定来实现平滑的手持或车载运动。电子惯性抑制滚转和高频抖动，同时仍由人携带摄影机，比推轨更自由，比原始手持更干净。"],"pi":["Gimbal move with [Subject], electronically stabilized but still human-carried, smoother than handheld, freer than dolly, modern action grammar. For motion: smooth gimbal move following [Subject], stabilized but slightly human, gliding through the space.","对[主体]进行稳定器运动，电子稳定但仍由人持机，比手持更平滑，比推轨更自由，现代动作语法。运动：平滑的稳定器运动跟随[主体]，稳定但略带人味，滑行穿过空间。"],"cp":["Smooth gimbal move following [Subject], stabilized but slightly human, gliding through the space.","平滑的稳定器运动跟随[主体]，稳定但略带人味，滑行穿过空间。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/gimbal-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/gimbal-gimbal-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/gimbal.jpg","r":[["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"稳定器拍摄"},"handheld":{"t":"Handheld","c":"camera-movement","g":"shaky cam","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","d":["A handheld camera is operated from the body without a stabilizing vest or gimbal, so breathing, micro-shake, and mass stay in the frame. The image has the nerves of a person holding weight, not a track and not a motor.","手持摄影机由身体操作，不使用稳定背心或稳定器，因此呼吸、微抖和重量感都留在画面中。影像带着一个人承重时的神经感，不是轨道，也不是马达。"],"pi":["Handheld camera on [Subject], breathing micro-shake, documentary immediacy, Super 16 grain feel, the operator's body in the frame's nerves. For motion: handheld camera with natural operator shake holding [Subject] in frame. Organic micro-tremors, no stabilization.","手持摄影拍 [主体]，呼吸般的细微抖动，纪录片的现场感，Super 16 颗粒质感，把摄影者的身体写进画面的神经里。用于动态时：手持摄影机带着自然的抖动，把 [主体] 稳在画内。有机的微颤，不做稳定处理。"],"cp":["Inside a moving minibus, a compact camera pivots from two chatting passengers to the windscreen as a fallen tree blocks the road, then to the driver’s reaction and the rear window. One continuous-looking viewpoint, consistent seats, believable window parallax, restrained panic. Build separate interior and exterior plates when necessary.","在行驶的小巴车内，一台小型摄影机从两位闲聊的乘客转向挡风玻璃——倒下的树挡住了路——再转向司机的反应和后窗。保持单一连续视点，座椅位置一致，窗外视差可信，慌乱克制。必要时分别生成车内与车外素材。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/handheld.jpg","r":[["Gimbal Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/gimbal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/gimbal-gimbal-mini.webp","Run-and-gun smoothness without a Steadicam vest."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"手持"},"head-tracking":{"t":"Head Tracking","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/head-tracking","d":["A head tracking camera glues the lens to the skull so the face stays pinned while the background orbits. The head is the tripod; turns shear the room.","头部追踪摄影机把镜头粘在头骨上，因此面部固定不动，而背景环绕。头部就是三脚架；转头会让房间切变。"],"pi":["Glue to the skull. Still: Head-tracking camera on [Subject], the lens glued to the skull, background sliding as the face stays pinned. Video: The camera stays locked to [Subject]'s head as they turn, background orbiting. No extra zoom. Face sharp.","贴住头骨。静帧：头部追踪摄影机对准[主体]，镜头粘在头骨上，面部固定时背景滑动。视频：当[主体]转头时，摄影机始终锁定其头部，背景环绕。不要额外变焦。面部清晰。"],"cp":["The camera stays locked to [Subject]'s head as they turn, background orbiting.","当[主体]转头时，摄影机始终锁定其头部，背景环绕。"],"hp":["Head-tracking camera on [Subject], the lens glued to the skull, background sliding as the face stays pinned.","头部追踪摄影机对准[主体]，镜头粘在头骨上，面部固定时背景滑动。"],"fq":["Write a camera locked to the head, face sharp, world sliding. Example: Head-tracking camera on [Subject], the lens glued to the skull, background sliding as the face stays pinned.","写一个锁定头部的摄影机，面部清晰，世界滑动。示例：头部追踪摄影机对准[主体]，镜头粘在头骨上，面部固定时背景滑动。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/head-tracking-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/head-tracking-head-tracking-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/head-tracking.jpg","r":[["Locked-On","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/locked-on","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/locked-on-020-object-locked-moving-camera-mini.webp","One thing is the only stable point in a moving world."],["SnorriCam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/snorricam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/snorricam-018-body-mounted-face-camera-mini.webp","Trap the audience in a body that cannot get out."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"头部追踪"},"hero-cam":{"t":"Hero Cam","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/hero-cam","d":["Hero cam is a low three-quarter tracking walk with rim light, a comic-book arrival at walking speed. The recipe is height plus travel plus a hard edge of light, not a static low angle.","英雄机位是一种低角度四分之三侧面的跟拍行走，带轮廓光，以步速完成漫画式登场。配方是高度加移动加强硬的光边，而不是静态低角度。"],"pi":["Walk, low, rim. Still: Hero-cam on [Subject], low three-quarter, rim light, a walk that sells myth, comic-book arrival. Video: Low heroic tracking on [Subject] walking, rim light, mythic pace. They must be walking. One direction. No crash zoom.","行走，低角度，轮廓光。静帧：英雄机位对准[主体]，低角度四分之三侧面，轮廓光，一种令人信服的神话感行走，漫画式登场。视频：低角度英雄式跟拍[主体]行走，轮廓光，神话般节奏。他们必须在行走。一个方向。不要急推变焦。"],"cp":["Low heroic tracking on [Subject] walking, rim light, mythic pace.","低角度英雄式跟拍[主体]行走，轮廓光，神话般节奏。"],"hp":["Hero-cam on [Subject], low three-quarter, rim light, a walk that sells myth, comic-book arrival.","英雄机位对准[主体]，低角度四分之三侧面，轮廓光，一种令人信服的神话感行走，漫画式登场。"],"fq":["Write a low three-quarter tracking walk with rim light. Example: Hero-cam on [Subject], low three-quarter, rim light, a walk that sells myth, comic-book arrival.","写一个带轮廓光的低角度四分之三侧面跟拍行走。示例：英雄机位对准[主体]，低角度四分之三侧面，轮廓光，一种令人信服的神话感行走，漫画式登场。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/hero-cam-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hero-cam-hero-cam-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/hero-cam.jpg","r":[["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Glam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/glam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/glam.webp","Sell the face."]],"z":"英雄机位"},"hyperlapse":{"t":"Hyperlapse","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/hyperlapse","d":["A hyperlapse combines time-lapse with significant camera movement through space. Time is compressed while the camera advances in steps that assemble into a glide, so crowds and weather race along a real path.","移动延时把定时拍摄与显著的空间摄影机运动结合起来。时间被压缩，同时摄影机一步步推进并汇成滑行，因此人群和天气沿着真实路径飞驰。"],"pi":["Hyperlapse toward or around [Subject], time compressed, crowds and weather racing, camera advancing in steps that become a glide. For motion: hyperlapse: the camera advances through the space around [Subject] while time is compressed, clouds and traffic racing.","朝向或围绕[主体]的移动延时，时间被压缩，人群和天气飞驰，摄影机一步步推进并汇成滑行。运动：移动延时：摄影机在[主体]周围的空间中推进，同时时间被压缩，云和车流飞驰。"],"cp":["Hyperlapse: the camera advances through the space around [Subject] while time is compressed, clouds and traffic racing.","移动延时：摄影机在[主体]周围的空间中推进，同时时间被压缩，云和车流飞驰。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/hyperlapse-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hyperlapse-hyperlapse-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/hyperlapse.jpg","r":[["Time-Lapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/time-lapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/time-lapse-084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.webp","Show weather, construction, or a night becoming morning."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"移动延时"},"jib":{"t":"Jib Shot","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/jib","d":["A jib shot uses a short pivoting arm to raise, lower, or sweep the camera a few feet. It is a compact crane: small height change, often over a table, a walk, or a two-shot.","摇臂镜头使用短枢轴臂把摄影机升高、降低或横扫几英尺。它是一种紧凑的摇臂：高度变化小，通常越过桌子、行走或双人镜头。"],"pi":["Short jib move on [Subject], a compact crane arm lifting or sweeping a few feet, more intimate than a full Technocrane, elegant vertical accent. For motion: a compact jib arm lifts a few feet above [Subject] with a gentle sweep.","对[主体]进行短摇臂运动，一个紧凑的摇臂升起或横扫几英尺，比全尺寸伸缩摇臂更亲密，优雅的垂直强调。运动：一个紧凑的摇臂在[主体]上方升起几英尺，并轻柔横扫。"],"cp":["A compact jib arm lifts a few feet above [Subject] with a gentle sweep.","一个紧凑的摇臂在[主体]上方升起几英尺，并轻柔横扫。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/crane-up-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jib-crane-up-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/jib.jpg","r":[["Crane Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp","End a scene, reveal a city, or turn a person into landscape."],["Pedestal Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pedestal-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pedestal-up-06-pedestal-up-v2-mini.webp","Change height without the drama of a crane arc."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"小摇臂镜头"},"jib-down":{"t":"Jib Down","c":"camera-movement","g":"short crane down","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/jib-down","d":["A jib down camera is a short descending arm, a few feet of boom, intimate arrival with nearby foreground sliding as the camera sits down. It is a small crane, not a city-scale drop.","摇臂下降镜头是一段短下降臂，几英尺的摇臂行程，亲密的抵达，当摄影机坐下时附近前景滑动。它是小型摇臂，不是城市尺度的坠落。"],"pi":["Short arm, sit down. Still: Jib down onto [Subject], a short descending arm, intimate arrival, nearby foreground sliding as the camera sits down. Video: A short jib down into [Subject], small crane, the room arriving rather than a city-scale drop. Demand foreground slide. Forbid a tilt from sticks.","短臂，坐下。静帧：摇臂下降至[主体]，短下降臂，亲密的抵达，当摄影机坐下时附近前景滑动。视频：短摇臂下降进入[主体]，小型摇臂，房间到来，而不是城市尺度的坠落。要求前景滑动。禁止从三脚架上下摇。"],"cp":["A short jib down into [Subject], small crane, the room arriving rather than a city-scale drop.","短摇臂下降进入[主体]，小型摇臂，房间到来，而不是城市尺度的坠落。"],"hp":["Jib down onto [Subject], a short descending arm, intimate arrival, nearby foreground sliding as the camera sits down.","摇臂下降至[主体]，短下降臂，亲密的抵达，当摄影机坐下时附近前景滑动。"],"fq":["Write a short descending arm and sliding foreground. Example: Jib down onto [Subject], a short descending arm, intimate arrival, nearby foreground sliding as the camera sits down.","写一个短下降臂和滑动前景。示例：摇臂下降至[主体]，短下降臂，亲密的抵达，当摄影机坐下时附近前景滑动。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/jib-down-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jib-down-jib-down-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/jib-down.jpg","r":[["Crane Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-down-011-crane-down-detail-reveal-mini.webp","Arrive from god-view into a person."],["Jib Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/jib-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jib-up-jib-up-mini.webp","Leave the face, keep the architecture small."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"小摇臂下降"},"jib-up":{"t":"Jib Up","c":"camera-movement","g":"short crane up","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/jib-up","d":["A jib up camera is a short rising arm that gives a table or face back to the room, human-scale lift. Who else is present appears; a skyline does not have to.","摇臂上升镜头是一段短上升臂，把桌子或脸交还给房间，人尺度的提升。还有谁在场会出现；天际线不必出现。"],"pi":["Short rise, room returns. Still: Jib up from [Subject], a short rising arm, the table or face giving the room back, human-scale lift. Video: A short jib up from [Subject], revealing who else is in the room. Demand parallax. Forbid a tilt.","短升，房间回归。静帧：摇臂从[主体]升起，短上升臂，桌子或脸把房间交还，人尺度的提升。视频：短摇臂从[主体]升起，揭示房间里还有谁。要求视差。禁止上下摇。"],"cp":["A short jib up from [Subject], revealing who else is in the room.","短摇臂从[主体]升起，揭示房间里还有谁。"],"hp":["Jib up from [Subject], a short rising arm, the table or face giving the room back, human-scale lift.","摇臂从[主体]升起，短上升臂，桌子或脸把房间交还，人尺度的提升。"],"fq":["Write a short rising arm and a room reveal. Example: Jib up from [Subject], a short rising arm, the table or face giving the room back, human-scale lift.","写一个短上升臂和房间揭示。示例：摇臂从[主体]升起，短上升臂，桌子或脸把房间交还，人尺度的提升。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/jib-up-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jib-up-jib-up-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/jib-up.jpg","r":[["Crane Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp","End a scene, reveal a city, or turn a person into landscape."],["Jib Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/jib-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jib-down-jib-down-mini.webp","A full crane is too much city. Sit down into the talk."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"小摇臂上升"},"lazy-susan":{"t":"Lazy Susan","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/lazy-susan","d":["A lazy susan shot rotates the subject on a motorized turntable while the camera stays put, or the camera circles at a fixed product-hero radius. Distance holds, so scale does not change, and the far wall barely shears if the disc is what turns.","转盘镜头让主体在电动转盘上旋转，而摄影机不动，或摄影机在固定的产品英雄半径环绕。距离保持不变，因此尺度不变；如果转动的是圆盘，远处墙面几乎不会切变。"],"pi":["Quote the move, not a mood. Still: Lazy-Susan rotation of [Subject] on a turntable while the camera stays put, or the camera circles a static product, commercial 360 hero. Video: [Subject] rotates slowly as if on a turntable, or the camera circles at product-hero distance. Name the object, keep distance constant, forbid a zoom.","复现运动，而不是情绪。静帧：[主体]在转盘上做转盘式旋转，摄影机不动，或摄影机环绕静态产品，商业360度英雄镜头。视频：[主体]像在转盘上一样缓慢旋转，或摄影机在产品英雄距离环绕。点明物体，保持距离恒定，禁止变焦。"],"cp":["[Subject] rotates slowly as if on a turntable, or the camera circles at product-hero distance.","[主体]像在转盘上一样缓慢旋转，或摄影机在产品英雄距离环绕。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Write a turntable rotation or a camera circling at product-hero distance. Name the object, hold distance, and say no zoom. Example: Lazy-Susan rotation of [Subject] on a turntable while the camera stays put.","写一个转盘旋转，或摄影机在产品英雄距离环绕。点明物体，保持距离，并说明不要变焦。示例：[主体]在转盘上做转盘式旋转，摄影机不动。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/lazy-susan-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lazy-susan-lazy-susan-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/lazy-susan.jpg","r":[["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."],["Slow Zoom Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-out-02-slow-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp","Reveal context, isolation, or a joke that was off-screen."]],"z":"转盘拍摄"},"locked-on":{"t":"Locked-On","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/locked-on","d":["A locked-on shot keeps one object or face glued in frame while the world streams past, as if the camera were bolted to a vehicle, a fall, or a spinning set. The subject is the only stable point.","锁定镜头让一个物体或脸粘在画面中，而世界流过去，仿佛摄影机固定在车辆、坠落物或旋转布景上。主体是唯一稳定的点。"],"pi":["Locked-on move with [Subject], camera glued to one object or face while the environment streams past, as if bolted to a vehicle or a falling body. For motion: the camera stays locked on [Subject] while the environment streams past them.","对[主体]进行锁定运动，摄影机粘在一个物体或脸上，而环境流过去，仿佛固定在车辆或坠落的身体上。运动：摄影机始终锁定[主体]，而环境从他们身边流过。"],"cp":["The camera stays locked on [Subject] while the environment streams past them.","摄影机始终锁定[主体]，而环境从他们身边流过。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/020-object-locked-moving-camera-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/locked-on-020-object-locked-moving-camera-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/locked-on.jpg","r":[["SnorriCam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/snorricam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/snorricam-018-body-mounted-face-camera-mini.webp","Trap the audience in a body that cannot get out."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"锁定跟踪"},"mouth-in":{"t":"Mouth In","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/mouth-in","d":["A mouth in camera move enters speech or appetite until lips and teeth become the set. The camera travels past the portrait into the orifice as landscape.","入嘴运镜进入言语或食欲，直到嘴唇与牙齿成为场景。摄影机越过肖像，进入作为景观的开口。"],"pi":["Demand the camera end past the lips. Still: Mouth-in move on [Subject], the camera entering speech or appetite, lips as landscape. Video: The camera pushes into [Subject]'s mouth until lips and teeth become the set. Keep the rest of the body out. One move.","要求摄影机越过嘴唇后结束。静帧：对[主体]进行入嘴运镜，摄影机进入言语或食欲，嘴唇作为景观。视频：摄影机推入[主体]的嘴，直到嘴唇与牙齿成为场景。将身体其余部分排除在外。一个动作。"],"cp":["The camera pushes into [Subject]'s mouth until lips and teeth become the set.","摄影机推入[主体]的嘴，直到嘴唇与牙齿成为场景。"],"hp":["Mouth-in move on [Subject], the camera entering speech or appetite, lips as landscape.","对[主体]进行入嘴运镜，摄影机进入言语或食欲，嘴唇作为景观。"],"fq":["Write a push that ends past the lips. Example: Mouth-in move on [Subject], the camera entering speech or appetite, lips as landscape.","写一个越过嘴唇后结束的推镜。例如：对[主体]进行入嘴运镜，摄影机进入言语或食欲，嘴唇作为景观。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/mouth-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mouth-in-mouth-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/mouth-in.jpg","r":[["Eyes In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/eyes-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eyes-in-eyes-in-mini.webp","The thought is in the eye. Go there."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Eating Zoom","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/eating-zoom","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eating-zoom-eating-zoom-mini.webp","The bite is the cut."]],"z":"推入嘴部"},"omnidirectional":{"t":"Omnidirectional","c":"camera-movement","g":"360 video","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/omnidirectional","d":["Omnidirectional capture uses a 360 camera to record spherical space, so the viewer can look any way and there is no behind the camera. Off-screen ceases to exist as a hiding place.","全向拍摄使用360摄影机记录球形空间，因此观众可以看向任何方向，摄影机背后也不存在。画外作为藏匿之处不复存在。"],"pi":["Name the sphere and the lack of off-screen. Still: Omnidirectional capture of [Subject], a world that can look every way, spherical space, no off-screen. Video: A 360-degree world around [Subject], camera able to look anywhere. Forbid a single directed pan as the whole idea.","命名球体并说明没有画外。静帧：[主体]的全向拍摄，一个可以看向四面八方的世界，球形空间，没有画外。视频：围绕[主体]的360度世界，摄影机可以看向任何地方。禁止把单一有方向的摇镜作为整个想法。"],"cp":["A 360-degree world around [Subject], camera able to look anywhere.","围绕[主体]的360度世界，摄影机可以看向任何地方。"],"hp":["Omnidirectional capture of [Subject], a world that can look every way, spherical space, no off-screen.","[主体]的全向拍摄，一个可以看向四面八方的世界，球形空间，没有画外。"],"fq":["Write spherical space and look-anywhere. Example: Omnidirectional capture of [Subject], a world that can look every way, spherical space, no off-screen.","写球形空间和可看向任何地方。例如：[主体]的全向拍摄，一个可以看向四面八方的世界，球形空间，没有画外。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/omnidirectional-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/omnidirectional-omnidirectional-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/omnidirectional.jpg","r":[["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["First-Person","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/first-person","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/first-person-first-person-mini.webp","The audience is the character."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"全向拍摄"},"orbit-360":{"t":"360-Degree Orbit","c":"camera-movement","g":"circular tracking","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","d":["A 360-degree orbit shot circles the subject through a full turn, usually at a constant radius, always facing them. The background becomes a continuous ribbon while the person stays the center of interest.","360度环绕镜头绕主体完整转一圈，通常保持恒定半径，始终朝向主体。背景变成一条连续的带状，而人物始终是视觉中心。"],"pi":["Full 360-degree orbit around [Subject], camera circling at constant radius, background becoming a continuous ribbon of light, centripetal romantic or predatory energy. For motion: the camera orbits 360 degrees around [Subject], always facing them, background wrapping as a ribbon of light.","围绕 [主体] 做完整 360 度环绕，摄影机以恒定半径绕行，背景连成一条连续的光带，带来向心的浪漫感或捕猎感。用于动态时：摄影机绕 [主体] 环行 360 度，始终朝向对方，背景像光带一样卷绕。"],"cp":["Orbit clockwise 120 degrees around a violinist standing still in an empty circular hall. Keep her eyes near the same point in frame, natural live-speed motion, constant camera distance, no zoom. Columns reveal genuine changing perspective. One uninterrupted eight-second take.","在空荡的圆形大厅里，围绕站着不动的小提琴手顺时针环绕 120 度。让她的眼睛保持在画面中大致相同的位置，实时速度，摄影机距离恒定，不变焦。柱子在绕行中呈现真实的透视变化。一个不间断的八秒长镜头。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/orbit-360.jpg","r":[["Arc Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-left-arc-left-mini.webp","Change the axis of a conversation or reveal the other half of a room."],["Arc Right","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/arc-right","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/arc-right-arc-right-mini.webp","Same as arc left, other side."],["Lazy Susan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/lazy-susan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lazy-susan-lazy-susan-mini.webp","Show an object or costume from every side."]],"z":"360°环绕"},"pan":{"t":"Pan","c":"camera-movement","g":"Pan shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pan","d":["A pan shot rotates the camera horizontally around a fixed position, yaw on the vertical axis, feet planted. The support does not travel; the horizon should stay level as the frame sweeps the world.","摇镜围绕固定位置水平旋转摄影机，绕垂直轴偏航，双脚站定。支撑不移动；当画框扫过世界时，地平线应保持水平。"],"pi":["Plant the feet. Still: Pan across [Subject], camera rotating on its vertical axis from a fixed point, a horizontal sweep of the world. Video: The camera pans across [Subject] from a tripod, horizon level, no body travel. Name start and end facts. Forbid a dolly.","站稳双脚。静帧：摇过[主体]，摄影机从固定点绕其垂直轴旋转，对世界进行水平扫视。视频：摄影机从三脚架摇过[主体]，地平线保持水平，机身不移动。点明起始和结束事实。禁止推轨。"],"cp":["Two siblings argue quietly at a kitchen table. Hold a two-shot; when one stands, gently tilt and pan to include her without cutting. As she leans back toward the seated brother, settle into a tighter shared composition. No arbitrary camera movement.","两个兄弟姐妹在厨房桌旁安静争吵。保持双人镜头；当其中一人站起时，轻轻上下摇并摇镜把她纳入画面，而不剪辑。当她向后靠向坐着的兄弟时，落定成更紧凑的共享构图。不要任意的摄影机运动。"],"hp":["Pan across [Subject], camera rotating on its vertical axis from a fixed point, a horizontal sweep of the world.","摇过[主体]，摄影机从固定点绕其垂直轴旋转，对世界进行水平扫视。"],"fq":["Write a tripod, a level horizon, and no body travel. Example: Pan across [Subject], camera rotating on its vertical axis from a fixed point, a horizontal sweep of the world.","写三脚架、水平地平线，并且机身不移动。例如：摇过[主体]，摄影机从固定点绕其垂直轴旋转，对世界进行水平扫视。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/pan-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pan-pan-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pan.jpg","r":[["Pan Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pan-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pan-left-pan-left-mini.webp","Connect two things in one geography without moving the support."],["Pan Right","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pan-right","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pan-right-008-pan-and-discovery-mini.webp","Same as pan left, other direction. End on the story beat."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."]],"z":"摇镜头"},"pan-left":{"t":"Pan Left","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pan-left","d":["A pan left is pan shot cinematography that rotates the camera on a fixed tripod or head around its vertical axis, sweeping the view to the left. The support does not travel; only the direction of the lens changes.","左摇是摇镜摄影，摄影机在固定三脚架或云台上绕其垂直轴旋转，将视野向左扫过。支撑不移动；只有镜头方向改变。"],"pi":["Slow pan left from a locked tripod across [Subject], camera rotating on its vertical axis, horizon level, revealing new architecture to the left. For motion: the camera pans left from a fixed tripod, sweeping across [Subject] and the environment. No body travel.","在锁定的三脚架上向左缓慢摇摄，扫过 [主体]，摄影机绕垂直轴旋转，地平线保持水平，向左侧逐步揭示新的建筑。用于动态时：摄影机在固定三脚架上向左摇，扫过 [主体] 与环境。机身不移动。"],"cp":["The camera pans left from a fixed tripod, sweeping across [Subject] and the environment. No body travel.","摄影机在固定三脚架上向左摇摄，扫过 [主体] 与周围环境。机身不移动。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/pan-left-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pan-left-pan-left-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pan-left.jpg","r":[["Pan Right","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pan-right","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pan-right-008-pan-and-discovery-mini.webp","Same as pan left, other direction. End on the story beat."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Tilt Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-up-009-tilt-reveal-mini.webp","Reveal height, awe, or a face last."]],"z":"向左摇"},"pan-right":{"t":"Pan Right","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pan-right","d":["A pan right shot is a horizontal rotation of a locked-off camera toward the right. It connects two parts of the same geography in one continuous turn from a single station point.","右摇镜头是锁定摄影机向右的水平旋转。它从单一机位、在一个连续转动中连接同一空间地理的两个部分。"],"pi":["Slow pan right from a locked tripod across [Subject], fluid head rotation, level horizon, a continuous horizontal reveal. For motion: the camera pans right from a fixed tripod across [Subject]. Smooth horizontal rotation only.","从锁定三脚架缓慢右摇过[主体]，液压云台旋转，地平线水平，连续水平揭示。运动版本：摄影机从固定三脚架右摇过[主体]。仅平滑的水平旋转。"],"cp":["The camera pans right from a fixed tripod across [Subject]. Smooth horizontal rotation only.","摄影机从固定三脚架右摇过[主体]。仅平滑的水平旋转。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/008-pan-and-discovery-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pan-right-008-pan-and-discovery-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pan-right.jpg","r":[["Pan Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pan-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pan-left-pan-left-mini.webp","Connect two things in one geography without moving the support."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"向右摇"},"parallax":{"t":"Parallax","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/parallax","d":["Parallax cinematography is the relative apparent motion between near and far objects as the camera translates. Near things race, far things crawl; that speed difference is how the image proves the world has layers.","视差摄影是当摄影机平移时，近处与远处物体之间相对的视觉运动。近处事物飞驰，远处事物爬行；这种速度差就是画面证明世界有层次的方式。"],"pi":["Name near, mid, and far, and make them disagree in speed. Still: Parallax around [Subject], near things racing, far things crawling, depth proven by relative speed. Video: Camera moves so foreground around [Subject] slides faster than the background. Forbid a zoom.","命名近景、中景和远景，并让它们在速度上不一致。静帧：[主体]周围的视差，近处事物飞驰，远处事物爬行，深度由相对速度证明。视频：摄影机移动，使[主体]周围的前景比背景滑动得更快。禁止变焦。"],"cp":["Camera moves so foreground around [Subject] slides faster than the background.","摄影机移动，使[主体]周围的前景比背景滑动得更快。"],"hp":["Parallax around [Subject], near things racing, far things crawling, depth proven by relative speed.","[主体]周围的视差，近处事物飞驰，远处事物爬行，深度由相对速度证明。"],"fq":["Write a translating camera and a near object that slides faster than the far plane. Example: Parallax around [Subject], near things racing, far things crawling, depth proven by relative speed.","写一个平移的摄影机和一个比远平面滑动更快的近处物体。例如：[主体]周围的视差，近处事物飞驰，远处事物爬行，深度由相对速度证明。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/parallax-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/parallax-parallax-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/parallax.jpg","r":[["Dolly","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-dolly-mini.webp","Walk the camera. Change geography."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"视差运镜"},"pass-through":{"t":"Pass Through","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pass-through","d":["A camera pass through travels through a wall, a body, or a window as if matter were optional. The path is continuous: one side of the barrier, its thickness, then the next space, without a cut.","穿越镜头穿过墙壁、身体或窗户，仿佛物质是可选的。路径是连续的：屏障的一侧、其厚度，然后是下一个空间，不剪切。"],"pi":["Name the barrier and the far side. Still: Pass-through of [Subject], the camera traveling through a wall, a body, a window as if matter were optional. Video: The camera passes through architecture or [Subject] into the next space. Show the hole. Forbid a hidden wipe.","写明穿过的屏障和另一侧。静帧：[主体] 的穿越镜头，摄影机穿过墙、身体或窗户，仿佛物质可以忽略。视频：摄影机穿过建筑或 [主体] 进入下一个空间。要露出穿透的孔洞。禁止用隐藏的划像糊过去。"],"cp":["The camera passes through architecture or [Subject] into the next space.","摄影机穿过建筑或 [主体]，进入下一个空间。"],"hp":["Pass-through of [Subject], the camera traveling through a wall, a body, a window as if matter were optional.","[主体]的穿越，摄影机穿过墙壁、身体、窗户，仿佛物质是可选的。"],"fq":["Name the barrier and the arrival space, and keep the path continuous. Example: Pass-through of [Subject], the camera traveling through a wall, a body, a window as if matter were optional.","命名屏障和到达空间，并保持路径连续。例如：[主体]的穿越，摄影机穿过墙壁、身体、窗户，仿佛物质是可选的。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/pass-through-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pass-through-pass-through-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pass-through.jpg","r":[["Object Portal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/object-portal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/object-portal-object-portal-mini.webp","A prop is a wormhole."],["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"穿越镜头"},"pedestal-down":{"t":"Pedestal Down","c":"camera-movement","g":"pedestal up","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pedestal-down","d":["A pedestal down lowers the entire camera vertically without changing its tilt. The descent stays on one axis: a calm drop through the same look, not a nod and not a crane swoop.","升降台下降使整个摄影机垂直降低，而不改变其俯仰。下降保持在一条轴线上：以同样的视角平静下坠，不是点头，也不是摇臂俯冲。"],"pi":["Pedestal down on [Subject], camera lowering vertically, no tilt, a calm descent through the same axis. For motion: the camera lowers straight down on a pedestal, keeping tilt constant, settling onto [Subject].","对[主体]进行升降台下降，摄影机垂直降低，不上下摇，沿同一轴线平静下降。运动版本：摄影机在升降台上笔直下降，保持俯仰不变，落定到[主体]上。"],"cp":["The camera lowers straight down on a pedestal, keeping tilt constant, settling onto [Subject].","摄影机在升降台上笔直下降，保持俯仰不变，落定到[主体]上。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/pedestal-down-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pedestal-down-pedestal-down-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pedestal-down.jpg","r":[["Crane Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-down-011-crane-down-detail-reveal-mini.webp","Arrive from god-view into a person."],["Pedestal Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pedestal-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pedestal-up-06-pedestal-up-v2-mini.webp","Change height without the drama of a crane arc."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"垂直下降"},"pedestal-up":{"t":"Pedestal Up","c":"camera-movement","g":"boom up","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pedestal-up","d":["A pedestal shot moves the entire camera vertically without changing its tilt. The lens rises on a column, eyeline climbs, and architecture slides down the frame while pitch stays constant.","升降台镜头使整个摄影机垂直移动，而不改变其俯仰。镜头在立柱上升高，视线攀升，建筑沿画框下滑，同时俯仰保持不变。"],"pi":["Pedestal up on [Subject], camera rising vertically on a column with no tilt change, eyeline climbing, architecture sliding down the frame. For motion: the camera rises straight up on a pedestal, keeping the same tilt, lifting past [Subject].","对[主体]进行升降台上升，摄影机在立柱上垂直升高，不改变俯仰，视线攀升，建筑沿画框下滑。运动版本：摄影机在升降台上笔直上升，保持相同俯仰，升过[主体]。"],"cp":["The camera rises straight up on a pedestal, keeping the same tilt, lifting past [Subject].","摄影机在升降台上笔直上升，保持相同俯仰，升过[主体]。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/06-pedestal-up-v2-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pedestal-up-06-pedestal-up-v2-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pedestal-up-06-pedestal-up-v2.jpg","r":[["Crane Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp","End a scene, reveal a city, or turn a person into landscape."],["Pedestal Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pedestal-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pedestal-down-pedestal-down-mini.webp","Return to human height after a high formal view."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"垂直升起"},"pull-out":{"t":"Pull Out","c":"camera-movement","g":"pull-out","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pull-out","d":["A pull out shot moves physically or virtually away from the subject so more environment enters around a person or detail. Intimacy widens into context without changing lenses.","拉出镜头以物理或虚拟方式远离主体，让更多环境在人物或细节周围进入画面。无需更换镜头，亲密感便扩展为语境。"],"pi":["Slow pull out from [Subject], intimacy widening into environment, the person remaining while the world claims them. For motion: slow pull out from [Subject], the frame widening to reveal the environment.","从[主体]缓慢拉出，亲密感向外扩展为环境，人物仍在原地，而世界将其吞没。动态：从[主体]缓慢拉出，画面逐渐展开，露出环境。"],"cp":["Slow pull out from [Subject], the frame widening to reveal the environment.","从[主体]缓慢拉出，画面逐渐展开，露出环境。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/pull-out-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pull-out-pull-out-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pull-out.jpg","r":[["Dolly Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-out-04-dolly-out-v2-mini.webp","Leave someone behind, or show how small they are in the system."],["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"拉镜头"},"push-in":{"t":"Push In","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/push-in","d":["A push in shot moves physically or virtually closer to the subject so size grows because the camera walks. It is a short pressure advance, often so gradual the audience feels the walls close before they notice motion.","推近镜头以物理或虚拟方式靠近主体，所以随着摄影机向前移动，主体尺寸变大。它是一次短促的压迫式推进，通常缓慢到观众先感到四壁合拢，才注意到运动。"],"pi":["Imperceptibly slow push in on [Subject], the camera closing from medium to medium close-up so gradually the audience feels walls closing before they notice motion. For motion: very slow push in toward [Subject] over 6 seconds, medium into medium close-up.","难以察觉地缓慢推近[主体]，摄影机从中景推到中近景，缓慢到观众先感到四壁合拢，才察觉运动。动态：在6秒内非常缓慢地推近[主体]，从中景到中近景。"],"cp":["Very slow push in toward [Subject] over 6 seconds, medium into medium close-up.","在6秒内非常缓慢地推近[主体]，从中景到中近景。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/push-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/push-in-push-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/push-in.jpg","r":[["Dolly In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-in-002-slow-dolly-in-mini.webp","Enter a mind, a room, or a threat. Geography changes because the camera walks."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."],["Slow Zoom Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-out-02-slow-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp","Reveal context, isolation, or a joke that was off-screen."]],"z":"推镜头"},"rapid-zoom-in":{"t":"Rapid Zoom In","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/rapid-zoom-in","d":["A rapid zoom in snaps focal length faster than a polite crash, almost a cut, the world tightening in a few frames, then a hold. The camera body does not travel.","快速变焦推近会在几帧内以比一次克制的急推还快的速度猛地改变焦距，几乎像切，世界收紧，然后保持。摄影机机身不移动。"],"pi":["Faster than a crash, then hold. Still: Rapid zoom in on [Subject], faster than a polite crash, almost a cut, the world snapping tight. Video: Extremely fast zoom into [Subject], nearly a cut, then a hold. Body still. Forbid wheels.","比急推还快，然后保持。静帧：快速变焦推近[主体]，比一次克制的急推还快，几乎像切，世界猛地收紧。视频：极快变焦推近[主体]，几乎像切，然后保持。机身不动。禁止使用轮子。"],"cp":["Extremely fast zoom into [Subject], nearly a cut, then a hold.","极快变焦推近[主体]，几乎像切，然后保持。"],"hp":["Rapid zoom in on [Subject], faster than a polite crash, almost a cut, the world snapping tight.","快速变焦推近[主体]，比一次克制的急推还快，几乎像切，世界猛地收紧。"],"fq":["Write an extremely fast zoom, then a hold. Example: Rapid zoom in on [Subject], faster than a polite crash, almost a cut, the world snapping tight.","写一个极快变焦，然后保持。示例：快速变焦推近[主体]，比一次克制的急推还快，几乎像切，世界猛地收紧。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/rapid-zoom-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rapid-zoom-in-rapid-zoom-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/rapid-zoom-in.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["YoYo Zoom","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/yoyo-zoom","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/yoyo-zoom-yoyo-zoom-mini.webp","One axis, two punches."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"快速变焦推近"},"rapid-zoom-out":{"t":"Rapid Zoom Out","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/rapid-zoom-out","d":["A rapid zoom out snaps from the subject to a wide, the environment exploding into view, then holds. Reveal as shock or joke; the camera body still does not travel.","快速变焦拉远会从主体猛地拉到广角，环境炸入画面，然后保持。作为惊吓或笑点揭示；摄影机机身依然不移动。"],"pi":["Snap to wide, hold. Still: Rapid zoom out from [Subject], the environment exploding into view in a snap. Video: Snap zoom out from [Subject] to a wide, then hold. Name what appears. Forbid a dolly reverse.","猛地拉到广角，保持。静帧：快速变焦拉远[主体]，环境在瞬间炸入画面。视频：急速变焦拉远[主体]至广角，然后保持。说明出现了什么。禁止推轨反向移动。"],"cp":["Snap zoom out from [Subject] to a wide, then hold.","急速变焦拉远[主体]至广角，然后保持。"],"hp":["Rapid zoom out from [Subject], the environment exploding into view in a snap.","快速变焦拉远[主体]，环境在瞬间炸入画面。"],"fq":["Write a snap to a wide, then a hold. Example: Rapid zoom out from [Subject], the environment exploding into view in a snap.","写一个猛地拉到广角，然后保持。示例：快速变焦拉远[主体]，环境在瞬间炸入画面。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/rapid-zoom-out-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rapid-zoom-out-rapid-zoom-out-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/rapid-zoom-out.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-out-03-crash-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp","Shock-reveal scale or undercut a close moment."],["Pull Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pull-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pull-out-pull-out-mini.webp","Show the container around a feeling."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"快速变焦拉远"},"road-rush":{"t":"Road Rush","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/road-rush","d":["A road rush camera sits low to the asphalt, speed as smear, headlights and lane lines as weapons. The road is the subject; a vehicle is optional.","道路疾驰镜头贴近柏油路面，速度化为拖影，车灯与车道线如武器。道路就是主体；车辆可有可无。"],"pi":["Get down. Still: Road-rush of [Subject], low to the asphalt, speed as smear, headlights and lane lines as weapons. Video: Low camera rushing along the road with [Subject], speed blur, lane lines streaking. Fill the frame with road. Forbid a standing-height beauty pass.","放低。静帧：[主体]的道路疾驰，贴近柏油路面，速度化为拖影，车灯与车道线如武器。视频：低机位摄影机与[主体]沿道路疾驰，速度模糊，车道线拉成条纹。让道路充满画面。禁止站姿高度的唯美扫过。"],"cp":["Low camera rushing along the road with [Subject], speed blur, lane lines streaking.","低机位摄影机与[主体]沿道路疾驰，速度模糊，车道线拉成条纹。"],"hp":["Road-rush of [Subject], low to the asphalt, speed as smear, headlights and lane lines as weapons.","[主体]的道路疾驰，贴近柏油路面，速度化为拖影，车灯与车道线如武器。"],"fq":["Write a low rush along asphalt with streaking lanes. Example: Road-rush of [Subject], low to the asphalt, speed as smear, headlights and lane lines as weapons.","写一个沿柏油路面低机位疾驰、车道线拉成条纹的镜头。示例：[主体]的道路疾驰，贴近柏油路面，速度化为拖影，车灯与车道线如武器。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/road-rush-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/road-rush-road-rush-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/road-rush.jpg","r":[["Car Chasing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/car-chasing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/car-chasing-car-chasing-mini.webp","Two machines, one argument."],["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."],["Motion Blur","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/motion-blur","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/motion-blur-01-motion-blur-mini.webp","Speed or trauma. Clarity would be false."]],"z":"贴地疾驰"},"robo-arm":{"t":"Robo Arm","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/robo-arm","d":["A robotic camera arm runs a programmed path with inhuman precision, repeatable every take for product geometry or a stunt match. No operator shake; the spline is the performance.","机械臂摄影机以非人精度运行预设路径，每次拍摄都可重复，用于产品几何或特技匹配。没有操作员抖动；样条曲线就是表演。"],"pi":["Programmed, repeatable, no shake. Still: Robotic arm move around [Subject], programmed path, inhuman precision, product or stunt geometry. Video: A precise robotic-arm path around [Subject], repeatable, no human shake. Name the path shape. Forbid handheld error.","编程控制，可重复，无抖动。静帧：机械臂围绕[主体]运动，预设路径，非人精度，产品或特技几何轨迹。视频：精确的机械臂路径围绕[主体]，可重复，无人体抖动。说明路径形状。禁止手持误差。"],"cp":["A precise robotic-arm path around [Subject], repeatable, no human shake.","精确的机械臂路径围绕[主体]，可重复，无人体抖动。"],"hp":["Robotic arm move around [Subject], programmed path, inhuman precision, product or stunt geometry.","机械臂围绕[主体]运动，预设路径，非人精度，产品或特技几何轨迹。"],"fq":["Write a programmed path with no shake. Example: Robotic arm move around [Subject], programmed path, inhuman precision, product or stunt geometry.","写一个无抖动的预设路径。示例：机械臂围绕[主体]运动，预设路径，非人精度，产品或特技几何轨迹。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/robo-arm-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/robo-arm-robo-arm-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/robo-arm.jpg","r":[["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Bolt Cam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/bolt-cam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bolt-cam-bolt-cam-mini.webp","The camera itself is the punch."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"机械臂运镜"},"slider":{"t":"Slider Shot","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slider","d":["A slider shot is a short, precise linear move on a compact rail, often 60 to 120 centimeters. It adds parallax to an interview, product, or lock-off without a full dolly track.","滑轨镜头是在紧凑轨道上进行短而精确的线性移动，通常为60至120厘米。它为采访、产品或固定镜头增加视差，无需完整推轨轨道。"],"pi":["Short slider move across [Subject], 60 to 120 centimeters of lateral travel, product or interview parallax, precise and small. For motion: a short slider move laterally across [Subject], subtle parallax, 6 seconds.","短距离滑轨横移经过[主体]，60至120厘米的横向行程，产品或采访视差，精确而幅度小。动态：短距离滑轨横向移动经过[主体]，轻微视差，6秒。"],"cp":["A short slider move laterally across [Subject], subtle parallax, 6 seconds.","短距离滑轨横向移动经过[主体]，轻微视差，6秒。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/slider-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slider-slider-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/slider.jpg","r":[["Dolly Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-left-05-dolly-left-v2-mini.webp","Survey a space or stay with a walker without turning the camera."],["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"滑轨镜头"},"slow-zoom-in":{"t":"Slow Zoom In","c":"camera-movement","g":"gradual zoom","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","d":["A slow zoom in is slow zoom in cinematography that tightens the frame by increasing focal length while the camera body stays locked. Perspective relations stay fixed: the world does not slide, it only enlarges as the lens compresses space.","慢变焦推近是一种电影摄影手法：通过增加焦距来收紧画面，同时机身保持锁定。透视关系保持不变：世界不会滑动，只会在镜头压缩空间时放大。"],"pi":["Slow optical zoom in on [Subject], camera body locked on a heavy tripod, lens gradually tightening over several seconds, background compression increasing, no physical dolly, prestige-drama patience. For motion: the lens slowly zooms in for 6 seconds while the camera body stays locked and the subject stays centered. Smooth optical zoom only.","缓慢光学变焦推近[主体]，机身锁定在重型三脚架上，镜头在数秒内逐渐收紧，背景压缩感增强，无物理推轨，精品剧式的耐心。动态：镜头缓慢变焦推近6秒，同时机身保持锁定，主体保持居中。仅限平滑光学变焦。"],"cp":["From a distant fixed window, slowly zoom into a solitary woman waiting at the center of a city square. Eight seconds, no camera translation, no foreground parallax, patient observational mood. She never acknowledges the camera.","从远处一扇固定的窗户，缓慢变焦推近一位独自在城市广场中央等待的女人。八秒，无摄影机位移，无前景视差，耐心观察的情绪。她从不看镜头。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Name a locked tripod, optical zoom in, duration, and no body travel. Example: camera body locked, lens slowly zooming in for 6 seconds, compression increasing, no dolly.","说明锁定三脚架、光学变焦推近、时长和无机身位移。示例：机身锁定，镜头缓慢变焦推近6秒，压缩感增强，无推轨。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2.jpg","r":[["Push In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/push-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/push-in-push-in-mini.webp","A thought lands. Do not rush it."],["Dolly In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-in-002-slow-dolly-in-mini.webp","Enter a mind, a room, or a threat. Geography changes because the camera walks."],["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."]],"z":"慢速变焦推近"},"slow-zoom-out":{"t":"Slow Zoom Out","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-out","d":["A slow zoom out widens the frame by decreasing focal length while the support stays put. More architecture and negative space enter the picture, yet the camera never travels, so true parallax does not appear.","慢变焦拉远通过减少焦距来加宽画面，同时支撑保持不动。更多建筑与负空间进入画面，但摄影机从不移动，因此不会出现真正的视差。"],"pi":["Slow optical zoom out from [Subject], tripod locked, the frame breathing open to reveal surrounding architecture and negative space, no camera body travel. For motion: the lens slowly zooms out for 6 seconds from a tight frame on [Subject] into a wider environment. Camera body stays still.","从[主体]缓慢光学变焦拉远，三脚架锁定，画面呼吸般展开，露出周围建筑与负空间，无摄影机机身位移。动态：镜头从[主体]的紧凑画面缓慢变焦拉远6秒，进入更宽广的环境。摄影机机身保持不动。"],"cp":["The lens slowly zooms out for 6 seconds from a tight frame on [Subject] into a wider environment. Camera body stays still.","镜头从[主体]的紧凑画面缓慢变焦拉远6秒，进入更宽广的环境。摄影机机身保持不动。"],"hp":0,"fq":["State locked tripod, optical zoom out, and what must be revealed. Example: tripod locked, lens slowly zooming out for 6 seconds, architecture entering, no body travel.","说明锁定三脚架、光学变焦拉远，以及必须揭示什么。示例：三脚架锁定，镜头缓慢变焦拉远6秒，建筑进入画面，无机身位移。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/02-slow-zoom-out-v2-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-out-02-slow-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/slow-zoom-out-02-slow-zoom-out-v2.jpg","r":[["Pull Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pull-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pull-out-pull-out-mini.webp","Show the container around a feeling."],["Dolly Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-out-04-dolly-out-v2-mini.webp","Leave someone behind, or show how small they are in the system."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"慢速变焦拉远"},"snorricam":{"t":"SnorriCam","c":"camera-movement","g":"body cam mount","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/snorricam","d":["A SnorriCam fixes the camera to the performer's body so the body remains stable relative to frame while the world moves. A rig points back at the wearer: the face stays pinned, the environment pitches around it.","斯诺里康将摄影机固定在表演者身上，因此身体相对于画面保持稳定，而世界在移动。一套支架朝佩戴者反向拍摄：脸部保持钉住，环境在周围上下颠簸。"],"pi":["SnorriCam body-mounted on [Subject], camera locked to the torso so the face stays pinned while the world sloshes behind, subjective intoxication or panic. For motion: body-mounted camera locked to [Subject]'s torso. The face stays centered while the background slides wildly.","斯诺里康固定在[主体]身上，摄影机锁定在躯干上，因此脸部保持钉住，而世界在背后晃荡，主观醉酒或恐慌。动态：机身固定摄影机锁定在[主体]的躯干上。脸部保持居中，背景剧烈滑动。"],"cp":["A frightened commuter walks quickly through a tiled tunnel. Body-mounted camera facing him: face and shoulders stay locked in the center while the corridor tilts and bobs with every step. Wide-angle proximity, natural strain, no free camera orbit and no normal handheld tracking.","一名受惊的通勤者快步穿过瓷砖隧道。机身固定的摄影机面对他：脸和肩膀锁定在中央，而走廊随着每一步倾斜、上下晃动。广角贴近，自然紧绷，无自由摄影机环绕，也无普通手持跟拍。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/018-body-mounted-face-camera-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/snorricam-018-body-mounted-face-camera-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/snorricam.jpg","r":[["Point of View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/pov","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pov-090-subjective-optical-pov-mini.webp","Force identification. The audience is the character."],["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"斯诺里康"},"static":{"t":"Static Locked-Off","c":"camera-movement","g":"locked off","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/static","d":["A static locked-off shot plants the camera on a heavy tripod with zero camera movement. Composition, blocking, and duration do the work; the frame is a living picture that does not tour.","静态固定镜头将摄影机架在重型三脚架上，零摄影机运动。构图、调度和时长发挥作用；画面是一幅不巡游的活画。"],"pi":["Perfectly static locked-off shot of [Subject], heavy tripod, zero camera movement, composition doing all the work, living-picture stillness. For motion: completely locked-off camera. [Subject] may breathe or the air may move, but the frame does not.","[主体] 的完全静止固定镜头：重型三脚架，摄影机零运动，全靠构图做功，静物画般的静止。用于动态时：摄影机完全锁定。[主体] 可以呼吸、空气可以流动，但画面不动。"],"cp":["In a dark archive, a librarian listens for someone outside. Remove music entirely and retain only quiet ventilation, cloth movement and her restrained breathing. Let the ventilation stop, leaving a single distant latch click clearly exposed. No sudden monster reveal or oversized bass hit.","在昏暗的档案库里，图书管理员在听门外是否有人。完全去掉音乐，只留下轻微的通气声、布料摩擦和她压抑的呼吸。让通气声停下，把远处一声门闩的轻响清楚地暴露出来。不要突然出现的怪物，也不要过量的低频重击。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/022-locked-off-duration-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/static-022-locked-off-duration-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/static.jpg","r":[["Tableau","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/tableau","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tableau.webp","Hold the arrangement."],["Long Take","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/long-take","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/long-take-031-genuine-feature-length-continuous-take-mini.webp","Do not let the audience leave the room."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"固定机位"},"steadicam":{"t":"Steadicam","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","d":["Steadicam is a mechanical stabilizing system using a sled, arm, and vest, so an operator can walk while the camera floats. The path can connect rooms with a smoothness that is neither handheld tremor nor dolly traction.","斯坦尼康是一种机械稳定系统，使用托板、机械臂和背心，因此操作员可以行走，而摄影机保持漂浮。其路径能以既非手持抖动也非推轨牵引的顺滑度连接房间。"],"pi":["Steadicam floating with [Subject] through connected spaces, preternatural smoothness, operator walking, light temperatures shifting as rooms change. For motion: smooth Steadicam move floating with [Subject] through the environment, no footfall shake.","用稳定器（Steadicam）与 [主体] 一起飘浮穿过相连的空间，超自然的顺滑，操作者在行走，随着房间变化光色也在改变。用于动态时：稳定器流畅浮动，与 [主体] 一起穿过环境，不带脚步晃动。"],"cp":["Smooth Steadicam move floating with [Subject] through the environment, no footfall shake.","用稳定器（Steadicam）与 [主体] 一起流畅浮动穿过环境，不带脚步晃动。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/steadicam-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/steadicam-steadicam.jpg","r":[["Gimbal Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/gimbal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/gimbal-gimbal-mini.webp","Run-and-gun smoothness without a Steadicam vest."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Oner","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/one-er","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-er-026-social-access-tracking-oner-mini.webp","The scene is a ride."]],"z":"斯坦尼康"},"super-dolly-in":{"t":"Super Dolly In","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/super-dolly-in","d":["A super dolly in is a long aggressive travel that eats the room, parallax violent, the face arriving too fast. It is a dolly in stretched until geography collapses into a close-up in one move.","超级推轨推近是一次长距离、强势的移动，吞掉房间，视差猛烈，脸到达得太快。它是把推轨推近拉长，直到空间在一次移动中坍缩成特写。"],"pi":["Long, fast, parallax. Still: Super dolly in on [Subject], a long aggressive travel that eats the room, parallax violent, the face arriving too fast. Video: A long, fast dolly in toward [Subject], the room collapsing into a close-up. Forbid a zoom. Name the length of the path.","长距离、快速、视差。静帧：超级推轨推近 [主体]，一次长距离、强势的移动，吞掉房间，视差猛烈，脸到达得太快。视频：向 [主体] 长距离快速推轨推近，房间坍缩成特写。禁止变焦。写明路径长度。"],"cp":["A long, fast dolly in toward [Subject], the room collapsing into a close-up.","向 [主体] 长距离快速推轨推近，房间坍缩成特写。"],"hp":["Super dolly in on [Subject], a long aggressive travel that eats the room, parallax violent, the face arriving too fast.","超级推轨推近 [主体]，一次长距离、强势的移动，吞掉房间，视差猛烈，脸到达得太快。"],"fq":["Write a long fast travel with violent parallax. Example: Super dolly in on [Subject], a long aggressive travel that eats the room, the face arriving too fast.","写一次长距离快速移动，带有猛烈视差。示例：超级推轨推近 [主体]，一次长距离、强势的移动，吞掉房间，脸到达得太快。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/super-dolly-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/super-dolly-in-super-dolly-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/super-dolly-in.jpg","r":[["Dolly In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-in-002-slow-dolly-in-mini.webp","Enter a mind, a room, or a threat. Geography changes because the camera walks."],["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"超长推轨推进"},"super-dolly-out":{"t":"Super Dolly Out","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/super-dolly-out","d":["A super dolly out is a long retreat that dumps the person into geography, the room exploding open. The environment takes the frame; the figure is left inside a system they no longer fill.","超级推轨拉远是一次长距离后撤，把人抛进空间，房间炸开。环境接管画面；人物被留在一个其不再填满的系统里。"],"pi":["Long reverse, geography wins. Still: Super dolly out from [Subject], a long retreat that dumps the person into geography, the room exploding open. Video: A long, fast dolly out from [Subject] until the environment owns the frame. Forbid a zoom out from sticks.","长距离反向，空间获胜。静帧：从 [主体] 超级推轨拉远，一次长距离后撤，把人抛进空间，房间炸开。视频：从 [主体] 长距离快速推轨拉远，直到环境占据画面。禁止从三脚架上变焦拉远。"],"cp":["A long, fast dolly out from [Subject] until the environment owns the frame.","从 [主体] 长距离快速推轨拉远，直到环境占据画面。"],"hp":["Super dolly out from [Subject], a long retreat that dumps the person into geography, the room exploding open.","从 [主体] 超级推轨拉远，一次长距离后撤，把人抛进空间，房间炸开。"],"fq":["Write a long reverse until the environment owns the frame. Example: Super dolly out from [Subject], a long retreat that dumps the person into geography.","写一次长距离反向，直到环境占据画面。示例：从 [主体] 超级推轨拉远，一次长距离后撤，把人抛进空间。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/super-dolly-out-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/super-dolly-out-super-dolly-out-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/super-dolly-out.jpg","r":[["Dolly Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-out-04-dolly-out-v2-mini.webp","Leave someone behind, or show how small they are in the system."],["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"超长推轨后拉"},"through-object-in":{"t":"Through Object In","c":"camera-movement","g":"Virtual camera","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/through-object-in","d":["Through object in sends the camera into a cup, keyhole, speaker, or mouth, matter as a door, then arrives on the subject. Scale often changes along a coherent 3D route that a physical camera could not take.","穿物进入把摄影机送入杯子、钥匙孔、扬声器或嘴中，物质成为门，然后到达主体。尺度常沿着一条连贯的 3D 路线变化，而实体摄影机无法走这条路线。"],"pi":["Name the object and the arrival. Still: Through-object-in on [Subject], the camera entering via a cup, keyhole, speaker, or mouth, matter as a door. Video: The camera travels into an object and arrives on [Subject] on the other side. Keep thickness. One continuous move.","写明物体和到达。静帧：穿物进入 [主体]，摄影机经由杯子、钥匙孔、扬声器或嘴进入，物质成为门。视频：摄影机进入一个物体，并在另一侧到达 [主体]。保持厚度。一次连续移动。"],"cp":["A single virtual camera glides from a dark kitchen, through the narrow handle opening of a kettle, across the room and through a keyhole into a lit study. Rigid continuous architecture, physically coherent perspective, controlled acceleration, no melting surfaces. Previsualize the route in 3D and use generated textures or plates rather than relying on one unconstrained generation.","单个虚拟摄影机从黑暗厨房滑行，穿过水壶狭窄的提手开口，穿过房间，再穿过钥匙孔进入一间明亮的书房。刚性连续空间结构，物理上连贯的透视，受控加速，无融化表面。在 3D 中预演路线，并使用生成的纹理或背景板，而不是依赖一次不受约束的生成。"],"hp":["Through-object-in on [Subject], the camera entering via a cup, keyhole, speaker, or mouth, matter as a door.","穿物进入 [主体]，摄影机经由杯子、钥匙孔、扬声器或嘴进入，物质成为门。"],"fq":["Name the object, the travel, and the arrival. Example: Through-object-in on [Subject], the camera entering via a cup, keyhole, speaker, or mouth, matter as a door.","写明物体、移动和到达。示例：穿物进入 [主体]，摄影机经由杯子、钥匙孔、扬声器或嘴进入，物质成为门。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/through-object-in-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/through-object-in-through-object-in-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/through-object-in.jpg","r":[["Pass Through","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pass-through","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pass-through-pass-through-mini.webp","Cut the building, not the film."],["Object Portal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/object-portal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/object-portal-object-portal-mini.webp","A prop is a wormhole."],["Through Object Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/through-object-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/through-object-out-through-object-out-mini.webp","Leave through a thing."]],"z":"穿物进入"},"through-object-out":{"t":"Through Object Out","c":"camera-movement","g":"The Passenger final shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/through-object-out","d":["Through object out leaves the subject by traveling out through an object into a wider world, interior becoming exterior. The viewpoint can abandon the person and let the decisive event happen off its direct attention.","穿物退出离开主体，通过一个物体向外移动进入更广阔的世界，内部变成外部。视点可以舍弃人物，让决定性事件发生在它不直接关注的地方。"],"pi":["Start on the subject, name the object, arrive larger. Still: Through-object-out from [Subject], the camera exiting via an object into a wider world, the interior becoming exterior. Video: The camera leaves [Subject] by traveling out through an object into a larger space. The object must be a tunnel.","从主体开始，写明物体，到达更大的空间。静帧：穿物退出 [主体]，摄影机经由一个物体退出到更广阔的世界，内部变成外部。视频：摄影机离开 [主体]，通过一个物体向外移动进入更大的空间。该物体必须是一条隧道。"],"cp":["Begin inside a quiet hotel room with a traveler seated near the edge of frame. Slowly approach a barred window, pass beyond it without visible interruption, drift into the courtyard, then turn to look back at the room. The traveler remains offscreen during a muffled disturbance. Use a planned barrier-removal composite, not bending metal.","从一间安静的酒店房间内部开始，一名旅行者坐在画面边缘附近。缓慢接近一扇带栅栏的窗户，不出现可见中断地越过它，飘入庭院，然后转回望向房间。在一阵低沉的骚动中，旅行者保持在画外。使用计划好的移除障碍合成，而不是弯曲金属。"],"hp":["Through-object-out from [Subject], the camera exiting via an object into a wider world, the interior becoming exterior.","穿物退出 [主体]，摄影机经由一个物体退出到更广阔的世界，内部变成外部。"],"fq":["Start on the subject, travel out through a named object, arrive in a larger space. Example: Through-object-out from [Subject], the camera exiting via an object into a wider world.","从主体开始，通过一个命名的物体向外移动，到达更大的空间。示例：穿物退出 [主体]，摄影机经由一个物体退出到更广阔的世界。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/through-object-out-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/through-object-out-through-object-out-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/through-object-out.jpg","r":[["Through Object In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/through-object-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/through-object-in-through-object-in-mini.webp","Enter through a thing."],["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"穿物而出"},"tilt":{"t":"Tilt","c":"camera-movement","g":"Tilt shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt","d":["A tilt shot rotates the camera vertically around a fixed position, pitch on the horizontal axis, tripod planted. Height is revealed or hidden by angle, not by lifting the support.","上下摇镜头让摄影机围绕固定位置垂直旋转，俯仰绕水平轴发生，三脚架固定。高度通过角度被揭示或隐藏，而不是通过升高支撑。"],"pi":["Plant the tripod. Still: Tilt on [Subject], camera rotating on its horizontal axis, climbing or descending the world from a fixed point. Video: The camera tilts vertically across [Subject], tripod planted. Name start (shoes, door) and end (face, roof). Forbid a crane.","架好三脚架。静帧：上下摇 [主体]，摄影机绕其水平轴旋转，从固定点攀爬或下降世界。视频：摄影机在 [主体] 上垂直上下摇，三脚架固定。写明起点（鞋子、门）和终点（脸、屋顶）。禁止摇臂。"],"cp":["The camera tilts vertically across [Subject], tripod planted.","摄影机在 [主体] 上垂直上下摇，三脚架固定。"],"hp":["Tilt on [Subject], camera rotating on its horizontal axis, climbing or descending the world from a fixed point.","上下摇 [主体]，摄影机绕其水平轴旋转，从固定点攀爬或下降世界。"],"fq":["Write a planted tripod and a vertical rotation. Example: Tilt on [Subject], camera rotating on its horizontal axis, climbing or descending the world from a fixed point.","写一个固定的三脚架和一次垂直旋转。示例：上下摇 [主体]，摄影机绕其水平轴旋转，从固定点攀爬或下降世界。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/tilt-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-tilt-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/tilt.jpg","r":[["Tilt Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-up-009-tilt-reveal-mini.webp","Reveal height, awe, or a face last."],["Tilt Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-down-tilt-down-mini.webp","Land on a person or object after establishing scale above."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"上下摇镜"},"tilt-down":{"t":"Tilt Down","c":"camera-movement","g":"Tilt shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-down","d":["A tilt-down rotates the camera vertically from a fixed position, starting higher and ending lower. It can drop from sky or architecture onto a person or object without moving the tripod.","下摇镜头让摄影机从固定位置垂直旋转，起点更高，终点更低。它可以从天空或建筑下降到人物或物体上，而无需移动三脚架。"],"pi":["Slow tilt down onto [Subject], starting in sky or ceiling and descending to the figure, a measured vertical scan. For motion: the camera tilts down from above onto [Subject], revealing the figure from head to environment.","缓慢下摇到 [主体]，从天空或天花板开始，下降到人物，一次有节制的垂直扫描。运动时：摄影机从上方下摇到 [主体]，从头部到环境揭示人物。"],"cp":["The camera tilts down from above onto [Subject], revealing the figure from head to environment.","摄影机从上方下摇到 [主体]，从头部到环境揭示人物。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/tilt-down-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-down-tilt-down-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/tilt-down.jpg","r":[["Tilt Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-up-009-tilt-reveal-mini.webp","Reveal height, awe, or a face last."],["Crane Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-down-011-crane-down-detail-reveal-mini.webp","Arrive from god-view into a person."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"向下摇"},"tilt-up":{"t":"Tilt Up","c":"camera-movement","g":"Tilt shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-up","d":["A tilt up shot rotates the camera vertically around a fixed position, climbing from a lower composition to a higher one. The tripod does not rise; only pitch changes, so the viewpoint height stays the same.","上摇镜头让摄影机围绕固定位置垂直旋转，从较低的构图攀升到较高的构图。三脚架不升高；只有俯仰变化，因此视点高度保持不变。"],"pi":["Slow tilt up from [Subject], camera rotating on its horizontal axis, climbing from ground detail to face or from face to towering architecture. For motion: the camera tilts up from a fixed position, starting low on [Subject] and climbing vertically.","从 [主体] 缓慢向上摇：摄影机绕水平轴旋转，从地面细节升到脸部，或从脸部升到高耸的建筑。用于动态时：摄影机在固定位置向上摇，从 [主体] 的低处起幅，垂直向上攀升。"],"cp":["Begin on a small muddy shoe at the foot of a massive stone monument. Slowly tilt upward from the same fixed position, revealing a child standing on a ledge high above. Maintain believable vertical lines, no crane rise, no zoom.","从巨大石碑底部一只沾泥的小鞋开始。在同一机位缓慢向上摇，逐渐露出站在高处石台上的孩子。保持垂直线条真实，不要升降臂上升，不要变焦。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/009-tilt-reveal-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-up-009-tilt-reveal-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/tilt-up.jpg","r":[["Tilt Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-down-tilt-down-mini.webp","Land on a person or object after establishing scale above."],["Crane Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crane-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crane-up-010-crane-up-scale-reveal-mini.webp","End a scene, reveal a city, or turn a person into landscape."],["Low Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/low-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-angle-043-low-angle-power-and-ceilings-mini.webp","Power, monument, or intimidation."]],"z":"向上摇"},"tracking":{"t":"Tracking Shot","c":"camera-movement","g":"traveling shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","d":["A tracking shot moves with, beside, ahead of, or behind a moving subject, typically matching pace on a parallel path. The person supplies the motion; the camera keeps distance, height, and scale while foreground, mid-ground, and deep background peel.","跟拍镜头随移动中的主体一起移动，在其旁边、前方或后方，通常沿平行路径匹配速度。人物提供运动；摄影机保持距离、高度和比例，同时前景、中景和深背景层层剥离。"],"pi":["Lateral tracking shot of [Subject], camera matching pace on a parallel path, shoulder height, parallax of foreground, mid-ground, and deep background. For motion: the camera tracks alongside [Subject] at walking pace, holding a consistent distance.","对 [主体] 的横向跟拍：摄影机在平行路径上以相同速度同行，肩高机位，前景、中景、深后景都产生视差。用于动态时：摄影机以步行速度在 [主体] 旁边跟拍，保持恒定距离。"],"cp":["Side-on continuous shot of a tired security guard trying to pass three obstructing figures in a narrow service corridor. Choreographed non-graphic action, visible pauses and fatigue, full bodies readable, camera tracks only laterally. No rapid edits, no impossible acrobatics, no concealed geography.","侧面连续镜头：一名疲惫的保安试图穿过狭窄员工通道里三个挡路的人。编排好的、不血腥的动作，能看见停顿与疲惫，全身可读，摄影机只做横向跟移。不要快速剪辑，不要不可能的杂技动作，不要把空间关系藏起来。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/tracking.jpg","r":[["Follow Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/follow","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/follow-005-rear-follow-tracking-mini.webp","Pursuit, haunting, or walking someone into a room."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Walk and Talk","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/walk-and-talk","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/walk-and-talk-walk-and-talk-mini.webp","Information and geography move together."]],"z":"跟拍镜头"},"trucking":{"t":"Trucking","c":"camera-movement","g":"truck","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/trucking","d":["A trucking shot is a lateral dolly: the camera slides sideways with a walker, a sidewalk or corridor peeling by. Subject size holds; the world streams along the street axis.","横向平移镜头是一种横向推轨：摄影机侧向滑动，行走者、人行道或走廊从旁掠过。主体大小保持不变；世界沿街道轴线流过。"],"pi":["Name the side-on travel. Still: Trucking with [Subject], lateral dolly, the camera sliding sideways, a sidewalk or corridor peeling by. Video: The camera trucks sideways with [Subject], lateral parallax. Match walking speed. Forbid a frontal follow unless you mean tracking.","写明「侧向移动」。静帧：Trucking 拍 [主体]，横向推轨，摄影机侧向滑行，人行道或走廊向旁掠过。视频：摄影机与 [主体] 一起横向平移，产生横向视差。匹配行走速度。除非你要的正是跟拍，否则禁止正面跟随。"],"cp":["The camera trucks sideways with [Subject], lateral parallax.","摄影机与 [主体] 一起横向平移（Truck），产生横向视差。"],"hp":["Trucking with [Subject], lateral dolly, the camera sliding sideways, a sidewalk or corridor peeling by.","横向平移 [主体]，横向推轨，摄影机侧向滑动，人行道或走廊从旁掠过。"],"fq":["Write a lateral dolly matching walk speed. Example: Trucking with [Subject], lateral dolly, the camera sliding sideways, a sidewalk or corridor peeling by.","写一个匹配行走速度的横向推轨。示例：横向平移 [主体]，横向推轨，摄影机侧向滑动，人行道或走廊从旁掠过。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/trucking-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/trucking-trucking-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/trucking.jpg","r":[["Dolly Left","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-left","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-left-05-dolly-left-v2-mini.webp","Survey a space or stay with a walker without turning the camera."],["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"横向平移"},"walk-and-talk":{"t":"Walk and Talk","c":"camera-movement","g":"follow shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/walk-and-talk","d":["A walk and talk shot moves with speaking people, camera leading or flanking at medium, so information and geography travel together. Architecture flows while a moving two-shot (or a moving single with interruptions) carries the dialogue.","边走边谈镜头随说话的人移动，摄影机以中景在前方引导或从侧翼跟随，因此信息和空间地理一起流动。建筑从旁流过，同时一个移动的双人镜头（或带打断的移动单人镜头）承载对话。"],"pi":["Walk-and-talk tracking of [Subject] in conversation motion, camera leading or flanking at medium, architecture flowing, West Wing corridor energy. For motion: the camera leads [Subject] walking through a space, holding a moving medium two-shot energy even if one figure.","边走边谈跟拍 [主体] 在对话中移动，摄影机以中景在前方引导或从侧翼跟随，建筑流动，《白宫风云》走廊般的能量。运动时：摄影机在 [主体] 前方引导其穿过空间，即使只有一个人也保持移动中景双人镜头的能量。"],"cp":["The camera leads [Subject] walking through a space, holding a moving medium two-shot energy even if one figure.","摄影机在 [主体] 前方引导其穿过空间，即使只有一个人也保持移动中景双人镜头的能量。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/walk-and-talk-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/walk-and-talk-walk-and-talk-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/walk-and-talk.jpg","r":[["Tracking Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tracking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tracking-006-leading-tracking-shot-mini.webp","Accompany a walker. The shot is a journey, not a picture."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"边走边谈"},"wandering":{"t":"Wandering","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/wandering","d":["A wandering camera drifts near the subject as curiosity, a search without a target yet. The move is not a motivated reframe to a known fact; looking itself is the action until something is found.","游移摄影机作为好奇在主体附近漂移，是一种尚未有目标的寻找。这个运动不是有动机地重新构图去确认已知事实；在发现某物之前，观看本身就是动作。"],"pi":["Write discovery, not a target lock. Still: Wandering camera near [Subject], unmotivated drift that becomes curiosity, a search without a target yet. Video: The camera wanders through the space around [Subject], discovering rather than targeting. Forbid a straight push to a close-up as the first idea.","写出发现感，而不是锁定目标。静帧：游移摄影机在 [主体] 附近，无动机漂移，逐渐变成好奇，尚未有目标的寻找。视频：摄影机在 [主体] 周围空间中游移，是发现而非锁定。禁止把直接推向特写作为第一想法。"],"cp":["The camera wanders through the space around [Subject], discovering rather than targeting.","摄影机在 [主体] 周围空间中游移，是发现而非锁定。"],"hp":["Wandering camera near [Subject], unmotivated drift that becomes curiosity, a search without a target yet.","游移摄影机在 [主体] 附近，无动机漂移，逐渐变成好奇，尚未有目标的寻找。"],"fq":["Write a drift that discovers rather than targets. Example: Wandering camera near [Subject], unmotivated drift that becomes curiosity, a search without a target yet.","写一个发现而非锁定的漂移。示例：游移摄影机在 [主体] 附近，无动机漂移，逐渐变成好奇，尚未有目标的寻找。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/wandering-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wandering-wandering-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/wandering.jpg","r":[["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"游移运镜"},"whip-pan":{"t":"Whip Pan","c":"camera-movement","g":"swish pan","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","d":["A whip pan pans so quickly that the image blurs into horizontal streaks, then snaps to a new composition. Two shots can be joined inside compatible directional motion blur, creating the impression of one fast reorientation.","甩摇摇得太快，画面模糊成水平条纹，然后骤然切到新构图。两个镜头可以在方向兼容的运动模糊中接合，制造一次快速转向的印象。"],"pi":["Violent whip pan off [Subject], horizontal motion blur streaking the world into ribbons, then a snap resolve on the next beat. For motion: extremely fast whip pan away from [Subject], heavy horizontal motion blur, then a sharp stop.","猛烈甩摇离开 [主体]，水平运动模糊把世界拉成条带，然后在下一拍骤然落定。运动时：极快甩摇离开 [主体]，强烈水平运动模糊，然后急停。"],"cp":["Generate A: a baker turns toward a ringing telephone and the camera whip-pans right into horizontal blur. Generate B: begin with the same rightward blur and land on a flour-covered delivery driver outside. Join at maximum blur. Keep motion direction and brightness compatible; no dissolve.","生成 A：面包师转向响铃的电话，摄影机向右甩摇，进入水平模糊。生成 B：以同样的向右模糊开始，落在外面一位满身面粉的送货司机身上。在最大模糊处衔接。保持运动方向和亮度兼容；不要叠化。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/013-whip-pan-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/whip-pan.jpg","r":[["Whip Tilt","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-tilt","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-tilt-whip-tilt-mini.webp","Vertical shock instead of a horizontal whip."],["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"甩镜头"},"whip-tilt":{"t":"Whip Tilt","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-tilt","d":["A whip tilt is a violent, motion-blurred vertical rotation of the camera, then a hard stop. It is the up-or-down cousin of a whip pan: shock through speed, not through traveling the support.","甩上下摇是摄影机猛烈、带运动模糊的垂直旋转，然后急停。它是甩摇的上下表亲：冲击来自速度，而不是来自移动支撑设备。"],"pi":["Violent vertical whip tilt across [Subject], the frame ripping up or down with motion blur, then a hard stop. For motion: extremely fast vertical whip tilt across [Subject] with motion blur, then a hard stop.","猛烈垂直甩上下摇掠过 [主体]，画面带着运动模糊向上或向下猛拉，然后急停。运动时：极快垂直甩上下摇掠过 [主体]，带运动模糊，然后急停。"],"cp":["Extremely fast vertical whip tilt across [Subject] with motion blur, then a hard stop.","极快垂直甩上下摇掠过 [主体]，带运动模糊，然后急停。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/whip-tilt-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-tilt-whip-tilt-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/whip-tilt.jpg","r":[["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Tilt Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/tilt-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-up-009-tilt-reveal-mini.webp","Reveal height, awe, or a face last."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"上下甩镜"},"wiggle":{"t":"Wiggle","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/wiggle","d":["A wiggle camera rocks between two nearby viewpoints, a tiny stereo fidget that makes a lock-off read as a living postcard. Travel is centimeters, not a dolly.","摆动摄影机在两个邻近视点之间摇摆，是一种微小立体小动作，让固定镜头读起来像一张会动的明信片。位移只有几厘米，不是推轨。"],"pi":["Two nearby viewpoints. Still: Wiggle cam on [Subject], tiny stereo rock, a living postcard, depth as a fidget. Video: The camera wiggles between two nearby viewpoints of [Subject]. Centimeters. Forbid a walk.","两个邻近视点。静帧：对 [主体] 使用摆动摄影机，微小立体摇摆，一张会动的明信片，深度感像小动作。视频：摄影机在 [主体] 的两个邻近视点之间摆动。几厘米。禁止走动。"],"cp":["The camera wiggles between two nearby viewpoints of [Subject].","摄影机在 [主体] 的两个邻近视点之间摆动。"],"hp":["Wiggle cam on [Subject], tiny stereo rock, a living postcard, depth as a fidget.","摆动摄影机对准 [主体]，微小立体摇摆，一张会动的明信片，深度感像小动作。"],"fq":["Write a tiny stereo rock between two nearby viewpoints. Example: Wiggle cam on [Subject], tiny stereo rock, a living postcard, depth as a fidget.","写一个在两个邻近视点之间的微小立体摇摆。示例：摆动摄影机对准 [主体]，微小立体摇摆，一张会动的明信片，深度感像小动作。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/wiggle-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wiggle-wiggle-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/wiggle.jpg","r":[["Wigglegram","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/wigglegram","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wigglegram-wigglegram-mini.webp","Depth as a twitch."],["Parallax","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/parallax","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/parallax-parallax-mini.webp","Prove the world has layers."],["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."]],"z":"摇摆运镜"},"yoyo-zoom":{"t":"YoYo Zoom","c":"camera-movement","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/yoyo-zoom","d":["A yoyo zoom inhales and exhales on the optical axis: a punch then a release, camera body still. One breath, two directions, no dolly.","悠悠变焦在光学轴线上吸气与呼气：一击一放，摄影机机身不动。一次呼吸，两个方向，不要推轨。"],"pi":["In then out, one breath. Still: Yo-yo zoom on [Subject], in and out on the same axis, a punch then a release, optical breathing. Video: The lens zooms in then out on [Subject] in one breath, a yo-yo on the optical axis. No dolly. Short.","先推近再拉远，一次呼吸。静帧：悠悠变焦 [主体]，在同一轴线上推近再拉远，一击一放，光学呼吸。视频：镜头对着 [主体] 在一次呼吸中推近再拉远，像光学轴线上的悠悠球。不要推轨。短。"],"cp":["The lens zooms in then out on [Subject] in one breath, a yo-yo on the optical axis.","镜头对着 [主体] 在一次呼吸中推近再拉远，像光学轴线上的悠悠球。"],"hp":["Yo-yo zoom on [Subject], in and out on the same axis, a punch then a release, optical breathing.","悠悠变焦 [主体]，在同一轴线上推近再拉远，一击一放，光学呼吸。"],"fq":["Write in then out on one axis, body still. Example: Yo-yo zoom on [Subject], in and out on the same axis, a punch then a release, optical breathing.","写在同一轴线上先推近再拉远，机身不动。示例：悠悠变焦 [主体]，在同一轴线上推近再拉远，一击一放，光学呼吸。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/yoyo-zoom-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/yoyo-zoom-yoyo-zoom-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/yoyo-zoom.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Crash Zoom Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-out","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-out-03-crash-zoom-out-v2-mini.webp","Shock-reveal scale or undercut a close moment."],["Zoom","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/zoom","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/zoom-zoom-mini.webp","Change size without walking."]],"z":"往复变焦"},"zoom":{"t":"Zoom","c":"camera-movement","g":"zoom in","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/zoom","d":["A zoom shot changes focal length without moving the camera. Space flattens or opens with no parallax: near and far grow or shrink together because the nodal point stays put.","变焦镜头改变焦距而不移动摄影机。空间在没有视差的情况下压扁或打开：近处和远处一起放大或缩小，因为节点保持不动。"],"pi":["Keep the body still. Still: Zoom on [Subject], optical magnification, camera body still, space flattening or opening without parallax. Video: The lens zooms on [Subject], no camera travel, space compressing. Say in or out. Forbid wheels.","保持机身不动。静帧：变焦 [主体]，光学放大，摄影机机身不动，空间在没有视差的情况下压扁或打开。视频：镜头对着 [主体] 变焦，摄影机不移动，空间压缩。说明推近还是拉远。禁止轮子。"],"cp":["The lens zooms on [Subject], no camera travel, space compressing.","镜头对着 [主体] 变焦，摄影机不移动，空间压缩。"],"hp":["Zoom on [Subject], optical magnification, camera body still, space flattening or opening without parallax.","变焦 [主体]，光学放大，摄影机机身不动，空间在没有视差的情况下压扁或打开。"],"fq":["Write optical magnification and no camera travel. Example: Zoom on [Subject], optical magnification, camera body still, space flattening or opening without parallax.","写光学放大且摄影机不移动。示例：变焦 [主体]，光学放大，摄影机机身不动，空间在没有视差的情况下压扁或打开。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/zoom-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/zoom-zoom-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/zoom.jpg","r":[["Slow Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/slow-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-zoom-in-01-slow-zoom-in-v2-mini.webp","Use to raise pressure without changing geography. The world stays put; attention closes."],["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Dolly Zoom","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/dolly-zoom","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolly-zoom-001-dolly-zoom-mini.webp","A realization that the ground is not stable. Use once."]],"z":"变焦"},"bleach-bypass":{"t":"Bleach Bypass","c":"color","g":"Silver-retention look","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","d":["Bleach bypass retains silver during processing, or simulates that retention, so the dye image sits on leftover metallic density. Contrast rises, grain shows, saturation falls, and highlights turn harsh rather than candy-colored.","漂白旁路在冲洗过程中保留银盐，或模拟这种保留，因此染料影像叠加在残留的金属密度上。反差升高，颗粒显现，饱和度下降，高光变得硬朗而非糖果色。"],"pi":["Name silver, crush, and metal. Bleach-bypass look on [Subject], retained silver, crushed color, harsh contrast, metallic midtones. Add grain if the stock would show it. Do not write teal-orange, and do not ask for candy complementary skies.","点明银盐、压暗和金属感。漂白旁路风格 [主体]，保留银盐，色彩压暗，高反差，金属感中间调。如果胶片会显现颗粒就加上颗粒。不要写青橙调，也不要要求糖果色互补天空。"],"cp":["Rain-soaked industrial street with restrained color, dense but separated blacks, pale stressed skin and hard wet highlights. Bleach-bypass-inspired tonal treatment, visible fine texture, no crushed black voids or monochrome conversion. Slow observational camera.","被雨浸透的工业街道，色彩克制，黑色浓密但层次分离，苍白紧绷的皮肤和坚硬湿润的高光。受漂白旁路启发的影调处理，可见细腻纹理，没有压死的黑色空洞，也不是单色转换。缓慢观察式摄影机。"],"hp":["Bleach-bypass look on [Subject], retained silver, crushed color, harsh contrast, metallic midtones.","漂白旁路风格 [主体]，保留银盐，色彩压暗，高反差，金属感中间调。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/bleach-bypass.jpg","r":[["Desaturation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/desaturation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/desaturation.webp","Drain the world without going fully mono."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."],["Monochrome","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/monochrome","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/monochrome-073-selective-color-in-monochrome-mini.webp","Strip to drawing."]],"z":"留银工艺"},"color-shift":{"t":"Color Shift","c":"color","g":"Color threshold","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/color-shift","d":["A color shift effect is a change of color state that the audience is meant to notice: monochrome to hue, one world to another, or a slide of temperature during the shot. Color is the event, not a hidden LUT.","色彩偏移效果是一种观众应当注意到的色彩状态变化：从单色到有色，从一个世界到另一个世界，或在镜头中色温滑动。颜色就是事件，而不是隐藏的 LUT。"],"pi":["Name the before and after. Color shift across [Subject], hues sliding mid-shot or mid-grade, a world that changes temperature in front of us. For motion, say when it happens (through a door, during the take). Do not write a static LUT, and do not confuse it with split-tone.","写明「之前」和「之后」。[主体] 身上的色彩偏移，镜头中段或调色中段色相滑动，一个在我们眼前改变温度的世界。用于动态时，写明发生在什么时候（穿过门时、这一镜进行中）。不要写静态 LUT，也不要与分离色调混为一谈。"],"cp":["Inside a muted sepia workshop, a child opens a large door onto a richly colored greenhouse. Keep the interior sepia while the exterior already exists in color beyond the threshold. As the camera crosses the doorway, enter the full-color world. No dissolve or global color wash.","在低饱和的棕褐色调作坊里，一个孩子推开一扇大门，门外是色彩浓郁的温室。室内保持棕褐调，而门外在门槛之外已是有色的。当摄影机越过门口时，画面进入全彩世界。不要用溶接，也不要整体铺色。"],"hp":["Color shift across [Subject], hues sliding mid-shot or mid-grade, a world that changes temperature in front of us.","色彩偏移贯穿 [主体]，色相在镜头中或调色中滑动，一个在我们眼前改变温度的世界。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/075-monochrome-to-color-revelation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/color-shift-075-monochrome-to-color-revelation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/color-shift.jpg","r":[["Split Toning","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/split-tone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-tone.webp","Shadows and lights belong to different gods."],["Cross Process","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cross-process","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-process.webp","Wrong chemistry on purpose."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"色彩偏移"},"cool-blue":{"t":"Cool Blue","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cool-blue","d":["A cool blue grade in cool color grade work shifts the image toward steel, cyan, or moonlight blues across shadows and often midtones. Warmth, if it survives, is reserved for a practical or a face that the story wants to save.","冷蓝色调在冷色调色中把画面推向钢铁、青色或月光蓝，遍及阴影，通常也遍及中间调。暖意如果幸存，会被留给一个实景光源，或一张故事想要拯救的脸。"],"pi":["Name the steel and the reserved hearth. Cool blue grade on [Subject], steel shadows, hospital or moonlight, warmth reserved for one practical if any. Specify whether skin goes cool or stays slightly protected. Do not write day-for-night sun, and do not add orange complementary punch unless you mean teal-orange.","点明钢铁感与被保留的炉火。对[主体]做冷蓝色调色，钢铁感阴影，医院或月光，暖意只保留给一个实景光源（如果有）。明确肤色是转冷还是仍稍受保护。不要写日拍夜阳光，也不要加入橙色互补冲击，除非你指的是青橙色调。"],"cp":["Cool blue grade on [Subject], steel shadows, hospital or moonlight, warmth reserved for one practical if any.","对[主体]做冷蓝色调色，钢铁感阴影，医院或月光，暖意只保留给一个实景光源（如果有）。"],"hp":["Cool blue grade on [Subject], steel shadows, hospital or moonlight, warmth reserved for one practical if any.","对[主体]做冷蓝色调色，钢铁感阴影，医院或月光，暖意只保留给一个实景光源（如果有）。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cool-blue/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Blue Hour","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/blue-hour","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/blue-hour.webp","Day is gone but the sky still works."],["Day for Night","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/day-for-night","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/day-for-night-071-day-for-night-landscape-mini.webp","You cannot wait for night, or night must still show terrain."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"冷蓝色调"},"cross-process":{"t":"Cross Process","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cross-process","d":["A cross process look imitates developing a film in the wrong chemistry, such as slide stock in color-negative developer, so primaries skew off their true identities. Contrast often climbs; cyan shadows, magenta or yellow skin shifts, and other chemical accidents become the palette.","交叉冲洗效果模仿用错误化学药水冲洗胶片，例如把反转片放进彩色负片显影液，于是原色偏离真实身份。对比度常常升高；青色阴影、洋红或黄色肤色偏移，以及其他化学事故成为调色板。"],"pi":["Name the wrong primaries. Cross-processed look on [Subject], skewed primaries, cyan shadows, magenta skin shift, music-video chemical accident. Keep the accident consistent. Do not write Velvia-true reds, and do not write teal-orange protected skin.","点明错误的原色。对[主体]做交叉冲洗效果，原色偏移，青色阴影，洋红肤色偏移，音乐录影带式的化学事故。让事故保持一致。不要写 Velvia 式真实的红，也不要写青橙式受保护的肤色。"],"cp":["Cross-processed look on [Subject], skewed primaries, cyan shadows, magenta skin shift, music-video chemical accident.","对[主体]做交叉冲洗效果，原色偏移，青色阴影，洋红肤色偏移，音乐录影带式的化学事故。"],"hp":["Cross-processed look on [Subject], skewed primaries, cyan shadows, magenta skin shift, music-video chemical accident.","对[主体]做交叉冲洗效果，原色偏移，青色阴影，洋红肤色偏移，音乐录影带式的化学事故。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cross-process/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Hyper-Saturation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/hyper-saturation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hyper-saturation.webp","Feeling is louder than fact."],["Vaporwave","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/vaporwave-look","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/vaporwave-look.webp","Nostalgia for a future that never shipped."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"交叉冲洗"},"day-for-night":{"t":"Day for Night","c":"color","g":"Nuit américaine","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/day-for-night","d":["Day for night cinematography photographs daylight so it will read as nighttime while still showing terrain that true night might hide. Exposure, sky, and highlight control do the lying; a blue wash alone is not the technique.","日拍夜摄影拍摄日光，让它看起来像夜晚，同时仍显示真正夜晚可能隐藏的地形。曝光、天空和高光控制负责说谎；单靠蓝色铺染并不是这项技术。"],"pi":["Hide the day, keep the land. Day-for-night treatment of [Subject], underexposed daylight, blue wash, skipped-over sun, moonlight as a lie that reads. Ban a visible sun disc and a pale daytime zenith. Do not write simply blue grade on a sunny street.","藏起白天，留住土地。对[主体]做日拍夜处理，日光曝光不足，蓝色铺染，略过太阳，月光作为一种读得出来的谎言。禁止可见的太阳圆盘和苍白日间天顶。不要写只是在阳光明媚的街道上加蓝色调色。"],"cp":["A wide horse ranch under apparent moonlight: deep dark sky, subtly readable distant hills, muted color and believable cool low-level illumination. One rider crosses the field. No bright daytime clouds, no obvious noon shadows, no uniform blue overlay. Generate a controlled base and grade sky and terrain separately.","一片广阔的养马场，笼罩在看似月光之下：深暗天空，隐约可辨的远山，柔和色彩和可信的冷色低照度照明。一名骑手穿过田野。没有明亮的日间云，没有明显的正午阴影，没有均匀蓝色叠加。生成一个受控底图，并分别对天空和地形进行调色。"],"hp":["Day-for-night treatment of [Subject], underexposed daylight, blue wash, skipped-over sun, moonlight as a lie that reads.","对[主体]做日拍夜处理，日光曝光不足，蓝色铺染，略过太阳，月光作为一种读得出来的谎言。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/071-day-for-night-landscape-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/day-for-night-071-day-for-night-landscape-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/day-for-night.jpg","r":[["Cool Blue","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cool-blue","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cool-blue.webp","Cold institutions, night, or alienation."],["Moonlight Gel","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/moonlight-gel","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/moonlight-gel.webp","Night that is still sculpted."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"日拍夜"},"desaturation":{"t":"Desaturation","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/desaturation","d":["Desaturation in desaturated cinematography reduces color intensity while leaving hue present. The world is wintered or dusted; leftover accents still speak, but chroma is no longer loud.","低饱和在低饱和摄影中降低色彩强度，同时保留色相存在。世界进入冬日或蒙尘；残余点缀仍然说话，但色度不再响亮。"],"pi":["Pull chroma, keep accents. Desaturated palette on [Subject], chroma pulled back, dusty, wintered, emotion in leftover color accents. Name the one leftover hue if there is one. Do not write bleach-bypass silver, and do not go fully black and white.","拉低色度，保留点缀。对[主体]做低饱和调色板，色度收回，灰蒙，冬日感，情绪留在残余色彩点缀中。如果有唯一残余色相，就点明它。不要写漂白旁路银色，也不要完全变成黑白。"],"cp":["Desaturated palette on [Subject], chroma pulled back, dusty, wintered, emotion in leftover color accents.","对[主体]做低饱和调色板，色度收回，灰蒙，冬日感，情绪留在残余色彩点缀中。"],"hp":["Desaturated palette on [Subject], chroma pulled back, dusty, wintered, emotion in leftover color accents.","对[主体]做低饱和调色板，色度收回，灰蒙，冬日感，情绪留在残余色彩点缀中。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/desaturation/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Bleach Bypass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp","War, crime, or a world without mercy."],["Cool Blue","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cool-blue","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cool-blue.webp","Cold institutions, night, or alienation."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"低饱和"},"filmic-faded":{"t":"Filmic Faded","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/filmic-faded","d":["A filmic faded grade in filmic color grade work imitates a print: blacks are lifted off true zero, highlights roll off instead of clipping like video, and contrast sits like photochemical display. It is not HDR punch, and it is not automatically period costume.","胶片褪色调色在胶片感调色中模仿印片：黑位从真正零点提升，高光滚降而非像视频那样裁切，对比度像光化学展示。它不是 HDR 冲击，也不自动等于年代服装。"],"pi":["Name the print curve. Filmic faded grade on [Subject], lifted blacks, rolled-off highlights, print-emulation, slightly expired romance. Say blacks are not crushed and highlights are not HDR-clipped. Do not write bleach-bypass, and do not add a sepia sticker unless you mean sepia.","点明印片曲线。对[主体]做胶片褪色调色，黑位提升，高光滚降，印片模拟，略带过期浪漫。说明黑位没有压死，高光没有 HDR 裁切。不要写漂白旁路，也不要加棕褐色贴纸，除非你指的是棕褐色。"],"cp":["Filmic faded grade on [Subject], lifted blacks, rolled-off highlights, print-emulation, slightly expired romance.","对[主体]做胶片褪色调色，黑位提升，高光滚降，印片模拟，略带过期浪漫。"],"hp":["Filmic faded grade on [Subject], lifted blacks, rolled-off highlights, print-emulation, slightly expired romance.","对[主体]做胶片褪色调色，黑位提升，高光滚降，印片模拟，略带过期浪漫。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/filmic-faded/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Film Grain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/film-grain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-grain-076-archival-or-damaged-medium-texture-mini.webp","The image should feel developed, not rendered."],["Vintage Cine Glass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/vintage-cine","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/vintage-cine.webp","Memory, period, or beauty over resolution."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"胶片褪色"},"hyper-saturation":{"t":"Hyper-Saturation","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/hyper-saturation","d":["Hyper-saturation in saturated cinematography raises color intensity past ordinary record, so hues read as lacquer, fever, or dream. Feeling is louder than fact; the palette is not documentary.","超饱和在饱和摄影中把色彩强度提高到普通记录之上，于是色相读起来像漆、热病或梦。感觉比事实更响亮；调色板不是纪录片。"],"pi":["Name intensity, not a mood word. Hyper-saturated color on [Subject], Velvia intensity, reds like lacquer, a dream or a fever, not documentary. List the loud hues. Do not write teal-orange split, and do not ask for naturalistic skin if the fever should include the face.","点明强度，而不是情绪词。对[主体]做超饱和色彩，Velvia 般强烈，红色如漆，一场梦或一场热病，不是纪录片。列出响亮的色相。不要写青橙分离，也不要要求自然肤色，如果这场热病应该包括脸部。"],"cp":["Hyper-saturated color on [Subject], Velvia intensity, reds like lacquer, a dream or a fever, not documentary.","对[主体]做超饱和色彩，Velvia 般强烈，红色如漆，一场梦或一场热病，不是纪录片。"],"hp":["Hyper-saturated color on [Subject], Velvia intensity, reds like lacquer, a dream or a fever, not documentary.","对[主体]做超饱和色彩，Velvia 般强烈，红色如漆，一场梦或一场热病，不是纪录片。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/hyper-saturation/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Giallo","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/giallo-look","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/giallo-look.webp","Horror that is also fashion."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."],["Bleach Bypass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp","War, crime, or a world without mercy."]],"z":"超饱和"},"monochrome":{"t":"Monochrome","c":"color","g":"black and white","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/monochrome","d":["Monochrome, including black and white cinematography, removes or does not record chromatic information so the image is value, texture, and shape. Hue is gone; contrast, grain, and outline do the talking.","单色，包括黑白摄影，移除或不记录色彩信息，因此画面成为明暗值、质感和形状。色相消失；对比度、颗粒和轮廓负责表达。"],"pi":["Ban hue explicitly. Monochrome treatment of [Subject], silver highlights, deep blacks, no chroma, shape and light only. Name the grey scale (deep blacks, silver highlights). Do not write sepia, and do not leave a teal wash.","明确禁用色彩。[主体] 的单色处理：银白高光，深黑，无任何色度，只留形状与光。写明灰度走向（深黑与银白高光）。不要写棕褐，也不要留下青色偏色。"],"cp":["Monochrome treatment of [Subject], silver highlights, deep blacks, no chroma, shape and light only.","[主体] 的单色处理，银白高光，深黑，无色度，只有形状与光。"],"hp":["Monochrome treatment of [Subject], silver highlights, deep blacks, no chroma, shape and light only.","对[主体]做单色处理，银色高光，深黑，无彩色，只有形状与光。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/073-selective-color-in-monochrome-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/monochrome-073-selective-color-in-monochrome-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/monochrome.jpg","r":[["Bleach Bypass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp","War, crime, or a world without mercy."],["Tonal Contrast","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/contrast-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/contrast-composition.webp","Make a poster out of a frame."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"单色"},"moonlight-gel":{"t":"Moonlight Gel","c":"color","g":"Gel-color world","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/moonlight-gel","d":["Moonlight gel in moonlight lighting gel work is a cool, often cyan or steel-green key standing in for the moon, usually a large source from above or through trees. Night stays sculpted: there is a direction, a rim, and deep underexposure, not only a blue grade.","月光色片在月光照明色片工作中是一种冷色、通常是青色或钢绿色的主光，用来代替月亮，通常是从上方或穿过树木的大光源。夜晚保持被雕塑：有方向、有轮廓光，以及深度曝光不足，而不只是蓝色调色。"],"pi":["Name the cool key and the underexposure. Moonlight gel on [Subject], cyan-green night, a single cool key as the moon, deep underexposure, silver edges. Add a warm practical only if it exists in the scene. Do not write day-for-night, and do not fill the night until it is even.","点明冷色主光和曝光不足。对[主体]做月光色片，青绿色夜晚，单一冷色主光充当月亮，深度曝光不足，银色边缘。只有在场景中存在时才加入暖色实景光源。不要写日拍夜，也不要把夜晚补光到均匀。"],"cp":["A dancer crosses an empty rehearsal room divided between deep crimson side light and cold cobalt light from the opposite side. Colors remain spatially separate and shift across her body as she moves. Rich blacks, deliberate theatrical unreality, no rainbow lighting or pulsing nightclub effects.","一名舞者穿过空排练室，室内被深红色侧光和来自对面的冷钴蓝光分隔。颜色在空间上保持分离，并随着她移动而在她身体上变化。浓郁黑位，刻意戏剧性非现实，没有彩虹照明或脉动夜店效果。"],"hp":["Moonlight gel on [Subject], cyan-green night, a single cool key as the moon, deep underexposure, silver edges.","对[主体]做月光色片，青绿色夜晚，单一冷色主光充当月亮，深度曝光不足，银色边缘。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/moonlight-gel/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Blue Hour","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/blue-hour","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/blue-hour.webp","Day is gone but the sky still works."],["Cool Blue","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cool-blue","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cool-blue.webp","Cold institutions, night, or alienation."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"月光色纸"},"natural-grade":{"t":"Natural Grade","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/natural-grade","d":["A natural color grade keeps skin faithful and saturation restrained so the location's real color science remains the authority. No stylized split, no silver punishment, no fever: the grade mostly refuses to editorialize hue.","自然调色保持肤色忠实、饱和度克制，让地点真实的色彩科学仍是权威。没有风格化分离，没有银色惩罚，没有热病：这种调色大多拒绝对色相进行编辑表态。"],"pi":["Forbid the splits by name. Natural grade on [Subject], faithful skin, restrained saturation, no stylized split, the location's real color science. Name the real place and time of day. Do not write teal-orange, bleach-bypass, or fever saturation.","点名禁止那些分离色调。对[主体]做自然调色，忠实肤色，克制饱和度，没有风格化分离，即地点真实的色彩科学。点明真实地点和一天中的时间。不要写青橙、漂白旁路或热病饱和。"],"cp":["Natural grade on [Subject], faithful skin, restrained saturation, no stylized split, the location's real color science.","对[主体]做自然调色，忠实肤色，克制饱和度，没有风格化分离，即地点真实的色彩科学。"],"hp":["Natural grade on [Subject], faithful skin, restrained saturation, no stylized split, the location's real color science.","对[主体]做自然调色，忠实肤色，克制饱和度，没有风格化分离，即地点真实的色彩科学。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/natural-grade/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Available Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/available-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/available-light.webp","Commit to the hour you have."],["Filmic Faded","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/filmic-faded","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/filmic-faded.webp","Not HDR. A print."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"自然调色"},"overexposed":{"t":"Overexposed","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/overexposed","d":["Overexposed cinematography lets values clip or bloom toward white on purpose so information in the highlights is burned. It is a choice to lose the top of the scale, not the same as high-key lighting, which can stay bright while still holding detail.","过曝摄影故意让明暗值裁切或向白色泛光，因此高光中的信息被烧掉。这是选择失去标尺顶端，与高调照明不同，后者可以保持明亮同时仍保留细节。"],"pi":["Name the burn. Overexposed [Subject], values clipping toward heaven or fluorescent hell, information burned on purpose. Say what still holds (eyes, a doorway silhouette). Do not write high-key with detail in the whites, and do not crush the blacks as a substitute.","点明灼烧。过曝的[主体]，明暗值朝天堂或荧光地狱裁切，信息被故意烧掉。说明还有什么仍然保留（眼睛、门道剪影）。不要写白位仍有细节的高调，也不要用压死黑位作为替代。"],"cp":["Overexposed [Subject], values clipping toward heaven or fluorescent hell, information burned on purpose.","过曝的[主体]，明暗值朝天堂或荧光地狱裁切，信息被故意烧掉。"],"hp":["Overexposed [Subject], values clipping toward heaven or fluorescent hell, information burned on purpose.","过曝的[主体]，明暗值朝天堂或荧光地狱裁切，信息被故意烧掉。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/overexposed/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["High-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/high-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-key-064-high-key-brightness-mini.webp","Comedy, heaven, hospital, or candy."],["Light Flash","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/light-flash","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/light-flash-light-flash-mini.webp","A cut that is also a wound of light."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"过曝"},"palette":{"t":"Palette","c":"color","g":"Palette as location or story state","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/palette","d":["A color palette in color palette cinematography is a restricted set of hues used as law across set, costume, light, and grade. Too many colors would be noise; a few chosen hues do all the work and can mark location, timeline, or story state.","在色彩调色板电影摄影中，色彩调色板是一组受限的色相，作为法则贯穿场景、服装、灯光和调色。颜色太多会成为噪声；少数选定的色相承担全部工作，并能标记地点、时间线或故事状态。"],"pi":["Name the allowed hues and ban the rest. Restricted palette on [Subject], a few chosen hues doing all the work, design as law. List the two or three hues. Do not write mixed complementary clutter, and do not say colorful.","写明允许的颜色，其余全部禁止。[主体] 的受限色板，少数几个选定的色相承担全部工作，设计即法则。列出那两三个色相。不要写互相冲突的互补色堆砌，也不要说「色彩丰富」。"],"cp":["Generate three matched views of one train-station meeting as alternate recollections: warm amber, cool blue-gray and restrained white-green. Keep blocking and character identities identical while wardrobe accents, environment and light follow each version’s palette. Assemble as distinct narrative strands rather than cycling hues within one shot.","把同一次车站相遇生成三个对位的版本，作为三种不同的回忆：暖琥珀、冷蓝灰、克制的白绿。调度与人物身份保持一致，而服装点缀、环境与光线各随其色板。把它们编成三条独立的叙事线，而不是在一个镜头里循环换色。"],"hp":["Restricted palette on [Subject], a few chosen hues doing all the work, design as law.","对[主体]使用受限色板，少数选定色相承担全部工作，设计即法则。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/palette/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Split Toning","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/split-tone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-tone.webp","Shadows and lights belong to different gods."],["Monochrome","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/monochrome","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/monochrome-073-selective-color-in-monochrome-mini.webp","Strip to drawing."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"限定色板"},"sepia":{"t":"Sepia","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/sepia","d":["Sepia tone in sepia tone film maps the grey scale onto brown-gold instead of neutral silver, so whites go toward faded paper and blacks toward umber. It is a color of the past as chemistry, not a warm grade on a full-hue world.","在棕褐色调影片中，棕褐色调把灰阶映射到棕金色，而非中性银盐，因此白色趋向褪色的纸张，黑色趋向深棕。它是作为化学的过去之色，而不是对全色相世界做暖调。"],"pi":["Map the scale to brown-gold. Sepia tonality on [Subject], brown-gold memory, faded whites, the past as a color, not a filter sticker. Ban cyan skies and saturated reds. Do not write warm amber full color.","把灰阶映射为棕金色。对[主体]使用棕褐色调，棕金色的记忆，褪色的白色，过去作为一种颜色，而不是滤镜贴纸。禁止青色天空和饱和红色。不要写成暖琥珀全彩。"],"cp":["Sepia tonality on [Subject], brown-gold memory, faded whites, the past as a color, not a filter sticker.","对[主体]使用棕褐色调，棕金色的记忆，褪色的白色，过去作为一种颜色，而不是滤镜贴纸。"],"hp":["Sepia tonality on [Subject], brown-gold memory, faded whites, the past as a color, not a filter sticker.","对[主体]使用棕褐色调，棕金色的记忆，褪色的白色，过去作为一种颜色，而不是滤镜贴纸。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/sepia/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Filmic Faded","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/filmic-faded","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/filmic-faded.webp","Not HDR. A print."],["Warm Amber","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/warm-amber","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/warm-amber.webp","Home, memory, or invitation."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"棕褐色调"},"split-tone":{"t":"Split Toning","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/split-tone","d":["Split toning in split toning cinematography assigns one hue to highlights and another to shadows, so the tone curve becomes a two-color world. Any pair is legal; teal-and-orange is only one famous instance.","分离色调在分离色调电影摄影中把一种色相分配给高光，另一种分配给阴影，因此色调曲线变成一个双色世界。任何一对颜色都合法；青橙只是其中一个著名例子。"],"pi":["Name both hues and which owns shadows. Split-toned grade on [Subject], highlights one hue, shadows another, for example gold over teal, a two-color world. State the pair. Do not write bleach-bypass, and do not require teal-orange unless that is the pair.","说明两种色相以及哪一种占据阴影。对[主体]做分离色调调色，高光一种色相，阴影另一种，例如金配青，一个双色世界。说明这对颜色。不要写漂白旁路，并且除非这对颜色就是青橙，否则不要要求青橙。"],"cp":["Split-toned grade on [Subject], highlights one hue, shadows another, for example gold over teal, a two-color world.","对[主体]做分离色调调色，高光一种色相，阴影另一种，例如金配青，一个双色世界。"],"hp":["Split-toned grade on [Subject], highlights one hue, shadows another, for example gold over teal, a two-color world.","对[主体]做分离色调调色，高光一种色相，阴影另一种，例如金配青，一个双色世界。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/split-tone/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."],["Neon Practicals","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neon-practical.webp","The city is the lighting department."],["Bleach Bypass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp","War, crime, or a world without mercy."]],"z":"分离色调"},"teal-orange":{"t":"Teal and Orange","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","d":["A teal and orange color grade pushes shadows and often skies toward cyan-teal while keeping skin and warm sources in the orange half of the wheel. It is a complementary split with faces protected, not a silver-retention process and not a general cool wash.","青橙调色把阴影以及常常天空推向青绿色，同时让肤色和暖光源留在色轮的橙色一半。它是一种保护面部的互补分离，而不是银盐保留工艺，也不是普遍的冷色覆盖。"],"pi":["Protect skin, then split the rest. Teal-and-orange grade on [Subject], skin staying warm, shadows and skies pushed cyan, complementary split. Name a warm practical if one exists. Do not write bleach-bypass, silver retention, or overall blue.","先保护肤色，再分离其余部分。[主体] 的青橙调色：肤色保持暖调，阴影与天空偏向青色，冷暖互补分离。如果画面里有暖色实景光源，就写出来。不要写漂白旁路、留银或整体偏蓝。"],"cp":["Teal-and-orange grade on [Subject], skin staying warm, shadows and skies pushed cyan, blockbuster complementary split.","[主体] 的青橙调色，肤色保持暖调，阴影与天空压向青色，大片式的冷暖互补分离。"],"hp":["Teal-and-orange grade on [Subject], skin staying warm, shadows and skies pushed cyan, complementary split.","对[主体]做青橙调色，肤色保持暖色，阴影和天空推向青色，互补分离。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/teal-orange/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Blockbuster Gloss","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/blockbuster-gloss","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/blockbuster-gloss.webp","The shot must play on a billboard."],["Warm Amber","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/warm-amber","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/warm-amber.webp","Home, memory, or invitation."],["Bleach Bypass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp","War, crime, or a world without mercy."]],"z":"青橙色调"},"tungsten-balance":{"t":"Tungsten Balance","c":"color","g":"Warm interior versus cool exterior","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/tungsten-balance","d":["Tungsten balance in tungsten color temperature work sets the camera or stock for about 3200K so tungsten practicals render near-neutral or gently warm while daylight and cooler sources go blue. Different source colors remain visibly distinct rather than being normalized to one white.","钨丝平衡在钨丝色温工作中把摄影机或胶片设为约 3200K，使钨丝实景光源呈现接近中性或微微偏暖，而日光和更冷光源变蓝。不同光源颜色保持明显区别，而不是被统一成一种白色。"],"pi":["Name 3200K and the cold window. Tungsten-balanced interior on [Subject], 3200K warmth, windows going cold blue, mixed sources telling inside versus out. Put real lamps in the shot. Do not paint a face in two unmotivated halves, and do not neutralize the windows.","说明 3200K 和冷色窗户。对[主体]使用钨丝平衡的室内，3200K 暖色，窗户变冷蓝，混合光源讲述室内与室外。在镜头中放入真实灯具。不要把脸分成没有动机的两半，也不要把窗户中性化。"],"cp":["A woman sits at a kitchen table lit by a warm tungsten pendant while cold blue predawn light enters from a window behind her. Both colors stay distinct, natural skin transitions, readable shadows. She turns toward the window and moves from warmth into cooler light.","一名女子坐在厨房桌旁，暖色钨丝吊灯照亮她，而冷蓝色黎明前光线从她身后的窗户进入。两种颜色保持分明，肤色过渡自然，阴影可读。她转向窗户，从暖色走入更冷的光中。"],"hp":["Tungsten-balanced interior on [Subject], 3200K warmth, windows going cold blue, mixed sources telling inside versus out.","对[主体]使用钨丝平衡的室内，3200K 暖色，窗户变冷蓝，混合光源讲述室内与室外。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/tungsten-balance/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Practical Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/practical-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/practical-lighting-065-practical-source-motivation-mini.webp","Let the set light the face."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."],["Bleach Bypass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp","War, crime, or a world without mercy."]],"z":"钨丝灯白平衡"},"vintage":{"t":"Vintage","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/vintage","d":["A vintage film look treats the image as past chemistry: faded dyes, possible Halation , softened contrast, and period color that has drifted. It is a whole-file costume of time, not only old glass and not only a lifted print curve.","复古胶片外观把影像当作过去的化学：褪色的染料，可能的泛光，柔化的对比度，以及已经漂移的时代色彩。它是整部影片的时间服装，而不只是老镜头，也不只是提亮的印片曲线。"],"pi":["Name dyes and bloom, not stickers. Vintage treatment of [Subject], faded dyes, halation, the past as chemistry, not a sticker. Keep it color unless you also want sepia. Do not write scratch overlay as the whole look, and do not confuse it with Cooke swirl alone.","说明染料和光晕，而不是贴纸。对[主体]做复古处理，褪色的染料，泛光，过去作为化学，而不是贴纸。保持彩色，除非你也想要棕褐色调。不要把划痕叠加写成整个外观，也不要把它与仅 Cooke 旋焦混为一谈。"],"cp":["Vintage treatment of [Subject], faded dyes, halation, the past as chemistry, not a sticker.","对[主体]做复古处理，褪色的染料，泛光，过去作为化学，而不是贴纸。"],"hp":["Vintage treatment of [Subject], faded dyes, halation, the past as chemistry, not a sticker.","对[主体]做复古处理，褪色的染料，泛光，过去作为化学，而不是贴纸。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/vintage/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Filmic Faded","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/filmic-faded","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/filmic-faded.webp","Not HDR. A print."],["Halation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp","Highlights should bleed like film, not clip like video."],["Sepia","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/sepia","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/sepia.webp","A story that already happened."]],"z":"复古胶片风"},"warm-amber":{"t":"Warm Amber","c":"color","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/warm-amber","d":["A warm amber grade in warm color grade work biases mids and highlights toward tungsten honey, candle, and practical glow. Safety, home, or nostalgia sits in the mids; the world is invited rather than chilled.","暖色调整中的暖琥珀调色把中间调和高光偏向钨丝蜂蜜色、烛光和实景光源光晕。安全感、家或怀旧位于中间调；世界是被邀请的，而不是被冷却的。"],"pi":["Name honey mids and practical glow. Warm amber grade on [Subject], tungsten honey, candle and practical glow, safety or nostalgia in the mids. Keep full color, not sepia. Do not write bleach-bypass, and do not add a teal complementary wall unless you mean that split.","说明蜂蜜色中间调与实景光源光晕。对[主体]做暖琥珀调色，钨丝蜂蜜色，烛光与实景光源光晕，中间调里有安全感或怀旧。保持全彩，不要棕褐色调。不要写漂白旁路，也不要添加青色互补墙，除非你指的就是那种分离。"],"cp":["Warm amber grade on [Subject], tungsten honey, candle and practical glow, safety or nostalgia in the mids.","对[主体]做暖琥珀调色，钨丝蜂蜜色，烛光与实景光源光晕，中间调里有安全感或怀旧。"],"hp":["Warm amber grade on [Subject], tungsten honey, candle and practical glow, safety or nostalgia in the mids.","对[主体]做暖琥珀调色，钨丝蜂蜜色，烛光与实景光源光晕，中间调里有安全感或怀旧。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/warm-amber/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Golden Hour","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/golden-hour","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/golden-hour.webp","You have twenty minutes of truth."],["Candlelight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/candlelight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/candlelight-066-candlelit-naturalism-mini.webp","Period night or ritual."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"暖琥珀色调"},"architexture":{"t":"Architexture","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/architexture","d":["Architexture, a nickname for architectural cinematography that treats the set as subject, fills the frame with facades, grids, and materials until a person is a detail of the building. Texture, module, and mass own space, and the body is an ornament or a scale figure.","建筑纹理（Architexture），建筑电影摄影的昵称，把场景当作主体，用立面、网格和材料填满画面，直到人物成为建筑的细节。纹理、模块和体量拥有空间，身体是装饰或尺度参照人物。"],"pi":["Let the building win. Architecture as texture around [Subject], facades, grids, and materials filling the frame until the person is a detail of the building. Name the material (concrete board-form, glass curtain, hotel carpet). Say the figure is small in the architecture. Do not crop as a portrait.","让建筑胜出。把建筑作为[主体]周围的纹理，立面、网格和材料填满画面，直到人物成为建筑的细节。说明材料（板模混凝土、玻璃幕墙、酒店地毯）。说明人物在建筑中很小。不要裁成肖像。"],"cp":["Architecture as texture around [Subject], façades, grids, and materials filling the frame until the person is a detail of the building.","把建筑作为[主体]周围的纹理，立面、网格和材料填满画面，直到人物成为建筑的细节。"],"hp":["Architecture as texture around [Subject], facades, grids, and materials filling the frame until the person is a detail of the building.","把建筑作为[主体]周围的纹理，立面、网格和材料填满画面，直到人物成为建筑的细节。"],"fq":["Make the person small in material. Example: Architecture as texture around [Subject], facades, grids, and materials filling the frame until the person is a detail of the building. Name concrete, glass, or grid. Forbid portrait crop.","让人在材料中变小。示例：把建筑作为[主体]周围的纹理，立面、网格和材料填满画面，直到人物成为建筑的细节。说明混凝土、玻璃或网格。禁止裁成肖像。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/architexture/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["One-Point Perspective","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/one-point-perspective","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-point-perspective-037-symmetry-and-one-point-perspective-mini.webp","Destiny has a vanishing point."],["Repetition and Pattern","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/repetition-pattern","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/repetition-pattern.webp","Systems, armies, hotels, factories."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"建筑纹理"},"asymmetry":{"t":"Asymmetry","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/asymmetry","d":["Asymmetry, or asymmetrical composition, offsets the dominant mass and answers it with a different kind of weight: color, light, a small face, a dark void, or a distant doorway. The frame does not mirror, so leftover space is a counterweight rather than a matching wing.","非对称，或非对称构图，使主导体量偏移，并用另一种重量回应它：颜色、光、一张小脸、黑暗虚空或远处门口。画面不做镜像，因此剩余空间是配重，而不是相配的侧翼。"],"pi":["Name the offset and the answer. Asymmetrical balance with [Subject] offset, counterweights of color or mass, tension instead of mirror. Say which side holds the body and what holds the other side (lamp, doorway, red wall, dark road). Do not write unbalanced as a mood.","说明偏移与回应。非对称平衡，[主体]偏移，颜色或体量作配重，张力而非镜像。说明哪一侧承载身体，另一侧由什么承载（灯、门口、红墙、暗路）。不要把不平衡写成一种情绪。"],"cp":["Asymmetrical balance with [Subject] offset, counterweights of color or mass, tension instead of mirror.","非对称平衡，[主体]偏移，颜色或体量作配重，张力而非镜像。"],"hp":["Asymmetrical balance with [Subject] offset, counterweights of color or mass, tension instead of mirror.","非对称平衡，[主体]偏移，颜色或体量作配重，张力而非镜像。"],"fq":["State the offset and the counterweight. Example: Asymmetrical balance with [Subject] offset, counterweights of color or mass, tension instead of mirror. Name the side and the answering object. Avoid the word messy unless mess is the counterweight.","说明偏移和配重。示例：非对称平衡，[主体]偏移，颜色或体量作配重，张力而非镜像。说明哪一侧以及回应的物体。除非杂乱就是配重，否则避免使用“杂乱”这个词。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/asymmetry/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."],["Visual Weight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/visual-weight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/visual-weight.webp","The eye should land where the story is."],["Golden Ratio","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/golden-ratio","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/golden-ratio.webp","A more secret order than thirds."]],"z":"非对称构图"},"centered-composition":{"t":"Centered Composition","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","d":["Centered composition places the dominant subject on or near the central vertical axis and organizes the rest of the picture around that axis. The frame reads as a frontal tableau: walls, furniture, and attendants arranged so the subject is an altar, not an accident of blocking.","居中构图把主导主体放在中央垂直轴上或附近，并围绕该轴组织画面其余部分。画面读作正面舞台造型：墙壁、家具和侍从被安排得让主体成为祭坛，而不是调度的意外。"],"pi":["Ask for the whole altar. Dead-center composition of [Subject], bilateral symmetry or frontal tableau, Wes Anderson formality, the subject as altar. Name the back wall, matching lamps or windows, camera square to architecture. Do not stop at face in the middle.","要求「完整的祭坛」。[主体] 绝对居中的构图，左右对称或正面舞台式排列，韦斯·安德森式的端正，主体如同祭坛。写明背景墙、成对的壁灯或窗户，摄影机与建筑正面平行。不要只把脸放到画面中间就结束。"],"cp":["Dead-center composition of [Subject], bilateral symmetry or frontal tableau, Wes Anderson formality, the subject as altar.","[主体] 绝对居中的构图，左右对称或正面舞台式排列，韦斯·安德森式的端正，主体如同祭坛。"],"hp":["Dead-center composition of [Subject], bilateral symmetry or frontal tableau, Wes Anderson formality, the subject as altar.","对[主体]做绝对居中构图，双侧对称或正面舞台造型，韦斯·安德森式的规整，主体如祭坛。"],"fq":["Demand the axis and the room. Example: Dead-center composition of [Subject], bilateral symmetry or frontal tableau, Wes Anderson formality, the subject as altar. Say camera square to the back wall. If you only say centered face, you will get a portrait crop.","要求轴线和房间。示例：对[主体]做绝对居中构图，双侧对称或正面舞台造型，韦斯·安德森式的规整，主体如祭坛。说明摄影机与后墙成直角。如果你只说居中脸部，就会得到肖像裁切。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/038-tableau-staging-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/centered-composition.jpg","r":[["Symmetry","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/symmetry","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/symmetry.webp","The world is designed. Or pretending to be."],["One-Point Perspective","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/one-point-perspective","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-point-perspective-037-symmetry-and-one-point-perspective-mini.webp","Destiny has a vanishing point."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"中心构图"},"central-framing":{"t":"Central Framing","c":"composition","g":"dead center","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/central-framing","d":["Central framing, also called dead center or center punch, places the figure on the optical axis so the body sits on the crosshairs of the frame. Bilateral weight may gather around that body, but the first fact is placement: the person is the altar, not a guest in a third.","居中构图，也称正中心或中心定位，将人物置于光轴上，使身体落在画面的十字准星上。左右重量可以围绕这个身体聚集，但首要事实是位置：人物是祭坛，而不是三分法里的客人。"],"pi":["Name the axis. Central framing of [Subject], the figure on the optical axis, bilateral weight, a formal altar in the frame. Say the camera is square to the face or body. Forbid extra look-space. If the room must also salute, add frontal architecture. If it must not, say messy sides, figure still dead center.","点明轴线。[主体]的居中构图，人物位于光轴上，左右重量均衡，画面中如正式祭坛。说明摄影机正对脸部或身体。禁止额外的视线空间。如果房间也必须致敬，就添加正面建筑。如果不必，就写两侧杂乱，人物仍位于正中心。"],"cp":["Central framing of [Subject], the figure on the optical axis, bilateral weight, a formal altar in the frame.","[主体]的居中构图，人物位于光轴上，左右重量均衡，画面中如正式祭坛。"],"hp":["Central framing of [Subject], the figure on the optical axis, bilateral weight, a formal altar in the frame.","[主体]的居中构图，人物位于光轴上，左右重量均衡，画面中如正式祭坛。"],"fq":["Say dead center and optical axis. Example: Central framing of [Subject], the figure on the optical axis, bilateral weight, a formal altar in the frame. Add square to camera. If you only write portrait, you will get thirds.","写明正中心和光轴。示例：[主体]的居中构图，人物位于光轴上，左右重量均衡，画面中如正式祭坛。加上正对摄影机。如果只写肖像，你会得到三分法。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/central-framing/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Centered Composition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp","Control, ritual, comedy, or fate."],["Symmetry","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/symmetry","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/symmetry.webp","The world is designed. Or pretending to be."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"正中取景"},"clean-frame":{"t":"Clean Frame","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/clean-frame","d":["A clean frame in clean frame cinematography keeps the edges empty of accidental objects so isolation arrives by tidiness, not by blur. The diagram has no landlord in the corners, which is studio-poster clarity even on a real street.","干净画面电影摄影中的干净画面让边缘不出现意外物体，因此隔离感来自整洁，而非模糊。构图里角落没有不请自来的东西，即便在真实街道上也有影棚海报般的清晰。"],"pi":["Forbid the corners. Clean frame of [Subject], edges empty, no accidental objects, studio-poster clarity, isolation by tidiness. Say no foreground occluders, margins clear. If the set is dressed, add fully dressed room, edges still empty of accident.","禁止角落。[主体]的干净画面，边缘空置，没有意外物体，影棚海报般的清晰，靠整洁达成隔离。说明没有前景遮挡物，边距干净。如果场景已布置，就添加完整布置的房间，边缘仍无意外之物。"],"cp":["Clean frame of [Subject], edges empty, no accidental objects, studio-poster clarity, isolation by tidiness.","[主体]的干净画面，边缘空置，没有意外物体，影棚海报般的清晰，靠整洁达成隔离。"],"hp":["Clean frame of [Subject], edges empty, no accidental objects, studio-poster clarity, isolation by tidiness.","[主体]的干净画面，边缘空置，没有意外物体，影棚海报般的清晰，靠整洁达成隔离。"],"fq":["Ban occluders. Example: Clean frame of [Subject], edges empty, no accidental objects, studio-poster clarity, isolation by tidiness. Add no foreground objects at the edges. Models love plants in corners. Forbid them.","禁止遮挡物。示例：[主体]的干净画面，边缘空置，没有意外物体，影棚海报般的清晰，靠整洁达成隔离。加上边缘没有前景物体。模型喜欢在角落放植物。禁止它们。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/clean-frame/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Negative Space","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/negative-space","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2-mini.webp","Loneliness needs room."],["Centered Composition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp","Control, ritual, comedy, or fate."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"干净画面"},"contrast-composition":{"t":"Tonal Contrast","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/contrast-composition","d":["Tonal contrast, the contrast composition of lightest against darkest mass, organizes the frame as a fight of value with the subject as one of those poles. Graphic punch replaces mid-grey mush, so the diagram reads as a poster of value rather than a gentle range of detail.","影调对比，即最亮块面与最暗块面的对比构图，把画面组织为明暗价值的对抗，主体是其中一极。图形冲击力取代中灰的糊状感，因此构图读起来像一张明暗海报，而不是温和的细节层次。"],"pi":["Declare which pole the subject occupies. High tonal contrast composition with [Subject] as the lightest or darkest mass, graphic punch, no mid-gray mush. Say pale face in a black field, or black coat on white concrete. Forbid even grey fill.","说明主体占据哪一极。高影调对比构图，[主体]为最亮或最暗的块面，图形冲击力，没有中灰的糊状感。写明苍白面孔在黑色场域中，或黑色外套在白色混凝土上。禁止均匀的灰色补光。"],"cp":["High tonal contrast composition with [Subject] as the lightest or darkest mass, graphic punch, no mid-gray mush.","高影调对比构图，[主体]为最亮或最暗的块面，图形冲击力，没有中灰的糊状感。"],"hp":["High tonal contrast composition with [Subject] as the lightest or darkest mass, graphic punch, no mid-gray mush.","高影调对比构图，[主体]为最亮或最暗的块面，图形冲击力，没有中灰的糊状感。"],"fq":["Name the poles. Example: High tonal contrast composition with [Subject] as the lightest or darkest mass, graphic punch, no mid-gray mush. Say which one they are. Ban even illumination.","点明两极。示例：高影调对比构图，[主体]为最亮或最暗的块面，图形冲击力，没有中灰的糊状感。说明他们属于哪一极。禁止均匀照明。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/contrast-composition/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["Silhouette","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/silhouette","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/silhouette-049-silhouette-as-graphic-storytelling-mini.webp","Identity is less important than shape."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"影调对比"},"diagonal-composition":{"t":"Diagonal Composition","c":"composition","g":"Diagonal lines","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/diagonal-composition","d":["Diagonal composition uses diagonal lines and masses (stairs, rifles, rain, a body on the bias, a street receding on a corner) to raise energy, instability, or depth. The camera can stay level, because the set supplies the tilt of the diagram.","对角线构图使用斜线和斜向块面（楼梯、步枪、雨、斜置的身体、在转角处后退的街道）来提升能量、不稳定感或深度。摄影机可以保持水平，因为场景本身提供了构图的倾斜。"],"pi":["Name the bias line and keep the horizon honest unless you also want a dutch. Diagonal composition through [Subject], energy on the bias, unstable, rain or stairs as the line. Replace rain or stairs with the actual vector. Add horizon level if the camera must not roll.","点明斜线并保持地平线端正，除非你也想要荷兰角。穿过[主体]的对角线构图，斜向能量，不稳定，以雨或楼梯作为线条。把雨或楼梯替换为实际矢量。如果摄影机不能倾斜，就加上地平线水平。"],"cp":["Diagonal composition through [Subject], energy on the bias, unstable, dynamic, rain or stairs as the line.","穿过[主体]的对角线构图，斜向能量，不稳定，充满动势，以雨或楼梯作为线条。"],"hp":["Diagonal composition through [Subject], energy on the bias, unstable, rain or stairs as the line.","穿过[主体]的对角线构图，斜向能量，不稳定，以雨或楼梯作为线条。"],"fq":["Name the bias and whether the camera is level. Example: Diagonal composition through [Subject], energy on the bias, unstable, rain or stairs as the line. Specify the line. Add horizon level to block an unwanted dutch.","点明斜向以及摄影机是否水平。示例：穿过[主体]的对角线构图，斜向能量，不稳定，以雨或楼梯作为线条。指明线条。加上地平线水平，以阻止不想要的荷兰角。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/diagonal-composition/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dutch Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/dutch-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-angle-161-dutch-angle-mini.webp","The world is off its axis. Do not use as decoration."],["Leading Lines","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/leading-lines","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/leading-lines.webp","Architecture should point."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"对角线构图"},"dirty-frame":{"t":"Dirty Frame","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/dirty-frame","d":["A dirty frame in dirty frame cinematography lets out-of-focus shoulders, glass, foliage, or crowd chew the edges of the picture so the aperture is occupied. The camera sits inside a populated space, not on a seamless studio axis.","脏画面电影摄影中的脏画面让失焦的肩膀、玻璃、植物或人群咬住画面边缘，从而占据光圈。摄影机坐在有人占据的空间内部，而不是无缝的影棚轴线上。"],"pi":["Occupy the edges and name the matter. Dirty frame around [Subject], out-of-focus shoulders, glass, foliage, or crowd chewing the edges, voyeur layers. Say which edges (left shoulder, bottom foliage, rain-streaked glass). Keep a readable hole for the subject. Forbid clean margins.","占据边缘并点明物质。[主体]周围的脏画面，失焦的肩膀、玻璃、植物或人群咬住边缘，窥视层次。说明是哪些边缘（左肩、底部植物、带雨痕的玻璃）。为[主体]保留可读的孔洞。禁止干净边距。"],"cp":["Dirty frame around [Subject], out-of-focus shoulders, glass, foliage, or crowd chewing the edges, voyeur layers.","[主体]周围的脏画面，失焦的肩膀、玻璃、植物或人群咬住边缘，窥视层次。"],"hp":["Dirty frame around [Subject], out-of-focus shoulders, glass, foliage, or crowd chewing the edges, voyeur layers.","[主体]周围的脏画面，失焦的肩膀、玻璃、植物或人群咬住边缘，窥视层次。"],"fq":["Name the occluders and the edges. Example: Dirty frame around [Subject], out-of-focus shoulders, glass, foliage, or crowd chewing the edges, voyeur layers. Models default to clean margins. You must demand occupied edges.","点明遮挡物和边缘。示例：[主体]周围的脏画面，失焦的肩膀、玻璃、植物或人群咬住边缘，窥视层次。模型默认干净边距。你必须要求边缘被占据。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/040-foreground-obstruction-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dirty-frame-040-foreground-obstruction-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dirty-frame.jpg","r":[["Foreground Interest","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/foreground-interest","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/foreground-interest.webp","Put air and obstacle between us and them."],["Frame within Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/frame-in-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frame-in-frame-041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.webp","Someone is watched, trapped, or pictured."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"脏画面"},"figure-ground":{"t":"Figure-Ground","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/figure-ground","d":["Figure-ground composition separates the subject from the field so the person or object reads in under a second. Contrast of tone, color, or focus does the split, and if figure and ground share the same value the diagram fails even if the acting is good.","图底构图把主体与场域分离，使人物或物体在一秒内可读。影调、色彩或焦点的对比完成分离；如果图形与背景共享同一明度，即使表演很好，构图也会失败。"],"pi":["Name the split method. Clear figure-ground separation of [Subject] from background, contrast of tone, color, or focus so the person reads instantly. Say dark figure on a pale wall, or sharp subject, background soft, or a rim outlining the coat. Do not write pops.","点明分离方法。[主体]与背景的清晰图底分离，通过影调、色彩或焦点的对比让人物瞬间可读。写明深色人物在苍白墙面上，或主体清晰、背景柔化，或轮廓光勾出外套边缘。不要写“跳出来”。"],"cp":["Clear figure-ground separation of [Subject] from background, contrast of tone, color, or focus so the person reads instantly.","[主体]与背景的清晰图底分离，通过影调、色彩或焦点的对比让人物瞬间可读。"],"hp":["Clear figure-ground separation of [Subject] from background, contrast of tone, color, or focus so the person reads instantly.","[主体]与背景的清晰图底分离，通过影调、色彩或焦点的对比让人物瞬间可读。"],"fq":["State how they separate. Example: Clear figure-ground separation of [Subject] from background, contrast of tone, color, or focus so the person reads instantly. Add dark coat against snow, or shallow focus, or rim light. Models often blend subject and wallpaper.","说明如何分离。示例：[主体]与背景的清晰图底分离，通过影调、色彩或焦点的对比让人物瞬间可读。加上深色外套衬雪地，或浅景深，或轮廓光。模型常把主体和壁纸混在一起。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/figure-ground/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Silhouette","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/silhouette","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/silhouette-049-silhouette-as-graphic-storytelling-mini.webp","Identity is less important than shape."],["Shallow Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shallow-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shallow-focus-052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.webp","Nothing else is invited."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"图底关系"},"foreground-interest":{"t":"Foreground Interest","c":"composition","g":"foreground anchor","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/foreground-interest","d":["Foreground interest (a foreground anchor or occluded observation) puts a salient near object between the lens and the subject: flowers, a fence, glass, a table, or a body. The near layer creates depth, scale, a visual entry, or partial concealment, so air and obstacle sit between us and them.","前景趣味（前景锚点或遮挡式观察）在镜头与主体之间放置一个显著的近处物体：花、栅栏、玻璃、桌子或身体。近景层创造深度、尺度、视觉入口或部分遮蔽，因此空气与障碍位于我们与他们之间。"],"pi":["Name the near object and whether it is sharp. Strong foreground object between lens and [Subject], dirty aperture of flowers, fence, or glass, layered depth. Say between lens and subject, and what the object is. If it should stay readable, say foreground sharp. If it is a veil, say out of focus foreground.","写明近处的物件，以及它是否清晰。镜头与 [主体] 之间强烈的前景物件，花、栅栏或玻璃形成的「脏框」，营造层次纵深。说明它在镜头与主体之间、是什么东西。如果它要保持可读，就写「前景清晰」；如果它是纱幕，就写「前景虚化」。"],"cp":["Observe two neighbors speaking softly in a stairwell through a narrow gap between a door and its frame. A dark blurred door edge occupies one third of the image. The camera remains hidden and still; both faces remain readable when they lean toward the light.","透过门与门框之间一道窄缝，观察两位邻居在楼梯间低声交谈。模糊的暗色门边占据画面三分之一。摄影机隐藏且静止；当两人凑向光亮时，两张脸都要保持可读。"],"hp":["Strong foreground object between lens and [Subject], dirty aperture of flowers, fence, or glass, layered depth.","镜头与[主体]之间有强烈前景物体，花、栅栏或玻璃构成的脏光圈，层次化深度。"],"fq":["Name the object and the focus. Example: Strong foreground object between lens and [Subject], dirty aperture of flowers, fence, or glass, layered depth. Replace the object with the actual thing. State whether that layer is sharp or soft.","点明物体和焦点。示例：镜头与[主体]之间有强烈前景物体，花、栅栏或玻璃构成的脏光圈，层次化深度。把物体替换为实际事物。说明该层是清晰还是柔化。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/foreground-interest/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dirty Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/dirty-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dirty-frame-040-foreground-obstruction-mini.webp","We are not supposed to have this view."],["Layered Depth","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/layered-depth","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/layered-depth-039-deep-space-staging-mini.webp","A shot should be walkable."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"前景兴趣点"},"frame-in-frame":{"t":"Frame within Frame","c":"composition","g":"Doorway framing","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/frame-in-frame","d":["A frame within a frame (doorway framing, surcadrage) puts a second rectangle inside the screen, a door, window, arch, mirror, or gap that encloses the subject. The inner aperture is a second boundary, and crossing it is a beat, not a decoration.","画中画（门框构图、二次框取）在屏幕内放置第二个矩形，门、窗、拱门、镜子或缝隙，将主体围住。内部开口是第二道边界，穿过它是一个节拍，而不是装饰。"],"pi":["Name both rectangles. Frame-within-frame around [Subject], doorway, window, mirror, or arch as a second rectangle, nested attention. Describe the jamb, the threshold, and which space is brighter. Say whether we are inside looking out or outside looking in.","写明两个矩形。围绕 [主体] 的框中框：门洞、窗户、镜子或拱门作为第二个矩形，注意力被套叠。描述门框、门槛，以及哪个空间更亮。写明我们是「在里面向外看」还是「在外面向里看」。"],"cp":["From inside a dim farmhouse, hold on a bright rectangular doorway framing a lone traveler outside. The family passes into the room while the traveler remains beyond the threshold. Locked wide shot, no push-in, natural exposure contrast.","从昏暗的农舍内部看向一个明亮的矩形门洞，门洞把屋外独自站着的旅人框住。家人走进房间，而旅人始终留在门槛之外。固定宽镜头，不推近，曝光对比自然。"],"hp":["Frame-within-frame around [Subject], doorway, window, mirror, or arch as a second rectangle, nested attention.","[主体]周围的画中画，门、窗、镜子或拱门作为第二个矩形，嵌套注意力。"],"fq":["Ask for a second rectangle and name it. Example: Frame-within-frame around [Subject], doorway, window, mirror, or arch as a second rectangle, nested attention. State which side of the threshold we occupy and the exposure split.","要求第二个矩形并点明它。示例：[主体]周围的画中画，门、窗、镜子或拱门作为第二个矩形，嵌套注意力。说明我们占据门槛的哪一侧以及曝光分配。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frame-in-frame-041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/frame-in-frame.jpg","r":[["Dirty Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/dirty-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dirty-frame-040-foreground-obstruction-mini.webp","We are not supposed to have this view."],["Negative Space","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/negative-space","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2-mini.webp","Loneliness needs room."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"框中框"},"golden-ratio":{"t":"Golden Ratio","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/golden-ratio","d":["Golden ratio composition organizes the frame with proportional relationships near phi, about eight to five, as a phi grid or a logarithmic spiral rather than a 3x3. The main mass sits closer to center than a third, and the eye is asked to travel a curve through secondary masses instead of jumping cell to cell.","黄金比例构图用接近φ的比例关系组织画面，约为八比五，采用φ网格或对数螺旋，而不是3x3。主要块面比三分之一更靠近中心，视线被引导沿曲线穿过次级块面，而不是从一格跳到另一格。"],"pi":["Name the curve and the destination. Golden-ratio spiral composition around [Subject], the eye traveling a harmonic curve rather than a grid. Say where the coil starts (corner, doorway, shoreline) and where it lands (eyes, hands, a window). Do not write Fibonacci as a sticker.","点明曲线和目的地。[主体]周围的黄金比例螺旋构图，视线沿着和谐曲线行进，而不是沿着网格。说明螺旋从哪里开始（角落、门口、海岸线），在哪里落脚（眼睛、手、窗户）。不要像贴标签一样写斐波那契。"],"cp":["Golden-ratio spiral composition around [Subject], the eye traveling a harmonic curve rather than a grid.","[主体]周围的黄金比例螺旋构图，视线沿着和谐曲线行进，而不是沿着网格。"],"hp":["Golden-ratio spiral composition around [Subject], the eye traveling a harmonic curve rather than a grid.","[主体]周围的黄金比例螺旋构图，视线沿着和谐曲线行进，而不是沿着网格。"],"fq":["Ask for a spiral or phi placement and name the path. Example: Golden-ratio spiral composition around [Subject], the eye traveling a harmonic curve rather than a grid. State the start of the coil and the landing point. Avoid mystic math talk.","要求螺旋或φ布局并点明路径。示例：[主体]周围的黄金比例螺旋构图，视线沿着和谐曲线行进，而不是沿着网格。说明螺旋的起点和落脚点。避免神秘数学说法。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/golden-ratio/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."],["Centered Composition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp","Control, ritual, comedy, or fate."],["Central Framing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/central-framing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/central-framing.webp","Put them on the crosshairs."]],"z":"黄金比例"},"headroom":{"t":"Headroom","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/headroom","d":["Headroom in headroom cinematography is the space between the crown of the head and the top frame edge. Tight headroom applies pressure, while generous headroom hands the upper field to air, architecture, or sky.","头部空间电影摄影中的头部空间是头顶与画面上边缘之间的空间。紧凑头部空间施加压迫感，而慷慨的头部空间把上方场域交给空气、建筑或天空。"],"pi":["State tight or open, and what lives in the gap. Deliberate headroom on [Subject], either tight to the hair (pressure) or generously open (air, God, sky). If open, name the upper field (ceiling, sky, concrete). If tight, say hair almost touching the top frame edge.","说明紧凑还是开阔，以及空隙里有什么。[主体]上方的刻意头部空间，要么紧贴头发（压迫感），要么慷慨开阔（空气、上帝、天空）。如果开阔，就点明上方场域（天花板、天空、混凝土）。如果紧凑，就说头发几乎碰到画面上边缘。"],"cp":["Deliberate headroom on [Subject], either tight to the hair (pressure) or generously open (air, God, sky).","[主体]上方的刻意头部空间，要么紧贴头发（压迫感），要么慷慨开阔（空气、上帝、天空）。"],"hp":["Deliberate headroom on [Subject], either tight to the hair (pressure) or generously open (air, God, sky).","[主体]上方的刻意头部空间，要么紧贴头发（压迫感），要么慷慨开阔（空气、上帝、天空）。"],"fq":["Say tight or generous and name the upper field. Example: Deliberate headroom on [Subject], either tight to the hair (pressure) or generously open (air, God, sky). Models default to too much sky. Be explicit.","说明紧凑还是慷慨，并点明上方场域。示例：[主体]上方的刻意头部空间，要么紧贴头发（压迫感），要么慷慨开阔（空气、上帝、天空）。模型默认天空太多。要明确。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/headroom/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Lead Room","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/lead-room","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lead-room.webp","They are going somewhere, even if standing."],["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"头部空间"},"layered-depth":{"t":"Layered Depth","c":"composition","g":"Foreground-midground-background action","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/layered-depth","d":["Layered depth, or layered composition, stages important action on at least two distances, typically foreground, midground, and background in one picture. Depth staging is that arrangement, while deep focus is a separate optical choice about how much of it is sharp.","分层纵深，或称分层构图，将重要动作安排在至少两个距离上，通常在一幅画面中分为前景、中景层和背景。纵深调度就是这种安排，而深焦则是另一个关于其中有多少内容保持清晰的光学选择。"],"pi":["Assign jobs to planes. Three-plane composition around [Subject], foreground, mid, and deep background all carrying information, deep staging. Name what happens near, middle, and far. Say whether all planes are sharp or which one holds focus. Do not write 3D as a slogan.","给每一层分配任务。[主体] 周围的三层构图：前景、中景、深后景都承载信息，纵深调度。写明近处、中间、远处各自发生什么。说明是三层都清晰，还是焦点落在哪一层。不要把「3D」当成口号写上去。"],"cp":["A landlord signs a document in the near foreground while, through an open doorway, a family quietly packs in the distant room. Hold both actions in one wide composition. The foreground gesture must not obscure the family. No cut or explanatory insert.","房东在近前景签文件，同时透过敞开的门，远处房间里一家人正在安静地收拾行李。用一个宽构图把两个动作同时拿下。前景的动作不能挡住那家人。不切镜，也不要解释性的插入镜头。"],"hp":["Three-plane composition around [Subject], foreground, mid, and deep background all carrying information, deep staging.","围绕[主体]的三层构图，前景、中景和远景都承载信息，纵深调度。"],"fq":["Name three planes and their actions. Example: Three-plane composition around [Subject], foreground, mid, and deep background all carrying information, deep staging. State focus treatment. If you only say depth, you may get blur and no staging.","说出三个层次及其动作。示例：围绕[主体]的三层构图，前景、中景和远景都承载信息，纵深调度。说明焦点处理。如果只说纵深，可能会得到虚化而没有调度。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/039-deep-space-staging-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/layered-depth-039-deep-space-staging-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/layered-depth.jpg","r":[["Deep Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/deep-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/deep-focus-051-deep-focus-mini.webp","Let the audience find the story in the whole room."],["Foreground Interest","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/foreground-interest","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/foreground-interest.webp","Put air and obstacle between us and them."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"层次纵深"},"lead-room":{"t":"Lead Room","c":"composition","g":"nose room","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/lead-room","d":["Lead room in lead room cinematography (nose room, looking room) is space in the direction a subject looks or moves. More frame sits ahead of the walk or the gaze than behind the head, so the surplus is the path rather than leftover wallpaper.","前导空间，在前导空间摄影中（鼻前空间、视线空间），是主体所看或所移动方向上的空间。走在路径或目光前方的画面多于头部后方，因此多出来的部分是前路，而不是剩下的墙纸。"],"pi":["Name the direction of the surplus. Lead room in front of [Subject]'s look or walk, more space in the direction of attention than behind, forward narrative. Say looking left or walking right, more frame ahead of the face than behind the head. Do not write balanced.","写明「多出来的空间」在哪个方向。[主体] 视线或行进方向前方的留白，朝向那侧比背后留得多，叙事上是「向前」。写明是向左看还是向右走，脸前方比脑后留得多。不要写「平衡」。"],"cp":["Lead room in front of [Subject]'s look or walk, more space in the direction of attention than behind, forward narrative.","在 [主体] 视线或行进方向的前方留出空间（Lead Room）：朝向的那侧比背后留得多，叙事上是「向前」。"],"hp":["Lead room in front of [Subject]'s look or walk, more space in the direction of attention than behind, forward narrative.","[主体]目光或行走方向前方的前导空间，注意力方向上的空间多于后方，向前推进的叙事。"],"fq":["State the look direction and the surplus. Example: Lead room in front of [Subject]'s look or walk, more space in the direction of attention than behind, forward narrative. Say looking screen-left, empty frame ahead of the eyes.","说明目光方向和富余空间。示例：[主体]目光或行走方向前方的前导空间，注意力方向上的空间多于后方，向前推进的叙事。说明看向银幕左侧，眼睛前方是空画框。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/lead-room/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Short Siding","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/short-siding","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/short-siding.webp","Deny the character air."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."],["Golden Ratio","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/golden-ratio","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/golden-ratio.webp","A more secret order than thirds."]],"z":"前导空间"},"leading-lines":{"t":"Leading Lines","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/leading-lines","d":["Leading lines in leading lines cinematography are edges, rails, roads, corridors, shadows, or gestures that steer the eye toward or through the image. The lines are vectors in the diagram, not decoration around a centered face.","引导线，在引导线摄影中，是边缘、栏杆、道路、走廊、阴影或姿态，把视线引向画面之中或穿过画面。这些线是图示中的向量，而不是围绕居中面孔的装饰。"],"pi":["Name the vector and the landing. Leading lines driving the eye to [Subject], rails, corridors, roads, or shadows converging on the figure. Say what the lines are made of. If they should miss the person and continue, say the figure is a gate, lines continuing to a distant point.","写明「引导的向量」和「落点」。引导线把视线带向 [主体]：铁轨、走廊、道路或阴影汇聚到人物身上。说清这些线是由什么构成的。如果你希望线条穿过人物继续延伸，就写「人物是一道门，线条继续通向远处的消失点」。"],"cp":["Leading lines driving the eye to [Subject], rails, corridors, roads, or shadows converging on the figure.","引导线把视线带向 [主体]，铁轨、走廊、道路或阴影汇聚到人物身上。"],"hp":["Leading lines driving the eye to [Subject], rails, corridors, roads, or shadows converging on the figure.","引导线把视线引向[主体]，栏杆、走廊、道路或阴影汇聚到人物身上。"],"fq":["Name the lines and the target. Example: Leading lines driving the eye to [Subject], rails, corridors, roads, or shadows converging on the figure. Specify material. If the lines should continue past the person, say so.","说明线条和目标。示例：引导线把视线引向[主体]，栏杆、走廊、道路或阴影汇聚到人物身上。明确材质。如果线条应继续越过人物，要说明。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/leading-lines/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Vanishing Point","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/vanishing-point","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/vanishing-point.webp","There is a long way still to go."],["One-Point Perspective","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/one-point-perspective","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-point-perspective-037-symmetry-and-one-point-perspective-mini.webp","Destiny has a vanishing point."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"引导线"},"look-space":{"t":"Look Space","c":"composition","g":"Look-object relationship","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/look-space","d":["Look space framing is the field in front of a gaze, the air a look owns, often because the important object is off-screen. In cutting, that look may be joined to what is seen (raccord regard, the look-object relationship).","视线空间构图是目光前方的场域，是目光所拥有的一片空气，通常因为重要对象在画外。在剪辑中，这一目光可以与所看之物连接（视线匹配，raccord regard，目光—对象关系）。"],"pi":["Give the gaze a field and keep the object off unless you want it. Generous look space for [Subject], the off-screen gaze owning a field of air, tension in what we cannot see. Say looking screen-left into empty frame, object not shown. If you will cut to Point of View , write that as a second shot.","给目光一个场域，除非需要，否则让对象留在画外。为[主体]留出充裕的视线空间，画外目光拥有一片空气，张力在于我们看不到的东西。说明看向银幕左侧、进入空画框，对象不出现。如果要切到主观视角（Point of View），把它写成第二个镜头。"],"cp":["Generate A: a seated woman looks upward and to her left toward a sound. Generate B: a slightly elevated wall clock seen from her seated side of the room. Generate C: return to her face as she understands she is late. Preserve look direction and plausible clock height.","生成 A：一名坐着的女人向上并向左看向一个声音。生成 B：从她坐的房间一侧看到略微高挂的挂钟。生成 C：回到她的脸，她明白自己迟到了。保持目光方向和合理的挂钟高度。"],"hp":["Generous look space for [Subject], the off-screen gaze owning a field of air, tension in what we cannot see.","为[主体]留出充裕的视线空间，画外目光拥有一片空气，张力在于我们看不到的东西。"],"fq":["Point the eyes and empty the field they face. Example: Generous look space for [Subject], the off-screen gaze owning a field of air, tension in what we cannot see. Say the object is not in frame. For video, you can add a second shot as POV.","指定眼睛方向，并清空它们面对的区域。示例：为[主体]留出充裕的视线空间，画外目光拥有一片空气，张力在于我们看不到的东西。说明对象不在画内。对于视频，可以加一个作为主观视角（POV）的第二个镜头。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/look-space/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Lead Room","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/lead-room","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lead-room.webp","They are going somewhere, even if standing."],["Point of View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/pov","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pov-090-subjective-optical-pov-mini.webp","Force identification. The audience is the character."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"视线空间"},"negative-space":{"t":"Negative Space","c":"composition","g":"Unbalanced framing","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/negative-space","d":["Negative space in negative space cinematography leaves a large, relatively empty area around or beside the subject so absence becomes a mass. The unoccupied field is still a world (sky, wall, snow, sea), and the subject occupies a small or unusual portion of the diagram.","负空间，在负空间摄影中，在主体周围或旁边留下大片相对空的区域，让缺席成为一种体量。未被占据的场域仍然是一个世界（天空、墙、雪、海），主体在构图中占据较小或不寻常的一部分。"],"pi":["Say what is empty and where the body sits. Vast negative space around [Subject], the figure small, absence as weight, Antonioni emptiness. Name the field (wall, sky, snow, sea) and the placement (low in frame, far right, a speck). Do not write lonely as a substitute for geometry.","说清哪里是空的、人坐在哪里。[主体] 周围留出大片负空间，人物很小，用「缺席」制造重量，安东尼奥尼式的空。指明空的是什么（墙、天空、雪、海）以及位置（画面下部、最右侧、一个小点）。不要用「孤独」这类词代替几何关系。"],"cp":["A young woman sits in the bottom-right corner of a tall, nearly empty waiting room. Most of the frame is pale wall and high windows. She looks toward the near edge rather than into the empty space. Static shot, restrained performance, no decorative camera movement.","一位年轻女性坐在高挑、几乎空无一人的候诊室右下角。画面大部分是浅色墙面和高窗。她望向近处的边缘，而不是望向空处。静止镜头，表演克制，不做装饰性运镜。"],"hp":["Vast negative space around [Subject], the figure small, absence as weight, Antonioni emptiness.","围绕[主体]的广阔负空间，人物很小，缺席即重量，安东尼奥尼式的空无。"],"fq":["Place the figure and name the empty field. Example: Vast negative space around [Subject], the figure small, absence as weight, Antonioni emptiness. Say low in frame or far to one side. Forbid extra props in the empty area.","放置人物并说明空场。示例：围绕[主体]的广阔负空间，人物很小，缺席即重量，安东尼奥尼式的空无。说明位于画面低处或远在一侧。禁止在空区加入额外道具。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/042-negative-space-v2-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2.jpg","r":[["Extreme Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-long-shot.webp","Scale is the emotion."],["Short Siding","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/short-siding","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/short-siding.webp","Deny the character air."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"负空间"},"one-point-perspective":{"t":"One-Point Perspective","c":"composition","g":"Central vanishing point","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/one-point-perspective","d":["One-point perspective in one point perspective cinematography squares the camera to a plane so receding parallels meet at a single vanishing point, often on the central axis. The result is tunnel depth or ceremonial order: a corridor, a nave, a hotel hall aimed at infinity or at a person.","单点透视，在单点透视摄影中，让摄影机正对某一平面，使向远处延伸的平行线汇聚于单一消失点，通常位于中轴线上。结果是隧道式纵深或仪式性秩序：一条走廊、一座教堂中殿、一个酒店大厅，指向无限远或指向一个人。"],"pi":["Demand a single vanishing point and a square camera. One-point perspective corridor toward [Subject] or through them, vanishing point on axis, Kubrick infinity. Name the receding architecture. Say camera on the centerline, verticals true. If the person is the target, put the point on them. If they are a gate, put the point beyond.","要求单一消失点与正对建筑的机位。朝向 [主体] 或穿过 [主体] 的单点透视走廊，消失点在轴线上，库布里克式的无限延伸。写明向远处退去的建筑。说明摄影机在中轴线上，垂直线笔直。如果人物是目标，就把消失点放在他身上；如果他是一道门，就把消失点放到更远处。"],"cp":["A lone night porter stands centered at the end of a perfectly symmetrical hotel corridor. Locked axial camera, central vanishing point, balanced lamps and doorways. Hold still as one door on the far left opens slightly, breaking the order. No camera move.","一名夜班行李员独自站在完全对称的酒店走廊尽头正中。锁定轴向机位，单一中心消失点，壁灯与门洞左右配重。镜头静置，直到最左远处的一扇门轻轻打开，打破秩序。摄影机不移动。"],"hp":["One-point perspective corridor toward [Subject] or through them, vanishing point on axis, Kubrick infinity.","单点透视走廊朝向[主体]或穿过主体，消失点在中轴线上，库布里克式无限。"],"fq":["Ask for one vanishing point on axis and a square camera. Example: One-point perspective corridor toward [Subject] or through them, vanishing point on axis, Kubrick infinity. Name the corridor. Add verticals true.","要求一个位于中轴线上的消失点和正对平面的摄影机。示例：单点透视走廊朝向[主体]或穿过主体，消失点在中轴线上，库布里克式无限。说明走廊。让垂直线保持垂直。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/037-symmetry-and-one-point-perspective-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-point-perspective-037-symmetry-and-one-point-perspective-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/one-point-perspective.jpg","r":[["Leading Lines","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/leading-lines","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/leading-lines.webp","Architecture should point."],["Centered Composition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp","Control, ritual, comedy, or fate."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"单点透视"},"reflections":{"t":"Reflections","c":"composition","g":"Mirror dialogue","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/reflections","d":["Reflections in reflection cinematography put observer and observed in one plane by using glass, water, chrome, or a mirror. Mirror dialogue and one-way-glass staging let two spaces occupy a single composition, because optics, not a filter, do the doubling.","反射，在反射摄影中，利用玻璃、水面、铬面或镜子把观察者与被观察者放在同一平面。镜中对话和单向玻璃调度让两个空间占据同一个构图，因为完成这一重影的是光学，而不是滤镜。"],"pi":["Name the surface and both occupants. Reflections of [Subject] in glass, water, or chrome, observer and observed in one plane. Say shop window, one-way glass, puddle, or chrome. State who is real in front of the surface and who appears in it. Add camera hidden if the camera must not appear.","写明反射面和画面里的两个人。[主体] 在玻璃、水面或镀铬表面中的倒影，观看者与被观看者同处一个平面。说清是橱窗、单向玻璃、水洼还是镀铬。说明谁在反射面之前是真实的、谁出现在倒影里。如果摄影机不能入画，就补上「摄影机藏在画面外」。"],"cp":["A man and woman speak across a one-way-glass booth. Her illuminated face is visible while his dim reflection gradually overlays the glass as the light balance changes. Keep their positions consistent and the reflection optically plausible. Slow, restrained performance; no supernatural double.","一男一女隔着一间单向玻璃亭交谈。她被打亮的脸清晰可见，而随着光比变化，他昏暗的倒影逐渐叠加在玻璃上。两人的位置保持一致，反射在光学上说得通。表演缓慢克制；不要超自然的替身。"],"hp":["Reflections of [Subject] in glass, water, or chrome, observer and observed in one plane.","[主体]在玻璃、水面或铬面中的反射，观察者与被观察者在同一平面。"],"fq":["Name the surface and both parties. Example: Reflections of [Subject] in glass, water, or chrome, observer and observed in one plane. Specify one-way glass, shop window, or water. For video, demand the reflection match head movement.","说明表面和双方。示例：[主体]在玻璃、水面或铬面中的反射，观察者与被观察者在同一平面。明确单向玻璃、商店橱窗或水面。对于视频，要求反射与头部运动匹配。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/reflections/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Frame within Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/frame-in-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frame-in-frame-041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.webp","Someone is watched, trapped, or pictured."],["Silhouette","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/silhouette","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/silhouette-049-silhouette-as-graphic-storytelling-mini.webp","Identity is less important than shape."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"反射"},"repetition-pattern":{"t":"Repetition and Pattern","c":"composition","g":"Repeated staging","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/repetition-pattern","d":["Repetition and pattern composition repeats shapes, colors, lines, positions, or actions so the eye reads a system of columns, windows, soldiers, or hotel doors. A break in that pattern is often the story, because the grid had already set the expectation.","重复与图案构图重复形状、颜色、线条、位置或动作，让眼睛读出一套柱子、窗户、士兵或酒店房门的系统。图案中的打破处往往就是故事，因为网格已经设定了预期。"],"pi":["Name the unit and the break. Repeating pattern around [Subject], columns, windows, soldiers, a break in the pattern as the story. Say what repeats, how many units are visible, and which unit is different. Do not write patterned as a mood.","说明重复单元和打破处。围绕[主体]的重复图案，柱子、窗户、士兵，图案中的打破处即故事。说明什么在重复、可见多少个单元、哪个单元不同。不要把有图案写成一种情绪。"],"cp":["Create two versions of a woman’s morning walk through the same apartment courtyard. First, she ignores three neighbors while checking her phone. Later, repeat the camera positions and route, but she greets each neighbor and notices a repaired fountain. Keep the environment consistent so changed attention, not a new location, carries the meaning.","创作两个版本：一名女人早晨穿过同一座公寓庭院。第一版，她查看手机，无视三位邻居。第二版，重复相同的机位和路线，但她向每位邻居打招呼，并注意到一座修好的喷泉。保持环境一致，让改变了的注意力、而不是新地点，承载含义。"],"hp":["Repeating pattern around [Subject], columns, windows, soldiers, a break in the pattern as the story.","围绕[主体]的重复图案，柱子、窗户、士兵，图案中的打破处即故事。"],"fq":["Name the repeating unit and the exception. Example: Repeating pattern around [Subject], columns, windows, soldiers, a break in the pattern as the story. Count the units if you can. Specify the break.","说明重复单元和例外。示例：围绕[主体]的重复图案，柱子、窗户、士兵，图案中的打破处即故事。如果可以，数出单元数量。明确打破处。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/repetition-pattern/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Symmetry","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/symmetry","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/symmetry.webp","The world is designed. Or pretending to be."],["Bird's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/birds-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/birds-eye-045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.webp","Turn life into a board game or a ritual."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"重复与图案"},"rule-of-thirds":{"t":"Rule of Thirds","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","d":["The rule of thirds in rule of thirds cinematography divides the frame into nine equal cells and parks important masses on those lines or at their four intersections. The horizon usually sits on an upper or lower third so land and sky are not equal partners, and the subject usually sits off-center with look-space in the larger remaining field.","三分法，在三分法摄影中，把画框分成九个相等的格子，把重要体量放在这些线或四个交点上。地平线通常位于上三分之一或下三分之一，使地面和天空不是同等分量的伙伴，主体通常偏离中心，并在较大的剩余区域中留有视线空间。"],"pi":["Write the grid, not a mood. Rule-of-thirds placement of [Subject] on a power intersection, horizon on a third, breathing room in the look direction. Name which third holds the horizon and whether the figure sits left or right. Do not write balanced or well composed.","写出网格，而不是情绪。[主体] 放在三分线的力点上，地平线落在三分之一处，视线方向留出呼吸空间。写明地平线落在哪一条三分线、人物在左还是右。不要只写「平衡」「构图好」。"],"cp":["Rule-of-thirds placement of [Subject] on a power intersection, horizon on a third, breathing room in the look direction.","[主体] 按三分法放在力点上，地平线落在三分之一处，视线方向留出呼吸空间。"],"hp":["Rule-of-thirds placement of [Subject] on a power intersection, horizon on a third, breathing room in the look direction.","把[主体]按三分法放在力量交点上，地平线位于三分之一处，目光方向留有呼吸空间。"],"fq":["Name the intersection and the horizon line. Example: Rule-of-thirds placement of [Subject] on a power intersection, horizon on a third, breathing room in the look direction. Say left or right. If you only write balanced, the model will center the face.","说明交点和地平线。示例：把[主体]按三分法放在力量交点上，地平线位于三分之一处，目光方向留有呼吸空间。说明左侧或右侧。如果只写平衡，模型会把脸居中。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/rule-of-thirds/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Golden Ratio","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/golden-ratio","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/golden-ratio.webp","A more secret order than thirds."],["Lead Room","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/lead-room","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lead-room.webp","They are going somewhere, even if standing."],["Central Framing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/central-framing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/central-framing.webp","Put them on the crosshairs."]],"z":"三分法"},"screen-in-screen":{"t":"Screen in Screen","c":"composition","g":"Desktop film","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/screen-in-screen","d":["Screen in screen (desktop film, interface as the camera) nests a monitor, phone, television, or cinema inside the cinema so someone is watching a picture of someone. The inner image has its own crop, delay, and artifacts, and nested looking is the diagram.","屏中屏（桌面电影、界面作为摄影机）把显示器、手机、电视或电影院嵌套在电影之中，于是某人在观看某人的画面。内部图像有自己的裁切、延迟和伪影，嵌套的观看就是构图图示。"],"pi":["Specify the outer view and the inner picture. Screen-in-screen of [Subject], a monitor, phone, or cinema inside the cinema, nested looking. Name the device, the content on it, and whether we see the watcher, only the UI, or both. If text matters, write the exact words. Keep the inner image stable.","写明「外层画面」和「内层画面」。[主体] 的画中画：监视器、手机，或电影里的电影院，嵌套的观看。写明是什么设备、上面播放什么内容，以及我们看到的是观看者、只有界面，还是两者都有。如果文字重要，就把文字原样写出来。内层画面保持稳定。"],"cp":["Create a desktop-screen short: a woman starts writing an apology email, deletes it, receives an old photo and opens a video call she hesitates to answer. Generate the photo and call footage separately. Build the interface, readable text, cursor path and notification timing with code or compositing. No unreadable AI-generated UI text.","做一支桌面屏幕短片：一位女性开始写一封道歉邮件，删掉，收到一张旧照片，打开一个她犹豫要不要接的视频通话。照片与通话画面分别生成。界面、可读文字、光标路径和通知时机用代码或合成来做。不要出现 AI 生成的、读不出来的界面文字。"],"hp":["Screen-in-screen of [Subject], a monitor, phone, or cinema inside the cinema, nested looking.","[主体]的屏中屏，显示器、手机或电影院在电影院之中，嵌套观看。"],"fq":["Name device and inner content. Example: Screen-in-screen of [Subject], a monitor, phone, or cinema inside the cinema, nested looking. For UI stories, render text deterministically. Do not generate the whole interface as unstable video if words must be exact.","说明设备和内部内容。示例：[主体]的屏中屏，显示器、手机或电影院在电影院之中，嵌套观看。对于 UI 故事，确定性地渲染文字。如果文字必须精确，不要把整个界面生成为不稳定的视频。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/screen-in-screen/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Frame within Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/frame-in-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frame-in-frame-041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.webp","Someone is watched, trapped, or pictured."],["Split Screen","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/split-screen","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-screen-120-simultaneous-split-screen-mini.webp","Two rooms, one moment."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"屏中屏"},"short-siding":{"t":"Short Siding","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/short-siding","d":["Short siding places the face near the frame edge the character looks toward, crushing look-space and leaving surplus air behind the head. The edge they face becomes a wall, so the diagram denies them a future in the picture.","短边构图把脸放在角色所看的那一侧画面边缘附近，压扁视线空间，并在头后留下多余空白。他们所面对的边缘变成一堵墙，因此构图拒绝让他们在画面中拥有未来。"],"pi":["Name the crush. Short-sided framing of [Subject], look space crushed, the face near the frame edge they look toward, trapped or urgent. Say looking right, face against the right edge, empty space behind the head. Do not add looking room.","点明被压扁的视线空间。对[主体]采用短边构图，视线空间被压扁，脸靠近他们所看的那一侧画面边缘，陷入困境或急迫。说明是向右看，脸贴着右边缘，头后是空余空间。不要添加视线空间。"],"cp":["Short-sided framing of [Subject], look space crushed, the face near the frame edge they look toward, trapped or urgent.","对[主体]采用短边构图，视线空间被压扁，脸靠近他们所看的那一侧画面边缘，被困或急迫。"],"hp":["Short-sided framing of [Subject], look space crushed, the face near the frame edge they look toward, trapped or urgent.","对[主体]采用短边构图，视线空间被压扁，脸靠近他们所看的那一侧画面边缘，被困或急迫。"],"fq":["State the edge and the starved look. Example: Short-sided framing of [Subject], look space crushed, the face near the frame edge they look toward, trapped or urgent. Models love looking room. You must forbid it.","说明边缘和匮乏的视线。示例：对[主体]采用短边构图，视线空间被压扁，脸靠近他们所看的那一侧画面边缘，被困或急迫。模型喜欢视线空间。你必须禁止它。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/short-siding/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Lead Room","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/lead-room","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lead-room.webp","They are going somewhere, even if standing."],["Negative Space","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/negative-space","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2-mini.webp","Loneliness needs room."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"短边构图"},"symmetry":{"t":"Symmetry","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/symmetry","d":["Symmetry in a symmetrical composition balances visual masses around an axis, usually the vertical centerline, so left answers right. The world looks designed, or it is pretending to be, whether or not a person occupies the middle.","对称构图中的对称围绕一条轴线平衡视觉块面，通常是垂直中线，因此左边回应右边。这个世界看起来像被设计过，或者它正在假装如此，无论中间是否有一个人。"],"pi":["Demand the mirror. Perfect symmetry around [Subject], mirrored architecture, a central axis, obsessive order. Name matching lamps, windows, columns. Say camera on the centerline, verticals true. If a break matters, name the one unmatched object.","要求「镜像」。围绕 [主体] 的完全对称：镜像的建筑、一条中轴、强迫症般的秩序。写明成对的壁灯、窗户、柱子。说明摄影机在中轴线上，垂直线笔直。如果失衡是重点，就点出那唯一不成对的物件。"],"cp":["Perfect symmetry around [Subject], mirrored architecture, a central axis, obsessive order.","围绕 [主体] 的完全对称，镜像建筑，一条中轴，强迫症般的秩序。"],"hp":["Perfect symmetry around [Subject], mirrored architecture, a central axis, obsessive order.","围绕[主体]的完美对称，镜像建筑，一条中心轴，强迫症般的秩序。"],"fq":["Ask for a mirror and an axis. Example: Perfect symmetry around [Subject], mirrored architecture, a central axis, obsessive order. Specify matching practicals and a camera on the centerline. Name one break if the story is the unmatched thing.","要求一面镜子和一条轴线。示例：围绕[主体]的完美对称，镜像建筑，一条中心轴，强迫症般的秩序。指定匹配的实景光源，并把摄影机放在中线上。如果故事讲的是那个不相配之物，就点出一个破绽。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/symmetry/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Centered Composition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp","Control, ritual, comedy, or fate."],["One-Point Perspective","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/one-point-perspective","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-point-perspective-037-symmetry-and-one-point-perspective-mini.webp","Destiny has a vanishing point."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"对称构图"},"tableau":{"t":"Tableau","c":"composition","g":"tableau vivant","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/tableau","d":["A tableau (tableau vivant, frontal ensemble, or frieze) is a staged composition whose meaning develops inside a relatively fixed frame. Arranged bodies and objects form a living picture, so duration replaces coverage while the camera stays locked or nearly locked.","活画（tableau vivant，正面群像，或饰带式构图）是一种舞台化构图，其含义在相对固定的画框内展开。排列的人体和物体形成一幅活的绘画，因此时长代替分镜覆盖，而摄影机保持固定或近乎固定。"],"pi":["Ask for arrangement and a hold. Tableau of [Subject], arranged bodies, a living painting, duration instead of coverage. Name positions (left standing, center seated, right in a doorway) and say camera locked off. For video, add little motion except a planned gesture, no coverage cuts.","要求排列和保持。对[主体]的活画式构图，排列的人体，一幅活的绘画，用时长代替分镜覆盖。说明位置（左侧站立，中央坐着，右侧在门口），并说明摄影机固定。对于视频，除一个计划好的手势外几乎不要运动，不要分镜覆盖的切镜。"],"cp":["Locked wide frontal shot of five museum attendants preparing a display. Each performs a different small task; one repeatedly moves an object that another immediately returns. Clear spacing, readable full-body gestures, dry visual humor, no close-ups or camera motion.","固定广角正面镜头，五名博物馆管理员正在准备一个展陈。每人执行不同的细小任务；一个人反复移动一个物体，另一个人立刻把它放回。间距清晰，全身手势可读，冷面视觉幽默，不要特写或摄影机运动。"],"hp":["Tableau of [Subject], arranged bodies, a living painting, duration instead of coverage.","对[主体]的活画式构图，排列的人体，一幅活的绘画，用时长代替分镜覆盖。"],"fq":["Describe the arrangement and the hold. Example: Tableau of [Subject], arranged bodies, a living painting, duration instead of coverage. List positions. For video, specify a locked camera and a long hold with one planned gesture.","描述排列和保持。示例：对[主体]的活画式构图，排列的人体，一幅活的绘画，用时长代替分镜覆盖。列出位置。对于视频，指定固定摄影机和一个长保持，只带一个计划好的手势。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/tableau/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Centered Composition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp","Control, ritual, comedy, or fate."],["Static Locked-Off","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/static","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/static-022-locked-off-duration-mini.webp","Trust blocking and duration. Movement would be noise."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"活人画"},"triangular-composition":{"t":"Triangular Composition","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/triangular-composition","d":["Triangular composition arranges subjects or visual masses into a triangle so three points lock the frame. A group gets a hierarchy: the apex is usually power, witness, or the object of desire, and the base is support, threat, or the audience inside the picture.","三角形构图把主体或视觉块面排列成三角形，使三个点锁定画框。一个群体会获得等级关系：顶点通常是权力、见证者或欲望对象，底边则是支撑、威胁，或画面内部的观众。"],"pi":["Name the three masses and the apex. Triangular arrangement with [Subject] at an apex, three masses locking the frame, Renaissance blocking. Say who or what occupies the other two vertices. If rank is the point, say the apex is the authority.","点明三个块面和顶点。以[主体]位于顶点的三角形排列，三个块面锁定画框，文艺复兴式调度。说明谁或什么占据另外两个顶点。如果重点是等级，就说顶点是权威。"],"cp":["Triangular arrangement with [Subject] at an apex, three masses locking the frame, Renaissance blocking.","以[主体]位于顶点的三角形排列，三个块面锁定画框，文艺复兴式调度。"],"hp":["Triangular arrangement with [Subject] at an apex, three masses locking the frame, Renaissance blocking.","以[主体]位于顶点的三角形排列，三个块面锁定画框，文艺复兴式调度。"],"fq":["Name the apex and the other two masses. Example: Triangular arrangement with [Subject] at an apex, three masses locking the frame, Renaissance blocking. State standing versus sitting if height is the hierarchy.","点明顶点和另外两个块面。示例：以[主体]位于顶点的三角形排列，三个块面锁定画框，文艺复兴式调度。如果高度就是等级，就说明站立还是坐着。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/triangular-composition/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Three-Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/three-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-shot.webp","A trio has politics."],["Visual Weight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/visual-weight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/visual-weight.webp","The eye should land where the story is."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"三角形构图"},"vanishing-point":{"t":"Vanishing Point","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/vanishing-point","d":["A vanishing point in vanishing point composition is the apparent meeting place of parallel lines in perspective, a destination for rails, a road, or a colonnade. The person often stands as a gate in front of that meeting, or occupies it as the target of the architecture.","消失点构图中的消失点是透视中平行线看似交汇的地方，是铁轨、道路或柱廊的目的地。人物常常站在那个交汇点前方，像一道门，或者占据它，成为建筑所指向的目标。"],"pi":["Place the point and the person. Deep vanishing point beyond [Subject], rails or road sucking the eye to infinity, the person as a gate. Name the parallels (rails, highway, colonnade). Say the point is on the horizon beyond them, or on their chest if they are the target.","放置点和人。在[主体]之外有深远的消失点，铁轨或道路把视线吸向无限远，人物作为一道门。说明平行线（铁轨、公路、柱廊）。说明消失点在他们之外的地平线上，或者如果他们是目标，就在他们的胸口上。"],"cp":["Deep vanishing point beyond [Subject], rails or road sucking the eye to infinity, the person as a gate.","在[主体]之外有深远的消失点，铁轨或道路把视线吸向无限远，人物作为一道门。"],"hp":["Deep vanishing point beyond [Subject], rails or road sucking the eye to infinity, the person as a gate.","在[主体]之外有深远的消失点，铁轨或道路把视线吸向无限远，人物作为一道门。"],"fq":["Name the parallels and where they meet. Example: Deep vanishing point beyond [Subject], rails or road sucking the eye to infinity, the person as a gate. If the point should sit on the body, say vanishing point on the chest, architecture aiming at them.","点明平行线以及它们交汇的位置。示例：在[主体]之外有深远的消失点，铁轨或道路把视线吸向无限远，人物作为一道门。如果消失点应该落在身体上，就说消失点在胸口，建筑正对准他们。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/vanishing-point/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["One-Point Perspective","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/one-point-perspective","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-point-perspective-037-symmetry-and-one-point-perspective-mini.webp","Destiny has a vanishing point."],["Leading Lines","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/leading-lines","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/leading-lines.webp","Architecture should point."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"消失点"},"visual-weight":{"t":"Visual Weight","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/visual-weight","d":["Visual weight in visual weight composition is the attention an element attracts through size, contrast, color, position, focus, faces, or motion. A small bright thing can equal a large dark mass, because scale of attention is not scale of object.","视觉重量构图中的视觉重量是一个元素通过大小、对比、颜色、位置、焦点、脸或运动所吸引的注意力。一个明亮的小物可以等于一个大而暗的块面，因为注意力的尺度不是物体的尺度。"],"pi":["Name the winner and the equalizer. Composition balancing visual weight around [Subject], a bright small thing equal to a large dark mass, scale of attention. Say what is small and bright, what is large and dark, and where the eye should land first. Forbid equal lighting on all masses.","点明胜出者和平衡者。围绕[主体]平衡视觉重量的构图，一个明亮的小物与一个大而暗的块面相等，注意力的尺度。说明什么是小而亮，什么是大而暗，以及视线应先落在哪里。禁止所有块面获得同等照明。"],"cp":["Composition balancing visual weight around [Subject], a bright small thing equal to a large dark mass, scale of attention.","围绕[主体]平衡视觉重量的构图，一个明亮的小物与一个大而暗的块面相等，注意力的尺度。"],"hp":["Composition balancing visual weight around [Subject], a bright small thing equal to a large dark mass, scale of attention.","围绕[主体]平衡视觉重量的构图，一个明亮的小物与一个大而暗的块面相等，注意力的尺度。"],"fq":["Declare the winner. Example: Composition balancing visual weight around [Subject], a bright small thing equal to a large dark mass, scale of attention. Name both masses. Say the eye lands on the subject first.","宣布胜出者。示例：围绕[主体]平衡视觉重量的构图，一个明亮的小物与一个大而暗的块面相等，注意力的尺度。点明两个块面。说明视线先落在主体上。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/visual-weight/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Asymmetry","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/asymmetry","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/asymmetry.webp","Life is not a diagram."],["Tonal Contrast","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/contrast-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/contrast-composition.webp","Make a poster out of a frame."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"视觉重量"},"void":{"t":"Void","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/void","d":["A void in void cinematography erases the set: darkness, white, or a blank field eating the world until a figure stands against nothing. Negative space still belongs to a place, while a void deletes place, leaving almost no landlord but the body or the darkness that might eat it.","虚空摄影中的虚空抹除布景：黑暗、白色或空白场域吞噬世界，直到一个人物立于虚无之中。负空间仍然属于某个地点，而虚空删除地点，几乎不留下任何主人，只剩身体，或可能吞噬它的黑暗。"],"pi":["Delete the place. Void around [Subject], darkness or blank field eating the world, a figure against nothing. Say black void, no set, no floor detail, or white featureless field. Light only the figure. Forbid furniture and windows.","删除地点。围绕[主体]的虚空，黑暗或空白场域吞噬世界，一个人物对着虚无。说明黑色虚空，没有布景，没有地面细节，或白色无特征场域。只照亮人物。禁止家具和窗户。"],"cp":["Void around [Subject], darkness or blank field eating the world, a figure against nothing.","围绕[主体]的虚空，黑暗或空白场域吞噬世界，一个人物对着虚无。"],"hp":["Void around [Subject], darkness or blank field eating the world, a figure against nothing.","围绕[主体]的虚空，黑暗或空白场域吞噬世界，一个人物对着虚无。"],"fq":["Forbid the set. Example: Void around [Subject], darkness or blank field eating the world, a figure against nothing. Add no environment, no furniture. Specify black or white. Models love to invent rooms. Ban them.","禁止布景。示例：围绕[主体]的虚空，黑暗或空白场域吞噬世界，一个人物对着虚无。不要添加环境，不要家具。指定黑色或白色。模型喜欢发明房间。禁止它们。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/void/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Negative Space","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/negative-space","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2-mini.webp","Loneliness needs room."],["Cameo Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/cameo-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cameo-lighting.webp","Erase the world. Keep the person."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"虚空背景"},"voyeur":{"t":"Voyeur","c":"composition","g":"Unseen sound source","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/voyeur","d":["Voyeur cinematography places the camera in concealment so the audience is trespassing: a view through foliage, glass, a grate, or a distant window, often with dirty edges. The diagram is a peephole, not coverage, and the owner of that hide does not want us there.","窥视摄影把摄影机放在隐蔽处，使观众成为闯入者：透过枝叶、玻璃、格栅或远处窗户的视角，常常带有脏边。这种构图是一个窥孔，而不是分镜覆盖，而那个藏身之处的主人并不想让我们在那里。"],"pi":["Name the hide and the forbidden view. Voyeur frame of [Subject], watching from concealment, dirty edges, a view we should not have. Say through blinds, from behind a car, through leaves, a long lens across a courtyard. Keep the subject unaware. Occupy the edges with the hide.","点明藏身之处和被禁止的视角。对[主体]的窥视画框，从隐蔽处观看，脏边，一个我们不该拥有的视角。说明透过百叶窗、从车后、穿过树叶、用长焦镜头隔着庭院。让主体毫无察觉。用藏身之物占据边缘。"],"cp":["Locked shot inside a dim railway waiting room. An unseen suitcase rolls across the platform outside; its wheels move audibly from left to right, pause, then return. The lone passenger reacts without the camera revealing the source. Design spatially coherent audio separately, with no visible creature or arbitrary musical sting.","固定镜头，位于昏暗的火车站候车室内。一个看不见的行李箱从外面的站台上滚过；轮子发出可听见的声音，从左到右移动，暂停，然后返回。唯一的乘客做出反应，而摄影机不揭示来源。单独设计空间连贯的音频，不要可见生物或任意的音乐惊音。"],"hp":["Voyeur frame of [Subject], watching from concealment, dirty edges, a view we should not have.","对[主体]的窥视画框，从隐蔽处观看，脏边，一个我们不该拥有的视角。"],"fq":["Name the concealment and the unaware subject. Example: Voyeur frame of [Subject], watching from concealment, dirty edges, a view we should not have. Specify blinds, foliage, a grate, a long lens. Forbid eye contact with camera.","点明隐蔽处和不知情的主体。示例：对[主体]的窥视画框，从隐蔽处观看，脏边，一个我们不该拥有的视角。指定百叶窗、枝叶、格栅、长焦镜头。禁止与摄影机发生眼神接触。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/voyeur-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/voyeur-voyeur-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/voyeur.jpg","r":[["Dirty Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/dirty-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dirty-frame-040-foreground-obstruction-mini.webp","We are not supposed to have this view."],["Over-the-Shoulder Coverage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/over-the-shoulder-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/over-the-shoulder-frame-088-over-the-shoulder-coverage-mini.webp","Default dialogue coverage with spatial glue."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"窥视视角"},"windows":{"t":"Windows","c":"composition","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/windows","d":["Windows cinematography treats panes as the true subject: stacked apertures, lives in rectangles, a building of frames. The diagram is a grid of possible pictures, not one doorway around one face.","窗户摄影把窗格当作真正的主体：堆叠的开口，矩形中的生活，一座由画框构成的建筑。这种构图是一张可能画面的网格，而不是围绕一张脸的单一门洞。"],"pi":["Make the panes the subject. Windows as the true subject around [Subject], stacked apertures, lives in rectangles, a building of frames. Say courtyard facade at night, multiple lit interiors, or a wall of office panes. Place the subject in one rectangle among others. Name at least two other lives or empty rooms.","让窗格成为主体。围绕[主体]，窗户成为真正的主体，堆叠的开口，矩形中的生活，一座由画框构成的建筑。说明夜晚的庭院立面、多个亮灯室内，或一整面办公室窗格。把主体放在众多矩形中的一个里。点明至少另外两种生活或空房间。"],"cp":["Windows as the true subject around [Subject], stacked apertures, lives in rectangles, a building of frames.","围绕[主体]，窗户成为真正的主体，堆叠的开口，矩形中的生活，一座由画框构成的建筑。"],"hp":["Windows as the true subject around [Subject], stacked apertures, lives in rectangles, a building of frames.","围绕[主体]，窗户成为真正的主体，堆叠的开口，矩形中的生活，一座由画框构成的建筑。"],"fq":["Ask for stacked panes and multiple lives. Example: Windows as the true subject around [Subject], stacked apertures, lives in rectangles, a building of frames. Specify a facade or courtyard and more than one lit interior. Place the subject in one cell.","要求堆叠的窗格和多种生活。示例：围绕[主体]，窗户成为真正的主体，堆叠的开口，矩形中的生活，一座由画框构成的建筑。指定一个立面或庭院，以及不止一个亮灯室内。把主体放在一个格子里。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/windows/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Frame within Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/frame-in-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frame-in-frame-041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.webp","Someone is watched, trapped, or pictured."],["Screen in Screen","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/screen-in-screen","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/screen-in-screen.webp","Someone is watching a picture of someone."],["Rule of Thirds","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/rule-of-thirds","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rule-of-thirds.webp","Default dynamic balance. Break it later on purpose."]],"z":"窗景构图"},"axial-cut":{"t":"Axial Cut","c":"editing","g":"Jump along the camera axis","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/axial-cut","d":["An axial cut jumps closer or farther along approximately the same camera axis, changing shot size without changing angle. The outgoing frame and the incoming frame share a viewpoint; only distance snaps.","轴向剪辑沿着大致相同的摄影机轴线跳得更近或更远，在不改变角度的情况下改变景别。切出画面和切入画面共享一个视点；只有距离发生跳变。"],"pi":["Axial cut jumping toward or away from [Subject] along the lens axis, punch-in without a zoom, a snap of scale. Name two or three matched framings, same angle, same pose, hard cuts. For video, do not ask the model to zoom; ask for a cut between a wide and a close on the same axis.","沿镜头轴线朝 [主体] 跳近或跳远的轴向剪辑，不靠变焦的「推近」，一次尺度的骤变。写明两三个对位的取景，同一角度、同一姿态、硬切。用于动态时，不要要求模型变焦；要求在同一轴线上做一个全景与一个近景之间的切。"],"cp":["A librarian notices an impossible new date stamped inside an old book. Make three hard cuts on the same axis: desk-wide, book close-up, extreme close-up of the date. Keep the page and hands fixed, with no zoom animation, morph or lateral angle change. Add exact date text in compositing.","图书管理员发现一本旧书里盖着一个不可能的新日期。在同一个轴线上做三次硬切：桌子全景、书本特写、日期的极特写。页面与手保持固定，不做变焦动画、变形或横向换角度。日期文字在合成时加上。"],"hp":["axial cut jumping toward or away from [Subject] along the lens axis, punch-in without a zoom.","轴向剪辑沿着镜头轴线朝[主体]跳近或跳远，不靠变焦的推近。"],"fq":["Ask for matched wide and close frames on the same axis, then a hard cut. Example: Axial cut jumping toward [Subject] along the lens axis, punch-in without a zoom. No zoom animation.","要求在同一轴线上匹配的广角和近景画面，然后硬切。示例：轴向剪辑沿着镜头轴线朝[主体]跳近或跳远，不靠变焦的推近。不要变焦动画。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/177-axial-cut-and-punch-in-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/axial-cut-177-axial-cut-and-punch-in-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/axial-cut.jpg","r":[["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"轴向剪辑"},"crash-cut":{"t":"Crash Cut","c":"editing","g":"Start inside the event","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/crash-cut","d":["A crash cut slams two images together with no blend, so the join itself stings. One side of the splice and the other collide; unlike a smash that breaks an earned quiet, a crash cut often starts inside the event or hits like a drum from the first frame.","撞击剪辑（crash cut）把两个画面猛地撞在一起，没有任何过渡，因此接点本身就会刺痛。拼接的两侧相互碰撞；不同于打破应得静默的猛切，撞击剪辑常常从事件内部开始，或从第一帧就像鼓点一样击中。"],"pi":["Crash cut on [Subject], two images colliding with no polite blend, a hard join that should sting. Name A and B, the scale or sound collision, and that B may already be mid-event. For video, no dissolve, no fade, no matched contour unless the match is itself the crash.","对 [主体] 的硬切：两个画面相撞，不做客气的过渡，一次本该刺痛的硬接。写明 A 和 B、尺度或声音上的撞击，以及 B 可能已经在事件中途。用于动态时，不要溶接、不要淡入淡出，也不要用匹配轮廓——除非这个匹配本身就是撞击。"],"cp":["Design three sequences: begin with a violinist standing alone on a flooded stage holding an unopened letter; cut to a calm morning before the concert; later return to the stage with the meaning of the letter now clear. Generate each sequence separately and edit the order deliberately. No unrelated mystery props.","设计三段：开头是小提琴手独自站在被水淹的舞台上，手里拿着一封未拆的信；硬切到音乐会前平静的早晨；之后回到舞台，此时信的含义已经清晰。分别生成每一段，再有意识地安排顺序。不要放无关的悬念道具。"],"hp":["crash cut on [Subject], two images colliding with no polite blend, a hard join that should sting.","对[主体]做撞击剪辑，两个画面相撞，没有温和融合，硬接点应当刺痛。"],"fq":["Name two colliding images and forbid a blend. Example: Crash cut on [Subject], two images colliding with no polite blend, a hard join that should sting. Let B be mid-action if the structure needs it.","说出两个相撞的画面，并禁止融合。示例：对[主体]做撞击剪辑，两个画面相撞，没有温和融合，硬接点应当刺痛。如果结构需要，让 B 处于动作中。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/02-crash-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-cut-02-crash-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/crash-cut.jpg","r":[["Smash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/smash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/smash-cut-165-smash-cut-mini.webp","The next image should hurt."],["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"撞击剪辑"},"cross-cut":{"t":"Cross-Cutting","c":"editing","g":"Misleading cross-cut","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/cross-cut","d":["Cross-cutting alternates two or more locations or action lines, often implying they are happening at the same time. Each side of the join is a complete strand; the engine is meanwhile, two clocks racing.","交叉剪辑（cross-cutting）在两条或多条地点或动作线之间交替，通常暗示它们同时发生。接点的每一侧都是一条完整线索；驱动力是“与此同时”，是两个时钟在赛跑。"],"pi":["Cross-cutting between [Subject] and a simultaneous other line, suspense by alternation, two clocks racing. Name both geographies, what the viewer is invited to assume, and whether that assumption is true. For video, two distinct spaces, alternating shots, tightening duration. Do not morph one room into the other.","在 [主体] 与另一条同时发生的线索之间交叉剪辑，用交替制造悬念，两个时钟在赛跑。写明两个空间各是哪里、引导观众去假设什么，以及这个假设是否成立。用于动态时，两个明确不同的空间、交替的镜头、逐渐缩短的时长。不要让一个房间变形为另一个。"],"cp":["Generate A: a team approaches a building and presses a doorbell. Generate B: someone in a similar interior hears a bell and walks toward a door. Intercut as though they connect. Reveal in a wide reverse that B opens to a lone courier at a different address. Keep the earlier shots ambiguous rather than contradictory.","生成 A：一队人走近一栋楼，按下门铃。生成 B：相似的室内，有人听到铃声并朝门口走去。交叉剪辑，让它们看起来是连贯的。最后用一个宽的反打揭示：B 开门后只有一名快递员，地址完全不同。前面的镜头保持暧昧，而不是自相矛盾。"],"hp":["cross-cutting between [Subject] and a simultaneous other line, suspense by alternation, two clocks racing.","在[主体]与另一条同时发生的线索之间交叉剪辑，用交替制造悬念，两个时钟在赛跑。"],"fq":["Name both spaces and the race. Example: Cross-cutting between [Subject] and a simultaneous other line, two clocks racing. Keep the geographies distinct and the assumption of contact clear.","说出两个空间和这场赛跑。示例：在[主体]与另一条同时发生的线索之间交叉剪辑，两个时钟在赛跑。保持地理空间彼此区分，并让接触的假定清晰。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/111-cross-cutting-between-converging-actions-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-cut-111-cross-cutting-between-converging-actions-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/cross-cut.jpg","r":[["Montage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/montage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/montage-114-elliptical-montage-mini.webp","You need months in a minute."],["Smash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/smash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/smash-cut-165-smash-cut-mini.webp","The next image should hurt."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"交叉剪辑"},"dissolve":{"t":"Dissolve","c":"editing","g":"cross-dissolve","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/dissolve","d":["A dissolve gradually overlaps the outgoing shot with the incoming shot so both images occupy the frame for a measurable duration. Opacity of A falls as opacity of B rises; at the midpoint you are looking at two ghosts.","叠化逐渐将出画镜头与入画镜头重叠，使两个画面在可测量的时长内同时占据画面。A 的不透明度下降，B 的不透明度上升；在中点时，你看到的是两个鬼影。"],"pi":["Dissolve from [Subject] into another time or place, overlapping ghosts, a longer time than a cut admits. Name both images, a shared hook if any (shape, motion, sound), and the mix duration. For video, two full shots plus an opacity crossfade; do not morph bodies or melt sets.","从[主体]叠化到另一个时间或地点，重叠的鬼影，比一个切点所承认的更长的时间。说出两个画面、若有任何共享钩子（形状、运动、声音），以及混合时长。对于视频，两个完整镜头加一个不透明度交叉淡化；不要让人体变形或让场景融化。"],"cp":["End on an old projector turning in a dark room. Let its rhythmic mechanical chatter continue across a cut to a sewing workshop, then resolve naturally into the sewing machine now on screen. Generate both pictures separately and match the two sound rhythms without a decorative visual dissolve.","以一台老式放映机在暗室中转动结束。让它的节奏性机械咔嗒声跨过一个切点继续到缝纫工坊，然后自然归入此刻屏幕上的缝纫机。分别生成两个画面，并匹配两种声音节奏，不要用装饰性的视觉叠化。"],"hp":["dissolve from [Subject] into another time or place, overlapping ghosts, longer than a cut admits.","从[主体]叠化到另一个时间或地点，重叠的鬼影，比一个切点所承认的更长。"],"fq":["Name both shots and the overlap. Example: Dissolve from [Subject] into another time or place, overlapping ghosts. Specify a mix, not a morph, and how long the ghosts share the frame.","说出两个镜头和重叠。示例：从[主体]叠化到另一个时间或地点，重叠的鬼影。指定混合，而不是变形，并说明鬼影共享画面多久。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/102-dissolve-and-temporal-layering-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dissolve-102-dissolve-and-temporal-layering-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dissolve.jpg","r":[["Fade In / Fade Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/fade","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fade-103-fade-to-a-field-of-black-or-color-mini.webp","A scene is a book chapter."],["Double Exposure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-exposure.webp","Two times or two selves occupy one frame."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"叠化"},"fade":{"t":"Fade In / Fade Out","c":"editing","g":"Fade-out","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/fade","d":["A fade in or fade out takes the picture to or from a uniform field of black or color, rather than handing the frame straight to another visible scene. One side of the join is a world; the other side is absence, sleep, death, or a chapter break.","淡入或淡出把画面带到或带离一个均匀的黑场或色场，而不是把画框直接交给另一个可见场景。接点的一侧是一个世界；另一侧是缺席、睡眠、死亡，或一个章节断点。"],"pi":["Fade to or from black around [Subject], chapter punctuation, sleep, death, or the start of a world. Name the field color if it is not black. For video, specify whether sound dies with the picture or hangs over the empty field. Do not describe smoke filling the room.","围绕[主体]淡入或淡出到黑场，章节标点、睡眠、死亡，或一个世界的开始。如果不是黑色，说出场色。对于视频，指定声音是随画面一同消亡，还是悬在空场上。不要描述烟雾充满房间。"],"cp":["A woman closes her eyes in a quiet room. Fade the image slowly into deep dark red while the room’s ticking continues for one second, then stops. Hold the empty color field before the next scene. Produce the fade and sound timing in post, not as red smoke filling the room.","一个女人在安静的房间里闭上眼睛。让画面缓慢淡变到深暗红色，同时房间的滴答声继续一秒，然后停止。在下一场之前保持空色场。在后期完成淡变与声音时机，不要做成红色烟雾充满房间。"],"hp":["fade to or from black around [Subject], chapter punctuation, sleep, death, or the start of a world.","围绕[主体]淡入或淡出到黑场，章节标点、睡眠、死亡，或一个世界的开始。"],"fq":["Name the subject and the field. Example: Fade to or from black around [Subject], chapter punctuation. Say whether sound continues over the empty field, and do not fake it with smoke.","说出主体和场。示例：围绕[主体]淡入或淡出到黑场，章节标点。说明声音是否在空场上继续，不要用烟雾伪造。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/103-fade-to-a-field-of-black-or-color-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fade-103-fade-to-a-field-of-black-or-color-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/fade.jpg","r":[["Dissolve","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/dissolve","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dissolve-102-dissolve-and-temporal-layering-mini.webp","Memory, passage, or a gentle death of a scene."],["Iris","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/iris","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/iris-104-iris-opening-or-closing-mini.webp","Point with the mask itself."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"淡入淡出"},"flash-cut":{"t":"Flash Cut","c":"editing","g":"Future presented as memory","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/flash-cut","d":["A flash cut interrupts the present image with a few frames of another picture, then returns or races on before the insert can be studied. One side of the join is the ongoing scene; the other is lightning: a thought, a future, a wound, lasting a blink.","闪切用另一画面的几帧打断当前画面，然后返回，或在插入镜头能被看清之前疾驰而过。接点的一侧是正在进行的场景；另一侧是闪电：一个念头、一个未来、一道伤口，只持续一眨眼。"],"pi":["Flash cut through [Subject], a few frames of another image interrupting, lightning in the edit. Name the present scene, the insert (and its duration in frames), and the return. For video, no dissolve, no long hold on the insert. If the insert is only white, you asked for a light flash.","用闪切穿过[主体]，另一画面的几帧插入打断，剪辑中的闪电。说出当前场景、插入镜头（及其帧数时长）和返回。对于视频，不要叠化，不要长时间停留在插入镜头上。如果插入镜头只是白色，那你是在要求一次闪光。"],"cp":["Show brief intimate images of a woman teaching a child to repair a radio, initially without dates or age labels. In the present, she has never met the child. A later encounter reveals these are future moments. Generate stable radio and room details that make the temporal recognition precise.","展示短暂而私密的画面：一个女人教一个孩子修理收音机，起初没有日期或年龄标签。在当下，她从未见过这个孩子。之后的一次相遇揭示这些是未来的时刻。生成稳定的收音机和房间细节，使时间上的辨认变得精确。"],"hp":["flash cut through [Subject], a few frames of another image interrupting, lightning in the edit.","用闪切穿过[主体]，另一画面的几帧插入打断，剪辑中的闪电。"],"fq":["Name the present shot, the insert, and the frame count. Example: Flash cut through [Subject], a few frames of another image interrupting. Hard cuts, no dissolve, then return.","说出当前镜头、插入镜头和帧数。示例：用闪切穿过[主体]，另一画面的几帧插入打断。硬切，不要叠化，然后返回。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/03-flash-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/flash-cut-03-flash-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/flash-cut.jpg","r":[["Crash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/crash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-cut-02-crash-cut-mini.webp","The next image must hurt."],["Light Flash","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/light-flash","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/light-flash-light-flash-mini.webp","A cut that is also a wound of light."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"闪切"},"fragments":{"t":"Fragments","c":"editing","g":"Constructed action","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/fragments","d":["Fragments, or fragmented editing, build an event from partial views, so the audience infers an action more complete than anything shown in one shot. Each side of a join is a shard: a blade, a mouth, a drain, a hand too late; the whole lives in the gaps.","碎片，或碎片化剪辑，用局部视角构建一个事件，使观众推断出的动作比任何一个镜头所展示的都要完整。接点的每一侧都是一块碎片：一片刀刃、一张嘴、一个排水口、一只伸得太晚的手；整体活在空隙中。"],"pi":["Fragments of [Subject], shattered coverage, pieces of a moment, the scene as shards. List the shards in causal order and name the missing master. For video, separate partial shots plus a binding sound; no single wide that completes the event, no incoherent duplication of the object.","[主体]的碎片，破碎的分镜覆盖，一个时刻的碎片，场景如碎片。按因果顺序列出碎片，并说出缺失的主镜头。对于视频，分开的局部镜头加一个绑定声音；不要用一个完成事件的完整广角镜头，不要对物体进行不连贯的重复。"],"cp":["Imply a valuable vase being accidentally knocked over without showing the full break. Generate separate shots of a sleeve brushing its base, a hand reaching too late, a startled face and ceramic pieces already on the floor. Join with one offscreen crash. No real hazardous stunt or incoherent object duplication.","暗示一个贵重花瓶被意外撞倒，但不展示完整的破碎。生成分开的镜头：袖子擦过它的底座、一只手伸得太晚、一张惊愕的脸，以及已经在地上的陶瓷碎片。用一个画外撞击声连接。不要真实危险特技或不连贯的物体重复。"],"hp":["fragments of [Subject], shattered coverage, pieces of a moment, the scene as shards.","[主体]的碎片，破碎的分镜覆盖，一个时刻的碎片，场景如碎片。"],"fq":["List the shards and what is missing. Example: Fragments of [Subject], shattered coverage, pieces of a moment. Keep causal order and a binding sound; forbid a complete master of the contact.","列出碎片和缺失之物。示例：[主体]的碎片，破碎的分镜覆盖，一个时刻的碎片。保持因果顺序和一个绑定声音；禁止展示接触的完整主镜头。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/176-fragmented-action-and-implied-impact-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fragments-176-fragmented-action-and-implied-impact-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/fragments.jpg","r":[["Quick Cuts","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/quick-cuts","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/quick-cuts-06-quick-cuts-mini.webp","Pace is the meaning."],["Collage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/collage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/collage.webp","One image is not enough; stack them."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"碎片化剪辑"},"graphic-match":{"t":"Graphic Match","c":"editing","g":"Shape match","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/graphic-match","d":["A graphic match cut joins two images that share a dominant shape, line, color, placement, or motion pattern, even when location and time change. The outgoing contour and the incoming contour occupy the same part of the screen, so form carries you across the splice.","图形匹配剪辑连接两个共享主导形状、线条、颜色、位置或运动模式的画面，即使地点和时间改变。出画轮廓和入画轮廓占据屏幕的同一部分，因此形式带你跨过拼接点。"],"pi":["Graphic match on the silhouette of [Subject], shape echoing shape, circle to circle, a visual rhyme. Specify the shared contour, its screen position, and that the objects stay distinct. For video: generate A and B with the same dominant shape size and placement, then hard-cut. No morph, no dissolve unless you explicitly want a soft rhyme.","对 [主体] 轮廓的图形匹配：形状呼应形状，圆接圆，一次视觉押韵。写明共用的轮廓、它在画面中的位置，以及两个物件保持各自独立。视频：生成 A、B，让主导形状的大小与位置一致，然后硬切。不要变形，也不要溶接——除非你明确想要一次柔和的押韵。"],"cp":["Generate A: close-up of a circular watch face centered in frame. Generate B: a circular observatory dome seen from above at exactly the same size and position. Hard-cut on the shared circle, with no morph or dissolve. Keep the two objects distinct and the visual connection immediate.","生成 A：居中构图的圆形表盘特写。生成 B：俯拍一个圆形天文台穹顶，大小与位置完全一致。在共用的圆形上硬切，不要变形，也不要溶接。两个物件保持各自独立，视觉关联要立刻成立。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Name the silhouette or shape on both sides and put it in the same screen place. Example: Graphic match on the silhouette of [Subject], circle to circle. Demand a hard cut and two distinct objects.","说出两侧的剪影或形状，并把它放在屏幕同一位置。示例：在[主体]的剪影上做图形匹配，圆形接圆形。要求硬切和两个不同物体。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/099-graphic-match-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/graphic-match-099-graphic-match-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/graphic-match.jpg","r":[["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."],["Match on Action","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-action","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-action-091-match-on-action-mini.webp","Hide the cut in a movement."],["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."]],"z":"图形匹配"},"invisible-cut":{"t":"Invisible Cut","c":"editing","g":"Substitution splice","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/invisible-cut","d":["An invisible cut hides an edit through motion, darkness, occlusion, blur, matching geometry, or digital stitching. One side of the join and the other are meant to feel like a single take; the splice is a seam the audience should not find.","隐形剪辑通过运动、黑暗、遮挡、模糊、匹配几何或数字缝合来隐藏剪辑。接点的两侧都应感觉像同一个镜头；拼接点是一道观众不应找到的接缝。"],"pi":["Invisible cut hidden in [Subject]'s whip, a dark wall, or a passing body, the oner illusion. Name the hiding action, the before plate, the after plate, and that the camera path should appear continuous. For video, two plates joined at occlusion or blur; locked lighting; no liquid morph.","隐形剪辑隐藏在[主体]的甩动、暗墙或经过的人体中，一镜到底的幻觉。说出隐藏动作、前板、后板，以及摄影机路径应显得连续。对于视频，两块画面板在遮挡或模糊处连接；锁定灯光；不要液体变形。"],"cp":["A stage magician drops a cloth over an empty chair. At the instant the cloth fills the chair silhouette, cut to an identically framed plate with a bouquet beneath it. The magician lifts the cloth. Locked camera, matching hands and shadows, no liquid morph or camera move. Generate two plates and join them at the occlusion.","一位舞台魔术师把布盖到一把空椅子上。在布填满椅子剪影的瞬间，切到一个构图相同、其下有一束花的画面板。魔术师掀起布。锁定摄影机，匹配手和阴影，不要液体变形或摄影机运动。生成两块画面板，并在遮挡处连接它们。"],"hp":["invisible cut hidden in [Subject]'s whip, a dark wall, or a passing body, the oner illusion.","隐形剪辑隐藏在[主体]的甩动、暗墙或经过的人体中，一镜到底的幻觉。"],"fq":["Name the hiding place and both plates. Example: Invisible cut hidden in [Subject]'s whip, a dark wall, or a passing body. Demand matched lighting and no morph.","说出隐藏处和两块画面板。示例：隐形剪辑隐藏在[主体]的甩动、暗墙或经过的人体中。要求匹配灯光，不要变形。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/107-occlusion-hidden-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/invisible-cut-107-occlusion-hidden-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/invisible-cut.jpg","r":[["Oner","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/one-er","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-er-026-social-access-tracking-oner-mini.webp","The scene is a ride."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"隐形剪辑"},"iris":{"t":"Iris","c":"editing","g":"Iris-in","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/iris","d":["An iris transition reveals or conceals the picture with a moving circular or shaped mask. The mask's center is a pointer: one side of the join is the full world, the other is a hole closing on a face, a detail, or black.","圈入圈出转场用移动的圆形或异形遮罩揭示或遮蔽画面。遮罩的中心是一个指针：接点的一侧是整个完整世界，另一侧是一个正在向脸部、细节或黑场闭合的洞。"],"pi":["Iris in or out on [Subject], a circular mask closing on a face or detail, silent-era pointing, or a wink. Name the center (an eye, a ring, a cat), whether the mask follows, and whether it opens or closes. For video, generate the clean scene, then animate a circular mask in post. Do not zoom into darkness and call it an iris.","在[主体]上圈入或圈出，一个圆形遮罩向脸部或细节闭合，默片式的指向，或一个眨眼。说出中心（一只眼睛、一个环、一只猫）、遮罩是否跟随，以及它是打开还是闭合。对于视频，生成干净场景，然后在后期动画一个圆形遮罩。不要变焦进入黑暗，并称它为圈入圈出。"],"cp":["A violinist finishes a performance in an otherwise empty hall. Close a circular iris around her satisfied face, then let the circle reveal a tiny yawning cat on the piano before closing to black. Generate the clean scene and animate the mask separately.","一位小提琴手在空荡大厅中结束演奏。在她满足的脸周围闭合一个圆形圈入遮罩，然后让圆圈揭示钢琴上一只打哈欠的小猫，再闭合到黑场。生成干净场景，并单独动画遮罩。"],"hp":["iris in or out on [Subject], a circular mask closing on a face or detail, silent-era pointing, or a wink.","在[主体]上圈入或圈出，一个圆形遮罩向脸部或细节闭合，默片式的指向，或一个眨眼。"],"fq":["Name the subject and the mask. Example: Iris in or out on [Subject], a circular mask closing on a face or detail. Specify center and direction (in or out), and say it is a mask, not a zoom.","说出主体和遮罩。示例：在[主体]上圈入或圈出，一个圆形遮罩向脸部或细节闭合。指定中心和方向（圈入或圈出），并说明它是遮罩，不是变焦。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/104-iris-opening-or-closing-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/iris-104-iris-opening-or-closing-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/iris.jpg","r":[["Vignette","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/vignette","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/vignette.webp","Hold the eye in. Do not crush the sides as a filter."],["Fade In / Fade Out","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/fade","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fade-103-fade-to-a-field-of-black-or-color-mini.webp","A scene is a book chapter."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"圈入圈出"},"jump-cut":{"t":"Jump Cut","c":"editing","g":"Visible temporal discontinuity","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","d":["A jump cut removes time or slightly shifts framing inside a similar setup, so the discontinuity is conspicuous. The outgoing frame and the incoming frame are close enough that the missing interval reads as a skip, not as a new shot.","跳切在相似设置内移除时间或轻微偏移构图，因此不连续性是显眼的。出画帧和入画帧足够接近，使缺失的间隔被读作一次跳跃，而不是一个新镜头。"],"pi":["Jump cut on [Subject], time skipped inside a similar framing, interruption, anxiety or comedy of missing frames. Specify a locked or near-locked setup, what changes (posture, clock, crowd), and that the camera does not morph. For video, one bench or seat, several jumps, elapsed waiting, no repositioning disguised as a jump.","对[主体]进行跳切，在相似构图中跳过时间，打断、焦虑或缺失帧的喜剧。指定一个锁定或近乎锁定的机位，说明什么发生变化（姿势、时钟、人群），以及摄影机不变形。对于视频，一张长椅或座位，若干次跳切，流逝的等待，不要把重新摆机位伪装成跳切。"],"cp":["Locked medium shot of a woman waiting at a station bench. Make six jump cuts in the same framing as she changes posture, checks the clock and shifts her bag. Other passengers change between cuts. Clear elapsed waiting time, no morphing transitions or camera repositioning.","锁定中景：一个女人在车站长椅上等待。在同一构图中做六次跳切，她改变姿势、看时钟、挪动包。其他乘客在切点之间变化。清晰的流逝等待时间，不要变形转场或重新摆摄影机。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Keep one framing and skip time inside it. Example: Jump cut on [Subject], time skipped inside a similar framing. Name what changes between jumps and forbid morphing.","保持一个构图，并在其中跳过时间。示例：对[主体]进行跳切，在相似构图中跳过时间。说出跳切之间变化的内容，并禁止变形。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/119-jump-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/jump-cut.jpg","r":[["Smash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/smash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/smash-cut-165-smash-cut-mini.webp","The next image should hurt."],["Montage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/montage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/montage-114-elliptical-montage-mini.webp","You need months in a minute."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"跳切"},"l-cut-visual":{"t":"J-Cut / L-Cut (Visual Setup)","c":"editing","g":"Contrapuntal sound","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/l-cut-visual","d":["A J-cut or L-cut visual setup is a picture designed so sound can lead or lag across the splice. One side of the join is a face, a room, or a listener that can hold; the other side is a space already speaking, or still speaking after we have left it.","J-cut 或 L-cut 的视觉设置是一种画面设计，让声音可以跨剪辑点提前进入或滞后延续。剪辑点的一侧是一张脸、一个房间或一个倾听者，可以停留；另一侧是已经在说话的空间，或我们已经离开后仍在说话的空间。"],"pi":["A frame of [Subject] designed as the picture half of an L-cut or J-cut, reaction holding while another space is already speaking. For stills, describe a listening face or a doorway that can hold offscreen voice. For video, specify whether audio of B starts under A (J) or audio of A continues under B (L), and name both spaces.","[主体] 的一个画面，被设计成 L-cut 或 J-cut 中「画面」的那一半：反应镜头保持着，而另一个空间的声音已经进来。静帧时，描述一张在倾听的脸，或一个能承载画外声音的门洞。视频时，明确是 B 的声音先压着 A 的画面起来（J-cut），还是 A 的声音延续到 B 的画面之下（L-cut），并把两个空间都写出来。"],"cp":["A cheerful original corporate jingle plays over a spotless office being emptied after a sudden closure. Workers quietly pack plants and family photographs while the tune maintains its bright tempo. Generate restrained visual coverage and compose an original cue; do not imitate an existing recording or melody.","一段欢快的原创企业广告歌，盖在一个因突然倒闭而正在被搬空、纤尘不染的办公室画面上。员工安静地打包绿植和家庭照片，而旋律保持明亮的节拍。生成克制的画面素材，并创作一段原创配乐；不要模仿已有的录音或旋律。"],"hp":["a frame of [Subject] designed as the picture half of an L-cut or J-cut, reaction holding while another space is already speaking.","一个 [主体] 的画面，设计为 L-cut 或 J-cut 的画面部分，反应停留，而另一个空间已经在说话。"],"fq":["Describe a face or room that can hold offscreen voice. Example: A frame of [Subject] as the picture half of an L-cut or J-cut, reaction holding while another space is already speaking. For video, say which track pre-laps.","描述一张能承接画外声音的脸或一个房间。示例：一个 [主体] 的画面，作为 L-cut 或 J-cut 的画面部分，反应停留，而另一个空间已经在说话。视频中，说明哪条音轨提前进入。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/152-l-cut-and-dialogue-postlap-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/l-cut-visual-152-l-cut-and-dialogue-postlap-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/l-cut-visual.jpg","r":[["Reaction Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/reaction-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reaction-shot-093-reaction-shot-mini.webp","The important action is watching."],["Cross-Cutting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/cross-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-cut-111-cross-cutting-between-converging-actions-mini.webp","Meanwhile is the engine."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"声画错位剪辑"},"match-action":{"t":"Match on Action","c":"editing","g":"Cut on movement","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-action","d":["Match on action cuts during one continuous action so the movement itself bridges two camera positions. The outgoing shot starts the gesture; the incoming shot finishes it, which is why the edit can change size or angle without feeling interrupted.","动作匹配在同一个连续动作中切换，使动作本身桥接两个机位。出镜镜头开始手势；入镜镜头完成它，因此剪辑可以改变景别或角度而不让人觉得被打断。"],"pi":["Match on action through [Subject]'s gesture, the motion started in one shot and finished in the next. Name the wide and the close, the hand, the object, the direction of travel, and that the cut happens during the move. For video, generate A and B of the same reach or step, then cut mid-motion. Do not reverse the hand or the walk.","用 [主体] 的动作做动作剪辑：动作在一个镜头里开始，在下一个镜头里完成。写明全景与特写、哪只手、什么物件、运动方向，以及剪辑点落在动作过程中。用于动态时，把同一个伸手或迈步生成 A、B 两段，然后在动作中段切。不要把手的方向或行走方向弄反。"],"cp":["Generate A: wide view of a courier reaching for a door handle with the right hand. Generate B: close view from the same side of the action axis, continuing that exact reach and turning the handle. Cut during the reach, preserving hand, speed, sleeve and handle position.","生成 A：快递员用右手去握门把手的全景。生成 B：从动作轴同一侧拍的近景，延续同一次伸手并转动把手。在伸手过程中切，保持手、速度、袖子和把手位置一致。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Describe a gesture started in one framing and finished in the next. Name the hand, the object, and the cut during motion. Example: Match on action through [Subject]'s gesture, continuity glue.","描述一个在一个构图里开始、在下一个构图里完成的手势。说明手、物体，以及在运动中切换。示例：通过 [主体] 的手势做动作匹配，连贯性黏合。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/091-match-on-action-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-action-091-match-on-action-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/match-action.jpg","r":[["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."],["Axial Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/axial-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/axial-cut-177-axial-cut-and-punch-in-cut-mini.webp","Change shot size without changing angle."],["Graphic Match","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/graphic-match","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/graphic-match-099-graphic-match-cut-mini.webp","Form carries you across time."]],"z":"动作匹配剪辑"},"match-cut":{"t":"Match Cut","c":"editing","g":"Plant and payoff","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","d":["A match cut joins two shots through a visual, spatial, sonic, or conceptual correspondence the viewer can read at the splice. The outgoing frame and the incoming frame share a shape, motion, object class, or idea, so the cut argues a relationship instead of only changing the view.","匹配剪辑通过观众能在剪辑点读出的视觉、空间、声音或概念对应关系，将两个镜头连接起来。出画帧和入画帧共享形状、运动、物体类别或理念，因此剪辑在论证一种关系，而不只是改变视角。"],"pi":["Write both sides of the join. Example: Match cut from [Subject] to a rhyming shape or motion in another time, graphic continuity across a hard cut, bone to station. Name the shared contour or vector, name what changes (place, era, scale), and forbid a morph or dissolve. For video, generate A and B as separate shots with matched screen position, then cut; do not ask the model to blend them.","把衔接的两端都写清楚。例：从 [主体] 匹配剪辑到一个在形状或运动上押韵的对象，跨越硬切保持图形连续，骨头接空间站。写明共用的轮廓或向量，写明变化的是什么（地点、年代、尺度），并禁止变形或溶接。用于动态时，把 A、B 生成为两个画面位置对位的独立镜头再切；不要要求模型把它们混合。"],"cp":["In an early workshop scene, casually show a door that sticks unless lifted slightly. Later, during an urgent evacuation, a visitor fails to open it until the apprentice remembers the trick. Generate the same door hardware and motion in both scenes. Avoid a conspicuous explanatory close-up in the setup.","在早期工坊的场景里，不经意地展示一扇必须轻轻抬起才能打开的门。之后在一次紧急疏散中，一位访客打不开它，直到学徒想起这个窍门。两场戏使用同一套门具与同样的动作。铺垫时不要用显眼的解释性特写。"],"hp":0,"fq":["Describe shot A, shot B, the shared shape or motion, and a hard cut. Example: Match cut from [Subject] to a rhyming shape in another time, bone to station. Say no morph and no dissolve.","描述镜头 A、镜头 B、共享的形状或运动，以及硬切。示例：从 [主体] 匹配剪辑到另一个时间里呼应的形状，骨头到空间站。说明不要变形、不要叠化。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/01-match-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/match-cut.jpg","r":[["Graphic Match","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/graphic-match","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/graphic-match-099-graphic-match-cut-mini.webp","Form carries you across time."],["Match on Action","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-action","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-action-091-match-on-action-mini.webp","Hide the cut in a movement."],["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."]],"z":"匹配剪辑"},"match-motion":{"t":"Match Motion","c":"editing","g":"Motion bridge","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-motion","d":["A match-motion cut continues direction and speed across the splice so the cut rides a vector even when location, time, or reality changes. One side of the join starts a movement; the other side keeps that movement, and the world around the body may be new.","运动匹配剪辑让方向和速度跨剪辑点延续，因此即使地点、时间或现实改变，剪辑也能乘着一个矢量运行。剪辑点的一侧开始一个动作；另一侧保持那个动作，而身体周围的世界可能是新的。"],"pi":["Match-motion cut on [Subject], direction and speed continuing across the join so the cut rides the movement. Name the outgoing path, the incoming path, matched pose and velocity, and what world changes. For video, two shots with aligned motion phase, hard cut, no dissolving body.","在 [主体] 上做运动匹配剪辑，方向和速度跨剪辑点延续，让剪辑乘着运动走。说明出画路径、入画路径、匹配的姿势和速度，以及什么世界发生变化。视频中，两个镜头的运动相位对齐，硬切，不要身体溶解。"],"cp":["Generate A: a woman falls backward onto a train berth. Generate B: the same woman completes the identical backward movement onto grass in a sunlit field. Match body pose, clothing, framing and velocity at the cut. Hard transition between worlds, no dissolving mattress or body morph.","生成 A：一名女子向后倒在火车卧铺上。生成 B：同一名女子完成完全相同的向后动作，倒在阳光照耀的田野草地上。在剪辑点匹配身体姿势、服装、构图和速度。世界之间硬切过渡，不要床垫溶解，不要身体变形。"],"hp":["match-motion cut on [Subject], direction and speed continuing across the join so the cut rides the movement.","在 [主体] 上做运动匹配剪辑，方向和速度跨剪辑点延续，让剪辑乘着运动走。"],"fq":["Describe the same direction and speed on both sides, and name the world change. Example: Match-motion cut on [Subject], direction and speed continuing across the join. Hard cut, matched pose, no morph.","描述两侧相同的方向和速度，并说明世界变化。示例：在 [主体] 上做运动匹配剪辑，方向和速度跨剪辑点延续。硬切，匹配姿势，不要变形。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/04-match-motion-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-motion-04-match-motion-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/match-motion.jpg","r":[["Match on Action","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-action","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-action-091-match-on-action-mini.webp","Hide the cut in a movement."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"运动匹配剪辑"},"match-split":{"t":"Match Split","c":"editing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-split","d":["A match split continues a graphic line or motion across a divide, so one contour belongs to two worlds at once. One side of the join is a pane or half-frame; the other is its partner; the shared edge, horizon, or gesture is the match.","匹配分割将一条图形线或运动延续跨过一道分割，因此一个轮廓同时属于两个世界。剪辑点的一侧是一块窗格或半画幅；另一侧是它的配对；共享的边缘、地平线或手势就是匹配点。"],"pi":["Match split of [Subject], a graphic divide that continues a line or motion into another space. Name the shared contour (horizon, table, eyeline), what each half contains, and that both are simultaneous. For video, two plates, one continued line, a stable boundary. No morph across the seam.","匹配分割 [主体]，一种图形分割，将一条线或运动延续到另一个空间。说明共享轮廓（地平线、桌子、视线），每一半包含什么，以及两者是同时发生的。视频中，两个画面层，一条延续的线，稳定的边界。接缝处不要变形。"],"cp":["Match split of [Subject], a graphic divide that continues a line or motion into another space.","匹配分割 [主体]，一种图形分割，将一条线或运动延续到另一个空间。"],"hp":["match split of [Subject], a graphic divide that continues a line or motion into another space.","匹配分割 [主体]，一种图形分割，将一条线或运动延续到另一个空间。"],"fq":["Name the continued line and both halves. Example: Match split of [Subject], a graphic divide that continues a line or motion into another space. Simultaneous panes, no morph.","说明延续的线和两个半边。示例：匹配分割 [主体]，一种图形分割，将一条线或运动延续到另一个空间。同时出现的窗格，不要变形。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/05-match-split-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-split-05-match-split-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/match-split.jpg","r":[["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."],["Split Screen","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/split-screen","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-screen-120-simultaneous-split-screen-mini.webp","Two rooms, one moment."],["Graphic Match","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/graphic-match","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/graphic-match-099-graphic-match-cut-mini.webp","Form carries you across time."]],"z":"匹配分割"},"montage":{"t":"Montage","c":"editing","g":"Associative juxtaposition","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/montage","d":["Film montage creates meaning or compression through the ordered juxtaposition of shots. Each side of a join is a complete image; the claim lives in the order, the collision, or the months squeezed into a minute.","电影蒙太奇通过镜头的有序并置创造意义或压缩。剪辑点的每一侧都是一幅完整影像；主张存在于顺序、碰撞，或被压缩进一分钟的几个月里。"],"pi":["Montage sequence built around [Subject], time collapsed by images, training, travel, or a life in twenty shots. List the ordered images, what the collision claims, and whether time or idea is the engine. For video, many distinct shots, no morph between them, a duration curve. Do not ask for one tracking shot labeled montage.","围绕 [主体] 构建的蒙太奇段落，用影像压缩时间，训练、旅行，或二十个镜头里的一生。列出有序影像、碰撞所主张的内容，以及引擎是时间还是理念。视频中，许多不同的镜头，镜头之间不要变形，一条时长曲线。不要要求一个被标为蒙太奇的单一跟拍镜头。"],"cp":["Create an essay montage alternating an automated sorting line with commuters moving through identical ticket gates. Match recurring barriers and mechanical rhythms to suggest institutional organization, while keeping humans visibly individual. No captions asserting the analogy as an objective fact.","创作一段散文式蒙太奇，将自动化分拣线与穿过相同检票闸机的通勤者交替呈现。匹配反复出现的屏障和机械节奏，以暗示机构化组织，同时让人类保持可见的个体性。不要用字幕把这一类比断言为客观事实。"],"hp":["montage sequence built around [Subject], time collapsed by images, training, travel, or a life in twenty shots.","围绕 [主体] 构建的蒙太奇段落，用影像压缩时间，训练、旅行，或二十个镜头里的一生。"],"fq":["List the shots and the claim. Example: Montage sequence built around [Subject], time collapsed by images, training, travel, or a life in twenty shots. Specify order, not a single moving take.","列出镜头和主张。示例：围绕 [主体] 构建的蒙太奇段落，用影像压缩时间，训练、旅行，或二十个镜头里的一生。说明顺序，而不是一个单一运动长镜头。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/114-elliptical-montage-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/montage-114-elliptical-montage-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/montage.jpg","r":[["Cross-Cutting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/cross-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-cut-111-cross-cutting-between-converging-actions-mini.webp","Meanwhile is the engine."],["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"蒙太奇"},"quick-cuts":{"t":"Quick Cuts","c":"editing","g":"Accelerating cut pattern","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/quick-cuts","d":["Quick cuts editing strings shots shorter than a breath, so duration itself becomes rhythm, pressure, or music. Each side of a join is a full view from a changing setup; the meaning is the rate, not a skip inside one frame.","快切剪辑把短于一息的镜头串起来，因此时长本身变成节奏、压力或音乐。剪辑点的每一侧都是来自变化机位的完整视图；意义在于速率，而不是某一帧内部的跳切。"],"pi":["Quick cuts around [Subject], shots shorter than a breath, rhythm as violence or music. List a progression of sizes (wide to eyes, or hands to kit) and a duration curve. For video, many distinct angles, short holds, no morph, and one planned pause if you need a landing.","[主体] 周围的快切：镜头比一次呼吸还短，节奏本身成为暴力或音乐。列出一套景别递进（从全景到眼睛，或从手到装备）和一条时长曲线。用于动态时，大量不同的角度、很短的停留、不要变形，如果需要落点就安排一次停顿。"],"cp":["Create a tense three-person card-game ending. Begin with wide spatial views, then progressively shorter shots of faces, hands and one face-down card. Accelerate the cutting while preserving who sits where, then hold a long silent close-up before the card turns. Assemble rhythm in the edit.","拍一场紧张的三人牌局结尾。先用宽的空间镜头，然后镜头越来越短：脸、手、一张扣着的牌。加快剪辑的同时保持谁坐在哪里的空间关系，然后在翻牌前用一个长时间无声的特写停住。节奏在剪辑里组装。"],"hp":["quick cuts around [Subject], shots shorter than a breath, rhythm as violence or music.","围绕 [主体] 的快切，短于一息的镜头，节奏作为暴力或音乐。"],"fq":["Ask for many short, distinct shots and a duration curve. Example: Quick cuts around [Subject], shots shorter than a breath, rhythm as violence or music. Name the progression of sizes.","要求许多短而不同的镜头和一条时长曲线。示例：围绕 [主体] 的快切，短于一息的镜头，节奏作为暴力或音乐。说明景别递进。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/06-quick-cuts-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/quick-cuts-06-quick-cuts-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/quick-cuts.jpg","r":[["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."],["Crash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/crash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-cut-02-crash-cut-mini.webp","The next image must hurt."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"快切"},"set-transition":{"t":"Set Transition","c":"editing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/set-transition","d":["A set transition lets the location change in camera: walls walk, architecture rewrites, one space becomes another without a hard cut. Both sides of the join are geographies that share a continuous camera path; the set itself is the editor.","布景转换让地点在镜头内变化：墙壁移动，建筑改写，一个空间变成另一个，没有硬切。剪辑点的两侧是共享连续摄影机路径的地理空间；布景本身就是剪辑师。"],"pi":["Set transition around [Subject], the location transforming in camera, walls walking, one space becoming another. Name the starting architecture, the ending architecture, and that the camera does not hard-cut. For video: the set around [Subject] transforms into a new location without a hard cut. No morphing faces; the room is what changes.","围绕 [主体] 的布景转换，地点在镜头内变化，墙壁移动，一个空间变成另一个。说明起始建筑、结束建筑，以及摄影机不硬切。视频中：围绕 [主体] 的布景变成一个新地点，没有硬切。不要人脸变形；变化的是房间。"],"cp":["The set around [Subject] transforms into a new location without a hard cut.","围绕 [主体] 的布景变成一个新地点，没有硬切。"],"hp":["set transition around [Subject], the location transforming in camera, walls walking, one space becoming another. Motion brief: the set around [Subject] transforms into a new location without a hard cut.","围绕 [主体] 的布景转换，地点在镜头内变化，墙壁移动，一个空间变成另一个。运动简述：围绕 [主体] 的布景变成一个新地点，没有硬切。"],"fq":["Name both locations and a continuous camera. Example: Set transition around [Subject], walls walking, one space becoming another. Video: the set transforms without a hard cut. Keep the body stable.","说明两个地点和连续的摄影机。示例：围绕 [主体] 的布景转换，墙壁移动，一个空间变成另一个。视频：布景变化没有硬切。保持身体稳定。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/07-set-transition-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/set-transition-07-set-transition-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/set-transition.jpg","r":[["Pass Through","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pass-through","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pass-through-pass-through-mini.webp","Cut the building, not the film."],["Morphing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/morphing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/morphing-morphing-mini.webp","Becoming is visible."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"场景转换"},"smash-cut":{"t":"Smash Cut","c":"editing","g":"Apparent closure","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/smash-cut","d":["A smash cut makes an abrupt, high-contrast transition in image, sound, tone, scale, or time. The outgoing side has earned a state (quiet, prayer, resolution); the incoming side contradicts it without a polite blend.","猛切在影像、声音、基调、尺度或时间上做出突然的高对比过渡。出画的一侧已经赢得一种状态（安静、祈祷、解决）；入画的一侧不经礼貌混合就与它矛盾。"],"pi":["Smash cut from [Subject] to a violently different image, silence to noise, prayer to explosion, no polite dissolve. Name the outgoing state (quiet, dark, small, resolved) and the incoming opposite (loud, bright, huge, ruptured). For video, hold A, then hard-cut to B; specify the sound smash or the delayed boom.","从 [主体] 猛切到一个剧烈不同的影像，寂静到噪音，祈祷到爆炸，不要礼貌的叠化。说明出画状态（安静、黑暗、小、已解决）和入画的相反状态（响亮、明亮、巨大、破裂）。视频中，保持 A，然后硬切到 B；说明声音猛击或延迟轰鸣。"],"cp":["After a conservator returns a stolen painting, show a calm closing sequence: gallery reopened, lights dimmed, doors locked. In one final locked shot, reveal a tiny fresh brushstroke appearing on the otherwise restored canvas. Keep the event subtle and consistent with earlier clues, not an unrelated shock.","在修复师归还一幅被盗画作后，展示一段平静的收尾段落：画廊重新开放，灯光调暗，门上锁。在最后一个固定镜头中，揭示经过修复的画布上出现一小笔新鲜的笔触，除此之外画面已修复。让这一事件保持微妙，并与早先线索一致，而不是无关的惊吓。"],"hp":["from [Subject] to a violently different image, no polite dissolve.","从 [主体] 猛切到一个剧烈不同的影像，不要礼貌的叠化。"],"fq":["Name the earned state and the contradicting image. Example: Smash cut from [Subject] to a violently different image, silence to noise, no dissolve. Hold A, then hard-cut to B.","说明已赢得的状态和与之矛盾的影像。示例：从 [主体] 猛切到一个剧烈不同的影像，寂静到噪音，不要叠化。保持 A，然后硬切到 B。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/165-smash-cut-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/smash-cut-165-smash-cut-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/smash-cut.jpg","r":[["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."],["Graphic Match","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/graphic-match","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/graphic-match-099-graphic-match-cut-mini.webp","Form carries you across time."]],"z":"硬切"},"split-screen":{"t":"Split Screen","c":"editing","g":"Rashomon structure","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/split-screen","d":["Split screen shows two or more image fields at once, so separate spaces share a single moment on the same frame. Both sides of the join are visible together; there is no waiting for the next cut.","分屏同时展示两个或更多影像区域，因此分隔的空间在同一画面上共享同一个时刻。剪辑点的两侧一起可见；无需等待下一次剪辑。"],"pi":["Split screen with [Subject] in one pane and another life in the other, simultaneous spaces, phone-call cinema or dual identity. Name the boundary, whether eyelines match, and what each pane contains. For video, two (or more) complete shots composited, not one image torn as a texture.","[主体] 在一格、另一种生活 在另一格的分屏，同时并存的空间，电话电影或双重身份。写明分界线、视线是否对位，以及每一格各有什么内容。用于动态时，是两条（或更多）完整镜头合成在一起，而不是把一张图当纹理撕开。"],"cp":["Show one lost-wallet incident three times: from the owner’s view, a cleaner’s view and a distant passenger’s view. Preserve the same station clock, movements and wallet position, but reveal different occluded actions each time. The third version resolves the apparent theft without inventing a new event.","把一次丢钱包事件展示三遍：失主的视角、清洁工的视角、远处乘客的视角。保留同一个车站时钟、同样的动作和钱包位置，但每次揭示不同的被遮挡动作。第三个版本解开这场看似盗窃的误会，而不是编出一件新事件。"],"hp":["split screen with [Subject] in one pane and another life in the other, simultaneous spaces, phone-call cinema or dual identity.","分屏，[主体] 在一个窗格，另一种生活在另一个窗格，同时发生的空间，电话通话电影或双重身份。"],"fq":["Describe each pane and the divide. Example: Split screen with [Subject] in one pane and another life in the other, simultaneous spaces. Specify a hard boundary and two complete scenes.","描述每个窗格和分割线。示例：分屏，[主体] 在一个窗格，另一种生活在另一个窗格，同时发生的空间。说明硬边界和两个完整场景。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/120-simultaneous-split-screen-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-screen-120-simultaneous-split-screen-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/split-screen.jpg","r":[["Frame within Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/frame-in-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frame-in-frame-041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.webp","Someone is watched, trapped, or pictured."],["Cross-Cutting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/cross-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-cut-111-cross-cutting-between-converging-actions-mini.webp","Meanwhile is the engine."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."]],"z":"分屏"},"transitions":{"t":"Transitions","c":"editing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/transitions","d":["Film transitions are designed joins: the splice treated as a visible gesture rather than as continuity glue. One side of the join and the other are planned as a pair, and the audience is meant to notice how we left A and entered B.","电影转场是经过设计的衔接：把剪接点当作可见的动作，而不是连贯性的胶水。接点的两侧被作为一对来规划，观众应当注意到我们如何离开 A、进入 B。"],"pi":["A designed transition around [Subject], the join as a gesture: wipe, morph, match, or light. Name both sides and the species of join. For video, generate A and B as complete shots, then specify the gesture (hard match, mix, traveling edge, whip). Do not write 'cool transition' or 'seamless' if you want the join seen.","围绕[主体]设计一次转场，把接点作为动作：划变、形变、匹配或光线。命名接点两侧以及接合的种类。视频时，将 A 和 B 生成为完整镜头，再指定动作（硬匹配、叠化、移动边缘、甩）。若想让接点被看见，不要写“酷炫转场”或“无缝”。"],"cp":["A designed transition around [Subject], the join as a gesture: wipe, morph, match, or light.","围绕[主体]设计一次转场，把接点作为动作：划变、形变、匹配或光线。"],"hp":["a designed transition around [Subject], the join as a gesture: wipe, morph, match, or light.","围绕[主体]设计一次转场，把接点作为动作：划变、形变、匹配或光线。"],"fq":["Name A, B, and the species of join. Example: a designed transition around [Subject], the join as a gesture: wipe, morph, match, or light. Forbid vague words like seamless or cool.","命名 A、B 以及接合的种类。示例：围绕[主体]设计一次转场，把接点作为动作：划变、形变、匹配或光线。禁止“无缝”或“酷炫”这类含糊词。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/08-transitions-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/transitions-08-transitions-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/transitions.jpg","r":[["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Dissolve","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/dissolve","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dissolve-102-dissolve-and-temporal-layering-mini.webp","Memory, passage, or a gentle death of a scene."]],"z":"转场"},"wipe":{"t":"Wipe","c":"editing","g":"horizontal wipe","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/wipe","d":["A wipe replaces one image with another through a moving boundary that travels across the frame. One side of the join is still A; the other side is already B; the edge between them is the edit, and it is meant to be seen.","划变通过一条横穿画面的移动边界，用一个图像替换另一个图像。接点的一侧仍是 A；另一侧已经是 B；它们之间的边缘就是剪辑，并且它应当被看见。"],"pi":["Wipe replacing [Subject] with the next image, a line traveling across the frame, Star Wars grammar or a clock hand. Name direction, edge hardness, and both scenes. For video, generate A and B as full frames, then composite a moving mask. No blending scenery, no morph.","用划像把 [主体] 换成下一个画面，一条线横穿画面，《星球大战》式的语法或时钟指针。写明方向、边缘的软硬，以及两个场景各是什么。用于动态时，把 A、B 生成完整画幅，再合成一个移动的遮罩。不要叠化景物，不要变形。"],"cp":["Generate A: a traveler leaves a dusty village at dawn. Generate B: the traveler approaches a distant mountain pass later that day. Replace A with B using a clean left-to-right vertical wipe. Consistent travel direction, no blending or morphing scenery.","生成 A：旅人在黎明离开尘土飞扬的村庄。生成 B：当天晚些时候，旅人接近远处的山口。用一条干净的、从左到右的竖向划像把 A 换成 B。行进方向一致，不要叠化，也不要变形的景物。"],"hp":["wipe replacing [Subject] with the next image, a line traveling across the frame, a clock hand or a hard vertical.","划变用下一个图像替换[主体]，一条线横穿画面，一个时钟指针或一条硬垂直边。"],"fq":["Name both images and the traveling edge. Example: Wipe replacing [Subject] with the next image, a line traveling across the frame. Specify direction and a clean mask, not a morph.","命名两个图像以及移动边缘。示例：划变用下一个图像替换[主体]，一条线横穿画面。指定方向和干净的遮罩，而不是形变。"],"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/105-wipe-transition-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wipe-105-wipe-transition-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/wipe.jpg","r":[["Iris","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/iris","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/iris-104-iris-opening-or-closing-mini.webp","Point with the mask itself."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."],["Graphic Match","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/graphic-match","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/graphic-match-099-graphic-match-cut-mini.webp","Form carries you across time."]],"z":"划像转场"},"altered-state":{"t":"Altered State","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/altered-state","d":["Altered state cinematography makes the mind the location: smear, afterimage, wrong color, unstable time, optics and cutting that no sober observer would report. It is a bundle of techniques motivated by consciousness, not a single filter name.","异常状态摄影把心灵当作场景：拖影、残影、错误颜色、不稳定的时间，以及任何清醒观察者都不会报告的镜头与剪辑。它是一组由意识驱动的技法，而不是某个滤镜名称。"],"pi":["List the perceptual tells. Still: Altered-state image of [Subject], smear, afterimage, wrong color, time that will not sit still. Video: The frame around [Subject] warps as if consciousness is slipping, edges trailing, color unhooked from the room.","列出感知线索。静帧：[主体]的异常状态图像，拖影、残影、错误颜色、无法静止的时间。视频：[主体]周围的画面扭曲，仿佛意识正在滑脱，边缘拖尾，颜色从房间里脱钩。"],"cp":["The frame around [Subject] warps as if consciousness is slipping, edges trailing, color unhooked from the room.","[主体]周围的画面扭曲，仿佛意识正在滑脱，边缘拖尾，颜色从房间里脱钩。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/altered-state-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/altered-state-altered-state-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/altered-state.jpg","r":[["Dreamcore","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/dreamcore","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dreamcore.webp","Nostalgia with the safety removed."],["Datamosh","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/datamosh","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/datamosh-datamosh-mini.webp","Break the file on purpose."],["Double Exposure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-exposure.webp","Two times or two selves occupy one frame."]],"z":"意识异变"},"anamorphic-flare":{"t":"Anamorphic Flare","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","d":["An anamorphic flare is a horizontal streak produced when a bright point hits the cylindrical elements of an anamorphic lens. It is a subset of lens flare, not a general haze, and it usually arrives with oval bokeh from the same squeeze.","变形镜头光晕是当亮点击中变形镜头的圆柱形元件时产生的水平光痕。它是镜头光晕的一个子类，不是一般雾状光晕，并且通常伴随同一压缩带来的椭圆形散景。"],"pi":["State squeeze and streak axis. Example: Horizontal anamorphic flares streaking through [Subject], cyan or magenta bars from headlights or neon, oval bokeh, 2x squeeze, not round spherical ghosts.","说明压缩与光痕轴向。示例：水平变形镜头光晕穿过[主体]，来自车灯或霓虹的青色或品红色条带，椭圆形散景，2x 压缩，不是圆形的球面鬼影。"],"cp":["Horizontal anamorphic flares streaking through [Subject], cyan or magenta bars, oval bokeh, scope cinema signature.","水平变形镜头光晕穿过[主体]，青色或品红色条带，椭圆形散景，宽银幕电影标志。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/anamorphic-flare/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Anamorphic","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/anamorphic","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-057-anamorphic-optical-character-mini.webp","You want the frame to announce it is a movie."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."],["Halation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp","Highlights should bleed like film, not clip like video."]],"z":"变形镜头光晕"},"anthropo":{"t":"Anthropo","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anthropo","d":["Anthropomorphic cinematography stages an object or animal as a performer: human scale in the frame, a gesture, an eyeline, reaction shots, as if the inanimate had a will. The camera does not need a face so much as an actor's grammar.","拟人化摄影把物体或动物调度成表演者：在画面中赋予人的尺度、一个手势、一条视线、反应镜头，仿佛无生命物有意志。摄影机需要的与其说是一张脸，不如说是演员的语法。"],"pi":["Cover the thing like a person. Example: Anthropomorphic frame of [Subject], an object or animal given human scale, gesture, or eyeline, singles and looks as if it had a will, not a camera inside the object.","像拍人一样覆盖这个东西。示例：[主体]的拟人化画面，一个物体或动物被赋予人的尺度、手势或视线，用单拍和目光，仿佛它有意志，而不是把摄影机放进物体内部。"],"cp":["Anthropomorphic frame of [Subject], an object or animal given human scale, gesture, or eyeline, the inanimate performing.","[主体]的拟人化画面，一个物体或动物被赋予人的尺度、手势或视线，让无生命物表演。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/anthropo-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anthropo-anthropo-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/anthropo.jpg","r":[["Object POV","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/object-pov","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/object-pov-object-pov-mini.webp","The prop has eyes."],["Tableau","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/tableau","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tableau.webp","Hold the arrangement."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"拟人化"},"argus":{"t":"Argus","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/argus","d":["An Argus image, argus many eyes, fills the frame with looking: extra pupils on a body, a swarm of viewpoints, a creature or a city of eyes. The surplus is seeing, counted as organs or cameras, not as flare.","阿耳戈斯图像，即百眼式的许多眼睛，用观看填满画面：身体上多出的瞳孔、一群视角、一个眼睛的生物或一座眼睛的城市。过剩的是观看，以器官或摄影机来计算，而不是以光晕来计算。"],"pi":["Argus image of [Subject], many eyes, many viewpoints, a creature or a city of looking. Count the eyes. Keep a center. Ban lens flare standing in for pupils, and ban a simple two-panel split.","[主体]的阿耳戈斯图像，许多眼睛，许多视角，一个观看的生物或一座观看的城市。数清眼睛。保留一个中心。禁止用镜头光晕代替瞳孔，禁止简单的双画面分屏。"],"cp":["Argus image of [Subject], many eyes, many viewpoints, a creature or a city of looking.","[主体]的阿耳戈斯图像，许多眼睛，许多视角，一个观看的生物或一座观看的城市。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/argus-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/argus-argus-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/argus.jpg","r":[["Duplication","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/duplication","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/duplication-duplication-mini.webp","One person is not a single self."],["Split Screen","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/split-screen","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-screen-120-simultaneous-split-screen-mini.webp","Two rooms, one moment."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"百眼视觉"},"bokeh":{"t":"Bokeh","c":"effects","g":"round bokeh","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/bokeh","d":["Bokeh in bokeh cinematography is the aesthetic character of out-of-focus rendering: the disc shape, edge, and smoothness of blurred points, not the mere fact of a thin depth of field. The glass, not a blur slider, decides whether those discs are round, oval, outlined, or swirling.","散景摄影中的散景是失焦渲染的美学特征：模糊光点的光斑形状、边缘和平滑度，而不只是浅景深这一事实。决定这些光斑是圆形、椭圆形、带轮廓还是旋涡状的，是镜头玻璃，而不是模糊滑块。"],"pi":["Name disc shape and highlight sources. Example: Creamy bokeh field behind [Subject], circular or oval highlight discs from practicals, subject sharp, background as light not as a masked blur.","说明光斑形状和高光来源。示例：[主体]身后奶油般柔滑的散景场，来自实景光源的圆形或椭圆形高光光斑，主体清晰，背景是光而不是遮罩模糊。"],"cp":["Creamy bokeh field behind [Subject], circular or oval highlights, the world melted to light, subject isolated by glass.","[主体]身后奶油般柔滑的散景场，圆形或椭圆形高光，世界融化成光，主体被玻璃隔离。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/bokeh/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Shallow Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shallow-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shallow-focus-052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.webp","Nothing else is invited."],["Anamorphic","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/anamorphic","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-057-anamorphic-optical-character-mini.webp","You want the frame to announce it is a movie."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"焦外散景"},"bubbles":{"t":"Bubbles","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/bubbles","d":["Bubbles cinematography fills the air with little lenses: soap films that refract the subject, rainbow edges, wet highlights. Each bubble is an optic, not a disk of bokeh.","泡泡摄影用小型镜头填满空气：折射主体的肥皂膜、彩虹边缘、湿润高光。每个泡泡都是一个光学元件，而不是散景光斑。"],"pi":["Bubbles around [Subject], refraction worlds that still read as joy or threat. Demand soap-film surfaces, rainbow edges, and a repeated face in the spheres. Ban bokeh circles that are only out-of-focus lamps.","围绕[主体]的泡泡，折射世界，仍然读作欢乐或威胁。要求肥皂膜表面、彩虹边缘，以及球体中重复出现的脸。禁止只是失焦灯光的散景圆圈。"],"cp":["Bubbles around [Subject], refraction worlds, cheap magic that still reads as joy or threat.","围绕[主体]的泡泡，折射世界，廉价魔法，仍然读作欢乐或威胁。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/bubbles-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bubbles-bubbles-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/bubbles.jpg","r":[["Particles","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/particles","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/particles-particles-mini.webp","The air should be countable."],["Reflections","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/reflections","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reflections.webp","Show looking and the looked-at together."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"泡泡"},"chromatic-aberration":{"t":"Chromatic Aberration","c":"effects","g":"lateral chromatic aberration","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/chromatic-aberration","d":["Chromatic aberration in chromatic aberration cinematography is color fringing from different wavelengths focusing at different distances or magnifications. Lateral CA puts red-cyan (or similar) fringes on high-contrast edges, worse toward the frame edge, while longitudinal CA puts different colors in front of and behind the focus plane.","色差摄影中的色差是不同波长聚焦在不同距离或放大率时产生的色边。横向色差在强对比边缘产生红青（或类似）色边，越靠近画面边缘越严重；而纵向色差把不同颜色放在焦平面前后。"],"pi":["Fringe the edges, do not split the body. Example: Chromatic aberration on [Subject], red-cyan fringing at high-contrast edges, stronger toward the corners, vintage or simple glass, not a full RGB channel offset.","让边缘出现色边，不要分裂身体。示例：[主体]上的色差，在强对比边缘出现红青色边，越靠近角落越强，复古或简单镜片，不是完整的 RGB 通道偏移。"],"cp":["Chromatic aberration on [Subject], red-cyan fringing at high-contrast edges, cheap glass or dream distortion.","[主体]上的色差，在强对比边缘出现红青色边，廉价镜片或梦幻失真。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/chromatic-aberration/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Fisheye","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/fisheye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fisheye-059-fisheye-space-distortion-mini.webp","The mind is warped, or the space is a dome."],["Vintage Cine Glass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/vintage-cine","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/vintage-cine.webp","Memory, period, or beauty over resolution."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"色差"},"cinemagraph":{"t":"Cinemagraph","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/cinemagraph","d":["A cinemagraph is a still photograph in which one isolated element continues to move on a loop (steam, rain on glass, hair, a blink) while the rest of the frame is frozen. It is not a freeze-frame of a whole shot, and it is not a full clip that happens to loop.","微动摄影是一张静帧照片，其中一个孤立元素持续循环运动（蒸汽、玻璃上的雨、头发、一次眨眼），而画面其余部分被冻结。它不是整个镜头的定格，也不是恰好循环播放的完整片段。"],"pi":["Freeze the frame, license one cycle. Still: Cinemagraph of [Subject], almost a still, one isolated motion looping: steam, hair, a blink, rain in a window. Video: Almost still on [Subject], only one named element loops, locked camera, seamless cycle.","冻结画面，只放行一个循环。静帧：[主体]的微动摄影，几乎是静帧，一个孤立的运动循环：蒸汽、头发、一次眨眼、窗上的雨。视频：[主体]几乎静止，只有一个指定元素循环，锁定摄影机，无缝循环。"],"cp":["Almost still on [Subject], only one element loops: steam, rain, or a subtle gesture.","[主体]几乎静止，只有一个元素循环：蒸汽、雨或一个细微动作。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/cinemagraph-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cinemagraph-cinemagraph-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/cinemagraph.jpg","r":[["Infinite Loop","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/infinite-loop","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/infinite-loop-126-time-loop-with-evolving-behavior-mini.webp","Duration without progress."],["Freeze Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/freeze-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/freeze-frame-082-freeze-frame-mini.webp","End, joke, or evidence."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"微动图"},"collage":{"t":"Collage","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/collage","d":["Collage cinematography builds a frame from torn, cut, or mixed pieces: different stocks, paper, print, and live action sharing one plane with visible joins. Edges are graphic, and the stack is a construction, not an optical blend.","拼贴摄影用撕开、剪下或混合的碎片构成画格：不同胶片、纸张、印刷品与实拍共享同一平面，接缝可见。边缘具有图形感，叠层是一种构造，不是光学融合。"],"pi":["Show the joins. Example: Collage frame of [Subject], torn layers, mixed stocks, cut paper and live action sharing one plane, visible edges, not a smooth optical overlay.","把接缝露出来。示例：[主体]的拼贴画格，撕裂的层，混合胶片，剪纸与实拍共享同一平面，边缘可见，不是平滑的光学叠加。"],"cp":["Collage frame of [Subject], torn layers, mixed stocks, cut paper and live action sharing one plane.","[主体]的拼贴画格，撕裂的层，混合胶片，剪纸与实拍共享同一平面。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/collage/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Mixed Media","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/mixed-media","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mixed-media-mixed-media-mini.webp","No single medium owns the truth."],["Double Exposure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-exposure.webp","Two times or two selves occupy one frame."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"拼贴"},"cyclope":{"t":"Cyclope","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/cyclope","d":["A cyclope camera is one giant iris looking: fisheye as a monster eye, a single hole, too close. The lens is the creature.","独眼摄影机就是一只巨眼在观看：鱼眼作为怪物之眼，单一孔洞，极度贴近。镜头就是那只生物。"],"pi":["Cyclope view of [Subject], a single giant iris, fisheye as a monster eye, one hole looking. Demand barrel distortion, a catchlight, and a circular hole. Ban a mildly wide face and ban extra human hands unless they are the prey.","独眼视角的[主体]，单一巨大虹膜，鱼眼作为怪物之眼，一个孔洞在观看。要求桶形畸变、眼神光和一个圆形孔洞。禁止只是轻微广角的脸，禁止多余的人手，除非它们是猎物。"],"cp":["Cyclope view of [Subject], a single giant iris, fisheye as a monster eye, one hole looking.","独眼视角的[主体]，单一巨大虹膜，鱼眼作为怪物之眼，一个孔洞在观看。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/cyclope-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cyclope-cyclope-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/cyclope.jpg","r":[["Fisheye","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/fisheye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fisheye-059-fisheye-space-distortion-mini.webp","The mind is warped, or the space is a dome."],["First-Person","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/first-person","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/first-person-first-person-mini.webp","The audience is the character."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"独眼巨眼"},"datamosh":{"t":"Datamosh","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/datamosh","d":["Datamosh is intentional codec failure: inter-frame prediction continues after keyframes are removed or broken, so motion vectors smear the previous picture into the next GOP and faces bleed into the following shot. The image is file wreckage, not a lens error.","Datamosh 是刻意制造的编解码失败：关键帧被移除或破坏后，帧间预测仍在继续，于是运动矢量把前一画面抹进下一个 GOP，脸渗入下一镜。影像是文件残骸，不是镜头错误。"],"pi":["Break prediction, not the lens. Still: Datamosh of [Subject], inter-frame collapse, faces smearing into the next GOP, digital ruin as style. Video: Datamosh corruption around [Subject], frames bleeding into the next, codec wreckage as image, not a shutter smear.","破坏预测，而不是镜头。静帧：对[主体]做 Datamosh，帧间崩塌，脸抹进下一个 GOP，以数字废墟为风格。视频：围绕[主体]的 Datamosh 损坏，帧渗入下一帧，以编解码残骸为影像，不是快门拖影。"],"cp":["Datamosh corruption around [Subject], frames bleeding into the next, codec wreckage as image.","围绕[主体]的 Datamosh 损坏，帧渗入下一帧，以编解码残骸为影像。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/datamosh-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/datamosh-datamosh-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/datamosh.jpg","r":[["Stutter / Stop-Stutter","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/stutter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stutter-086-short-shutter-staccato-action-mini.webp","The mind skips."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."],["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."]],"z":"数据融化"},"deep-focus":{"t":"Deep Focus","c":"effects","g":"Extended depth of field","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/deep-focus","d":["Deep focus in deep focus cinematography keeps multiple near and far planes legibly sharp in one image. It is a continuous depth of field, not merely action arranged in depth while the glass stays selective.","深焦摄影中的深焦让一个画面中多个近景与远景平面都清晰可辨。它是连续的景深，而不只是把动作安排在纵深里、镜头却保持选择性对焦。"],"pi":["Demand continuous sharpness, not two cut planes. Example: Deep focus on [Subject] and the far plane, near action and distant doorway both sharp, no rack focus, no split-diopter seam, the eye may wander.","要求连续的清晰，而不是两个切开的平面。例：[主体] 与远处层面的深景深，近处动作与远处门口都清晰，不做焦点转移，没有分光镜的接缝，视线可以自由游走。"],"cp":["Locked wide shot of a courthouse office: a clerk’s hand stamps a form near the lens while an anxious visitor stands in a distant doorway. Both near and far action remain sharply readable, natural perspective, no rack focus, no artificial split-screen seam.","法院办公室的固定宽镜头：书记员的手在近处盖章，同时一位焦虑的访客站在远处的门口。近处与远处的动作都保持清晰可读，透视自然，不做焦点转移，不要人为的分屏接缝。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/051-deep-focus-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/deep-focus-051-deep-focus-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/deep-focus.jpg","r":[["Layered Depth","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/layered-depth","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/layered-depth-039-deep-space-staging-mini.webp","A shot should be walkable."],["Split Diopter","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/split-diopter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-diopter-054-split-diopter-focus-mini.webp","Two distances must both be true at once."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"深焦"},"diorama":{"t":"Diorama","c":"effects","g":"Scale-model effects","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/diorama","d":["Diorama cinematography photographs a physical scale model so that it stands in for a much larger object or environment, with real light hitting real miniature surfaces. Scale is sold by texture, camera speed, depth of field, and movement, not by a toy-like tilt of focus.","微缩模型摄影拍摄实体比例模型，让它替代大得多的物体或环境，用真实光线打在真实的微缩表面上。比例靠质感、摄影机速度、景深和运动成立，而不是靠玩具般的移轴式焦点倾斜。"],"pi":["Photograph a model as a world. Example: Diorama view of [Subject], physical miniature, tactile surfaces, deep enough focus for full-size scale, slow camera, not tilt-shift toy blur.","把一个模型拍成一个世界。示例：微缩模型视角的[主体]，实体微缩模型，可触质感表面，景深足够深以呈现全尺寸比例，缓慢运镜，不是移轴玩具模糊。"],"cp":["Photograph a practical-looking miniature orbital freighter as if it were enormous. Slow precise camera pass, deep enough focus for convincing scale, hard distant key light, tiny windows and layered surface detail. No shallow tabletop focus or fast toy-like acceleration.","把一艘看起来像实物的微缩轨道货船拍得仿佛无比巨大。缓慢精确的运镜掠过，景深足够深以呈现可信比例，远处硬质主光，微小舷窗和分层表面细节。不要浅景深的桌面聚焦或玩具般的快速加速。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/diorama-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/diorama-diorama-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/diorama.jpg","r":[["Tilt-Shift","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/tilt-shift","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-shift-062-miniature-look-selective-focus-mini.webp","Make a city a model, or slice focus through a crowd."],["Forced Perspective","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/forced-perspective","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/forced-perspective-143-forced-perspective-and-scale-illusion-mini.webp","Change size without VFX."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"微缩模型"},"distortions":{"t":"Distortions","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/distortions","d":["Lens distortion cinematography warps space so straight lines bow, stretch, or melt: barrel, pincushion, mustache, extreme wide stretch, or a physical distorting optic such as a diopter, a bottle, or rain on glass. The lens is lying about geometry, not adding flare.","镜头畸变摄影扭曲空间，让直线弯曲、拉伸或融化：桶形、枕形、胡须形、极端广角拉伸，或屈光镜、瓶子、玻璃上的雨等物理变形光学件。镜头在对几何撒谎，不是添加光斑。"],"pi":["Bend the space with glass. Example: Optical distortion around [Subject], stretched edges, barrel or melted geometry from ultra-wide or fisheye glass close to the face, the lens lying about space, not a flare pack.","用镜头弯折空间。示例：围绕[主体]的光学畸变，边缘拉伸，超广角或鱼眼镜头贴近脸部造成的桶形或融化几何，镜头在对空间撒谎，不是一堆光斑。"],"cp":["Optical distortion around [Subject], stretched edges, melted geometry, the lens lying about space.","围绕[主体]的光学畸变，边缘拉伸，融化几何，镜头在对空间撒谎。"],"hp":["optical distortion around [Subject], stretched edges, melted geometry, named wide or fisheye, not a flare overlay.","围绕[主体]的光学畸变，边缘拉伸，融化几何，点名广角或鱼眼，不是光斑叠加。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/distortions-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/distortions-distortions-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/distortions.jpg","r":[["Fisheye","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/fisheye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fisheye-059-fisheye-space-distortion-mini.webp","The mind is warped, or the space is a dome."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."],["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."]],"z":"镜头畸变"},"double-exposure":{"t":"Double Exposure","c":"effects","g":"Cloning","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","d":["Double exposure in double exposure film combines two or more image records on one frame, in camera by winding back, optically in a printer, or digitally as an additive composite. Both pictures occupy the same emulsion or file unless a matte fully holds one off.","双重曝光电影中的双重曝光把两条或更多影像记录合到同一画格上，可以在摄影机内倒卷实现，也可以在印片机上光学合成，或在数字端作为加法合成。两幅画面占据同一乳剂或文件，除非用遮罩完全挡住其中一幅。"],"pi":["Name both records and the mix. Example: Double exposure of [Subject] overlaid with a second named image, faces in cities, a ghost in rain, optical composite in camera, both exposures visible, not a morph and not a split-screen join.","写明两次曝光各是什么，以及如何叠加。例：[主体] 的双重曝光，与被明确指出的第二个影像叠合，城市中的面孔、雨中的幽灵，机内光学合成，两层曝光都可见，不是变形，也不是分屏拼接。"],"cp":["A woman argues with an identical version of herself across a kitchen table. Generate each performance as a separate plate from the same locked camera and clean kitchen reference. Match eyelines and timing; keep their silhouettes separate. Composite them together with consistent shadows and no identity blending.","一位女性隔着厨房餐桌与另一个和自己一模一样的人争吵。用同一台锁定摄影机和同一份干净的厨房参考，把两次表演分别生成为独立素材。对齐视线与时机；让两人的剪影保持分离。合成时阴影一致，身份不混在一起。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/double-exposure/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dissolve","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/dissolve","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dissolve-102-dissolve-and-temporal-layering-mini.webp","Memory, passage, or a gentle death of a scene."],["Match Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/match-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-cut-01-match-cut-mini.webp","Two images are the same idea."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"双重曝光"},"duplication":{"t":"Duplication","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/duplication","d":["A duplicate subject effect puts the same performer in a frame more than once as solid bodies: twins, a self across a table, copies in one room. It is usually a split matte, motion control, or a locked-camera composite, not a translucent double exposure.","复制主体效果把同一位表演者在同一画格中多次呈现为实体身体：双胞胎、桌对面的自己、同一房间里的多个副本。它通常是分割遮罩、运动控制或锁定摄影机合成，而不是半透明双重曝光。"],"pi":["Two solid performances, one space. Example: Duplication of [Subject], the same figure twice in one frame, twins of identity, solid bodies with matched light and contact shadows, not a double-exposure ghost, not a visible split-screen line.","两场实体表演，一个空间。示例：[主体]的复制，同一人物在一帧中出现两次，身份的双胞胎，实体身体且光线与接触阴影匹配，不是双重曝光的鬼影，也不是可见的分屏线。"],"cp":["Duplication of [Subject], the same figure twice or more in one frame, twins of time or identity.","[主体]的复制，同一人物在一帧中出现两次或更多次，时间或身份的双胞胎。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/duplication-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/duplication-duplication-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/duplication.jpg","r":[["Double Exposure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-exposure.webp","Two times or two selves occupy one frame."],["Split Screen","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/split-screen","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-screen-120-simultaneous-split-screen-mini.webp","Two rooms, one moment."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"同屏分身"},"echo-print":{"t":"Echo Print","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/echo-print","d":["An echo print is an echo print effect that leaves a ghosted afterimage offset in time or register, so the last pose is still printed on this frame. The ghost is a stain of a previous exposure, not a second complete picture sharing the same plane.","回声印片是一种回声印片效果，留下在时间或套准上偏移的鬼影残像，于是上一个姿态仍印在这一帧上。鬼影是前一次曝光的污渍，不是第二幅完整画面共享同一平面。"],"pi":["Write the still as a photochemical hold, then name the ghost. Quote: Echo print of [Subject], a ghosted afterimage offset in time or register, the last frame still printed on this one. For video: Afterimages of [Subject] trail the present, an echo print of the previous moment. Name the offset direction. Ban a second full scene.","把静帧写成光化学滞留，然后点名鬼影。引用：[主体]的回声印片，在时间或套准上偏移的鬼影残像，上一帧仍印在这一帧上。视频版：[主体]的残像拖在当下之后，是前一时刻的回声印片。要点名偏移方向。禁止第二个完整场景。"],"cp":["Afterimages of [Subject] trail the present, an echo print of the previous moment.","[主体]的残像拖在当下之后，是前一时刻的回声印片。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/echo-print-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/echo-print-echo-print-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/echo-print.jpg","r":[["Double Exposure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-exposure.webp","Two times or two selves occupy one frame."],["Step Printing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/step-printing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/step-printing-083-step-printing-and-smeared-motion-mini.webp","Longing that cannot move at normal speed."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"残影印片"},"feedback":{"t":"Feedback","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/feedback","d":["Video feedback is made by pointing a camera at its own live output so the picture nests into a recursive corridor of the same face. Each generation is a rephotograph of the monitor, with bloom, lag, and a tunnel of shrinking frames.","视频反馈是把摄影机对准它自己的实时输出，让画面嵌套成同一种脸的递归走廊。每一代都是对监视器的再拍摄，带有泛光、延迟，以及不断缩小的帧构成的隧道。"],"pi":["Video feedback around [Subject], camera looking into its own output, infinite corridor of the same face. For video: Recursive video feedback of [Subject], the image eating itself into a tunnel. Name the first generation (a face, a room) so the nest has a source.","围绕[主体]的视频反馈，摄影机看向自己的输出，同一张脸的无限走廊。视频版：[主体]的递归视频反馈，影像把自己吃进一条隧道。要点名第一代（一张脸、一个房间），让这个嵌套有源头。"],"cp":["Recursive video feedback of [Subject], the image eating itself into a tunnel.","[主体]的递归视频反馈，影像把自己吃进一条隧道。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/feedback-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/feedback-feedback-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/feedback.jpg","r":[["Kaleidoscope","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/kaleidoscope","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/kaleidoscope.webp","Ornament, drugs, or chorus girls."],["Infinite Loop","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/infinite-loop","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/infinite-loop-126-time-loop-with-evolving-behavior-mini.webp","Duration without progress."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"视频反馈"},"film-grain":{"t":"Film Grain","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/film-grain","d":["Film grain in film grain cinematography is the random texture of silver halide crystals or color dye clouds in the emulsion, or a digital simulation of that structure. It is a developed surface, not a PNG overlay sitting on top of a clean render.","胶片颗粒摄影中的颗粒，是乳剂中卤化银晶体或彩色染料云随机形成的纹理，或对这种结构的数字模拟。它是一种显影后的表面，不是叠在干净渲染图上的 PNG 覆盖层。"],"pi":["Specify format and that the grain is in the image, not on it. Example: Visible film grain over [Subject], 35mm or 16mm dye-cloud texture, temporally unstable, denser in shadows, not a cheap overlay.","写明画幅格式，并说明颗粒是「画面里长出来的」，不是「贴上去的」。例：[主体] 身上可见的胶片颗粒，35mm 或 16mm 的染料云质感，随时间有机跳动，暗部更密，而不是廉价叠加层。"],"cp":["Visible film grain over [Subject], 35mm or 16mm texture, living silver, not a cheap overlay.","[主体] 身上可见的胶片颗粒，35mm 或 16mm 质感，活的银盐，而不是廉价叠加层。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/076-archival-or-damaged-medium-texture-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-grain-076-archival-or-damaged-medium-texture-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/film-grain.jpg","r":[["Halation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp","Highlights should bleed like film, not clip like video."],["Filmic Faded","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/filmic-faded","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/filmic-faded.webp","Not HDR. A print."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"胶片颗粒"},"floating-fall":{"t":"Floating Fall","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/floating-fall","d":["A floating fall is a body hanging in a slow drop: delayed gravity on hair and coat, still going down. The path remains toward the ground, even when the clock on the body is late.","漂浮坠落是一具身体悬在缓慢下坠中：头发和外套受延迟重力影响，仍在向下。即使身体上的时钟走得迟，路径仍朝向地面。"],"pi":["Floating fall of [Subject], a body hanging in slow drop, weightless disaster, hair and coat in delayed gravity. Video: [Subject] falls in slow, floating pieces, delayed gravity, a dream of dropping. Name the height, the ground, and that the path is down.","[主体] 的漂浮坠落，一具身体悬在缓慢下坠中，失重的灾难，头发和外套处于延迟重力。视频：[主体] 以缓慢、漂浮的碎片坠落，延迟重力，一场坠落的梦。说明高度、地面，以及路径向下。"],"cp":["[Subject] falls in slow, floating pieces, delayed gravity, a dream of dropping.","[主体] 以缓慢、漂浮的碎片坠落，延迟重力，一场坠落的梦。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/floating-fall-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/floating-fall-floating-fall-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/floating-fall.jpg","r":[["Falling","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/falling","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/falling-falling-mini.webp","Gravity is the plot."],["Levitation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/levitation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/levitation-145-wire-assisted-flight-and-levitation-mini.webp","Weight is optional."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"漂浮坠落"},"floating-ui":{"t":"Floating UI","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/floating-ui","d":["Floating UI, or HUD overlay cinematography, places readable interface, callouts, and data planes in the air of the scene so information lives in space, not only on a physical screen. The cockpit is the room.","漂浮 UI，或称 HUD 叠加摄影，把可读界面、标注和数据平面放置在场景空气中，让信息存在于空间里，而不只在实体屏幕上。驾驶舱就是房间。"],"pi":["Floating UI over [Subject], HUD, callouts, and interface planes in 3D space, the screen as a cockpit. Name what the panels say in plain language, keep type sharp, and say the planes parallax if the camera moves. Ban unreadable scribble.","漂浮 UI 覆盖在 [主体] 上方，HUD、标注和界面平面位于 3D 空间，屏幕如同驾驶舱。用直白语言说明面板上写了什么，保持字体锐利，如果摄影机移动，就说明这些平面具有视差。禁止无法辨认的涂鸦。"],"cp":["Floating UI over [Subject], HUD, callouts, and interface planes in 3D space, the screen as a cockpit.","漂浮 UI 覆盖在 [主体] 上方，HUD、标注和界面平面位于 3D 空间，屏幕如同驾驶舱。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/floating-ui-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/floating-ui-floating-ui-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/floating-ui.jpg","r":[["Video Game","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/video-game","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/video-game-video-game-mini.webp","The world is playable."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."],["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."]],"z":"悬浮界面"},"focal-shift":{"t":"Focal Shift","c":"effects","g":"focus pull","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/focal-shift","d":["A focal shift moves the plane of sharpness from one subject or distance to another during the shot, so attention travels as a pull. The camera body can stay put, and only the focus mechanism walks the depth.","移焦在镜头过程中把清晰平面从一个主体或距离移到另一个，因此注意力作为牵引移动。摄影机机身可以保持不动，只有对焦机制在景深中行进。"],"pi":["Focal shift on [Subject], the plane of sharpness traveling from one fact to another, attention as a pull. Video: Focus pulls from a foreground object onto [Subject], or the reverse. Name both planes, the lens, and that the camera body stays put.","对 [主体] 进行移焦，清晰平面从一个事实移动到另一个事实，注意力被牵引。视频：焦点从前景物体拉到 [主体]，或反向。说明两个平面、镜头，以及摄影机机身保持不动。"],"cp":["Focus pulls from a foreground object onto [Subject], or the reverse.","焦点从前景物体拉到 [主体]，或反向。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/focal-shift-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/focal-shift-focal-shift-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/focal-shift.jpg","r":[["Rack Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/rack-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rack-focus-053-rack-focus-mini.webp","Change who owns the shot without cutting."],["Shallow Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shallow-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shallow-focus-052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.webp","Nothing else is invited."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"移焦"},"focus-change":{"t":"Focus Change","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/focus-change","d":["Focus change cinematography jumps or slides the plane of sharpness to a new fact, a rack without apology. The mid-blur is short, and the new plane owns the shot as soon as it lands.","焦点变化摄影把清晰平面跳变或滑动到一个新事实，一次不留情面的移焦。中间模糊很短，新平面一旦落定就掌控镜头。"],"pi":["Focus change on [Subject], the plane of sharpness jumping or sliding to a new fact, a rack without apology. Video: Focus changes from one plane onto [Subject] or away from them. Name both planes and that the mid-blur is brief.","对 [主体] 的焦点变化：清晰平面跳跃或滑动到新的事实上，一次不加抱歉的焦点转移。视频：焦点从一个层面转移到 [主体] 身上或移开。写明两个层面，以及中间虚焦的时间很短。"],"cp":["Focus changes from one plane onto [Subject] or away from them.","焦点从一个层面转移到 [主体] 身上，或从 [主体] 身上移开。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/focus-change-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/focus-change-focus-change-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/focus-change.jpg","r":[["Focal Shift","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/focal-shift","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/focal-shift-focal-shift-mini.webp","Change who owns the shot without cutting."],["Rack Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/rack-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rack-focus-053-rack-focus-mini.webp","Change who owns the shot without cutting."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"焦点变化"},"forced-perspective":{"t":"Forced Perspective","c":"effects","g":"Apparent size manipulation","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/forced-perspective","d":["Forced perspective uses camera position, subject distance, and set geometry to alter apparent size or distance, and the lie exists only from the taking viewpoint. Bodies, furniture, and eyelines must agree or the scale collapses.","强制透视利用摄影机位置、主体距离和布景几何来改变表观大小或距离，而这个错觉只存在于拍摄视角。身体、家具和视线必须一致，否则比例就会崩塌。"],"pi":["Describe the viewpoint lie, not a shrink filter. Example: Forced perspective with [Subject], scale altered by camera placement and scaled furniture, giant or miniature in camera, locked viewpoint, matching eyelines, not a digital resize.","描述视角谎言，而不是缩小滤镜。示例：与 [主体] 做强制透视，通过摄影机位置和缩放家具改变比例，在摄影机内呈现巨人或微缩效果，锁定视角，匹配视线，而不是数字缩放。"],"cp":["From one locked camera, a tiny adult guest sits beside a normal-sized host at a rustic table. Design the table and seating in separate scaled sections so their eyelines meet correctly. Stable hands, feet and contact shadows; no shrinking animation or distorted anatomy.","从一台锁定摄影机出发，一位微小的成年客人坐在正常大小的主人旁边，围着一张质朴的桌子。把桌子和座位设计成不同比例的部分，让他们的视线正确相接。手、脚和接触阴影保持稳定；不要缩小动画或扭曲的人体结构。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/143-forced-perspective-and-scale-illusion-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/forced-perspective-143-forced-perspective-and-scale-illusion-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/forced-perspective.jpg","r":[["Tilt-Shift","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/tilt-shift","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-shift-062-miniature-look-selective-focus-mini.webp","Make a city a model, or slice focus through a crowd."],["Deep Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/deep-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/deep-focus-051-deep-focus-mini.webp","Let the audience find the story in the whole room."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"强制透视"},"generative":{"t":"Generative","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/generative","d":["Generative visuals show process: forms grown by rule, particles, and iteration, so cinema is made by a system rather than only by a finished photograph. Making is visible.","生成式视觉展示过程：形态按规则、粒子和迭代生长，因此电影由系统生成，而不只是由一张完成照片构成。制作过程可见。"],"pi":["Generative image of [Subject], forms grown by rule, particles, and iteration, cinema made by a system. Name the rule and the light on the bits. Keep the subject recognizable at the end of the growth.","[主体] 的生成式图像，形态按规则、粒子和迭代生长，电影由系统生成。说明规则和照在比特上的光。在生长结束时保持主体可辨认。"],"cp":["Generative image of [Subject], forms grown by rule, particles, and iteration, cinema made by a system.","[主体] 的生成式图像，形态按规则、粒子和迭代生长，电影由系统生成。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/generative-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/generative-generative-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/generative.jpg","r":[["Datamosh","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/datamosh","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/datamosh-datamosh-mini.webp","Break the file on purpose."],["Transformation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/transformation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/transformation-147-continuous-material-transformation-mini.webp","The change is the scene."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"生成式视觉"},"halation":{"t":"Halation","c":"effects","g":"Soft filtration","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","d":["Halation in film is a reddish or warm glow around bright highlights caused by light passing through the emulsion, reflecting off the base, and scattering back into the image. It is a stock behavior, not a diffusion filter and not flare inside the lens.","胶片中的泛光，是明亮高光周围出现的偏红或暖色辉光，由光线穿过乳剂、从片基反射并散射回影像造成。它是胶片固有特性，不是柔光镜，也不是镜头内部的眩光。"],"pi":["Bloom the highlight edge, not the whole room. Example: Halation glow around highlights on [Subject], red-edge bloom of film stock, lamps breathing, eyes and fabric texture preserved, not a global fog.","让高光边缘发光，而不是整个房间发光。例：[主体] 高光周围的光晕，胶片式的红色边缘溢出，灯泡在呼吸，眼睛与布料质感保留，不是全局雾化。"],"cp":["A woman reads beside a bright summer window. Fine facial detail stays readable while window highlights bloom gently into the surrounding air. Subtle soft filtration, luminous skin without smoothing away texture, no fog overlay or global defocus.","一位女性在明亮的夏日窗边读书。面部细节保持可读，而窗外的高光柔和地晕散到周围的空气里。轻微的柔光滤镜，皮肤透亮但不磨掉质感，不要整体雾化，也不要全局虚化。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/halation.jpg","r":[["Film Grain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/film-grain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-grain-076-archival-or-damaged-medium-texture-mini.webp","The image should feel developed, not rendered."],["Vintage Cine Glass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/vintage-cine","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/vintage-cine.webp","Memory, period, or beauty over resolution."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"光晕溢出"},"infrared":{"t":"Infrared","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/infrared","d":["Infrared cinematography photographs near-infrared reflectance (roughly 700 to 900 nm), not heat, so foliage often goes pale, skies go dark, and skin can look waxy. It is a different slice of reflected light, still a photograph of the location.","红外摄影拍摄近红外反射（约 700 到 900 nm），而不是热量，因此枝叶常变淡，天空变暗，皮肤可能呈蜡质。它是反射光的另一段切片，仍是该地点的照片。"],"pi":["Specify near-IR reflectance, not heat. Example: Infrared look on [Subject], foliage going pale, skies black, skin waxy, near-infrared photograph, not night-vision green, not a thermal palette.","指定近红外反射率，而不是热量。示例：[主体] 的红外效果，枝叶变淡，天空变黑，皮肤呈蜡质，近红外照片，不是夜视绿色，不是热成像配色。"],"cp":["Infrared look on [Subject], foliage going pale, skies black, skin otherworldly, a spectrum humans do not own.","[主体] 的红外效果，枝叶变淡，天空变黑，皮肤超凡脱俗，一段人类并不拥有的光谱。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/infrared/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Night Vision","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/night-vision","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/night-vision.webp","Someone is hunting in the dark."],["Monochrome","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/monochrome","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/monochrome-073-selective-color-in-monochrome-mini.webp","Strip to drawing."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"红外摄影"},"kaleidoscope":{"t":"Kaleidoscope","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/kaleidoscope","d":["Kaleidoscope cinematography fragments the image with mirrors or radial repetition so one subject becomes a symmetric pattern. The camera looks into angled glass, or the staging itself is a kaleidoscope: bodies arranged around an axis, often from above.","万花筒摄影用镜子或放射式重复把影像碎片化，使一个主体变成对称图案。摄影机看向成角度的玻璃，或者调度本身就是万花筒：身体围绕轴线排列，通常从上方拍摄。"],"pi":["Demand mirrors or radial shards. Example: Kaleidoscopic fragmentation of [Subject], mirrored shards, radial symmetry, Busby Berkeley from inside a jewel, not a slit-scan tunnel.","要求镜子或放射状碎片。示例：[主体] 的万花筒式碎片化，镜像碎片，放射对称，像从宝石内部看巴斯比·伯克利，不是狭缝扫描隧道。"],"cp":["Kaleidoscopic fragmentation of [Subject], mirrored shards, Busby Berkeley from inside a jewel.","[主体] 的万花筒式碎片化，镜像碎片，像从宝石内部看巴斯比·伯克利。"],"hp":["kaleidoscopic fragmentation, mirrored shards, radial repeat of [Subject], not slit-scan streaks.","万花筒式碎片化，镜像碎片，[主体] 的放射式重复，不是狭缝扫描拖影。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/kaleidoscope/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Repetition and Pattern","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/repetition-pattern","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/repetition-pattern.webp","Systems, armies, hotels, factories."],["Bird's-Eye View","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/birds-eye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/birds-eye-045-top-down-diagrammatic-view-mini.webp","Turn life into a board game or a ritual."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"万花筒"},"lens-flare":{"t":"Lens Flare","c":"effects","g":"veiling flare","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","d":["Lens flare in lens flare cinematography is stray light scattered by glass, coatings, and barrel walls, producing ghosts, streaks, or veiling glare instead of a clean image. The artifacts live in the taking optic, so they track the source angle and dim when a body occludes the lamp.","镜头光晕摄影中的镜头光晕，是杂散光被玻璃、镀膜和镜筒壁散射，产生鬼影、条纹或蒙雾眩光，而不是干净画面。这些伪影存在于拍摄光学系统中，因此会跟随光源角度，并在有物体遮挡灯时减弱。"],"pi":["Name the source and the glass, not a pack. Example: Lens flare across [Subject], the sun or a hard practical striking the front element, veiling contrast, ghost orbs tracking the source, source-linked not floating.","说出光源和镜片，不要写成一整套预设。示例：镜头光晕横跨[主体]，太阳或强硬实景光源击中前镜片，对比度蒙雾，鬼影光球跟随光源，与光源关联而非漂浮。"],"cp":["A rescue worker opens a hangar door onto dazzling daylight. As the source enters the lens angle, a restrained flare and brief veiling glare wash across the image, then clear as she blocks it. Realistic source-linked behavior, no floating decorative rainbow effects.","一名救援人员打开机库门，迎向刺眼日光。当光源进入镜头角度时，一道克制的光晕和短暂的蒙雾眩光掠过画面，随后在她挡住光源时消失。真实的与光源关联行为，没有漂浮的装饰性彩虹效果。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/lens-flare.jpg","r":[["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."],["Halation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp","Highlights should bleed like film, not clip like video."],["Film Grain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/film-grain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-grain-076-archival-or-damaged-medium-texture-mini.webp","The image should feel developed, not rendered."]],"z":"镜头光晕"},"levitation":{"t":"Levitation","c":"effects","g":"Wire work","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/levitation","d":["A levitation shot holds a body or object in a quiet impossible hover, refusing ordinary gravity while support is hidden or removed. Hair and cloth still hang, and the gap under the feet is the proof.","悬浮镜头让身体或物体保持在安静而不可思议的悬停中，在支撑被隐藏或移除时违抗日常重力。头发和布料仍会垂坠，而脚下的空隙就是证据。"],"pi":["Levitation of [Subject], body or object refusing gravity, a quiet impossible hover. Video: [Subject] hangs in air, slow drift, no visible support. Name the gap under the feet, the hang of cloth, and takeoff or landing if they exist.","[主体]悬浮，身体或物体拒绝重力，一种安静而不可思议的悬停。视频：[主体]悬在空中，缓慢漂移，没有可见支撑。说明脚下的空隙、布料的垂坠，以及如有起跳或落地也说明。"],"cp":["A fictional acrobat crosses between two low rooftops in one graceful extended leap. Clear push-off, smooth rising arc, brief suspension and weighted landing with knees absorbing impact. Loose fabric follows the body with delay. Fixed wide camera, consistent architecture, no teleportation or rubber limbs.","一名虚构杂技演员以一次优雅而舒展的跳跃，在两座低矮屋顶之间穿过。清晰的蹬地起跳，平滑上升弧线，短暂悬停，以及膝盖吸收冲击的带重量落地。宽松布料延迟跟随身体。固定广角摄影机，建筑保持一致，没有瞬移或橡皮四肢。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/145-wire-assisted-flight-and-levitation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/levitation-145-wire-assisted-flight-and-levitation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/levitation.jpg","r":[["Falling","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/falling","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/falling-falling-mini.webp","Gravity is the plot."],["Bullet Time","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/bullet-time","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bullet-time-080-bullet-time-mini.webp","A moment is so important it becomes architecture."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"悬浮"},"light-flash":{"t":"Light Flash","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/light-flash","d":["A light flash transition is a brief blowout of the frame to white or near-white, then a return, as if a bulb, explosion, or memory dump hit the emulsion. It is a temporal event, often a cut hidden in the peak, not a standing lens flare.","闪光转场是画面短暂过曝至白色或接近白色，然后恢复，仿佛灯泡、爆炸或记忆倾泻击中了胶片乳剂。它是一个时间性事件，常常是在峰值中隐藏的剪辑点，而不是持续存在的镜头光晕。"],"pi":["Make it an event with a recovery. Still: Blinding light flash over [Subject], a bulb, explosion, or memory cut, the frame going to white then returning. Video: A hard light flash blows out [Subject] then settles back, as a memory or explosion sting.","让它成为一次有回落的事件。静帧：[主体] 身上刺目的光闪，灯泡、爆炸或记忆的闪断，画面冲到白色再回来。视频：一道硬光闪光把 [主体] 打爆，随后回落，用作回忆或爆炸的刺痛感。"],"cp":["A hard light flash blows out [Subject] then settles back, as a memory or explosion sting.","一道硬光闪光把 [主体] 打爆，随后回落，用作回忆或爆炸的刺痛感。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/light-flash-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/light-flash-light-flash-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/light-flash.jpg","r":[["Smash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/smash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/smash-cut-165-smash-cut-mini.webp","The next image should hurt."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."],["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."]],"z":"闪白转场"},"light-leak":{"t":"Light Leak","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/light-leak","d":["A light leak in light leak film is unfiltered light that reaches the emulsion or sensor without passing through the taking lens, usually through a gap in the body, magazine, or gate. It fogs from the edge or along a scratch in the film path, often orange or red on color negative because it hits the base side.","漏光胶片中的漏光，是未经过滤的光不经过拍摄镜头就到达乳剂或传感器，通常通过机身、片盒或片门的缝隙进入。它从边缘或沿片路的划痕形成雾化，在彩色负片上常呈橙色或红色，因为它打到片基侧。"],"pi":["Put the wound on the edge, not on the sun. Example: Analog light leak washing [Subject], orange or red fog eating the frame edge, unfiltered light on the emulsion, not a source-linked lens flare.","把伤口放在边缘，而不是放在太阳上。示例：模拟漏光冲刷[主体]，橙色或红色雾霭侵蚀画面边缘，未经过滤的光落在乳剂上，而不是与光源关联的镜头光晕。"],"cp":["Analog light leak washing [Subject], orange or red flare eating the frame edge, a wound in the emulsion.","模拟漏光冲刷[主体]，橙色或红色光晕侵蚀画面边缘，乳剂上的一道伤口。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/light-leak/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Halation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp","Highlights should bleed like film, not clip like video."],["Film Grain","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/film-grain","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-grain-076-archival-or-damaged-medium-texture-mini.webp","The image should feel developed, not rendered."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"漏光"},"masking":{"t":"Masking","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/masking","d":["Masking cinematography uses a matte, a viewfinder object, or a graphic window so looking is visible as a shape cutting the picture. We see through binoculars, a keyhole, or a hard-edged hole.","遮罩摄影使用遮片、取景器物体或图形窗口，使观看本身显现为一个切割画面的形状。我们透过双筒望远镜、钥匙孔或硬边孔洞观看。"],"pi":["Masked frame around [Subject], a shape cutting the picture, binoculars, a keyhole, a graphic window. Name the shape, keep the interior photographed, and keep the surround opaque. Do not stretch the image to fill the hole.","[主体]周围的遮罩画框，一个切割画面的形状，双筒望远镜、钥匙孔、图形窗口。说明这个形状，保持内部为实拍影像，并让周围区域不透明。不要拉伸影像来填满孔洞。"],"cp":["Masked frame around [Subject], a shape cutting the picture, binoculars, a keyhole, a graphic window.","[主体]周围的遮罩画框，一个切割画面的形状，双筒望远镜、钥匙孔、图形窗口。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/masking-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/masking-masking-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/masking.jpg","r":[["Frame within Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/frame-in-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frame-in-frame-041-frame-within-the-frame-mini.webp","Someone is watched, trapped, or pictured."],["Iris","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/iris","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/iris-104-iris-opening-or-closing-mini.webp","Point with the mask itself."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"遮罩"},"match-morph":{"t":"Morph","c":"effects","g":"Morphing / Dissolve Effect","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/match-morph","d":["A morphing effect transforms one image, face, shape, or object into another by interpolating corresponding geometry over time. It is a continuous becoming, not a crossfade of opacities and not two exposures stacked.","变形效果通过随时间插值对应的几何结构，将一张影像、面孔、形状或物体转化为另一个。它是一种连续生成，不是不透明度的交叉淡化，也不是两次曝光叠加。"],"pi":["Name both states and the duration. Still: Morph between [Subject] and another named state, face or body becoming, in-between geometry visible. Video: [Subject] morphs into another form or face over 6 seconds, a continuous transformation, not a dissolve.","说明两种状态和持续时间。静帧：[主体]与另一个已命名状态之间的变形，脸或身体正在生成，中间几何可见。视频：[主体]在6秒内变形为另一种形态或脸，连续转化，不是叠化。"],"cp":["[Subject] morphs into another form or face over 6 seconds, a continuous transformation.","[主体]在6秒内变形为另一种形态或面孔，一种连续转化。"],"hp":["[Subject] morphs into a named second form over N seconds, continuous transformation, not a dissolve, not a cut.","[主体]在N秒内变形为已命名的第二形态，连续转化，不是叠化，不是硬切。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/108-morph-transition-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-morph-108-morph-transition-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/match-morph.jpg","r":[["Dissolve","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/dissolve","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dissolve-102-dissolve-and-temporal-layering-mini.webp","Memory, passage, or a gentle death of a scene."],["Double Exposure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-exposure.webp","Two times or two selves occupy one frame."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"匹配变形"},"mixed-media":{"t":"Mixed Media","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/mixed-media","d":["Mixed media film combines live action with type, illustration, and stock in one plane so no single capture method owns the truth of the frame. Media collide rather than dissolve into one photograph.","混合媒介影片将实拍与字体、插画和素材片结合在同一平面中，使没有任何单一捕捉方式独占画面的真实。各种媒介相互碰撞，而不是融解成一张照片。"],"pi":["Mixed media around [Subject], live action, type, illustration, and stock colliding in one plane. Name each medium. Keep edges visible. Ban a single seamless grade that hides the collision.","[主体]周围的混合媒介，实拍、字体、插画和素材片在同一个平面上碰撞。说明每种媒介。保持边缘可见。禁止用单一无缝调色掩盖这种碰撞。"],"cp":["Mixed media around [Subject], live action, type, illustration, and stock colliding in one plane.","[主体]周围的混合媒介，实拍、字体、插画和素材片在同一平面上碰撞。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/mixed-media-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mixed-media-mixed-media-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/mixed-media.jpg","r":[["Collage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/collage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/collage.webp","One image is not enough; stack them."],["Typography","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/typography","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/typography-typography-mini.webp","The sentence is in the shot."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"混合媒介"},"morphing":{"t":"Morphing","c":"effects","g":"Geometric image transformation","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/morphing","d":["Morphing cinematography transforms one shape or image continuously into another by interpolating geometry, rather than merely fading between pictures. Identity is a dissolve you can watch as contour.","变形摄影通过插值几何结构，将一个形状或影像连续转化为另一个，而不是仅仅在画面之间淡化。身份是一场可以观看其轮廓的叠化。"],"pi":["Morph of [Subject] into another state, continuous transformation, identity as a dissolve you can watch. Video: [Subject] morphs into another form over the shot. Name both endpoints, keep eyes aligned, and forbid a cross-dissolve of unmatched poses.","[主体]向另一状态变形，连续转化，身份像一场可以观看的叠化。视频：[主体]在镜头中变形为另一种形态。说明两个端点，保持眼睛对齐，并禁止不匹配姿势的交叉叠化。"],"cp":["Transform a close-up of a young fictional woman’s face into her older self over four seconds. Keep eyes aligned, head pose, expression and light direction fixed. Age changes occur gradually and coherently. Use matched endpoint portraits and controlled landmark-based compositing, no identity swap or liquefying face.","在四秒内将一名年轻虚构女性的脸部特写转化为她年长后的样子。保持眼睛对齐，头部姿势、表情和光线方向固定。年龄变化逐渐且连贯地发生。使用匹配的端点肖像和受控的基于特征点的合成，没有身份替换或脸部液化。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/morphing-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/morphing-morphing-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/morphing.jpg","r":[["Morph","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/match-morph","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/match-morph-108-morph-transition-mini.webp","Identity is unstable."],["Transformation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/transformation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/transformation-147-continuous-material-transformation-mini.webp","The change is the scene."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"渐变变形"},"night-vision":{"t":"Night Vision","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/night-vision","d":["Night vision in night vision cinematography is image intensification: residual photons, and often a near-IR illuminator, amplified through a photocathode and microchannel plate onto a phosphor. The picture is typically green, grainy, blooming around lamps, with the framing of goggles, a weapon sight, or a camera in the dark.","夜视摄影中的夜视是图像增强：残余光子，通常还有近红外照明器，经光电阴极和微通道板放大后投射到荧光屏上。画面通常呈绿色、有颗粒感，灯光周围泛晕，并带有护目镜、武器瞄准镜或黑暗中摄影机的取景画框。"],"pi":["Make it a device, not a grade. Example: Night-vision green phosphor of [Subject], grainy image intensification, blooming lamps, goggle or sight framing, surveillance or military eye, not a thermal palette.","把它做成一种设备，而不是一种调色。示例：[主体]的夜视绿色荧光，颗粒感图像增强，灯光泛晕，护目镜或瞄准镜画框，监控或军事视角，不是热成像色板。"],"cp":["Night-vision green phosphor of [Subject], grainy, surveillance, found-footage military eye.","[主体]的夜视绿色荧光，颗粒感，监控风，拾得录像式军事视角。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/night-vision/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Thermal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/thermal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/thermal.webp","See temperature, not light."],["Found Footage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/found-footage-look","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/found-footage-look-167-found-footage-framing-mini.webp","The operator is in danger too."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"夜视"},"object-portal":{"t":"Object Portal","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/object-portal","d":["An object portal effect treats a prop as a wormhole: a bag, a screen, or a doorway that should not lead there, opening onto another space. The thing is the cut.","物体传送门效果把道具当作虫洞：一个袋子、一块屏幕或一扇不该通向那里的门，打开通向另一空间。这个物件就是剪辑。"],"pi":["Object portal through [Subject], a thing opening onto another space, a bag, a screen, a doorway that should not lead there. Name the prop, the rim, and the far geography inside it. Keep the surrounding room in this world.","通过[主体]的物体传送门，一个通向另一空间的物件，一个袋子、一块屏幕、一扇不该通向那里的门。说明道具、边缘，以及其中的远方地理。让周围房间保持在这个世界。"],"cp":["Object portal through [Subject], a thing opening onto another space, a bag, a screen, a doorway that should not lead there.","通过[主体]的物体传送门，一个通向另一空间的物件，一个袋子、一块屏幕、一扇不该通向那里的门。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/object-portal-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/object-portal-object-portal-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/object-portal.jpg","r":[["Pass Through","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/pass-through","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pass-through-pass-through-mini.webp","Cut the building, not the film."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."],["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."]],"z":"物体传送门"},"particles":{"t":"Particles","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/particles","d":["Particle effects cinematography fills the air with countable bits: dust, sparks, pollen, a weather of motes, each one catching light. Atmosphere you can inventory, not a blanket of fog.","粒子效果摄影让空气充满可清点的微粒：尘埃、火花、花粉，一场微尘的天气，每一粒都捕捉光线。这是可清点的氛围，不是一层雾毯。"],"pi":["Particles around [Subject], dust, sparks, pollen, a weather of bits, light catching each one. Name the species, a backlight, and that the bits are discrete. Ban a fog wash with no specks.","[主体]周围的粒子，尘埃、火花、花粉，一片微粒的天气，光线捕捉每一粒。点明粒子种类、逆光，以及微粒是离散的。禁止没有微粒的雾幕。"],"cp":["Particles around [Subject], dust, sparks, pollen, a weather of bits, light catching each one.","[主体]周围的粒子，尘埃、火花、花粉，一片微粒的天气，光线捕捉每一粒。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/particles-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/particles-particles-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/particles.jpg","r":[["Dust Motes","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/dust-motes","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dust-motes.webp","Stillness that is still alive."],["Volumetric Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/volumetric-light.webp","Air has to be photographed, not just the subject."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"粒子"},"photogrammetry":{"t":"Photogrammetry","c":"effects","g":"Gravitational lensing","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/photogrammetry","d":["The photogrammetry look reconstructs 3D geometry and texture from overlapping photographs, so a real place is turned into a scanned mesh. Slightly wrong normals, stretched texture, and holes are the evidence of capture.","摄影测量外观从重叠照片重建 3D 几何与纹理，因此真实地点变成扫描网格。略有偏差的法线、拉伸的纹理和破洞，就是拍摄采集的证据。"],"pi":["Photogrammetry look of [Subject], scanned space, slightly wrong mesh, a real place turned into a model. Name overlapping-photo texture, a hole or stretch, and an orbit or inspection camera. Ban a toy diorama and ban a perfect game render.","[主体]的摄影测量外观，扫描空间，略有偏差的网格，一个真实地点变成模型。点明重叠照片纹理、破洞或拉伸，以及环绕或检视相机。禁止玩具立体模型，禁止完美的游戏渲染。"],"cp":["Create a visualization concept for a spinning black hole with an accretion disk appearing lensed around the dark central region. Use a validated ray-traced simulation as the geometric reference and preserve its major contours. Label this as a cinematic visualization, not a newly computed scientific result.","为旋转黑洞创建一个可视化概念，吸积盘在黑暗中心区域周围呈现引力透镜效果。使用经过验证的光线追踪模拟作为几何参考，并保留其主要轮廓。将其标注为电影化可视化，而非新计算出的科学结果。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/photogrammetry-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/photogrammetry-photogrammetry-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/photogrammetry.jpg","r":[["Diorama","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/diorama","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/diorama-diorama-mini.webp","Shrink the epic until it fits a shelf."],["Video Game","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/video-game","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/video-game-video-game-mini.webp","The world is playable."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"摄影测量"},"projection-mapping":{"t":"Projections","c":"effects","g":"Reflective-screen projection","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/projection-mapping","d":["Projections in projection mapping film put a pictured image onto a surface that the taking camera then photographs: front projection onto a retroreflective screen, rear projection behind a window or windshield, or video mapped onto architecture. The projector is a light source, and the set is also a screen.","投影映射影片中的投影把一幅影像放到表面上，再由拍摄相机拍下：前投影投到回射屏上，后投影在窗户或挡风玻璃后，或者视频映射到建筑上。投影仪是光源，布景也是屏幕。"],"pi":["Put the image on a surface. Example: Projected imagery crawling over [Subject] and architecture, a plate on a screen or faces on walls, foreground lit to match the projection, in-camera process not a double-exposure ghost.","把影像放到表面上。示例：投影影像爬过[主体]与建筑，屏幕上的背景板或墙上的面孔，前景打光匹配投影，是机内流程而非双重曝光的鬼影。"],"cp":["A small practical-looking rocky foreground merges into an immense still desert panorama. Locked wide camera, performers lit to match the horizon photograph, subtle boundary between physical foreground and distant projected landscape. No drifting mountain geometry or independently moving horizon.","一个小型、看起来像实景的岩石前景融入巨大的静止沙漠全景。固定广角摄影机，表演者打光匹配地平线照片，物理前景与远处投影景观之间边界微妙。没有漂移的山体几何，也没有独立移动的地平线。"],"hp":["projected imagery on walls or a screen behind [Subject], shared viewpoint, foreground lit to match, not a ghost overlay.","投影影像投在墙上或[主体]后面的屏幕上，共享视点，前景打光匹配，不是鬼影叠加。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/projection-mapping/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Double Exposure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/double-exposure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-exposure.webp","Two times or two selves occupy one frame."],["Practical Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/practical-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/practical-lighting-065-practical-source-motivation-mini.webp","Let the set light the face."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"投影映射"},"rack-focus":{"t":"Rack Focus","c":"effects","g":"focus pull","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/rack-focus","d":["A rack focus moves the sharp plane from one subject or distance to another during a continuous shot, while the composition stays largely the same. Attention changes because the helical turns, not because the camera cuts or dollies.","移焦在一个连续镜头中把清晰平面从一个主体或距离移到另一个，同时构图基本保持不变。注意力发生变化是因为螺旋环转动，而不是因为摄影机切换或推轨。"],"pi":["Name both planes and the duration. Still: Rack focus between planes around [Subject], a two-second pull from foreground to the figure or the reverse. Video: Focus racks from a named foreground element onto [Subject] over about two seconds, shallow depth of field, locked camera, no zoom.","写明两个层面和时长。静帧：[主体] 周围两层之间的焦点转移，用约两秒把焦点从前景拉到人物身上或反向拉回。视频：焦点从指定的前景物件在约两秒内转移到 [主体]，浅景深，摄影机锁定，不变焦。"],"cp":["Locked composition: a brass key in sharp foreground on a desk, a woman blurred in the doorway behind it. Hold the key, then slowly rack focus to her expression as the key becomes soft. No camera move, no zoom, neither object changes position.","固定构图：桌上一把黄铜钥匙在前景清晰，门边的女人在后景虚化。先停在钥匙上，再缓慢把焦点转移到她的表情，钥匙随之虚化。摄影机不动，不变焦，两个对象都不改变位置。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/053-rack-focus-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rack-focus-053-rack-focus-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/rack-focus.jpg","r":[["Shallow Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shallow-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shallow-focus-052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.webp","Nothing else is invited."],["Split Diopter","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/split-diopter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-diopter-054-split-diopter-focus-mini.webp","Two distances must both be true at once."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"焦点转移"},"ratio-switch":{"t":"Ratio Switch","c":"effects","g":"Expanding frame","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/ratio-switch","d":["An aspect ratio switch changes the image's visible boundaries so the container itself widens or closes as the story changes register. The picture is not stretched: previously unseen area is revealed, or the crop tightens.","画幅比切换改变影像的可见边界，因此当故事变换调性时，容器本身变宽或收窄。画面不会被拉伸：之前未见的区域被揭示，或者裁切收紧。"],"pi":["Aspect-ratio switch on [Subject], the frame itself widening or closing as the story changes register. Video: The frame around [Subject] changes aspect ratio during the sequence, a visible crop or reveal. Say the image does not stretch. Name the start ratio and the end ratio.","[主体]上的画幅比切换，随着故事变换调性，画框本身变宽或收窄。视频：序列中[主体]周围的画框改变画幅比，可见的裁切或揭示。说明影像不会拉伸。点明起始比例和结束比例。"],"cp":["Begin with a young cyclist confined within a square image. As she reaches an open seaside road and takes a deep breath, widen the frame smoothly to a broad rectangle, revealing the ocean on both sides. Reveal previously unseen image area; never stretch her body or bicycle. Animate the framing in post.","开始于一个年轻骑行者被限制在方形画面中。当她到达开阔的海边道路并深吸一口气时，把画框平滑地拓宽为宽矩形，露出两侧的海洋。揭示之前未见的画面区域；绝不要拉伸她的身体或自行车。在后期中制作取景动画。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/109-aspect-ratio-change-as-an-event-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ratio-switch-109-aspect-ratio-change-as-an-event-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/ratio-switch.jpg","r":[["Masking","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/masking","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/masking-masking-mini.webp","Show looking as an object."],["Wide Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/wide-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wide-shot.webp","Do not isolate yet."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"画幅切换"},"scale-shift":{"t":"Scale Shift","c":"effects","g":"Dunkirk temporal convergence","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/scale-shift","d":["Scale shift cinematography changes a body's size against the same room so the figure is suddenly giant or tiny: Alice physics as an optical event. Furniture, shadows, and contact have to match the new ratio.","比例突变摄影改变身体在同一房间中的大小，使人物突然巨大或微小：爱丽丝物理作为光学事件。家具、阴影和接触都必须匹配新的比例。"],"pi":["Scale shift of [Subject], the body suddenly giant or tiny against the same room, Alice physics. Name the room, the new size, and matching shadows. Ban a mere close-up and ban stretching the architecture.","[主体]的比例突变，身体在同一房间里突然巨大或微小，爱丽丝物理。点明房间、新尺寸和匹配的阴影。禁止只是特写，禁止拉伸建筑。"],"cp":["Design an intercut rescue story: a mountain team’s six-hour ascent, a driver’s thirty-minute approach and a climber’s final two-minute wait. Build a timeline showing exactly where they converge. Generate separate location strands and edit them toward one shared radio call, not as falsely equal real-time durations.","设计一个交叉剪辑的救援故事：山地队的六小时攀登、司机的三十分钟接近，以及攀登者的最后两分钟等待。构建时间线，准确显示他们在哪里汇合。生成分开的地点线索，并将它们剪向同一次共享无线电呼叫，而不是伪装成等长的实时时长。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/scale-shift-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/scale-shift-scale-shift-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/scale-shift.jpg","r":[["Forced Perspective","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/forced-perspective","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/forced-perspective-143-forced-perspective-and-scale-illusion-mini.webp","Change size without VFX."],["Magnification","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/magnification","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/magnification.webp","Go closer than a close-up."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"比例突变"},"selfie-twin":{"t":"Selfie Twin","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/selfie-twin","d":["A selfie twin puts two of the same face in a phone-arm frame, identity as a double take at arm's length. The camera is a compact wide in a hand, not a hidden studio body.","自拍双胞胎把同一张脸的两个放进手机手臂距离的画框，身份在一臂距离处成为二次回看。相机是手中的紧凑广角，而不是隐藏的摄影棚机身。"],"pi":["Selfie twin of [Subject], two of the same face in a phone-arm frame, identity as a double take. Demand the same person twice, compact-camera distortion, and a phone-arm wide. Ban two similar actors and ban a hidden studio two-shot.","[主体]的自拍双胞胎，同一张脸在手机手臂距离的画框里出现两次，身份作为二次回看。要求同一个人出现两次、紧凑相机畸变，以及手机臂展广角。禁止两个相似演员，禁止隐藏的摄影棚双人镜头。"],"cp":["Selfie twin of [Subject], two of the same face in a phone-arm frame, identity as a double take.","[主体]的自拍双胞胎，同一张脸在手机手臂距离的画框里出现两次，身份作为二次回看。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/selfie-twin-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/selfie-twin-selfie-twin-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/selfie-twin.jpg","r":[["Duplication","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/duplication","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/duplication-duplication-mini.webp","One person is not a single self."],["Fourth Wall","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/fourth-wall","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fourth-wall-135-direct-address-and-fourth-wall-break-mini.webp","They know we are here."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"自拍双胞胎"},"shadow-box":{"t":"Shadow Box","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shadow-box","d":["Shadow-box cinematography tells the story in layered cut-outs, depth as stacked silhouettes, a diorama of darkness. Figures are unfilled, and distance is paper stacked in front of a hard backlight.","影箱摄影用分层剪纸讲故事，以堆叠剪影形成深度，一座黑暗的立体模型。人物没有辅光，距离是硬逆光前堆叠的纸张。"],"pi":["Shadow-box of [Subject], layered cut-outs, depth as stacked silhouettes, a diorama of darkness. Name several planes, a hard backlight, and no fill on the figures. Ban painted faces and ban a single silhouette in a real street.","[主体]的影箱，分层剪纸，以堆叠剪影形成深度，一座黑暗的立体模型。点明若干平面、硬逆光，以及人物上没有辅光。禁止画出来的脸，禁止真实街道中的单一剪影。"],"cp":["Shadow-box of [Subject], layered cut-outs, depth as stacked silhouettes, a diorama of darkness.","[主体]的影箱，分层剪纸，以堆叠剪影形成深度，一座黑暗的立体模型。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/shadow-box-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shadow-box-shadow-box-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/shadow-box.jpg","r":[["Silhouette","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/silhouette","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/silhouette-049-silhouette-as-graphic-storytelling-mini.webp","Identity is less important than shape."],["Diorama","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/diorama","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/diorama-diorama-mini.webp","Shrink the epic until it fits a shelf."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"影箱剪纸"},"shallow-focus":{"t":"Shallow Focus","c":"effects","g":"Selective focus","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shallow-focus","d":["Shallow focus keeps a narrow depth range sharp while foreground or background falls off. It is a depth-of-field choice made with distance, focal length, and aperture together, not a button labeled blur.","浅焦让一个狭窄的景深范围保持清晰，而前景或背景虚化。它是用距离、焦距和光圈共同做出的景深选择，不是标着模糊的按钮。"],"pi":["Name the mark and the stop. Example: Very shallow focus on [Subject], T1.4, near eye sharp, background dissolved into optical discs, intimacy by exclusion, not a cutout mask.","写明对焦位置和光圈值。例：[主体] 的极浅景深，T1.4，靠近镜头的那只眼清晰，背景融成一个个光学圆盘，用「排除」制造亲密感，而不是剪贴蒙版。"],"cp":["An elderly ticket seller sits behind glass in a busy station. Tight portrait with the near eye sharp and the crowd reduced to soft, unrecognizable shapes. Tiny natural movements, stable eye focus, no plastic skin, no abrupt background replacement.","在繁忙车站里，一位年长的售票员坐在玻璃后面。紧凑的肖像，靠近镜头的那只眼清晰，人群虚化成无法辨认的柔软形状。细小的自然动作，对眼部对焦稳定，不要塑料感的皮肤，不要突兀的背景替换。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shallow-focus-052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/shallow-focus.jpg","r":[["Bokeh","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/bokeh","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bokeh.webp","Only one plane may be true."],["Deep Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/deep-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/deep-focus-051-deep-focus-mini.webp","Let the audience find the story in the whole room."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"浅焦"},"slit-scan":{"t":"Slit-Scan","c":"effects","g":"Star Gate effect","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/slit-scan","d":["Slit-scan exposes moving artwork or a moving camera through a narrow slit over time, stretching space into streaks and corridors with time laid along one axis. The result is structured geometry, not a random particle tunnel.","狭缝扫描让移动中的画作或移动的摄影机随时间通过一条狭窄狭缝曝光，把空间拉成条纹与走廊，时间沿一个轴铺展。结果是结构化几何，而不是随机粒子隧道。"],"pi":["Ask for ordered temporal geometry. Example: Slit-scan streaking around [Subject], time smeared along one axis, structured corridor of light with a stable vanishing point, Star Gate language, no random neon particles.","要求有序的时间几何。示例：狭缝扫描在[主体]周围拖出条纹，时间沿一个轴涂抹，结构化光廊带稳定灭点，星际之门语言，没有随机霓虹粒子。"],"cp":["A sustained voyage through abstract planes of luminous geometry. Long parallel light streaks converge toward a stable central vanishing point, evolving through layered spatial corridors. Procedural slit-scan character, controlled acceleration, no literal starfield, random sparks or kaleidoscope cuts.","一场持续穿越发光几何抽象平面的航行。长长的平行光条纹汇聚向稳定的中央灭点，在分层空间走廊中演变。程序化狭缝扫描特征，受控加速，没有字面星场、随机火花或万花筒式剪切。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/146-slit-scan-and-light-tunnel-imagery-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slit-scan-146-slit-scan-and-light-tunnel-imagery-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/slit-scan.jpg","r":[["Time-Lapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/time-lapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/time-lapse-084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.webp","Show weather, construction, or a night becoming morning."],["Kaleidoscope","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/kaleidoscope","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/kaleidoscope.webp","Ornament, drugs, or chorus girls."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"狭缝扫描"},"smash-and-grab":{"t":"Smash and Grab","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/smash-and-grab","d":["Smash-and-grab video is impact as coverage: glass, snatch, handheld chaos, a theft of a moment. The camera is inside the crime, too close and too late.","砸抢式视频是作为分镜覆盖的冲击：玻璃、抢夺、手持混乱，一瞬间的窃取。摄影机就在犯罪现场内部，贴得太近，也来得太晚。"],"pi":["Smash-and-grab energy on [Subject], glass, impact, snatch, handheld chaos, a theft of a moment. Video: Violent handheld smash around [Subject], impact, grab, escape. Force shards toward the lens. Name the object taken. Ban a posed hero in front of a tidy broken window.","砸抢式能量落在 [主体] 上，玻璃、撞击、抢夺、手持混乱，一瞬间的窃取。视频：围绕 [主体] 的暴力手持砸击，撞击、抓取、逃逸。让碎片冲向镜头。说明被抢走的物品。禁止摆拍的英雄站在整齐的破窗前。"],"cp":["Violent handheld smash around [Subject], impact, grab, escape.","围绕 [主体] 的暴力手持砸击，撞击、抓取、逃逸。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/smash-and-grab-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/smash-and-grab-smash-and-grab-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/smash-and-grab.jpg","r":[["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Crash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/crash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-cut-02-crash-cut-mini.webp","The next image must hurt."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"砸抢式快剪"},"sticker-peel":{"t":"Sticker Peel","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/sticker-peel","d":["A sticker peel effect lifts the image from a backing: adhesive shine, a die-cut layer coming off the world. Thickness, curl, and glue are the physics, not a still collage of torn paper.","贴纸剥离效果把影像从背纸上掀起：胶面反光，一层模切图层从世界上脱落。厚度、卷曲和胶水才是物理，而不是撕碎纸张的静帧拼贴。"],"pi":["Sticker peel on [Subject], the image lifting from a backing, adhesive shine, a graphic coming off the world. Video: A sticker layer peels off [Subject] or the frame, revealing another layer. Name the curl direction and the backing. Ban a person merely standing in front of a poster.","贴纸剥离落在 [主体] 上，影像从背纸上掀起，胶面反光，一个图形从世界上脱落。视频：一层贴纸从 [主体] 或画面剥离，露出另一层。说明卷曲方向和背纸。禁止一个人只是站在海报前面。"],"cp":["A sticker layer peels off [Subject] or the frame, revealing another layer.","一层贴纸从 [主体] 或画面剥离，露出另一层。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/sticker-peel-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/sticker-peel-sticker-peel-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/sticker-peel.jpg","r":[["Collage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/collage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/collage.webp","One image is not enough; stack them."],["Mixed Media","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/mixed-media","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mixed-media-mixed-media-mini.webp","No single medium owns the truth."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"贴纸撕起"},"thermal":{"t":"Thermal","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/thermal","d":["Thermal imaging cinematography maps emitted long-wave infrared (heat), not reflected light. A microbolometer or similar sensor assigns a palette (white-hot, black-hot, ironbow) to temperature, so faces, engines, and blood read warm while cold metal and night air do not.","热成像摄影映射的是物体发出的长波红外（热），而不是反射光。微测辐射热计或类似传感器把温度指派到某种调色板（白热、黑热、铁虹），因此面孔、引擎和血液读起来是暖的，而冰冷的金属和夜间的空气不是。"],"pi":["Map temperature, not lamps. Example: Thermal palette of [Subject], heat as color, faces as warm masks, ironbow or white-hot, search-and-rescue or predator vision, not night-vision green, not pale infrared foliage.","映射温度，而不是灯具。示例：热成像调色板下的 [主体]，热作为颜色，面孔成为温暖的色块，铁虹或白热，搜救或掠食者视觉，不是夜视绿，不是苍白的红外植被。"],"cp":["Thermal palette of [Subject], heat as color, faces as warm masks, Predator vision or search-and-rescue.","热成像调色板下的 [主体]，热作为颜色，面孔成为温暖的色块，掠食者视觉或搜救。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/thermal/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Night Vision","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/night-vision","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/night-vision.webp","Someone is hunting in the dark."],["Infrared","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/infrared","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/infrared.webp","The world should look like another planet that is still Earth."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"热成像"},"transformation":{"t":"Transformation","c":"effects","g":"Psychological background transformation","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/transformation","d":["Transformation cinematography makes a body, room, or object become something else in continuous view. The camera keeps watching while the state changes, with a stable anchor so the becoming can be read.","变形摄影让一个身体、房间或物体在连续视野中变成别的东西。摄影机持续观察，状态发生变化，同时有一个稳定的锚点，好让这个变成的过程被读出来。"],"pi":["Transformation of [Subject], a body, room, or object becoming something else in continuous view. Video: [Subject] transforms across the shot, a visible change of state. Name what stays (pose, face, contact) and what changes (room, species, substance).","[主体] 的变形，一个身体、房间或物体在连续视野中变成别的东西。视频：[主体] 在一个镜头内转变，可见的状态变化。说明什么保持不变（姿势、面孔、接触），什么发生变化（房间、物种、材质）。"],"cp":["Orbit slowly around two fictional former friends embracing in a modern station. Keep their bodies and contact continuous while the architecture behind them gradually becomes the childhood railway platform they remember. Change only the surrounding world, with coherent light and perspective. Plan matched environment plates and composite the transition; no melting faces.","缓慢环绕两位虚构的旧友，他们在一座现代车站拥抱。让他们的身体和接触保持连续，而身后的建筑逐渐变成他们记忆中的童年火车站台。只改变周围的世界，光线和透视保持一致。计划好匹配的环境板，并合成这次转变；不要融化的脸。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/147-continuous-material-transformation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/transformation-147-continuous-material-transformation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/transformation.jpg","r":[["Morphing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/morphing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/morphing-morphing-mini.webp","Becoming is visible."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."],["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."]],"z":"变身"},"typography":{"t":"Typography","c":"effects","g":"Narrative main titles","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/typography","d":["Kinetic typography puts words in the world of the shot as objects: titles that occupy space, letters with scale, parallax, and a surface. The sentence is in the picture, not parked as a caption.","动态排版把文字作为物体放进镜头里的世界：占据空间的字幕，有比例、视差和依附表面的字母。句子在画面里，而不是停在旁边当说明文字。"],"pi":["Typography in the world of [Subject], words as objects, titles that occupy space, kinetic type. Name the words, the surface they sit on, and the light. Ban decorative gibberish and ban a floating caption with no place in the room.","[主体] 世界中的排版，文字作为物体，占据空间的字幕，动态字体。说明文字内容、它们所依附的表面，以及光线。禁止装饰性的乱码，禁止在房间里无处安放的漂浮字幕。"],"cp":["Design a forty-second title sequence for a film about a missing cartographer. A single ink line becomes a street, a fingerprint ridge and a coastline before vanishing at the edge of a map. Generate visual elements separately; animate the transformations and add exact credits in a motion-graphics timeline. No arbitrary stock-footage montage.","为一部关于失踪制图师的电影设计四十秒的片头。一条墨线变成街道、指纹的脊线和海岸线，最后在地图边缘消失。分别生成各个视觉元素；在动态图形时间线上做变形动画并添加准确的字幕。不要随意的素材拼贴。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/typography-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/typography-typography-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/typography.jpg","r":[["Mixed Media","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/mixed-media","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mixed-media-mixed-media-mini.webp","No single medium owns the truth."],["Collage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/collage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/collage.webp","One image is not enough; stack them."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"动态文字"},"vignette":{"t":"Vignette","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/vignette","d":["A vignette in vignette cinematography darkens, desaturates, or lowers contrast toward the frame edges because of optical falloff, mechanical vignetting in the barrel, a filter, or a later grade. Optical vignette follows the lens, while a post oval is a drawing.","暗角摄影中的暗角，是因为光学衰减、镜筒的机械遮角、滤镜或后期调色，使画面朝边缘变暗、去饱和或降低对比。光学暗角跟着镜头走，而后期椭圆是画上去的。"],"pi":["Ask for lens falloff, not a baked oval. Example: Natural optical vignette around [Subject], corners a stop down, attention pooled in the center, vintage falloff not a post oval.","要镜头的边缘衰减，而不是烤进去的椭圆。示例：[主体] 周围自然的光学暗角，四角暗一档，注意力聚在中心，老镜头式的衰减而非后期椭圆。"],"cp":["Natural optical vignette around [Subject], edges falling off, attention pooled in the center, vintage falloff not a post oval.","[主体] 周围自然的光学暗角，边缘衰减，注意力聚在中心，老镜头式的衰减而非后期椭圆。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/vignette/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Vintage Cine Glass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/vintage-cine","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/vintage-cine.webp","Memory, period, or beauty over resolution."],["Cameo Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/cameo-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cameo-lighting.webp","Erase the world. Keep the person."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"暗角"},"wigglegram":{"t":"Wigglegram","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/wigglegram","d":["A wigglegram is a short stereo shiver: two or three frames rocking so depth reads as a fidget. The viewpoints are a few centimeters apart, so depth is a twitch, not a dolly.","摆动立体图是一种短促的立体颤动：两三帧来回摇动，让深度读起来像一个小动作。两个视点相隔几厘米，所以深度是一下抽动，不是推轨。"],"pi":["Wigglegram of [Subject], two or three frames rocking, a cheap stereo shiver, depth as a fidget. Video: A short wiggle between two viewpoints of [Subject], stereoscopic shiver. Name a small baseline and a locked subject. Ban a dolly and ban handheld shake.","[主体] 的摆动立体图，两三帧来回摇动，廉价的立体颤动，深度像一个小动作。视频：[主体] 两个视点之间的短促摆动，立体颤动。说明小基线和锁定的主体。禁止推轨，禁止手持抖动。"],"cp":["A short wiggle between two viewpoints of [Subject], stereoscopic shiver.","[主体] 两个视点之间的短促摆动，立体颤动。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/wigglegram-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wigglegram-wigglegram-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/wigglegram.jpg","r":[["Parallax","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/parallax","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/parallax-parallax-mini.webp","Prove the world has layers."],["Stutter / Stop-Stutter","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/stutter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stutter-086-short-shutter-staccato-action-mini.webp","The mind skips."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"抖动立体图"},"x-ray":{"t":"X-Ray","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/x-ray","d":["X-ray cinematography images through a surface as if denser structure were visible: bones, wiring, a body as diagram. Transmission, not reflectance, is the physics.","X 光摄影像是透过表面成像，仿佛密度更高的结构可见了：骨骼、线路，把身体当作图解。透射而非反射，才是它的物理。"],"pi":["X-ray view of [Subject], interior structure, bones or wiring, a body as diagram. Demand transmission, a readable skeleton or circuit, and no thermal palette. Ban glowing skin that is only a grade.","[主体] 的 X 光视图，内部结构，骨骼或线路，把身体当作图解。要求透射，可读的骨架或电路，不要热成像调色板。禁止只是调色出来的发光皮肤。"],"cp":["X-ray view of [Subject], interior structure, bones or wiring, a body as diagram.","[主体] 的 X 光视图，内部结构，骨骼或线路，把身体当作图解。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/x-ray/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Thermal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/thermal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/thermal.webp","See temperature, not light."],["Infrared","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/infrared","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/infrared.webp","The world should look like another planet that is still Earth."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"X光透视"},"zoetrope":{"t":"Zoetrope","c":"effects","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/zoetrope","d":["Zoetrope cinematography shows the frames inside a movement: stroboscopic slices of a spinning action, motion as a drum of poses. You see the sampling, not a smooth blur.","旋转画筒摄影展示一个运动内部的帧：旋转动作的频闪切片，运动如同一筒姿态。你看到的是采样，而不是平滑的模糊。"],"pi":["Zoetrope of [Subject], stroboscopic slices of a spinning action, motion as a drum of frames. Video: Stroboscopic zoetrope slices of [Subject] in repeating action. Demand discrete sharp poses, a spin or cycle, and visible sampling. Ban smooth blur.","[主体] 的旋转画筒（zoetrope），旋转动作的频闪切片，运动如同一筒帧。视频：重复动作中 [主体] 的频闪旋转画筒切片。要求离散的清晰姿态、一次旋转或循环，以及可见的采样。禁止平滑的模糊。"],"cp":["Stroboscopic zoetrope slices of [Subject] in repeating action.","重复动作中 [主体] 的频闪旋转画筒切片。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/zoetrope-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/zoetrope-zoetrope-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/zoetrope.jpg","r":[["Stop Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/stop-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stop-motion-150-stop-motion-animation-mini.webp","Motion should feel made."],["Step Printing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/step-printing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/step-printing-083-step-printing-and-smeared-motion-mini.webp","Longing that cannot move at normal speed."],["Lens Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/lens-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lens-flare-060-expressive-lens-flare-mini.webp","Light is too strong to be polite."]],"z":"旋转画筒"},"choker":{"t":"Choker Shot (BCU)","c":"framing","g":"Big Close-Up","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/choker","d":["A choker shot, also called a big close-up (BCU), frames the face from hairline to chin, often clipping the skull on every side. Shoulders are out; almost no background remains.","紧特写，也叫大特写（BCU），把面部从发际线框到下巴，通常四边都切掉颅顶。肩膀在画外；背景几乎不剩什么。"],"pi":["Quote the crop. Example: Choker shot of [Subject] from hairline to chin, almost no background. Add lens only if you need undistorted proportion (75mm to 100mm). Do not write extreme close-up, and do not ask for shoulders. For video, lock the head in that crop; a lean that reveals clavicle has left the size.","明确写出景别。示例：[主体] 的紧特写，从发际线到下巴，几乎没有背景。只有在你需要无畸变的比例时才加镜头（75mm 到 100mm）。不要写大特写，也不要要求肩膀。拍摄视频时，把头部锁在这个景别里；一个露出锁骨的倾斜就已经脱离了这个景别。"],"cp":["Choker shot of [Subject] from hairline to chin, almost no background, claustrophobic portrait, Bergman proximity.","[主体] 的紧特写，从发际线到下巴，几乎没有背景，令人窒息的人像，伯格曼式的贴近。"],"hp":["Choker shot of [Subject] from hairline to chin, almost no background.","[主体] 的紧特写，从发际线到下巴，几乎没有背景。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/choker/hero-bcu.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Medium Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/medium-close-up.webp","Talk without losing body language."]],"z":"紧特写"},"close-up":{"t":"Close-Up (CU)","c":"framing","g":"CU","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","d":["A close-up, or close up shot, frames a face tightly enough to privilege detail over surroundings, usually head and upper shoulders. The room becomes secondary; the person still reads as a head, not a fragment.","特写，或称特写镜头，把一张脸框得足够紧，使细节优先于周围环境，通常是头部与上肩。房间变为次要；人物仍然被读作一个头部，而不是一个局部。"],"pi":["Name the anatomy. Example: Tight close-up of [Subject], head and upper shoulders, 75mm, shallow depth of field. Do not write choker, chest up, or a single eye. Keep a sliver of collar or shoulder so the model does not crop inside the face. For video, hold the head; a pull that reveals waist has become a different size.","写明取哪段身体。例：[主体] 的紧凑近景，头部与上肩，75mm，浅景深。不要写 choker、胸部以上或单只眼睛。保留一点衣领或肩膀，否则模型会切进脸里。用于动态时，保持头部；一旦拉出到腰部，就变成另一个景别了。"],"cp":["Tight close-up of [Subject], head and upper shoulders, shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh, 75mm Cooke, the face as landscape.","近景拍 [主体]，头部与上肩，浅景深，柔滑的散景，75mm Cooke 镜头，把脸当作风景来拍。"],"hp":["Tight close-up of [Subject], head and upper shoulders.","紧特写 [主体]，头部与上肩。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/close-up/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Medium Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/medium-close-up.webp","Talk without losing body language."],["Choker Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/choker","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/choker.webp","Emotion with nowhere to hide."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"特写"},"cowboy-shot":{"t":"Cowboy Shot","c":"framing","g":"American shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cowboy-shot","d":["A cowboy shot frames a person from mid-thigh or the knees upward so the hands stay in at the holster line. It is also called an American shot or knee shot; it is not a waist shot and not a full figure.","牛仔镜头把人物从中大腿或膝盖以上框入，使双手保持在枪套线处。它也叫美式镜头或膝部镜头；它不是腰部镜头，也不是全身。"],"pi":["Name mid-thigh and the hands. Example: Cowboy shot of [Subject] framed mid-thigh up, hands visible at the holster line, American shot. Do not write waist up or head to toe. For video, if the feet enter you have left cowboy; if the belt is the bottom you have returned to medium.","点明中大腿和手部。示例：牛仔镜头 [主体] 框到中大腿以上，手在枪套线处可见，美式镜头。不要写腰部以上或从头到脚。用于视频时，如果脚进入画面，你就离开了牛仔镜头；如果腰带是底边，你就回到了中景。"],"cp":["Cowboy shot of [Subject] framed mid-thigh up, hands visible at the holster line, American shot, casual authority.","牛仔镜头 [主体] 框到中大腿以上，手在枪套线处可见，美式镜头，随性的权威感。"],"hp":["Cowboy shot of [Subject] framed mid-thigh up, hands visible at the holster line.","牛仔镜头 [主体] 框到中大腿以上，手在枪套线处可见。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cowboy-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Medium Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/medium-shot.webp","Workhorse coverage. Most scenes live here."],["Full Body","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/full-body","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/full-body.webp","Costume, blocking, and gait matter."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"牛仔镜头"},"cut-ins":{"t":"Cut-ins","c":"framing","g":"cut in","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cut-ins","d":["A cut-in, or cut in shot, moves from a wider view to a closer detail of something already present in that space, usually along the same axis. It proves a fact the wide cannot prove: the hands, the phone, the wound.","切入，或称切入镜头，从一个更宽的视角移动到一个更近的细节，该细节已存在于那个空间中，通常沿同一轴线。它证明广角镜头无法证明的事实：手、手机、伤口。"],"pi":["Say already in the master and same axis. Example: Cut-in on a detail of [Subject] already in the master, tighter, the same axis, a fact the wide cannot prove. Name the detail (hands, phone, wound). For video, do not relocate the camera around the table; you are closer on the same line.","说明已在主镜头中，并且同轴。示例：切入 [主体] 的一个细节，该细节已在主镜头中，更紧，同一轴线，一个广角镜头无法证明的事实。点明细节（手、手机、伤口）。用于视频时，不要绕着桌子移动摄影机；你在同一轴线上更近。"],"cp":["Cut-in on a detail of [Subject] already in the master, tighter, the same axis, a fact the wide cannot prove.","切入 [主体] 的一个细节，该细节已在主镜头中，更紧，同一轴线，一个广角镜头无法证明的事实。"],"hp":["Cut-in on a detail of [Subject] already in the master, tighter, the same axis, a fact the wide cannot prove.","切入 [主体] 的一个细节，该细节已在主镜头中，更紧，同一轴线，一个广角镜头无法证明的事实。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cut-ins/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Insert Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/insert","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/insert-095-narrative-insert-mini.webp","Point at the thing that will matter later."],["Axial Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/axial-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/axial-cut-177-axial-cut-and-punch-in-cut-mini.webp","Change shot size without changing angle."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"切入镜头"},"cutaway":{"t":"Cutaway","c":"framing","g":"Plan de coupe","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cutaway","d":["A cutaway shot leaves the primary action for a related detail, observer, or part of the same world. It is used for context, reaction, compression, or continuity repair.","切出镜头离开主要动作，转向同一世界中的相关细节、观察者或组成部分。它用于提供语境、反应、压缩时间或修复连贯性。"],"pi":["Name the exit. Example: Cutaway from [Subject] to a related detail in the same world (a clock, a kettle, a street, a listener), not an insert on the actor. Match the key. For video, hold the detail, then imply a return; do not keep the original action in frame if you meant to leave it.","点明切出对象。示例：从 [主体] 切出到同一世界中的一个相关细节（时钟、水壶、街道、聆听者），而不是对演员的插入镜头。匹配主光。用于视频时，保持该细节，然后暗示返回；如果你本意是离开原动作，就不要把原动作留在画面中。"],"cp":["A couple argues quietly in a kitchen. Cut away to a kettle beginning to tremble on the stove while their voices continue, then return to the couple after a tense pause. Generate the insert separately with matching light and room sound. No literal symbolism captions.","一对伴侣在厨房里低声争吵。切出到炉子上开始颤动的水壶，同时他们的声音继续，然后在紧张停顿后回到这对伴侣。单独生成插入镜头，匹配光线与房间声。不要字面象征的字幕。"],"hp":["Cutaway from [Subject] to a related detail in the same world, a pressure-release or information beat that is not an insert on the actor.","从 [主体] 切出到同一世界中的相关细节，一个释放压力或传递信息的节拍，而不是对演员的插入镜头。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/094-cutaway-for-meaning-or-continuity-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cutaway-094-cutaway-for-meaning-or-continuity-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/cutaway.jpg","r":[["Insert Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/insert","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/insert-095-narrative-insert-mini.webp","Point at the thing that will matter later."],["Reaction Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/reaction-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reaction-shot-093-reaction-shot-mini.webp","The important action is watching."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"切出镜头"},"establishing-shot":{"t":"Establishing Shot","c":"framing","g":"opening establishing shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/establishing-shot","d":["An establishing shot introduces or re-establishes location, geography, time of day, or social context. It is a job in the sequence, not a synonym for wide or extreme long shot.","定场镜头引入或重新确立地点、地理关系、一天中的时间或社会背景。它是序列中的一项任务，不是广角镜头或极远景的同义词。"],"pi":["Declare place and time. Example: Wide establishing shot of [Subject] and the location at once, time of day and spatial relations declared before coverage begins. Name the hour, the weather, and what building or street this is. For video, a small environmental motion (traffic, steam, a flag) is enough; do not tour if the job is only to plant geography.","交代地点与时间。例：[主体] 与场景同时出现的宽幅建立镜头，在开始分镜之前先声明时间、天气与空间关系。写明钟点、天气，以及这是哪栋建筑或哪条街。用于动态时，一点环境动向（车流、蒸汽、旗帜）就够了；如果任务只是确立地理关系，就不要做游览式运镜。"],"cp":["After a daughter leaves the house, hold a static shot of the empty entryway: her shoes are gone, afternoon light remains on the floor and distant street noise continues. No person enters, no camera move, no sentimental insert music. Cut to the next scene only after the room has registered as its own space.","女儿离家之后，用一个静止镜头停在空玄关：她的鞋不见了，午后的光还留在地板上，远处的街声继续。没有人入画，摄影机不动，不加煽情的插入音乐。等这个空间被观众认成「它自己」之后，再切到下一场。"],"hp":["Wide establishing shot of [Subject] and the location at once, time of day and spatial relations declared before coverage begins.","广角定场镜头，同时呈现 [主体] 与地点，在分镜覆盖开始之前交代一天中的时间与空间关系。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/096-establishing-and-reestablishing-shots-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/establishing-shot-096-establishing-and-reestablishing-shots-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/establishing-shot.jpg","r":[["Extreme Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-long-shot.webp","Scale is the emotion."],["Master Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/master-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/master-shot.webp","Protect the scene. You can always go tighter."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"定场镜头"},"extreme-close-up":{"t":"Extreme Close-Up (ECU)","c":"framing","g":"ECU","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","d":["An extreme close-up, or extreme close up shot, fills the frame with one small feature: an eye, a mouth, a fingertip, a trigger. Surrounding space disappears; the crop is tighter than a whole face.","大特写，或称大特写镜头，用一个微小的特征充满画面：一只眼睛、一张嘴、一个指尖、一个扳机。周围空间消失；裁切比整张脸更紧。"],"pi":["Lead with the crop, then the feature. Example: Extreme close-up of [Subject], a single feature filling the frame, pores and texture, tighter than forehead-to-chin. Name which feature (left eye, mouth, fingertip, trigger) and what must stay sharp. Do not write tight close-up, choker, or macro unless you actually need those. For video, lock the camera, keep the feature in frame, and allow only a blink, a swallow, or a tiny gaze shift.","先说取景范围，再说具体部位。例：极特写中的 [主体]，单一部位填满画面，毛孔与质感可见，比「额头到下巴」更紧。指明是哪个部位（左眼、嘴、指尖、扳机），以及哪里必须保持清晰。若不是真的需要，不要写「紧特写」「choker」「微距」。用于动态时，锁定摄影机，让该部位保持画内，只允许一次眨眼、一次吞咽或极小的视线移动。"],"cp":["Extreme close-up of an older watchmaker’s eyes as she decides whether to open a sealed mechanism. Frame from brow to upper cheek, natural skin texture, tiny shift in gaze and controlled breathing. Restrained light, stable focus, no cosmetic smoothing or wide-angle facial distortion.","极特写一位年长制表师的眼睛，她正在决定要不要打开一个封死的机芯。取景从眉到上颊，自然的皮肤质感，视线极小的移动，呼吸克制。光线克制，焦点稳定，不要磨皮，也不要有广角的面部变形。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/extreme-close-up.jpg","r":[["Choker Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/choker","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/choker.webp","Emotion with nowhere to hide."],["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Insert Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/insert","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/insert-095-narrative-insert-mini.webp","Point at the thing that will matter later."]],"z":"极特写"},"extreme-long-shot":{"t":"Extreme Long Shot (ELS)","c":"framing","g":"ELS","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","d":["An extreme long shot makes environment, scale, geography, or isolation dominant over individual detail. A person, if present, is a speck: a scale mark, not a portrait.","极远景让环境、尺度、地理关系或孤立感压过个体细节。人物若出现，只是一个斑点：一个尺度标记，而不是一幅肖像。"],"pi":["Say speck and name the terrain. Example: Extreme long shot of [Subject] as a speck against vast terrain, infinite depth of field, landscape as the true subject. Demand a detectable human-scale reference. For video, a tiny walk or a dust veil helps the figure read; a locked empty canyon with no marker will look like a maquette.","写出「一个小点」，并说清地形。例：极远景中的 [主体] 只是广袤地形上的一个小点，无限景深，风景才是真正的主体。要求画面里有可辨识的人体尺度参照。用于动态时，一点点走动或一层尘雾能让身形被看清；如果只是空无一人的峡谷静镜、没有任何参照，看起来会像模型。"],"cp":["Extreme-wide static shot of a lone surveyor in a yellow coat at the base of an enormous concrete spillway. The figure is tiny but unmistakable; immense walls recede naturally. Slow drifting mist, no camera move, no giant-person scale errors.","极宽静态镜头：一名穿黄外套的测量员独自站在巨大的混凝土泄洪道底部。人极小但一眼可辨；巨大的墙体自然向远处退去。缓慢飘动的薄雾，摄影机不动，不要出现把人拍成巨人的比例错误。"],"hp":["Extreme long shot of [Subject] as a speck against vast terrain, landscape as the true subject.","极远景 [主体] 作为广阔地形上的一个斑点，风景才是真正的主体。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/extreme-long-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Aerial Pullback","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial-pullback","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-pullback-025-cosmic-scale-pull-back-mini.webp","Close a chapter. Geography wins."],["Establishing Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/establishing-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/establishing-shot-096-establishing-and-reestablishing-shots-mini.webp","Open a scene. Tell us where and when."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"极远景"},"full-body":{"t":"Full Body (WS)","c":"framing","g":"long shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/full-body","d":["A full body shot holds a person head to toe, with the figure complete and a readable strip of environment around the silhouette. The person is still the subject; the world is a border, not the owner of the frame.","全身镜头把人物从头到脚收入画面，人物完整，剪影周围有一条可读的环境带。人物仍然是主体；世界是边框，而不是画面的拥有者。"],"pi":["Say head to toe. Example: Full-body shot of [Subject], head to toe, figure complete in frame, environment readable around the silhouette. Do not write long shot, wide, or mid-thigh. For video, if the figure shrinks into architecture you have drifted into a long shot.","说明从头到脚。示例：全身镜头 [主体]，从头到脚，人物在画面中完整，剪影周围环境可读。不要写远景、广角或中大腿。用于视频时，如果人物缩小进建筑中，你就漂移成了远景。"],"cp":["Full-body shot of [Subject], head to toe, figure complete in frame, environment readable around the silhouette.","全身镜头 [主体]，从头到脚，人物完整在画面中，剪影周围环境可读。"],"hp":["Full-body shot of [Subject], head to toe, figure complete in frame, environment readable around the silhouette.","全身镜头 [主体]，从头到脚，人物完整在画面中，剪影周围环境可读。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/full-body/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Cowboy Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cowboy-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cowboy-shot.webp","Show hands, weapons, or stance without going full body."],["Extreme Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-long-shot.webp","Scale is the emotion."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"全身镜头"},"gesture":{"t":"Gesture","c":"framing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/gesture","d":["Gesture cinematography sizes and times a shot around a discrete expressive body movement: a hand, a glance, a weight shift. The plot is in the motion, not in an object sitting still.","手势摄影围绕一个离散的、富有表现力的身体动作来确定景别与时机：一只手、一瞥、一次重心转移。情节在动作中，而不在一个静止的物体里。"],"pi":["Name the movement. Example: Gesture close on [Subject], the meaning in a hand, a glance, a weight shift, coverage of the small action. Say what the body does (fingers almost touching, a look away). For video, one motion with a settle; do not add a camera tour.","点明动作。示例：手势特写 [主体]，意义在一只手、一瞥、一次重心转移中，对小动作的分镜覆盖。说明身体做什么（手指几乎相触、看向别处）。用于视频时，一个动作，带一个落定；不要添加摄影机巡游。"],"cp":["Gesture close on [Subject], the meaning in a hand, a glance, a weight shift, coverage of the small action.","手势特写 [主体]，意义在一只手、一瞥、一次重心转移中，对小动作的分镜覆盖。"],"hp":["Gesture close on [Subject], the meaning in a hand, a glance, a weight shift, coverage of the small action.","手势特写 [主体]，意义在一只手、一瞥、一次重心转移中，对小动作的分镜覆盖。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/gesture/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Insert Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/insert","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/insert-095-narrative-insert-mini.webp","Point at the thing that will matter later."],["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"手势镜头"},"group-shot":{"t":"Group Shot","c":"framing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/group-shot","d":["A group shot frames a small ensemble as a relational unit, such as a family, a crew, or a jury. Position, height, and light say who belongs and who dominates.","群像镜头把一个小型群戏框成一个关系单元，例如一个家庭、一个剧组或一个陪审团。位置、高度与光线说明谁属于其中、谁占主导。"],"pi":["Name the unit and the owner. Example: Group shot containing [Subject] among several figures, ensemble blocking, who owns the frame by position and light. Specify count (five at a table, a crew of six) and who is brightest or highest. For video, a small shift in who stands can re-rank the group without a cut.","点明群体与主导者。示例：群像镜头包含 [主体] 在若干人物之中，群戏调度，谁通过位置与光线拥有画面。明确人数（桌边五人、六人剧组）以及谁最亮或最高。用于视频时，站立者的小幅变化就能在不剪切的情况下重新排列群体等级。"],"cp":["Group shot containing [Subject] among several figures, ensemble blocking, who owns the frame by position and light.","群像镜头包含 [主体] 在若干人物之中，群戏调度，谁通过位置与光线拥有画面。"],"hp":["Group shot containing [Subject] among several figures, ensemble blocking, who owns the frame by position and light.","群像镜头包含 [主体] 在若干人物之中，群戏调度，谁通过位置与光线拥有画面。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/group-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Three-Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/three-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-shot.webp","A trio has politics."],["Master Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/master-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/master-shot.webp","Protect the scene. You can always go tighter."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"群像镜头"},"insert":{"t":"Insert Shot","c":"framing","g":"Pursued object","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/insert","d":["An insert shot is a close view of a story-relevant detail: an object, a hand action, a screen, or text. It points at the thing that will matter, at real scale.","插入镜头是对与故事相关的细节的近距离视角：一个物体、一个手部动作、一块屏幕或文字。它指向将要重要的东西，并保持真实比例。"],"pi":["Name the object and the scale. Example: Tight close-up of an object that carries the plot near [Subject]: a glass, a letter, a latch. Hands at real scale. No glowing skin. Match the room's key. For video, a small physical change (a tremor, a thumb on a latch) is the motion; do not orbit the prop.","写明物件与尺寸。例：在 [主体] 附近承载剧情的物件特写：一只杯子、一封信、一个门闩。手按真实比例。皮肤不要发光。与该房间的主光一致。用于动态时，一点物理变化（一次轻颤、拇指按上门闩）就是动作；不要让道具转圈。"],"cp":["Outline a short caper around an unopened blue envelope sought by three strangers. Never reveal its contents. Build the scenes around shifting trust, mistaken possession and one character choosing a friend over the envelope. Generate a consistent, easily trackable prop for every shot.","围绕一个从未拆开的蓝色信封写一段短小闹剧，三拨陌生人都在找它。永远不揭示内容。用信任的转移、拿错东西和「有人为了朋友放弃信封」来搭建场景。每一镜都要生成同一个、易于辨认追踪的道具。"],"hp":["Tight close-up of an object that carries the plot near [Subject]: a glass, a letter, a latch. Hands at real scale.","在[主体]附近，对承载情节的物体拍大特写：一只玻璃杯、一封信、一个门闩。手部保持真实比例。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/095-narrative-insert-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/insert-095-narrative-insert-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/insert.jpg","r":[["Cutaway","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cutaway","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cutaway-094-cutaway-for-meaning-or-continuity-mini.webp","Hide a cut, show a clock, or let the room comment."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Choker Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/choker","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/choker.webp","Emotion with nowhere to hide."]],"z":"插入镜头"},"interview":{"t":"Interview","c":"framing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/interview","d":["Interview cinematography is a talking-head setup: stable size, eyeline just off the lens, a listener implied. Someone is answering a question we often do not hear.","采访摄影是一种头部访谈式设置：稳定的景别，视线刚好偏离镜头，暗示有倾听者。某人在回答一个我们通常听不到的问题。"],"pi":["Lock eyeline and size. Example: Interview frame of [Subject], talking-head distance, eyeline just off lens, a listener implied. Specify look space toward camera-left or camera-right. For video, hold; small hand motion is fine. Do not stare down the lens unless you want direct address.","锁定视线和景别。示例：对[主体]的采访取景，头部访谈景别，视线刚好偏离镜头，暗示有倾听者。指定看向摄影机左侧或右侧的视线空间。视频中保持不动；小幅手部动作可以。除非想要直接对观众说话，否则不要让被摄者直视镜头。"],"cp":["Interview frame of [Subject], talking-head distance, eyeline just off lens, a listener implied.","对[主体]的采访取景，头部访谈景别，视线刚好偏离镜头，暗示有倾听者。"],"hp":["Interview frame of [Subject], talking-head distance, eyeline just off lens, a listener implied.","对[主体]的采访取景，头部访谈景别，视线刚好偏离镜头，暗示有倾听者。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/interview/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Medium Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/medium-close-up.webp","Talk without losing body language."],["Eye Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/eye-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/eye-level.webp","Default honesty. Do not look down or up unless you mean it."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"访谈镜头"},"long-shot":{"t":"Long Shot (WS)","c":"framing","g":"wide shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/long-shot","d":["A long shot in cinematography shows the full subject plus a substantial portion of the environment, so a person sits small in geography. The figure is still locatable as a human; the world is large enough to ignore them.","电影摄影中的远景展示完整主体以及环境的很大一部分，因此人物在空间中显得很小。人物仍然可被定位为人；世界大到足以忽略他们。"],"pi":["Say full figure plus geography. Example: Long shot of [Subject] small in a large environment, full figure plus geography. Do not write head to toe as a hero portrait, and do not write speck against vast terrain. For video, keep the body identifiable; if they vanish into texture, you have gone to extreme long shot.","说明完整人形加空间地理。示例：[主体]在大环境中的远景，人物很小，完整人形加空间地理。不要写成从头到脚的英雄肖像，也不要写成效广阔地形中的小点。视频中要保持身体可辨认；如果人物消失在纹理中，就已经变成大远景。"],"cp":["Long shot of [Subject] small in a large environment, full figure plus geography, mythic placement of a person in land.","[主体]在大环境中的远景，人物很小，完整人形加空间地理，人在土地中的神话式放置。"],"hp":["Long shot of [Subject] small in a large environment, full figure plus geography.","[主体]在大环境中的远景，人物很小，完整人形加空间地理。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/long-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Extreme Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-long-shot.webp","Scale is the emotion."],["Establishing Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/establishing-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/establishing-shot-096-establishing-and-reestablishing-shots-mini.webp","Open a scene. Tell us where and when."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"远景"},"master-shot":{"t":"Master Shot","c":"framing","g":"wide master","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/master-shot","d":["A master shot covers the complete dramatic action and the spatial geography of a scene in one setup. It is the skeleton you can play in full, then cut into.","主镜头在一个机位设置中覆盖一场戏完整的戏剧动作和空间地理。它是你可以完整播放、然后再切入的骨架。"],"pi":["Demand all blocking. Example: Wide master of [Subject] with all blocking visible, the skeleton of the scene in one continuous frame. Name the door, the table, and who stands where. For video, let the action play; do not punch in. Coverage can be generated as later sizes from the same geography.","要求展现全部调度。示例：[主体]的全景主镜头，所有调度可见，用单个连续画面呈现场景骨架。指明门、桌子以及谁站在哪里。视频中让动作完整发生；不要推近。分镜覆盖可以从同一空间地理中生成后续景别。"],"cp":["Wide master of [Subject] with all blocking visible, the skeleton of the scene in one continuous frame, coverage can cut in later.","[主体]的全景主镜头，所有调度可见，用单个连续画面呈现场景骨架，分镜覆盖可在之后切入。"],"hp":["Wide master of [Subject] with all blocking visible, the skeleton of the scene in one continuous frame, coverage can cut in later.","[主体]的全景主镜头，所有调度可见，用单个连续画面呈现场景骨架，分镜覆盖可在之后切入。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/master-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Establishing Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/establishing-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/establishing-shot-096-establishing-and-reestablishing-shots-mini.webp","Open a scene. Tell us where and when."],["Two-Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/two-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/two-shot-048-profile-two-shot-mini.webp","The relationship is the shot."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"主镜头"},"medium-close-up":{"t":"Medium Close-Up (MCU)","c":"framing","g":"MCU","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-close-up","d":["A medium close-up, or medium close up, usually frames a person from chest or shoulders upward. Dialogue distance remains: face, shoulders, and often a hand at chest height stay readable.","中近景通常将人物取景为胸部或肩部以上。对话距离仍然保留：脸部、肩部，以及常常在胸部高度的手部，都保持可读。"],"pi":["Say chest up. Example: Medium close-up of [Subject] from chest up, dialogue distance, shoulders and hands still readable, 65 to 75mm. Do not say head and shoulders only, and do not say waist. For video, keep the chest line; a zoom into the eyes has become a close-up.","说明胸部以上。示例：[主体]的中近景，从胸部以上，对话距离，肩部和手部仍然可读，65到75mm。不要说只有头部和肩部，也不要说腰部。视频中保持胸部线；推近到眼睛就变成了特写。"],"cp":["Medium close-up of [Subject] from chest up, dialogue distance, shoulders and hands still readable, 65 to 75mm.","[主体]的中近景，从胸部以上，对话距离，肩部和手部仍然可读，65到75mm。"],"hp":["Medium close-up of [Subject] from chest up, shoulders and hands still readable.","[主体]的中近景，从胸部以上，肩部和手部仍然可读。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/medium-close-up/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Medium Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/medium-shot.webp","Workhorse coverage. Most scenes live here."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"中近景"},"medium-shot":{"t":"Medium Shot (MS)","c":"framing","g":"MS","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-shot","d":["A medium shot frames a person from approximately the waist upward, so face and gesture share the rectangle. It is the workhorse size of coverage, sometimes called a waist shot.","中景将人物取景为大约腰部以上，因此脸部和手势共享画框。它是分镜覆盖的主力景别，有时称为腰部镜头。"],"pi":["Say waist. Example: Medium shot of [Subject] from the waist up, conversational distance, 50mm, gesture and face in balance. Do not write chest up, mid-thigh, or head and shoulders. For video, if the camera drifts down to the knees you have entered cowboy territory.","写明「腰部」。例：中景中的 [主体]，从腰部以上取景，谈话距离，50mm，动作与面部比重均衡。不要写成胸部以上、大腿中部或头肩。用于动态时，如果取景向下滑到膝盖，就已经变成牛仔景别了。"],"cp":["Medium shot of [Subject] from the waist up, conversational distance, 50mm, gesture and face in balance.","中景拍 [主体]，腰部以上，谈话距离，50mm，动作与面部比重均衡。"],"hp":["Medium shot of [Subject] from the waist up, gesture and face in balance.","[主体]的中景，从腰部以上，手势和脸部平衡。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/medium-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Cowboy Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cowboy-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cowboy-shot.webp","Show hands, weapons, or stance without going full body."],["Medium Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/medium-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/medium-close-up.webp","Talk without losing body language."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"中景"},"over-the-shoulder-frame":{"t":"Over-the-Shoulder Coverage (OTS)","c":"framing","g":"OTS","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/over-the-shoulder-frame","d":["Over-the-shoulder coverage, or an over the shoulder shot, puts a near shoulder or head in the foreground while the far face stays sharp. Paired reverses preserve relational space.","过肩分镜覆盖，或过肩镜头，将近处肩膀或头部放在前景，同时远处脸部保持清晰。成对反打保留关系空间。"],"pi":["Name the near shoulder and the far face. Example: Over-the-shoulder framing of [Subject], near shoulder soft in foreground, the far face sharp, looking toward the near shoulder, 180-line held. Specify which body is near. For a pair, generate a matched reverse on the same side of the axis, same table and key. Do not put both full faces to camera, and do not let the far person look into the lens.","指明近处肩膀和远处脸部。示例：[主体]的过肩取景，近处肩膀在前景中虚化，远处脸部清晰，看向近处肩膀，保持180度线。指定哪具身体在近处。对于一对人物，在轴线同一侧生成匹配的反打，同一张桌子和主光。不要让两张完整脸都朝向摄影机，也不要让远处的人看向镜头。"],"cp":["Generate two matching over-the-shoulder shots of a tense café conversation. A: the man’s blurred shoulder frames the woman’s face. B: her blurred shoulder frames his face. Preserve seat positions, cup placement and light direction. Edit on changing reactions, not every spoken word.","生成两个匹配的过肩镜头，表现一场紧张的咖啡馆对话。A：男人虚化的肩膀框住女人的脸。B：她虚化的肩膀框住他的脸。保持座位位置、杯子摆放和光线方向。根据反应变化来剪辑，而不是每句台词。"],"hp":["Over-the-shoulder framing of [Subject], near shoulder soft in foreground, the far face sharp, looking toward the near shoulder, 180-line held.","[主体]的过肩取景，近处肩膀在前景中虚化，远处脸部清晰，看向近处肩膀，保持180度线。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/088-over-the-shoulder-coverage-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/over-the-shoulder-frame-088-over-the-shoulder-coverage-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/over-the-shoulder-frame.jpg","r":[["Two-Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/two-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/two-shot-048-profile-two-shot-mini.webp","The relationship is the shot."],["Single","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/single","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/single.webp","Isolate. The other person is gone even if they are in the room."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"过肩镜头"},"product":{"t":"Product","c":"framing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/product","d":["Product cinematography lights and frames an object the way a portrait treats a face: hero angle, catalog clarity, controlled reflections. The thing is the subject, not a plot insert in a messy room.","产品摄影像肖像对待脸部一样为物体打光并取景：主视觉角度、产品目录般清晰、受控反光。物体就是主体，而不是杂乱房间里的情节插入镜头。"],"pi":["Name the object as hero. Example: Product hero of [Subject], catalog clarity, controlled reflections, the object as the only subject. Specify material (brushed aluminum, glass, leather) and the background (black sweep, white cyclorama). For video, one slow turn or a locked hero; do not add a person unless they are a scale hand.","把物体当作主角来说明。示例：[主体]的产品主视觉，产品目录般清晰，受控反光，物体是唯一主体。指定材质（拉丝铝、玻璃、皮革）和背景（黑色无缝背景、白色天幕）。视频中缓慢旋转一次或锁定主视觉；除非是展示比例的手，否则不要加入人物。"],"cp":["Product hero of [Subject], catalog clarity, controlled reflections, the object as celebrity.","[主体]的产品主视觉，产品目录般清晰，受控反光，物体如明星。"],"hp":["Product hero of [Subject], catalog clarity, controlled reflections, the object as the only subject.","[主体]的产品主视觉，产品目录般清晰，受控反光，物体是唯一主体。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/product/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Macro","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/macro","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/macro-058-macro-insert-mini.webp","The plot is microscopic."],["Lazy Susan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/lazy-susan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lazy-susan-lazy-susan-mini.webp","Show an object or costume from every side."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"产品镜头"},"reaction-shot":{"t":"Reaction Shot","c":"framing","g":"Kuleshov effect","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/reaction-shot","d":["A reaction shot shows a character's response to an event, a line, or an unseen stimulus. The important action is watching; the face (or body) is the cut.","反应镜头展示角色对事件、台词或未见刺激的回应。重要的动作是观看；脸（或身体）就是剪辑点。"],"pi":["Name receiving. Example: Reaction close-up of [Subject] receiving news they cannot speak yet, the face as the cut. Specify eyeline offscreen or toward a known object. For video, hold a small physical change (a swallow, a blink) rather than a tour of expressions.","说明接收反应。示例：[主体]的反应特写，正在接收还无法说出口的消息，脸部就是剪辑点。指定视线看向画外或看向一个已知物体。视频中保持一个细微的生理变化（吞咽、眨眼），而不是遍览各种表情。"],"cp":["Generate one neutral close-up of a woman looking slightly down and right. Reuse the identical clip in three short edits: after a broken heirloom, after a sleeping puppy and after an unsigned contract. Generate the inserts separately and keep the reaction genuinely unchanged. Compare the meanings created by the juxtaposition.","生成一个女人略微向下、向右看的单一中性特写。将同一片段重复用于三个短剪辑：在破碎传家宝之后、在熟睡小狗之后、在未签署合同之后。分别生成插入镜头，并让反应真正保持不变。比较并置所产生的含义。"],"hp":["Reaction close-up of [Subject] receiving news they cannot speak yet, the face as the cut.","[主体]的反应特写，正在接收还无法说出口的消息，脸部就是剪辑点。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/093-reaction-shot-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reaction-shot-093-reaction-shot-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/reaction-shot.jpg","r":[["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Choker Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/choker","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/choker.webp","Emotion with nowhere to hide."]],"z":"反应镜头"},"single":{"t":"Single","c":"framing","g":"clean single","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/single","d":["A single, in single shot cinematography, is a coverage shot of one principal character, not a one-take scene. A clean single keeps other bodies out; a dirty single lets a shoulder or blur from the partner chew the edge without becoming a true over-the-shoulder.","单人镜头，在单人镜头摄影中，是对一位主要角色的分镜覆盖镜头，而不是一镜到底的场景。干净单人镜头把其他身体排除在外；脏单人镜头让伴侣的肩膀或虚影啃噬边缘，但不会变成真正的过肩镜头。"],"pi":["Say one person and whether the edges are clean. Example: Clean single of [Subject], one person, no foreground shoulder, the frame belonging entirely to them. If you want dirty, say a blur of the partner at the frame edge, not an OTS shoulder. For video, do not let a second face walk in unless that is the beat.","说明一个人以及边缘是否干净。示例：[主体]的干净单人镜头，一个人，没有前景肩膀，画框完全属于他们。如果想要脏单人，就说画框边缘有伴侣的虚影，而不是过肩镜头中的肩膀。视频中不要让第二张脸走入，除非那就是节拍。"],"cp":["Clean single of [Subject], one person, no foreground shoulder, the frame belonging entirely to them.","[主体]的干净单人镜头，一个人，没有前景肩膀，画框完全属于他们。"],"hp":["Clean single of [Subject], one person, no foreground shoulder, the frame belonging entirely to them.","[主体]的干净单人镜头，一个人，没有前景肩膀，画框完全属于他们。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/single/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Over-the-Shoulder Coverage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/over-the-shoulder-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/over-the-shoulder-frame-088-over-the-shoulder-coverage-mini.webp","Default dialogue coverage with spatial glue."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"单人镜头"},"three-shot":{"t":"Three-Shot","c":"framing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/three-shot","d":["A three-shot, or three shot, frames three principal subjects together, usually so alliances and the odd one out are readable in the blocking. It is a group sentence of three, not three singles cut together.","三人镜头（three-shot，或称 three shot）将三位主要主体框在一起，通常要让联盟关系与局外人在调度中清晰可读。它是由三人组成的一个群体句子，而不是三个单人镜头剪在一起。"],"pi":["Name three and the triangle. Example: Three-shot of [Subject] in a triangular group, alliances and the odd one out readable in blocking. Specify who is isolated by height, light, or gap. For video, a small blocking shift (one step back) should change the politics without a cut.","点名三人与三角形。示例：三人镜头：[主体]呈三角形群组，联盟关系与局外人在调度中清晰可读。明确谁因高度、光线或间隙而被孤立。视频中，小幅调度变化（后退一步）应无需剪辑就改变权力关系。"],"cp":["Three-shot of [Subject] in a triangular group, alliances and the odd one out readable in blocking.","三人镜头：[主体]呈三角形群组，联盟关系与局外人在调度中清晰可读。"],"hp":["Three-shot of [Subject] in a triangular group, alliances and the odd one out readable in blocking.","三人镜头：[主体]呈三角形群组，联盟关系与局外人在调度中清晰可读。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/three-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Two-Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/two-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/two-shot-048-profile-two-shot-mini.webp","The relationship is the shot."],["Group Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/group-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/group-shot.webp","A family, a crew, a jury."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"三人镜头"},"two-shot":{"t":"Two-Shot","c":"framing","g":"profile two-shot","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/two-shot","d":["A two-shot, or two shot, frames two principal subjects together so their distance and posture can be compared in one composition. The space between them is part of the sentence.","双人镜头（two-shot，或称 two shot）将两位主要主体框在一起，使他们的距离与姿态能在同一构图中被比较。二人之间的空间是句子的一部分。"],"pi":["Demand two people and the gap. Example: Two-shot of [Subject] with a second figure, the space between them doing narrative work, 50mm. Specify profile, facing, or layered. Keep both faces readable unless you are hiding one on purpose. For video, let distance change; do not cut to singles inside the prompt if you want the shared frame to hold.","要求两个人与间隙。示例：双人镜头：[主体]与第二个人物，二人之间的空间承担叙事作用，50mm。明确侧脸、面对面或前后分层。保持两张脸都可读，除非你刻意隐藏其中一张。视频中，让距离发生变化；若想让共享画框保持住，不要在提示词内切到单人镜头。"],"cp":["Hold a medium profile two-shot of two former business partners seated across a narrow café table. Both faces remain readable at once. One leans forward while the other slowly leans back. No cutting to singles, no focus change, tension expressed through changing distance.","保持一个中景侧脸双人镜头：两位前商业伙伴隔着一张窄咖啡桌坐着。两张脸同时保持可读。一人向前倾，另一人缓缓后仰。不切单人镜头，不改变焦点，张力通过变化距离表达。"],"hp":["Two-shot of [Subject] with a second figure, the space between them doing narrative work, 50mm, shared frame as relationship.","双人镜头：[主体]与第二个人物，二人之间的空间承担叙事作用，50mm，共享画框即关系。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/048-profile-two-shot-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/two-shot-048-profile-two-shot-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/two-shot.jpg","r":[["Three-Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/three-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-shot.webp","A trio has politics."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Choker Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/choker","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/choker.webp","Emotion with nowhere to hide."]],"z":"双人镜头"},"video-portraits":{"t":"Video Portraits","c":"framing","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/video-portraits","d":["A video portrait is a sustained, simply covered study of one person: stable size, patient time, the face as the whole event. Duration is the intimacy; a person is enough.","视频肖像是对一个人的持续、简朴分镜覆盖式研究：稳定的大小、耐心的时光，脸就是全部事件。时长即亲密感；一个人就够了。"],"pi":["Demand the hold. Still: Video portrait of [Subject], a held face, duration as intimacy. Video: A long held portrait of [Subject], tiny life in the face, almost still. Forbid camera travel. Allow blink, breath, a swallow. Do not write cinemagraph unless only one element should move.","要求保持。静帧：视频肖像：[主体]，一张被保持的脸，时长即亲密感。视频：一段长时间保持的[主体]肖像，脸上有微小生命感，几乎静止。禁止摄影机移动。允许眨眼、呼吸、吞咽。除非只有一个元素应移动，否则不要写局部动态图（cinemagraph）。"],"cp":["A long held portrait of [Subject], tiny life in the face, almost still.","一段长时间保持的[主体]肖像，脸上有微小生命感，几乎静止。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/video-portraits-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/video-portraits-video-portraits-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/video-portraits.jpg","r":[["Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/close-up.webp","Read micro-expression. Default for important dialogue."],["Cinemagraph","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/cinemagraph","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cinemagraph-cinemagraph-mini.webp","A photograph that refuses to die."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."]],"z":"视频肖像"},"wide-shot":{"t":"Wide Shot (WS)","c":"framing","g":"wide","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/wide-shot","d":["A wide shot shows the subject in full environment, with bodies small enough that place still speaks. It is environment-forward coverage: do not isolate yet.","全景镜头展示主体所处的完整环境，身体小到让地点仍在说话。它是以环境为先的分镜覆盖：此时不要孤立主体。"],"pi":["Say full environment and small bodies. Example: Wide shot of [Subject] in full environment, bodies small enough that place still speaks. Name the door, the street, the weather. Do not write head to toe hero, mid-thigh cowboy, or speck. For video, hold the geography; a tiny figure motion is enough.","说清完整环境与渺小身体。示例：全景镜头：[主体]处在完整环境中，身体小到让地点仍在说话。点名门、街道、天气。不要写从头到脚的英雄镜头、中大腿的牛仔镜头或小点。视频中，保持地理环境；微小的身形动作就足够。"],"cp":["Wide shot of [Subject] in full environment, bodies small enough that place still speaks.","全景镜头：[主体]处在完整环境中，身体小到让地点仍在说话。"],"hp":["Wide shot of [Subject] in full environment, bodies small enough that place still speaks.","全景镜头：[主体]处在完整环境中，身体小到让地点仍在说话。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/wide-shot/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/long-shot.webp","Place a human in a world that could ignore them."],["Establishing Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/establishing-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/establishing-shot-096-establishing-and-reestablishing-shots-mini.webp","Open a scene. Tell us where and when."],["Extreme Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-long-shot.webp","Scale is the emotion."]],"z":"全景"},"animation":{"t":"Animation","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/animation","d":["Animation cinematography constructs light and motion instead of capturing them: graphic volume, designed keys, and movement as drawing, paint, or stepped CG, not as a photographed exposure. The world is built. Lens physics appear only if you choose them.","动画摄影构建光线与运动，而非捕捉它们：图形化体积、设计主光，以及作为绘画、涂抹或阶梯式CG的运动，而不是被拍摄下来的曝光。世界是被建造出来的。镜头物理只在你选择时才出现。"],"pi":["Animated treatment of [Subject], graphic volume, designed light, motion as drawing rather than photography. Name the medium (halftone, charcoal, cel, graphic CG). Do not ask for photoreal lens bokeh unless that is the construction.","对[主体]的动画化处理，图形化体积，设计光，运动是绘画而非摄影。点名媒介（半色调、炭笔、赛璐璐、图形CG）。除非这就是其构造方式，否则不要要求照片级镜头虚化。"],"cp":["Animated cinematic treatment of [Subject], graphic volume, designed light, motion as drawing rather than photography.","对[主体]的动画电影化处理，图形化体积，设计光，运动是绘画而非摄影。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/animation/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Pixel Art","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/pixel-art","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pixel-art.webp","The world is tiles."],["Stop Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/stop-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stop-motion-150-stop-motion-animation-mini.webp","Motion should feel made."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"动画风格"},"arthouse":{"t":"Arthouse","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/arthouse","d":["Arthouse cinematography leaves space for thought: a Static Locked-Off camera, odd Headroom , natural or window light, and a frame willing to be empty. Duration is implied even in a still. The picture does not sell itself as a poster.","艺术电影摄影为思考留出空间：固定锁定机位、古怪的头顶留白、自然光或窗光，以及愿意空着的画框。即使是一张静帧，也暗示着时长。画面不把自己推销成海报。"],"pi":["Arthouse still of [Subject], patience, odd headroom, natural window light, the frame willing to be empty, static camera, duration implied. Name the unused air in the frame. Do not add a heroic rim or clean poster skies.","艺术电影静帧：[主体]，耐心，古怪的头顶空间，自然窗光，画框愿意空着，固定摄影机，暗示时长。点名画框中未使用的空气。不要加英雄式轮廓光或干净的海报天空。"],"cp":["Arthouse still of [Subject], patience, odd headroom, natural light, the frame willing to be empty, duration implied.","艺术电影静帧：[主体]，耐心，古怪的头顶空间，自然光，画框愿意空着，暗示时长。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/arthouse/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Negative Space","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/negative-space","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2-mini.webp","Loneliness needs room."],["Static Locked-Off","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/static","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/static-022-locked-off-duration-mini.webp","Trust blocking and duration. Movement would be noise."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"艺术电影"},"blockbuster-gloss":{"t":"Blockbuster Gloss","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/blockbuster-gloss","d":["Blockbuster cinematography is high-contrast, billboard-readable coverage: clean skies or designed weather, a heroic rim on hair and shoulder, volumetric shafts, and a grade that often splits teal shadow from warm skin. The shot must still parse at poster size.","大片摄影是高对比、广告牌可读的分镜覆盖：干净天空或设计过的天气，头发与肩上的英雄式轮廓光，体积光束，以及常把青绿色阴影与暖色皮肤分开的调色。镜头在放大到海报尺寸时仍必须清晰可读。"],"pi":["Blockbuster gloss on [Subject], expensive contrast, clean skies, heroic rim, volumetric haze, IMAX-scale finish, adventure poster in motion. Name the rim and the horizon. Do not prompt odd headroom or mixed unstyled color.","对[主体]的大片光泽，昂贵对比，干净天空，英雄式轮廓光，体积雾，IMAX级完成度，运动中的冒险海报。点名轮廓光与地平线。不要提示古怪的头顶留白或未调色的混合色彩。"],"cp":["Blockbuster gloss on [Subject], expensive contrast, clean skies, heroic rim, IMAX-scale finish, adventure poster in motion.","对[主体]的大片光泽，昂贵对比，干净天空，英雄式轮廓光，IMAX级完成度，运动中的冒险海报。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/blockbuster-gloss/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."],["Volumetric Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/volumetric-light.webp","Air has to be photographed, not just the subject."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"大片质感"},"bts":{"t":"BTS","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/bts","d":["Behind the scenes cinematography shows the making: C-stands, flags, the set wall, and crew in the same frame as the fiction, so the constructed world leaks. Documentary light (worklamps, mixed Kinos) sits beside the scene's key.","幕后摄影展示制作过程：C型支架、遮光板、片场墙壁和剧组与虚构内容出现在同一画框里，于是构建出的世界发生泄漏。纪录片式光线（工作灯、混合色温的 Kino 灯）与场景主光并置。"],"pi":["Behind-the-scenes look at [Subject], crew, C-stands, and the set edge visible, the fiction leaking, worklight mixed with the scene key. Name a stand or a flag. Do not hide the apparatus.","对[主体]的幕后视角，剧组、C型支架与片场边缘可见，虚构正在泄漏，工作灯与场景主光混合。点名一个支架或遮光板。不要隐藏器材。"],"cp":["Behind-the-scenes look at [Subject], crew, stands, and the set edge visible, the fiction leaking, documentary light on a constructed world.","对[主体]的幕后视角，剧组、支架与片场边缘可见，虚构正在泄漏，纪录片式光线照在构建出的世界上。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/bts/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Cinéma Vérité","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/cinema-verite","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cinema-verite.webp","Style would be propaganda."],["Interview","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/interview","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/interview.webp","Someone is answering a question we did not hear."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"幕后花絮"},"cinema-verite":{"t":"Cinéma Vérité","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/cinema-verite","d":["Cinéma vérité uses available light, zoom-to-find framing, and the filmmaker's presence as a catalyst, so the camera is admitted into the room rather than hidden. Unpretty 16mm or digital frames, mixed color temperature, and a zoom hunting the moment are the physical signature, not a recovered amateur tape.","真实电影（Cinéma vérité）使用可用光、以变焦寻找的取景，以及电影制作人的在场作为催化剂，因此摄影机被允许进入房间，而不是被隐藏。不漂亮的16mm或数字画框、混合色温，以及搜寻当下的变焦，是其物理签名，而不是一盘被重新发现的业余录像带。"],"pi":["Cinéma vérité treatment of [Subject], available light, unpretty frames, zooming to find, mixed color temperature, life unstaged. Name the window or practical. Do not add a rim, a crane, or a recovered-tape timestamp.","[主体] 的真实电影（Cinéma vérité）处理：可用光，不好看的构图，靠变焦去寻找，混合色温，生活不经安排。写明是哪扇窗或哪盏实景灯。不要加轮廓光、摇臂，也不要加「找回的录像带」时间码。"],"cp":["Cinéma vérité treatment of [Subject], available light, unpretty frames, zooming to find, life unstaged.","[主体] 的真实电影（Cinéma vérité）处理：可用光，不好看的构图，靠变焦去寻找，生活不经安排。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cinema-verite/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Available Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/available-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/available-light.webp","Commit to the hour you have."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"真实电影"},"cosmic-horror-look":{"t":"Cosmic Horror","c":"genre-looks","g":"Lovecraftian horror","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/cosmic-horror-look","d":["Cosmic horror cinematography builds dread from human insignificance: extreme long shots, slightly illegal geometry, under-light on faces, and a brightness that reveals too much. The threat is not a man. Scale, entity, and knowledge that will not fit a face are the optical problem.","宇宙恐怖摄影从人类的渺小中建立恐惧：极远景镜头、略微违规的几何构图、脸上欠光，以及揭示过多的亮度。威胁不是一个人。尺度、实体，以及无法装进一张脸的知识，才是光学问题。"],"pi":["Cosmic horror framing of [Subject], scale wrong, geometry slightly illegal, under-lit face or a brightness that reveals too much, human irrelevance, extreme long shot or a corridor that does not vanish correctly. Do not prompt a gloved killer.","[主体] 的宇宙恐怖式构图：尺度不对劲，几何关系略微不合常理，脸欠曝，或者亮得揭示了太多，人的无关紧要，用极远景，或者一条消失点不对的走廊。不要写成戴手套的杀手。"],"cp":["Cosmic horror framing of [Subject], scale wrong, geometry slightly illegal, a brightness that reveals too much, human irrelevance.","[主体] 的宇宙恐怖式构图，尺度不对劲，几何略微不合常理，一种揭示得太多的亮，人的无关紧要。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cosmic-horror-look/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Extreme Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-long-shot.webp","Scale is the emotion."],["Underlighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/under-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/under-light.webp","The source is fire, a screen on the floor, or a monster."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"宇宙恐怖"},"documentary-look":{"t":"Documentary","c":"genre-looks","g":"Fictional documentary","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/documentary-look","d":["Documentary cinematography mixes observational coverage with interview and archive rhetoric: unstyled wardrobe light, mixed color temperatures, a zoom finding focus, and respect without a glamour rim. Fictional films may borrow the same grammar as mockumentary. That is still documentary rhetoric, not a recovered camcorder tape.","纪录片摄影把观察式分镜覆盖与采访和档案修辞混合在一起：未做造型的服装光、混合色温、变焦寻找焦点，以及不带魅力轮廓光的尊重。虚构影片可能借用同样的语法来拍伪纪录片。那仍然是纪录片修辞，而不是一盘找回的便携摄像机磁带。"],"pi":["Documentary look on [Subject], mixed color, unstyled wardrobe light, zoom finding focus, interview or observational coverage, respect without glamour. Name whether this is a sit-down or a follow. Do not add a timestamp or a rim.","[主体] 的纪录片质感：色彩来源混杂，服装与光线都不加修饰，变焦边找焦点，采访或观察式跟拍，尊重而不美化。写明这是坐下访谈还是跟随拍摄。不要加时间码字幕，也不要加轮廓光。"],"cp":["Create a short mockumentary about a municipal committee preparing the world’s smallest parade. Intercut confident seated interviews with observational footage of tiny practical setbacks. Keep interview framing consistent, interviewer mostly offscreen and comedy grounded in sincere behavior rather than broad reaction faces.","做一支短伪纪录片：一个市政委员会正在筹备世界上最小的游行。把自信的坐姿采访与观察式的现场素材交叉剪辑，现场里全是微不足道的现实阻碍。采访构图保持一致，采访者基本在画外，笑点来自真诚的行为，而不是夸张的反应脸。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/168-mockumentary-construction-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/documentary-look-168-mockumentary-construction-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/documentary-look.jpg","r":[["Cinéma Vérité","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/cinema-verite","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cinema-verite.webp","Style would be propaganda."],["Available Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/available-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/available-light.webp","Commit to the hour you have."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"纪录片风格"},"dreamcore":{"t":"Dreamcore","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/dreamcore","d":["The dreamcore aesthetic is a soft, liminal interior look: empty rooms, pools, and suburban halls lit by childhood practicals gone slightly wrong, with low contrast and unresolved space. Nostalgia is present. Safety is not.","梦核美学是一种柔和、阈限的室内外观：空房间、泳池和郊区走廊，由略有出错的童年实景光源照亮，低对比度，空间悬而未决。怀旧在场。安全感不在。"],"pi":["Dreamcore image of [Subject], liminal rooms, soft fluorescent or blown window, childhood lighting gone wrong, low contrast, a memory that will not resolve. Name the empty hall or pool. Do not add JPEG captions or psychedelic smear.","[主体]的梦核图像，阈限房间，柔和荧光或过曝窗户，童年照明出了错，低对比度，一段无法解开的记忆。指定空荡走廊或泳池。不要添加 JPEG 字幕或迷幻涂抹。"],"cp":["Dreamcore image of [Subject], liminal rooms, soft dread, childhood lighting gone wrong, a memory that will not resolve.","[主体]的梦核图像，阈限房间，柔和的恐惧，童年照明出了错，一段无法解开的记忆。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/dreamcore/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Weirdcore","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/weirdcore","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/weirdcore.webp","The familiar is incorrectly rendered."],["Altered State","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/altered-state","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/altered-state-altered-state-mini.webp","The mind is the location."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"梦核"},"dystopian":{"t":"Dystopian","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/dystopian","d":["Dystopian cinematography makes the civic system the antagonist: used architecture, haze, rank, and signage at a scale that already feels worn. The future is not shiny. It is bureaucratic, polluted, or monumental and cold, often in daylight as well as night.","反乌托邦摄影把公共系统变成反派：使用过的建筑、雾霾、等级和标识，以已经显得破旧的尺度呈现。未来并不光鲜。它是官僚的、被污染的，或纪念碑式而冰冷的，常常既在白天也在夜晚。"],"pi":["Dystopian view of [Subject], civic scale gone cold, haze, signage, and rank, used surfaces, a future that already feels worn. Name the checkpoint, queue, or tower. Do not add a clean heroic rim or a detective fedora unless the story has one.","[主体]的反乌托邦景象，公共尺度变得冰冷，雾霾、标识与等级，使用过的表面，一个已经显得破旧的未来。指定检查站、队列或高塔。不要添加干净的英雄轮廓光或侦探软呢帽，除非故事里本来就有。"],"cp":["Dystopian view of [Subject], civic scale gone cold, haze, signage, and rank, a future that already feels used.","[主体]的反乌托邦景象，公共尺度变得冰冷，雾霾、标识与等级，一个已经显得被使用过的未来。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/dystopian/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Tech Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/tech-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tech-noir.webp","The future is wet and guilty."],["Bleach Bypass","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/bleach-bypass","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bleach-bypass-072-bleach-bypass-style-contrast-mini.webp","War, crime, or a world without mercy."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"反乌托邦"},"film-noir":{"t":"Film Noir","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","d":["Film noir lighting is a low-key, high-contrast setup: a hard key, often cut by a venetian gobo or a streetlamp cookie, leaves one cheek in true black while wet pavement returns silver. The camera sits at eye height on a 35mm or 50mm spherical lens, tungsten practicals as motivated sources, and blocking that isolates a figure in a doorway, an alley, or a pool of light.","黑色电影照明是一种低调、高反差的布光：硬主光常被百叶窗遮光图案或路灯遮光片切割，让一侧脸颊留在纯黑中，而湿路面泛回银色。摄影机以眼平高度架在 35mm 或 50mm 球面镜头上，钨丝实景光源作为有动机的光源，调度把人物孤立在门口、小巷或一片光池中。"],"pi":["Lead with the treatment, then lock physics. Film-noir treatment of [Subject], hard venetian gobos, unfilled far cheek, wet-down street bounce, 50mm spherical, 1940s crime blocking. Name who stands where and which practical is the motivated key. Do not replace the gobo, the ratio, and the wet pavement with mood adjectives.","先写处理手法，再锁定物理逻辑。[主体] 的黑色电影处理：硬朗的百叶窗遮光图案，远侧脸颊不补光，打湿街道的反光，50mm 球面镜头，1940 年代犯罪片的调度。写明谁站在哪里，以及哪盏实景灯是有动机的主光。不要用情绪形容词代替遮光图案、光比和湿路面。"],"cp":["Film-noir treatment of [Subject], hard venetian gobos, wet streets, fedora shadows, moral night, 1940s crime grammar.","[主体] 的黑色电影处理，硬朗的百叶窗光影，湿漉漉的街道，礼帽的影子，道德的黑夜，1940 年代犯罪片的语法。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/film-noir/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["Gobo Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/gobo-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/gobo-lighting.webp","The room writes on the person."],["Wet-Down","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/wet-down","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/wet-down.webp","Night exteriors that must sparkle."]],"z":"黑色电影"},"found-footage-look":{"t":"Found Footage","c":"genre-looks","g":"Recovered recording","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/found-footage-look","d":["The found footage look presents images as a recording made by someone inside the events, often later discovered or assembled, so the camera is a story object with a timestamp, a battery, and a reason to keep rolling. Consumer digital, Hi8, or MiniDV optics, autofocus hunt, and amateur framing are constraints, not decoration.","拾得录像外观把影像呈现为事件内部某人拍下的记录，通常在后来被发现或拼装，因此摄影机是一个故事物件，带有时间戳、电池和继续拍摄的理由。消费级数码、Hi8 或 MiniDV 光学、自动对焦搜索和业余构图是限制条件，不是装饰。"],"pi":["Found-footage camera on [Subject], consumer digital or Hi8, timestamp, autofocus hunt, amateur framing, operator-height, documentary panic. Name who holds the camera and why it stays on. Do not add a second, prettier angle.","拾得录像摄影机对准[主体]，消费级数码或 Hi8，时间戳，自动对焦搜索，业余构图，持机者视高，纪录片式恐慌。指定谁拿着摄影机以及它为什么一直开着。不要添加第二个更漂亮的机位。"],"cp":["A volunteer records the final inventory of a closing observatory on a handheld camcorder. Every shot must have a plausible recording reason. When an unexplained door opens, the operator first documents the room number, then hesitates before following. Maintain limited battery, imperfect framing and consistent microphone perspective.","一名志愿者用手持便携摄像机记录一座即将关闭的天文台的最终清点。每个镜头都必须有合理的录制理由。当一扇无法解释的门打开时，操作者先记录房间号，然后犹豫片刻才跟进去。保持有限电量、不完美构图和一致的麦克风视角。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/167-found-footage-framing-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/found-footage-look-167-found-footage-framing-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/found-footage-look.jpg","r":[["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Night Vision","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/night-vision","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/night-vision.webp","Someone is hunting in the dark."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"伪纪录片"},"french-new-wave":{"t":"French New Wave","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/french-new-wave","d":["French New Wave cinematography shoots fiction on locations with street light, handheld 16mm or 35mm, and an edit that will jump-cut rather than cover. The frame jumps into walking life: cafes, sidewalks, apartments with mixed practicals, and a camera that admits it is a camera.","法国新浪潮摄影在实景中拍摄虚构故事，用街灯、手持 16mm 或 35mm，以及一种会跳切而不是做分镜覆盖的剪辑。画面跃入行走的生活：咖啡馆、人行道、带混合实景光源的公寓，以及一台承认自己就是摄影机的摄影机。"],"pi":["French New Wave energy on [Subject], location street light, handheld 35mm, jump cuts implied, jump-into-life framing, mixed cafe practicals. Name the sidewalk or apartment. Do not add a rim, a timestamp, or studio flags.","[主体]的法国新浪潮能量，实景街灯，手持 35mm，暗示跳切，跃入生活的构图，混合咖啡馆实景光源。指定人行道或公寓。不要添加轮廓光、时间戳或摄影棚旗板。"],"cp":["French New Wave energy on [Subject], jump cuts implied, street light, jump-into-life framing, handheld Paris oxygen.","[主体]的法国新浪潮能量，暗示跳切，街灯，跃入生活的构图，手持的巴黎氧气。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/french-new-wave/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."],["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"法国新浪潮"},"german-expressionism":{"t":"German Expressionism","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/german-expressionism","d":["German Expressionism cinematography treats the set as a mind: forced-perspective corridors, painted shadows, and jagged hard light replace natural architecture. The camera is often locked and slightly dutch, so the actor walks a geometry that already looks illegal.","德国表现主义摄影把布景当作心灵：强制透视走廊、画出来的阴影和锯齿状硬光取代自然建筑。摄影机常常固定并轻微倾斜，于是演员行走在一个已经看起来违规的几何结构中。"],"pi":["German expressionist treatment of [Subject], painted shadows, impossible architecture, jagged hard light, dutch horizon, theatrical blocking. Name which wall or stair is illegally angled. Do not ask for a normal street with a moody grade.","[主体]的德国表现主义处理，画出来的阴影，不可能的架构，锯齿状硬光，倾斜地平线，戏剧化调度。指定哪面墙或哪段楼梯以违规角度倾斜。不要要求一条普通街道配上情绪化调色。"],"cp":["German expressionist treatment of [Subject], painted shadows, impossible architecture, jagged light, Caligari psychology as set.","[主体]的德国表现主义处理，画出来的阴影，不可能的架构，锯齿状光，把卡里加里式心理当作布景。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/german-expressionism/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dutch Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/dutch-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-angle-161-dutch-angle-mini.webp","The world is off its axis. Do not use as decoration."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"德国表现主义"},"giallo-look":{"t":"Giallo","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/giallo-look","d":["Giallo cinematography is Italian thriller grammar: hyper-saturated primaries from gelled windows and glass, fashion interiors, and a camera that often zooms rather than dollies toward threat. Beauty lighting sits on the victim. The violence is styled, not silver.","铅黄电影摄影是意大利惊悚片语法：来自贴色片的窗户和玻璃的超饱和原色，时尚感室内，以及一台常常变焦而不是推轨逼近威胁的摄影机。美人光落在受害者身上。暴力是风格化的，不是银色。"],"pi":["Giallo look on [Subject], hyper-saturated primaries, gelled window key, black leather implied in the foreground, 35mm zoom threat, Argento color crime. Name the red, green, or cobalt source. Do not prompt a black-and-white alley.","[主体] 的铅黄（Giallo）风格，高饱和的三原色，带色纸的窗光作主光，前景暗示黑色皮手套，35mm 变焦的威胁感，阿基多式的彩色犯罪。写明红、绿或钴蓝的光源。不要写成黑白小巷。"],"cp":["Giallo look on [Subject], hyper-saturated primaries, black leather gloves implied, Argento color crime, beauty as threat.","[主体] 的铅黄（Giallo）风格，高饱和的三原色，暗示黑色皮手套，阿基多式的彩色犯罪，美本身成为威胁。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/giallo-look/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Hyper-Saturation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/hyper-saturation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hyper-saturation.webp","Feeling is louder than fact."],["Dutch Angle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/dutch-angle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dutch-angle-161-dutch-angle-mini.webp","The world is off its axis. Do not use as decoration."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"铅黄电影"},"magical-realism":{"t":"Magical Realism","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/magical-realism","d":["Magical realism cinematography treats an extraordinary event as ordinary inside a recognizable world: the same window light, the same 35mm coverage, with one impossible fact staged as if it were weather. The camera does not gawk, add a rim, or warp the lens.","魔幻现实主义摄影在可辨认的世界里把非凡事件当作普通事件：同样的窗户光，同样的 35mm 分镜覆盖，把一个不可能的事实调度得像天气一样。摄影机不瞪大眼睛、不添加轮廓光，也不扭曲镜头。"],"pi":["Magical-realist image of [Subject], ordinary window or overcast light, 35mm eye level, one impossible fact treated as weather, no extra rim, no dutch. Name the ordinary room and the single impossibility. Do not add spectacle shafts.","[主体]的魔幻现实主义图像，普通窗户光或阴天光，35mm 眼平高度，把一个不可能的事实当作天气来处理，不要额外轮廓光，不要倾斜。指定普通房间和那一个不可能之处。不要添加奇观光束。"],"cp":["Magical-realist image of [Subject], ordinary light, one impossible fact treated as weather.","[主体]的魔幻现实主义图像，普通光，把一个不可能的事实当作天气来处理。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/magical-realism/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dreamcore","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/dreamcore","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dreamcore.webp","Nostalgia with the safety removed."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."],["Neo-Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/neo-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neo-noir.webp","Noir after color was invented."]],"z":"魔幻现实主义"},"maximalism":{"t":"Maximalism","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/maximalism","d":["Maximalist cinematography uses density as the point: too much color, too much pattern, ornament in every zone, and lighting that keeps the clutter readable rather than hiding it. Restraint would be a lie, so the frame is packed on purpose.","极繁主义摄影把密度当作重点：太多颜色，太多图案，每个区域都有装饰，照明让杂乱保持可读，而不是把它藏起来。克制会是谎言，所以画面是故意塞满的。"],"pi":["Maximalist frame of [Subject], too much color, too much pattern, multiple practicals, density as the point, 24mm to 40mm so the clutter stays readable. Name the wallpaper and the costume clash. Do not empty the room.","[主体]的极繁主义画面，太多颜色，太多图案，多个实景光源，密度就是重点，24mm 到 40mm，让杂乱保持可读。指定墙纸和服装冲突。不要把房间清空。"],"cp":["Maximalist frame of [Subject], too much color, too much pattern, density as the point.","[主体]的极繁主义画面，太多颜色，太多图案，密度就是重点。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/maximalism/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Giallo","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/giallo-look","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/giallo-look.webp","Horror that is also fashion."],["Hyper-Saturation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/hyper-saturation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hyper-saturation.webp","Feeling is louder than fact."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"极繁主义"},"neo-noir":{"t":"Neo-Noir","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/neo-noir","d":["Neo-noir cinematography keeps noir's hard keys and isolated blocking but replaces silver night with color: sodium vapor, neon practicals, and tungsten that stain rain and skin. The camera still hunts faces in shadow, yet the palette is contemporary, often cyan signage against warm flesh, not black-and-white contrast alone.","新黑色电影摄影保留黑色电影的硬主光和孤立调度，但用色彩取代银色夜晚：钠灯、霓虹实景光源，以及把雨和皮肤染色的钨丝灯。摄影机仍在阴影中搜寻面孔，但调色板是当代的，常常是青色招牌映着温暖肌肤，而不只是黑白对比。"],"pi":["Neo-noir look on [Subject], color where classic noir was silver, neon practicals, rain, contemporary crime blocking, hard key, unfilled far cheek. Name the hue of the signage and whether the camera is locked or tracking. Do not write only teal and orange.","[主体] 的新黑色电影风格：经典黑色电影是银灰，这里用彩色；霓虹实景光，雨，当代犯罪片的调度，硬主光，远侧脸颊不补光。写明招牌的色相，以及摄影机是锁定还是跟移。不要只写青橙。"],"cp":["Neo-noir look on [Subject], color where classic noir was silver, neon practicals, rain, contemporary crime melancholy.","[主体] 的新黑色电影风格：经典黑色电影是银灰，这里用彩色；霓虹实景光，雨，当代犯罪片的忧郁。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/neo-noir/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."],["Neon Practicals","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neon-practical.webp","The city is the lighting department."],["Teal and Orange","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/teal-orange","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/teal-orange.webp","You want contemporary studio punch. Use with taste."]],"z":"新黑色电影"},"photography":{"t":"Photography","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/photography","d":["Photographic cinematography treats the movie as a print: a single decisive frame, posed or found light, often Centered Composition or Tableau blocking, with the camera pretending it could hang on a wall. Motion is allowed, but the still is the law.","照片式摄影把电影当作一张照片：单一决定性画面，摆拍光或发现光，常常是中央构图或群像调度，摄影机假装画面能挂在墙上。允许运动，但静帧是法则。"],"pi":["Still-photography grammar on [Subject], a single decisive frame, posed or window light, tripod, the movie pretending to be a print. Name the print logic (candle tableau, river still, posed portrait). Do not add a hunting zoom or a rim that only exists for motion.","静态摄影语法用于[主体]，单一决定性画面，摆拍光或窗光，三脚架，电影假装成一张照片。点明照片逻辑（烛光群像、河流静帧、摆拍肖像）。不要添加搜寻式变焦，也不要添加只为运动而存在的轮廓光。"],"cp":["Still-photography grammar on [Subject], a single decisive frame, posed light, the movie pretending to be a print.","静态摄影语法用于[主体]，单一决定性画面，摆拍光，电影假装成一张照片。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/photography/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Tableau","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/tableau","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tableau.webp","Hold the arrangement."],["Centered Composition","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/centered-composition","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/centered-composition-038-tableau-staging-mini.webp","Control, ritual, comedy, or fate."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"照片质感"},"pixel-art":{"t":"Pixel Art","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/pixel-art","d":["Pixel art builds the image from visible tiles or a low-resolution grid. The world is discrete squares, not continuous grain.","像素艺术用可见图块或低分辨率网格构建画面。世界是离散方块，不是连续颗粒。"],"pi":["Lead with who does what. Camera, light, and style follow. Do not replace physics with mood adjectives. Still clause: Pixel-art treatment of the subject, chunky samples, limited palette, game-sprite cinema. At most one motivated camera move per clip. The last frame is law for the next shot.","先写谁做什么。摄影机、光线和风格随后。不要用情绪形容词替代物理。静帧句：对主体的像素艺术处理，粗糙采样，有限色板，游戏精灵电影。每个片段最多一个有动机的摄影机运动。最后一帧是下一个镜头的法则。"],"cp":["Pixel-art treatment of [Subject], chunky samples, limited palette, game-sprite cinema.","对[主体]的像素艺术处理，粗糙采样，有限色板，游戏精灵电影。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/pixel-art/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Video Game","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/video-game","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/video-game-video-game-mini.webp","The world is playable."],["Animation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/animation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/animation.webp","The world is constructed, not captured."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"像素艺术"},"southern-gothic":{"t":"Southern Gothic","c":"genre-looks","g":"Southern Gothic cinema","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/southern-gothic","d":["Southern gothic cinematography uses the American South as a humid optical problem: late-afternoon gold gone sickly, Spanish-moss Dappled Light , porch tungsten, and Atmospheric Haze that keeps heat in the air. Decay is on the walls. The threat is family, history, and something under the porch, not a city streetlamp.","南方哥特摄影把美国南方当作潮湿的光学难题：午后金色变得病态，西班牙苔藓斑驳光，门廊钨丝灯，以及把热气留在空气中的大气雾霭。腐坏在墙上。威胁是家庭、历史，以及门廊下的某种东西，而不是城市路灯。"],"pi":["Southern gothic air around [Subject], humid decay, Spanish moss dappled sun, late-afternoon gold gone sickly, porch tungsten, peeling paint. Name the heat and the house. Do not prompt a dry noir alley or a cosmic void.","[主体]周围的南方哥特氛围，潮湿的腐坏，西班牙苔藓斑驳阳光，午后金色变得病态，门廊钨丝灯，剥落油漆。点明热度和房子。不要提示干燥的黑色电影小巷或宇宙虚空。"],"cp":["Southern gothic air around [Subject], humid decay, moss, late-afternoon gold gone sickly, beauty rotting.","[主体]周围的南方哥特氛围，潮湿的腐坏，苔藓，午后金色变得病态，美正在腐烂。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/southern-gothic/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dappled Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/dappled-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dappled-light.webp","Nature or blinds as gobo."],["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"南方哥特"},"spaghetti-western":{"t":"Spaghetti Western","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/spaghetti-western","d":["Spaghetti western cinematography restages western iconography on Techniscope 2.35: dusty ochre landscapes, hard sun as the only key, and cuts from a 24mm plaza wide to a telephoto extreme close-up of eyes. Moral ambiguity sits in the hold on a face before anyone draws.","意大利西部片摄影在 Techniscope 2.35 上重演西部图像志：尘土赭色风景，硬太阳作为唯一主光，并从24mm广场远景切到长焦眼睛大特写。道德暧昧存在于拔枪前停留在脸上的凝视中。"],"pi":["35, dusty ochre, hard noon sun, no fill, extreme close-up of eyes cut against a 24mm ridge. Name the dust and the holster height. Do not prompt a clean golden-hour poster western.","35，尘土赭色，正午硬太阳，无辅光，眼睛的大特写与24mm山脊对切。点明尘土和枪套高度。不要提示干净黄金时刻海报式西部片。"],"cp":["Spaghetti-western frame of [Subject], Techniscope grit, dusty ochre, extreme close-ups of eyes, sun as a weapon.","[主体]的意大利西部片画面，Techniscope 颗粒感，尘土赭色，眼睛大特写，太阳作为武器。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/spaghetti-western/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Cowboy Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/cowboy-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cowboy-shot.webp","Show hands, weapons, or stance without going full body."],["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."]],"z":"意大利西部片"},"stylistic-suck":{"t":"Stylistic Suck","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/stylistic-suck","d":["Stylistic suck is deliberate amateur cinematography: hunting zooms, cheap video, and the wrong white balance as a choice of the film's own camera, not necessarily of a character's recovered tape. Polish would be dishonest, so the image is ugly on purpose.","风格化拙劣是刻意的业余摄影：搜寻式变焦、廉价视频，以及把错误白平衡当作影片自身摄影机的选择，而不一定是角色寻回录像带的选择。精致打磨会不诚实，所以画面故意难看。"],"pi":["Deliberate amateur look on [Subject], hunting zoom, cheap video, wrong white balance as a choice, blown practicals, bad centering. Do not add a timestamp unless there is also a diegetic camera. Do not correct the color.","对[主体]刻意业余观感，搜寻式变焦，廉价视频，把错误白平衡当作选择，过曝实景光源，糟糕居中。除非同时有叙事内摄影机，否则不要添加时间戳。不要校正色彩。"],"cp":["Deliberate amateur look on [Subject], bad zoom, cheap video, the wrong white balance as a choice.","对[主体]刻意业余观感，糟糕变焦，廉价视频，把错误白平衡当作选择。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/stylistic-suck-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stylistic-suck-stylistic-suck-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/stylistic-suck.jpg","r":[["Found Footage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/found-footage-look","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/found-footage-look-167-found-footage-framing-mini.webp","The operator is in danger too."],["Cinéma Vérité","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/cinema-verite","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cinema-verite.webp","Style would be propaganda."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"刻意粗糙"},"tech-noir":{"t":"Tech Noir","c":"genre-looks","g":"future noir","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/tech-noir","d":["Tech noir (also called future noir or cyber-noir) fuses noir's hard keys, rain, and guilty blocking with science-fiction production design: screens, LEDs, and corporate towers as practical sources. Analog crime grammar sits inside a digital city.","技术黑色电影（也称未来黑色电影或赛博黑色电影）把黑色电影的硬主光、雨和负罪调度与科幻制作设计融合：屏幕、LED和企业大楼作为实景光源。模拟犯罪语法位于数字城市之中。"],"pi":["Tech-noir on [Subject], future crime, screens as practicals, rain, corporate night, hard unfilled key, analog noir in a digital city. Name the display that lights the face. Do not prompt a present-day alley with no speculative design.","对[主体]的技术黑色电影，未来犯罪，屏幕作为实景光源，雨，企业夜晚，硬质无辅光主光，数字城市里的模拟黑色电影。点明照亮脸部的显示屏。不要提示没有推测性设计的当代小巷。"],"cp":["Tech-noir on [Subject], future crime, screens as practicals, rain, corporate night, analog noir in a digital city.","对[主体]的技术黑色电影，未来犯罪，屏幕作为实景光源，雨，企业夜晚，数字城市里的模拟黑色电影。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/tech-noir/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Neo-Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/neo-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neo-noir.webp","Noir after color was invented."],["Neon Practicals","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neon-practical.webp","The city is the lighting department."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"科技黑色电影"},"vaporwave-look":{"t":"Vaporwave","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/vaporwave-look","d":["The vaporwave aesthetic is a pastel, low-contrast look: pink-cyan gradients, marble and palms, mall fluorescents, and VHS chroma bleed, as if a 1980s future never shipped. The camera is often centered and still. There is no crime geometry unless you add it.","蒸汽波美学是一种柔和、低对比的观感：粉青渐变、大理石和棕榈、商场荧光灯，以及VHS色度溢色，仿佛1980年代的未来从未发货。摄影机常常居中且静止。除非你添加，否则没有犯罪几何。"],"pi":["Vaporwave treatment of [Subject], pink-cyan gradient, marble and palms, VHS bleed, centered 35mm, mall fluorescent fill, no hard unfilled cheek. Name the bust or the grid. Do not prompt a wet detective alley.","对[主体]的蒸汽波处理，粉青渐变，大理石和棕榈，VHS溢色，居中35mm，商场荧光辅光，没有硬质无辅光打脸颊。点明半身像或网格。不要提示潮湿的侦探小巷。"],"cp":["Vaporwave treatment of [Subject], pink-cyan gradient, marble and palms, VHS bleed, mall-at-closing melancholy.","对[主体]的蒸汽波处理，粉青渐变，大理石和棕榈，VHS溢色，商场打烊时的忧郁。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/vaporwave-look/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Cross Process","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cross-process","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-process.webp","Wrong chemistry on purpose."],["Neon Practicals","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neon-practical.webp","The city is the lighting department."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"蒸汽波"},"video-game":{"t":"Video Game","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/video-game","d":["Video game cinematography uses playable camera logic: a follow cam, an isometric view, or an FPS eyeline, with space readable as a level and a HUD implied. Collision, boom height, and pathing constrain the lens the way a game engine would.","电子游戏摄影使用可玩的摄影机逻辑：跟随摄影机、等距视图或FPS视线，空间可读为关卡，并隐含HUD。碰撞、吊臂高度和寻路像游戏引擎那样约束镜头。"],"pi":["Video-game camera on [Subject], follow cam or isometric logic, HUD implied, space as a level, boom height locked, path readable. Name the camera type. Do not describe a film dolly unless the game would dolly.","[主体]上的电子游戏摄影机，跟随摄影机或等距逻辑，HUD隐含，空间作为关卡，吊臂高度锁定，路径可读。点明摄影机类型。除非游戏会推轨，否则不要描述电影推轨。"],"cp":["Video-game camera on [Subject], follow cam or isometric logic, HUD implied, space as a level.","[主体]上的电子游戏摄影机，跟随摄影机或等距逻辑，HUD隐含，空间作为关卡。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/video-game-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/video-game-video-game-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/video-game.jpg","r":[["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."],["Pixel Art","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/pixel-art","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pixel-art.webp","The world is tiles."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"游戏视角"},"weirdcore":{"t":"Weirdcore","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/weirdcore","d":["The weirdcore aesthetic renders the familiar incorrectly: early-web compression, low-res sacred images, off-center crops, and a joke that is also a threat. The file looks like it should not have opened. Light is on-camera flash or a dim analog room, not a designed key.","怪核美学错误地渲染熟悉事物：早期网络压缩、低分辨率神圣图像、偏心裁切，以及一个同时也是威胁的笑话。文件看起来像本不该打开。光线是机顶闪光灯或昏暗的模拟房间，而不是设计好的主光。"],"pi":["Weirdcore image of [Subject], early-web dread, low-res sacred, wrong crop, JPEG artifacts, a joke that is also a threat. Name the caption or the chopped face. Do not polish, and do not soften into a liminal pool.","[主体]的怪核图像，早期网络恐惧，低分辨率神圣，错误裁切，JPEG伪影，一个同时也是威胁的笑话。点明配文或被切掉的脸。不要打磨，也不要柔化成阈限水池。"],"cp":["Weirdcore image of [Subject], early-web dread, low-res sacred, a joke that is also a threat.","[主体]的怪核图像，早期网络恐惧，低分辨率神圣，一个同时也是威胁的笑话。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/weirdcore/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Dreamcore","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/dreamcore","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dreamcore.webp","Nostalgia with the safety removed."],["Altered State","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/altered-state","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/altered-state-altered-state-mini.webp","The mind is the location."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"怪核"},"wuxia-look":{"t":"Wuxia","c":"genre-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/wuxia-look","d":["Wuxia cinematography stages martial chivalry in landscape: misted bamboo or desert silk, long-shot geography, and wire-assisted paths that read as weightless rather than as street punching. Color is costume and fog, not a gelled murder window.","武侠摄影将侠义武打置于山水景中：雾中竹林或大漠丝绸、远景地理，以及借助威亚的空中路径，读起来是失重而非街头拳脚。色彩来自服装与雾气，而不是加色纸的谋杀窗光。"],"pi":["Wuxia look on [Subject], misted bamboo or silk banners, wire-fu weightlessness implied, long-shot landscape, designed costume color, crane or wide hold. Name the weather and the path through air. Do not prompt a dusty gunfight or a handheld alley brawl.","武侠风格呈现[主体]，雾中竹林或丝质幡旗，暗示威亚失重感，远景山水，设计过的服装色彩，摇臂或广角固定。写明天气和空中路径。不要提示尘土飞扬的枪战或手持小巷斗殴。"],"cp":["Wuxia look on [Subject], misted bamboo, wire-fu weightlessness implied, silk color, heroic wides, Crouching Tiger air.","武侠风格呈现[主体]，雾中竹林，暗示威亚失重感，丝绸色彩，英雄式宽画幅，《卧虎藏龙》般气息。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/wuxia-look/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Mist","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/mist","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mist.webp","Softer mystery than fog. Lyric, not monster."],["Long Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/long-shot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/long-shot.webp","Place a human in a world that could ignore them."],["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."]],"z":"武侠"},"24mm-wide":{"t":"24mm Wide","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/24mm-wide","d":["A 24mm wide in 24mm lens cinematography is a moderately wide prime that holds a person and a usable amount of place without extreme stretch. Body and architecture share the rectangle; neither fully wins.","24mm 广角在 24mm 镜头摄影中是一种中等广角定焦，能容纳一个人和可用的环境，而不会造成极端拉伸。身体与建筑共享画面矩形；两者都不完全占上风。"],"pi":["Lead with body in space, not with a mood. 24mm wide on [Subject], environmental portrait, body in space, moderate stretch, reportage coverage. Name what architecture must remain (door, street, kitchen). Do not ask for extreme distortion, oval bokeh, or a melted background.","从「身体在空间里的位置」写起，而不是从情绪写起。24mm 广角拍 [主体]，环境肖像，身体处于空间中，适度拉伸，报道式取景。写明哪些建筑元素必须保留（门、街道、厨房）。不要要求极端畸变、椭圆形散景或融化般的背景。"],"cp":["24mm wide on [Subject], environmental portrait, body in space, moderate stretch, reportage cinema.","24mm 广角拍 [主体]，环境肖像，身体置身空间之中，适度拉伸，报道式电影感。"],"hp":["24mm wide on [Subject], environmental portrait, body in space, moderate stretch, reportage coverage.","24mm 广角呈现[主体]，环境肖像，身体处于空间中，中等拉伸，纪实式分镜覆盖。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/055-close-wide-angle-distortion-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/24mm-wide-055-close-wide-angle-distortion-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/24mm-wide.jpg","r":[["35mm Moderate Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/35mm-moderate","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/35mm-moderate.webp","Most narrative coverage. Human but not telephoto."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."],["50mm Normal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/50mm-normal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/50mm-normal.webp","You do not want the glass to editorialize."]],"z":"24mm广角"},"35mm-moderate":{"t":"35mm Moderate Wide","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/35mm-moderate","d":["A 35mm moderate wide in 35mm cinematography is the common narrative wide-normal: natural perspective with a little more world than a 50mm. It is default coverage for scenes that need both face and room.","35mm 中广角在 35mm 摄影中是常见的叙事型广角标准镜头：自然透视，比 50mm 多出一点世界。它是需要同时容纳脸与房间的场景的默认分镜覆盖。"],"pi":["Name the storyteller length and the extra world. 35mm on [Subject], storyteller focal length, natural perspective with a little more world than 50. Add the room slice (kitchen, porch, car interior). Do not write bokeh wash or ultra-wide stretch.","点明叙事者焦距和多出来的世界。35mm 呈现[主体]，叙事者焦距，自然透视，比 50 多出一点世界。加入房间切片（厨房、门廊、车内）。不要写虚化泛滥或超广角拉伸。"],"cp":["35mm on [Subject], the classic storyteller focal length, natural perspective with a little more world than 50.","35mm 呈现[主体]，经典叙事者焦距，自然透视，比 50 多出一点世界。"],"hp":["35mm on [Subject], storyteller focal length, natural perspective with a little more world than 50.","35mm 呈现[主体]，叙事者焦距，自然透视，比 50 多出一点世界。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/35mm-moderate/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["50mm Normal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/50mm-normal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/50mm-normal.webp","You do not want the glass to editorialize."],["24mm Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/24mm-wide","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/24mm-wide-055-close-wide-angle-distortion-mini.webp","Person plus place, neither winning."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"35mm中广角"},"50mm-normal":{"t":"50mm Normal","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/50mm-normal","d":["A 50mm normal in 50mm cinematography is the conventional normal prime: from a typical stand it neither stretches near space nor stacks distant planes. The glass refuses to editorialize perspective; camera position still does all of that work.","50mm 标准镜头在 50mm 摄影中是常规标准定焦：从典型机位看，它既不拉伸近处空间，也不堆叠远处平面。镜片拒绝主观化透视；这一切仍然由摄影机位置完成。"],"pi":["Name the refusal to stretch or stack. 50mm normal lens on [Subject], human-scale perspective, neither compressed nor stretched, conversational truth. State camera distance (across a table, a few paces). Do not add oval bokeh, barrel distortion, or heat-haze compression.","点明拒绝拉伸或堆叠。50mm 标准镜头呈现[主体]，人际尺度透视，既不压缩也不拉伸，对话式真实。说明摄影机距离（隔着桌子、几步远）。不要加入椭圆形虚化、桶形畸变或热浪压缩。"],"cp":["50mm normal lens on [Subject], human-eye perspective, neither compressed nor stretched, conversational truth.","50mm 标准镜头呈现[主体]，人眼透视，既不压缩也不拉伸，对话式真实。"],"hp":["50mm normal lens on [Subject], human-scale perspective, neither compressed nor stretched, conversational truth.","50mm 标准镜头呈现[主体]，人际尺度透视，既不压缩也不拉伸，对话式真实。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/50mm-normal/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["35mm Moderate Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/35mm-moderate","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/35mm-moderate.webp","Most narrative coverage. Human but not telephoto."],["85mm Portrait","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/85mm-portrait","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/85mm-portrait.webp","A person is the landscape."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"50mm标准镜头"},"85mm-portrait":{"t":"85mm Portrait","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/85mm-portrait","d":["An 85mm portrait in 85mm cinematography is a short telephoto used from a farther stand so a head-and-shoulders stays large while the background enlarges and recedes in importance. The person becomes the landscape; the room becomes stacked color and shape behind them.","85mm 肖像在 85mm 摄影中是从更远机位使用的短望远镜头，让头肩景保持足够大，同时背景被放大并在重要性上后退。人物成为风景；房间变成他们身后的堆叠色彩与形状。"],"pi":["Name the farther stand and the isolation. 85mm portrait of [Subject], compressed background, rapid falloff, isolation, the face as the only country. Say head-and-shoulders, background as a soft plane, not a readable room. Do not write 24mm, and do not ask for environmental architecture in focus.","点明更远的机位与孤立感。85mm 肖像呈现[主体]，压缩背景，快速衰减，孤立感，脸是唯一的国度。说明头肩景，背景为柔焦平面，而不是可读的房间。不要写 24mm，也不要要求环境建筑清晰对焦。"],"cp":["85mm portrait of [Subject], compressed background, beautiful falloff, isolation, the face as the only country.","85mm 肖像呈现[主体]，压缩背景，漂亮的衰减，孤立感，脸是唯一的国度。"],"hp":["85mm portrait of [Subject], compressed background, rapid falloff, isolation, the face as the only country.","85mm 肖像呈现[主体]，压缩背景，快速衰减，孤立感，脸是唯一的国度。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/85mm-portrait/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["135mm Telephoto","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/135mm-telephoto","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/135mm-telephoto-056-telephoto-compression-mini.webp","Surveillance, sports, or stacked city."],["Shallow Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shallow-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shallow-focus-052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.webp","Nothing else is invited."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"85mm人像镜头"},"135mm-telephoto":{"t":"135mm Telephoto","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/135mm-telephoto","d":["A 135mm telephoto in 135mm cinematography is a long lens used from a distant stand so planes stack and the background crowds the figure. The image feels like eavesdropping: you are far away, yet the world presses in.","135mm 长焦在 135mm 摄影中是从远处机位使用的长镜头，使平面堆叠，背景逼近人物。画面像在偷听：你离得很远，世界却压了过来。"],"pi":["Name the distant stand and the crowded background. 135mm telephoto on [Subject], stacked planes, eavesdropping compression, background crowding the figure. Add across-the-street or parking-lot throw. Do not write 85mm portrait, and do not ask for wide environmental stretch.","写明「从远处拍」和「拥挤的背景」。135mm 长焦拍 [主体]，空间层次被压扁堆叠，像偷听一样的压缩感，背景向人物挤压。补上「隔着一条街」或「从停车场那么远」。不要写 85mm 人像，也不要要求广角式的环境拉伸。"],"cp":["135mm telephoto on [Subject], stacked planes, eavesdropping compression, background crowding the figure.","135mm 长焦拍 [主体]，层次堆叠，偷听式的压缩感，背景向人物挤压。"],"hp":["135mm telephoto on [Subject], stacked planes, eavesdropping compression, background crowding the figure.","135mm 长焦呈现[主体]，堆叠平面，偷听式压缩，背景逼近人物。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/056-telephoto-compression-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/135mm-telephoto-056-telephoto-compression-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/135mm-telephoto.jpg","r":[["200mm Long Telephoto","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/200mm-long","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/200mm-long.webp","Far away and still in their pores."],["85mm Portrait","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/85mm-portrait","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/85mm-portrait.webp","A person is the landscape."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"135mm长焦"},"200mm-long":{"t":"200mm Long Telephoto","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/200mm-long","d":["A 200mm long telephoto in 200mm cinematography is an extreme long lens used from a very distant stand so size differences between planes almost vanish. Heat shimmer, stacked terrain, and sniper intimacy are the physical leftovers of that throw.","200mm 长焦在 200mm 摄影中是从极远机位使用的极端长焦镜头，使平面之间的大小差异几乎消失。热浪闪烁、堆叠地形和狙击手式亲密，是那种投射留下的物理残余。"],"pi":["Name the extreme throw and the air. 200mm long lens on [Subject], extreme compression, heat shimmer, isolated from a distance, sniper intimacy. Say the camera is hundreds of feet away. Do not write portrait 85mm, and do not ask for a wide establishing field.","点明极端投射和空气感。200mm 长焦镜头呈现[主体]，极端压缩，热浪闪烁，从远处孤立，狙击手式亲密。说明摄影机在数百英尺之外。不要写 85mm 肖像，也不要要求广角定场视野。"],"cp":["200mm long lens on [Subject], extreme compression, heat shimmer, isolated from a distance, sniper intimacy.","200mm 长焦镜头呈现[主体]，极端压缩，热浪闪烁，从远处孤立，狙击手式亲密。"],"hp":["200mm long lens on [Subject], extreme compression, heat shimmer, isolated from a distance, sniper intimacy.","200mm 长焦镜头呈现[主体]，极端压缩，热浪闪烁，从远处孤立，狙击手式亲密。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/200mm-long/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["135mm Telephoto","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/135mm-telephoto","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/135mm-telephoto-056-telephoto-compression-mini.webp","Surveillance, sports, or stacked city."],["Telephoto Compression","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/compression","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/compression.webp","The city or army is right on their back."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"200mm超长焦"},"anamorphic":{"t":"Anamorphic","c":"lenses","g":"Oval bokeh","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/anamorphic","d":["Anamorphic cinematography squeezes one image dimension during capture, usually horizontally by 2x, then expands it for presentation. Depending on the lens, that cylindrical squeeze can produce oval bokeh, directional flares, and distinctive edge behavior; a wide aspect ratio alone is not anamorphic photography.","变形宽银幕摄影在拍摄时挤压画面的一个维度，通常是水平方向 2x，然后在呈现时展开。取决于镜头，这种圆柱形挤压可以产生椭圆形虚化、定向眩光和独特的边缘表现；单是宽画幅并不等于变形宽银幕摄影。"],"pi":["Name the squeeze and the artifacts you actually want. Anamorphic 2x on [Subject], oval bokeh, horizontal flares, widescreen squeeze character. 39:1 if the delivery is widescreen. Do not write letterbox on a spherical lens, and do not add random blue streaks without oval bokeh and correct geometry.","点明挤压和你真正想要的伪影。变形宽银幕 2x 呈现[主体]，椭圆形虚化，水平眩光，宽银幕挤压特性。若交付为宽银幕则 39:1。不要在球面镜头上写遮幅黑边，也不要在没有椭圆形虚化和正确几何时加入随机蓝色光条。"],"cp":["Night exterior of a woman beneath station lights, widescreen anamorphic-style optics, subtle oval defocused highlights and restrained horizontal flare from one practical light. Natural face width, coherent architecture, no excessive streaks and no letterbox bars baked into the image.","夜晚外景，一名女子在车站灯光下，宽银幕变形风格光学，来自一个实景光源的细微椭圆形失焦高光与克制的水平眩光。自然的面部宽度，建筑结构连贯，没有过度光条，也没有内嵌在画面中的遮幅黑边。"],"hp":["Anamorphic 2x on [Subject], oval bokeh, horizontal flares, widescreen squeeze character.","变形宽银幕 2x 呈现[主体]，椭圆形虚化，水平眩光，宽银幕挤压特性。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/057-anamorphic-optical-character-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-057-anamorphic-optical-character-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/anamorphic.jpg","r":[["Anamorphic Flare","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/anamorphic-flare","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-flare.webp","Night lights and headlights should write on the lens."],["Spherical","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/spherical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/spherical.webp","Control and sharpness over romance."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"变形宽银幕镜头"},"compression":{"t":"Telephoto Compression","c":"lenses","g":"Distant viewpoint","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/compression","d":["Telephoto compression in lens compression cinematography is the perspective effect of a distant viewpoint: size differences between separated depth planes shrink, so a crowd or a city appears to press against a person. A long lens then frames that distant view tightly; a long lens from a close stand does not create the effect.","镜头压缩摄影中的长焦压缩是远距离视点带来的透视效应：分离的纵深平面之间大小差异缩小，因此人群或城市看起来压向一个人。长焦镜头随后把那个远距离视图框得紧凑；从近处机位使用长焦镜头不会产生这种效果。"],"pi":["Name the collapsed distances, not only the lens. Telephoto compression stacking [Subject] against a wall of background, distances collapsed, crowded air, no escape in depth. State a far camera. Do not write 14mm, and do not crop a close-stand wide and call it compression.","写明被压扁的距离，而不只是镜头。长焦压缩把 [主体] 压在一面背景墙上，距离被压缩，空气拥挤，纵深上无处可逃。写明摄影机在很远处。不要写 14mm，也不要用广角近拍再冒充压缩。"],"cp":["From far away with a long lens, frame one cyclist approaching along a straight road. Successive streetlights appear densely stacked behind him and his approach seems slow despite steady pedaling. Heat shimmer, fixed camera, no wide-angle expansion or zoom.","用长焦从很远处取景：一名骑车人沿着笔直的道路驶来。一排路灯在他身后被密集地叠在一起，尽管他一直在蹬，靠近的速度看起来却很慢。地面有热浪扰动，摄影机固定，不要广角的扩张感，也不要变焦。"],"hp":["Telephoto compression stacking [Subject] against a wall of background, distances collapsed, crowded air, no escape in depth.","长焦压缩将[主体]堆叠在一堵背景墙前，距离坍缩，空气拥挤，纵深中无处可逃。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/compression/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["200mm Long Telephoto","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/200mm-long","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/200mm-long.webp","Far away and still in their pores."],["135mm Telephoto","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/135mm-telephoto","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/135mm-telephoto-056-telephoto-compression-mini.webp","Surveillance, sports, or stacked city."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"长焦压缩"},"fisheye":{"t":"Fisheye","c":"lenses","g":"Curvilinear ultra-wide view","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/fisheye","d":["A fisheye in fisheye cinematography is a very wide curvilinear projection that bends straight lines, especially away from the center. The world wraps around the lens; architecture becomes a bowl rather than a rectilinear box.","鱼眼在鱼眼摄影中是一种非常广的曲线投影，会弯曲直线，尤其在远离中心处。世界环绕镜头；建筑变成一个碗，而不是直线校正的盒子。"],"pi":["Name the projection. Fisheye on [Subject], circular or extreme barrel distortion, a world wrapping around a face, subjective unreality. Say whether the image is a circle or fills the frame, and keep the face near center unless stretch is the point. Do not write 14mm rectilinear, and do not ask for random wobble.","点明投影方式。鱼眼呈现[主体]，圆形或极端桶形畸变，世界环绕一张脸，主观非现实。说明画面是圆形还是充满画幅，并让脸靠近中心，除非拉伸才是重点。不要写 14mm 直线校正镜头，也不要要求随机晃动。"],"cp":["A palace official stands small at the center of an enormous ornate chamber, filmed with a frame-filling fisheye look. Walls bow smoothly toward the edges, ceiling and floor remain structurally coherent. Slow restrained action, locked camera, no circular black border.","一名宫廷官员小小地站在巨大华丽厅堂的中心，以充满画幅的鱼眼效果拍摄。墙壁向边缘平滑弯曲，天花板与地板保持结构连贯。缓慢克制的动作，固定摄影机，没有圆形黑边。"],"hp":["Fisheye on [Subject], circular or extreme barrel distortion, a world wrapping around a face, subjective unreality.","鱼眼呈现[主体]，圆形或极端桶形畸变，世界环绕一张脸，主观非现实。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/059-fisheye-space-distortion-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fisheye-059-fisheye-space-distortion-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/fisheye.jpg","r":[["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."],["24mm Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/24mm-wide","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/24mm-wide-055-close-wide-angle-distortion-mini.webp","Person plus place, neither winning."],["35mm Moderate Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/35mm-moderate","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/35mm-moderate.webp","Most narrative coverage. Human but not telephoto."]],"z":"鱼眼镜头"},"macro":{"t":"Macro","c":"lenses","g":"Extreme-detail photography","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/macro","d":["Macro cinematography is close-focusing optics that let a small object or surface occupy the image at high reproduction scale, often near 1:1. An unusually close view turns texture, insects, eyes, or mechanisms into the entire shot.","微距摄影是近距对焦光学，让小型物体或表面以高复制倍率占据画面，通常接近 1:1。异常近距离的视角把纹理、昆虫、眼睛或机械机构变成整个镜头。"],"pi":["Name the optic and the centimeter. Macro lens on a detail of [Subject], insects of texture, an eye, a watch, a drop of rain, a world in a centimeter. State 1:1 or similar scale, razor-thin focus, real surface texture. Do not write close-up of a face unless the face feature is truly macro-scaled.","点明镜头与厘米尺度。微距镜头对准[主体]的细节，纹理中的昆虫、一只眼睛、一块手表、一滴雨，一厘米里的世界。说明 1:1 或相近放大倍率，极薄对焦，真实表面纹理。不要写脸部特写，除非面部特征确实是微距尺度。"],"cp":["Extreme macro shot of a watchmaker lowering one tiny screw into an old brass mechanism. The screw head and adjacent gear teeth are crisp; focus falls away rapidly. One slow precise movement, realistic metal scale, no oversized fingers or morphing gears.","极致微距镜头拍摄制表师将一颗小螺丝放入老旧黄铜机构。螺丝头和相邻齿轮齿清晰锐利；焦点迅速衰减。一次缓慢精准的动作，真实的金属尺度，没有过大的手指或变形的齿轮。"],"hp":["Macro lens on a detail of [Subject], insects of texture, an eye, a watch, a drop of rain, a world in a centimeter.","微距镜头对准[主体]的细节，纹理中的昆虫、一只眼睛、一块手表、一滴雨，一厘米里的世界。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/058-macro-insert-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/macro-058-macro-insert-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/macro.jpg","r":[["Extreme Close-Up","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/extreme-close-up","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/extreme-close-up-163-extreme-facial-close-up-mini.webp","A detail is the scene: an eye, a mouth, a trigger."],["Insert Shot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/insert","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/insert-095-narrative-insert-mini.webp","Point at the thing that will matter later."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"微距"},"magnification":{"t":"Magnification","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/magnification","d":["Magnification in magnification cinematography is the ratio of the subject's image size on the sensor to its real size. High magnification makes a centimeter of the world fill the frame; it is a scale number, not a shot-size name and not automatically a macro lens.","放大摄影中的放大倍率是主体在传感器上的成像尺寸与其真实尺寸之比。高放大倍率让一厘米的世界填满画面；它是一个尺度数字，不是景别名称，也不自动等于微距镜头。"],"pi":["Name the lost scale. Extreme magnification of [Subject], a world inside a centimeter, scale lost on purpose. State a ratio if you can (1:1). Forbid ordinary close-up of a face, and forbid a simple crop of a wider shot.","点明失去的尺度。极致放大[主体]，一厘米内的世界，刻意丢失尺度。如果可以，说明比例（1:1）。禁止普通的脸部特写，禁止简单裁切更宽的镜头。"],"cp":["Extreme magnification of [Subject], a world inside a centimeter, scale lost on purpose.","极致放大[主体]，一厘米内的世界，刻意丢失尺度。"],"hp":["Extreme magnification of [Subject], a world inside a centimeter, scale lost on purpose.","极致放大[主体]，一厘米内的世界，刻意丢失尺度。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/magnification/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Macro","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/macro","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/macro-058-macro-insert-mini.webp","The plot is microscopic."],["Probe Lens","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/probe-lens","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/probe-lens.webp","Go where a camera body cannot."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"放大倍率"},"probe-lens":{"t":"Probe Lens","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/probe-lens","d":["A probe lens is a long, narrow macro optic that can pass through small spaces and create extreme close moving shots from inside the subject. The front element is tiny and far from the camera body, so the viewpoint can enter a glass, a wound of machinery, food, or a miniature set.","探针镜头是一种长而窄的微距光学镜头，可穿过狭小空间，从主体内部拍出极近的运动镜头。前镜片很小且远离机身，因此视点可以进入玻璃杯、机械内部、食物或微缩布景。"],"pi":["Name the tube and the interior path. Probe-lens view of [Subject], tiny wide lens on a stick, impossible proximity through glass, food, or machinery, miniature world. Describe the path (through the ice, between gears). Do not write 85mm portrait or ordinary overhead macro.","点明镜管与内部路径。探针镜头视角看[主体]，杆上的微型广角镜头，穿过玻璃、食物或机械的极限贴近，微缩世界。描述路径（穿过冰层、齿轮之间）。不要写 85mm 人像或普通俯拍微距。"],"cp":["Probe-lens view of [Subject], tiny wide lens on a stick, impossible proximity through glass, food, or machinery, miniature world.","探针镜头视角看[主体]，杆上的微型广角镜头，穿过玻璃、食物或机械的极限贴近，微缩世界。"],"hp":["Probe-lens view of [Subject], tiny wide lens on a stick, impossible proximity through glass, food, or machinery, miniature world.","探针镜头视角看[主体]，杆上的微型广角镜头，穿过玻璃、食物或机械的极限贴近，微缩世界。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/probe-lens/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Macro","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/macro","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/macro-058-macro-insert-mini.webp","The plot is microscopic."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."],["24mm Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/24mm-wide","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/24mm-wide-055-close-wide-angle-distortion-mini.webp","Person plus place, neither winning."]],"z":"探针镜头"},"spherical":{"t":"Spherical","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/spherical","d":["A spherical lens in spherical lens cinematography uses rotationally symmetric elements with no anamorphic squeeze, so the image is captured already in its display proportions. Bokeh from a round iris is round, and edges stay rectilinear aside from ordinary wide-angle stretch.","球面镜头摄影中的球面镜头使用旋转对称镜片，没有变形宽银幕压缩，因此影像记录时已是其放映比例。圆形光圈产生的焦外是圆的，除了普通广角拉伸外，边缘保持平直。"],"pi":["Name the lack of squeeze. Spherical prime on [Subject], round bokeh, rectilinear edges, clean modern capture, no anamorphic streak. Then name the actual focal length (35mm, 50mm, 85mm). Do not add oval highlights or blue horizontal flares.","点明没有压缩变形。球面定焦镜头对准[主体]，圆形焦外，线条平直，干净的现代影像，没有变形宽银幕拉丝。然后说明实际焦距（35mm、50mm、85mm）。不要加椭圆形高光或蓝色横向眩光。"],"cp":["Spherical prime on [Subject], round bokeh, rectilinear edges, clean modern capture, no anamorphic streak.","球面定焦镜头对准[主体]，圆形焦外，线条平直，干净的现代影像，没有变形宽银幕拉丝。"],"hp":["Spherical prime on [Subject], round bokeh, rectilinear edges, clean modern capture, no anamorphic streak.","球面定焦镜头对准[主体]，圆形焦外，线条平直，干净的现代影像，没有变形宽银幕拉丝。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/spherical/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Anamorphic","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/anamorphic","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-057-anamorphic-optical-character-mini.webp","You want the frame to announce it is a movie."],["50mm Normal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/50mm-normal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/50mm-normal.webp","You do not want the glass to editorialize."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"球面镜头"},"split-diopter":{"t":"Split Diopter","c":"lenses","g":"Split-field diopter","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/split-diopter","d":["A split diopter is a partial close-focus element that keeps different distance zones sharp in one frame. One region focuses very near while another remains focused farther away; it is not two focal lengths, and it is not ordinary deep focus.","分像屈光度镜是一种局部近距对焦元件，能让同一画面中不同距离区域保持清晰。一个区域对焦很近，而另一个区域仍在更远处合焦；它不是两个焦距，也不是普通深焦。"],"pi":["Name one room and two sharp zones. One continuous room: a near object on the left tack-sharp and [Subject] far on the right also tack-sharp, a narrow blur band between them. Not a split-screen, not a ghost overlay. Hide the join on a door or pole. Do not write deep focus or two shots side by side.","点明一个房间和两个清晰区域。一个连续房间：左侧近处物体极其清晰，右侧远处的[主体]也极其清晰，两者之间有一条狭窄模糊带。不是分屏，不是重影叠加。把接缝藏在门或柱子上。不要写深焦，也不要写两个镜头并排。"],"cp":["A listening device fills the near-left foreground; a suspicious figure stands far back on the right. Both are tack sharp, with a narrow soft transition aligned to a dark door jamb between them. Locked camera, deliberate split-diopter look, not uniformly sharp depth throughout the room.","一个窃听装置占满近左前景；一个可疑人物站在右侧远处。两者都极其清晰，中间一条狭窄的柔焦过渡与深色门框对齐。固定机位，刻意的分像屈光度效果，房间景深并非全程均匀清晰。"],"hp":["One continuous room: a near object on the left tack-sharp and [Subject] far on the right also tack-sharp, a narrow blur band between them. Not a split-screen, not a ghost overlay.","一个连续房间：左侧近处物体极其清晰，右侧远处的[主体]也极其清晰，两者之间有一条狭窄模糊带。不是分屏，不是重影叠加。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/054-split-diopter-focus-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-diopter-054-split-diopter-focus-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/split-diopter.jpg","r":[["Deep Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/deep-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/deep-focus-051-deep-focus-mini.webp","Let the audience find the story in the whole room."],["Rack Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/rack-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rack-focus-053-rack-focus-mini.webp","Change who owns the shot without cutting."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"分焦镜"},"tilt-shift":{"t":"Tilt-Shift","c":"lenses","g":"Tilt-shift look","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/tilt-shift","d":["Tilt-shift cinematography tilts the lens relative to the sensor so the plane of focus rotates, and may also shift the lens to slide perspective. A narrow band or shaped region of sharpness, often from a high viewpoint, can make a real-scale scene resemble a small model.","移轴摄影让镜头相对于传感器倾斜，使对焦平面旋转，也可以平移镜头来滑动透视。一条狭窄的清晰带或成形清晰区域，通常来自高视点，能让真实尺度场景看起来像小型模型。"],"pi":["Name real scale, then the thin focus plane. A real-scale city or citadel with [Subject] human-sized. A thin horizontal band of focus across the subject, foreground and far ground softly blurred, no hard seam across the frame. Add a high viewpoint if you want the diorama. Do not write shallow bokeh portrait, and do not ask for a hard blur stripe.","点明真实尺度，然后点明薄对焦平面。真实尺度的城市或城堡，[主体]为人类大小。一条细水平对焦带横跨主体，前景和远处地面柔和模糊，画面没有生硬接缝。如果想要微缩模型感，加高视点。不要写浅景深焦外人像，也不要要求生硬的模糊条带。"],"cp":["High oblique view of two rowing teams moving along a river, with a narrow depth-aware focus region around the boats and smoothly increasing blur nearer and farther away. Slightly brisk motion and crisp miniature-like detail. No actual toy proportions, no arbitrary blurry stripe across faces.","高角度斜视两支赛艇队沿河移动，船只周围有一条狭窄的景深感知对焦区域，向更近和更远处平滑增加模糊。动作略轻快，细节清晰如微缩模型。没有真正的玩具比例，没有任意横跨面部的模糊条带。"],"hp":["A real-scale city or citadel with [Subject] human-sized. A thin band of focus across the subject, foreground and far ground softly blurred, no hard seam across the frame.","真实尺度的城市或城堡，[主体]为人类大小。一条细对焦带横跨主体，前景和远处地面柔和模糊，画面没有生硬接缝。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/062-miniature-look-selective-focus-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tilt-shift-062-miniature-look-selective-focus-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/tilt-shift.jpg","r":[["Shallow Focus","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/shallow-focus","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/shallow-focus-052-shallow-focus-isolation-mini.webp","Nothing else is invited."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."],["24mm Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/24mm-wide","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/24mm-wide-055-close-wide-angle-distortion-mini.webp","Person plus place, neither winning."]],"z":"移轴"},"ultra-wide-14mm":{"t":"14mm Ultra-Wide","c":"lenses","g":"Intimate wide lens","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","d":["A 14mm ultra-wide in 14mm cinematography is a very short focal length that, from a close stand, takes in a huge field and exaggerates near-to-far size. The close camera position, not the millimeter stamp alone, is what balloons a foreground face or object against a receding room.","14mm 超广角在 14mm 摄影中是一种极短焦距，从近距离机位可收入巨大视野，并夸大近处与远处的大小对比。是贴近的机位，而不只是毫米数标记，让前景的脸或物体在后退的房间前膨胀。"],"pi":["Name the stand and the stretch. 14mm ultra-wide on [Subject], exaggerated perspective, looming foreground, stretched architecture, slight heroic distortion. Say how close the camera is (arm's length, over the table, in the doorway) and keep the face near center unless edge stretch is the point. Do not write distorted as a sticker, and do not ask for oval bokeh.","写明确位置和拉伸。14mm 超广角拍 [主体]，夸张透视，前景逼人，建筑被拉伸，带一点英雄式畸变。写明摄影机有多近（一臂之内、隔着桌子、站在门口），并让脸靠近画面中心，除非边缘拉伸正是重点。不要把「畸变」当标签写上去，也不要要求椭圆形散景。"],"cp":["Very close wide-angle portrait of a tired night cook leaning toward the camera in a tiny kitchen. His near hand appears larger, the room stretches strongly behind him, walls remain rigid. Expressive perspective, natural facial anatomy, no fisheye circle.","在狭小厨房里，一位疲惫的夜班厨师朝镜头前倾的极近广角肖像。靠近镜头的那只手显得更大，身后的房间被强烈拉伸，墙体保持笔直。有表现力的透视，面部解剖自然，不要鱼眼圆形。"],"hp":["14mm ultra-wide on [Subject], exaggerated perspective, looming foreground, stretched architecture, slight heroic distortion.","14mm 超广角对准[主体]，夸张透视，前景逼近，建筑拉伸，轻微英雄式畸变。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/ultra-wide-14mm/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["24mm Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/24mm-wide","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/24mm-wide-055-close-wide-angle-distortion-mini.webp","Person plus place, neither winning."],["Fisheye","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/fisheye","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fisheye-059-fisheye-space-distortion-mini.webp","The mind is warped, or the space is a dome."],["35mm Moderate Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/35mm-moderate","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/35mm-moderate.webp","Most narrative coverage. Human but not telephoto."]],"z":"14mm超广角"},"vintage-cine":{"t":"Vintage Cine Glass","c":"lenses","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/vintage-cine","d":["Vintage cine glass is older motion-picture optics whose coatings, contrast, and aberrations differ from modern clinical primes. Lower contrast, gentle halation, and sometimes swirling or rolling edges are properties of the lens, not a grade slapped on sharp digital.","复古电影镜头是较老的电影光学镜头，其镀膜、对比度和像差与现代临床式定焦不同。较低对比度、柔和泛光，有时还有旋焦或滚动边缘，是镜头本身的特性，不是给锐利数字影像套上的调色。"],"pi":["Name the glass, not a sticker. Vintage cine glass on [Subject], lower contrast, gentle halation, swirling edges, Cooke or K35 character, not clinical sharpness. Add spherical unless you also want anamorphic ovals. Do not write faded LUT only, and do not add heavy grain as a substitute for the lens.","点明镜头，不是贴纸。复古电影镜头对准[主体]，较低对比度，柔和泛光，旋焦边缘，Cooke 或 K35 风格，不是临床式锐利。加球面，除非你也想要变形宽银幕椭圆焦外。不要只写褪色 LUT，也不要用重度颗粒替代镜头。"],"cp":["Vintage cine glass on [Subject], lower contrast, gentle halation, swirling edges, Cooke or K35 romance, not clinical sharpness.","复古电影镜头对准[主体]，较低对比度，柔和泛光，旋焦边缘，Cooke 或 K35 浪漫感，不是临床式锐利。"],"hp":["Vintage cine glass on [Subject], lower contrast, gentle halation, swirling edges, Cooke or K35 character, not clinical sharpness.","复古电影镜头对准[主体]，较低对比度，柔和泛光，旋焦边缘，Cooke 或 K35 风格，不是临床式锐利。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/vintage-cine/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Halation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp","Highlights should bleed like film, not clip like video."],["Anamorphic","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/anamorphic","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/anamorphic-057-anamorphic-optical-character-mini.webp","You want the frame to announce it is a movie."],["14mm Ultra-Wide","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lenses/ultra-wide-14mm","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultra-wide-14mm.webp","Put the audience inside a space that is too big or too close."]],"z":"老式电影镜头"},"available-light":{"t":"Available Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/available-light","d":["Available light in available light cinematography is the illumination already at the location before the crew adds or changes units: sun, sky, or existing interior fixtures. You commit to the hour and the existing contrast.","现有光摄影中的现有光是剧组添加或改变灯具之前，现场已有的照明：太阳、天空或室内现有灯具。你要接受具体时段与现有反差。"],"pi":["Forbid added units. \" Name the hour and the existing source. Do not list movie lamps.","禁止添加灯具。说明小时与现有光源。不要列电影灯。"],"cp":["Available light only on [Subject], sun, sky, or existing interior fixtures, documentary humility, no added units.","仅用现有光拍摄[主体]，太阳、天空或室内现有灯具，纪录片式谦逊，不添加灯具。"],"hp":["Available light only on [Subject], sun, sky, or existing interior fixtures, documentary humility, no added units.","仅用现有光拍摄[主体]，太阳、天空或室内现有灯具，纪录片式谦逊，不添加灯具。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/available-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Naturalistic Ambient","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/naturalistic-ambient","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/naturalistic-ambient.webp","Invisible craft."],["Motivated Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/motivated-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/motivated-lighting.webp","Realism with control. Light like a world, not a studio."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"现场光"},"backlight":{"t":"Backlight","c":"lighting","g":"hair light when on hair","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/backlight","d":["Backlight in backlight cinematography is light coming from behind the subject toward the camera, tracing edges and lifting the figure off the background. It may stay a thin rim or, in haze, become a visible shaft.","逆光摄影中的逆光是从主体后方朝摄影机射来的光，勾勒边缘并把人物从背景中托起。它可以保持为细轮廓光，或在雾霭中变成可见光束。"],"pi":["Put the source behind the body, not on the nose. \" Name hair, coat edge, and whether haze is present. Do not ask for a glowing outline sticker.","把光源放到身体后面，而不是打在鼻子上。写明头发、外套边缘，以及有没有雾霾介质。不要要求那种像贴纸一样的发光轮廓。"],"cp":["A conservator enters a dark archive where one high window sends a narrow hard shaft through suspended dust. Her body briefly interrupts the beam, producing a coherent moving shadow in the haze. Deep room, restrained atmosphere, no magical glowing particles.","一位文物修复员走进昏暗的档案库，一扇高窗射下一道穿过浮尘的窄硬光柱。她的身体短暂挡住光柱，在雾尘中投下连贯移动的影子。房间纵深很深，气氛克制，不要会魔法般发光的粒子。"],"hp":["Backlight on [Subject] from behind, rim of light tracing edges, slight veil, separation from background.","逆光从后方照[主体]，光线轮廓勾勒边缘，轻微薄雾，与背景分离。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/backlight-067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/backlight.jpg","r":[["Rim Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rim-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rim-light.webp","Graphic silhouette with just enough flesh."],["Silhouette","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/silhouette","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/silhouette-049-silhouette-as-graphic-storytelling-mini.webp","Identity is less important than shape."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"逆光"},"blue-hour":{"t":"Blue Hour","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/blue-hour","d":["Blue hour in blue hour cinematography is cool ambient twilight before sunrise or after sunset, when the sun is below the horizon but the sky still glows. There is no hard sunlight; the sky is a large cool source, and warm practicals often kick in.","在蓝调时刻摄影中，蓝调时刻是日出前或日落后的冷调环境暮光，此时太阳位于地平线以下，但天空仍有余晖。没有强烈的直射阳光；天空是巨大的冷色光源，暖色实景光源常常加入。"],"pi":["Keep the sky luminous and cool. Use: \"Blue hour wrap on [Subject], deep cobalt sky still glowing, warm practicals kicking in.\" Forbid a visible sun disk and a black night sky with no residual light.","让天空保持透亮且偏冷。用这句：「[主体] 的蓝调时刻收工镜头，深钴蓝的天空仍有微光，暖色实景灯开始亮起。」禁止出现可见的太阳圆盘，也禁止没有任何残余光线的漆黑夜空。"],"cp":["Blue hour wrap on [Subject], deep cobalt sky still glowing, warm practicals kicking in, Mann twilight melancholy.","[主体] 的蓝调时刻收工镜头，深钴蓝的天空仍有微光，暖色实景灯开始亮起，迈克尔·曼式的黄昏忧郁。"],"hp":["Blue hour wrap on [Subject], deep cobalt sky still glowing, warm practicals kicking in.","蓝调时刻拍摄收尾 [主体]，深钴蓝色天空仍有余晖，暖色实景光源正在加入。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/blue-hour/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Golden Hour","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/golden-hour","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/golden-hour.webp","You have twenty minutes of truth."],["Neon Practicals","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neon-practical.webp","The city is the lighting department."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"蓝调时刻"},"bounce-light":{"t":"Bounce Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/bounce-light","d":["Bounce lighting reflects light from a surface (wall, ceiling, poly, card) before it reaches the subject, so the apparent source becomes that large surface. Direction remains, but shadow edges soften and wrap.","反射光照明在光线抵达主体之前，先把它从某一表面（墙面、天花板、泡沫板、卡纸）反射出去，因此表观光源就变成了那个大表面。方向仍然保留，但阴影边缘变柔并产生包裹感。"],"pi":["Name the reflecting surface. \" State the wall's side and color. Forbid a small bare bulb as the apparent source.","说出反射面。说明墙所在的一侧和颜色。禁止把一个小裸灯泡作为表观光源。"],"cp":["Bounce light on [Subject], key ricocheted off a white wall or poly, wrapping, gentle, large-source softness.","反射光打在[主体]上，主光从白墙或泡沫反光板弹射，包裹感，柔和，大光源的柔度。"],"hp":["Bounce light on [Subject], key ricocheted off a white wall or poly, wrapping, gentle, large-source softness.","反射光打在[主体]上，主光从白墙或泡沫反光板弹射，包裹感，柔和，大光源的柔度。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/bounce-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Soft Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/soft-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/soft-light.webp","Beauty, memory, or kindness."],["Window Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/window-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/window-light.webp","Day interiors without looking lit."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"反射光"},"broad-lighting":{"t":"Broad Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/broad-lighting","d":["Broad lighting keys the side of the face turned toward camera, so the near cheek is the bright one and the shadow sits on the far side. The face reads open, public, and less mysterious.","宽面光把朝向摄影机的那一侧脸作为主光照射面，因此近侧脸颊是亮面，阴影落在远侧。脸部显得开放、公开、不那么神秘。"],"pi":["Light the near cheek. Use: \"Broad lighting on [Subject], the camera-facing side keyed, open and public, less shadow on the near cheek.\" Say the bright plane is the one occupying most of the frame.","照亮近侧脸颊。使用：“宽面光打在[主体]上，朝向摄影机的一侧被主光照亮，开放而公开，近侧脸颊阴影更少。”说明明亮平面是占据画面大部分的那一面。"],"cp":["Broad lighting on [Subject], the camera-facing side keyed, open and public, less shadow on the near cheek.","宽面光打在[主体]上，朝向摄影机的一侧被主光照亮，开放而公开，近侧脸颊阴影更少。"],"hp":["Broad lighting on [Subject], the camera-facing side keyed, open and public, less shadow on the near cheek.","宽面光打在[主体]上，朝向摄影机的一侧被主光照亮，开放而公开，近侧脸颊阴影更少。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/broad-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Short Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/short-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/short-lighting.webp","Sculpt a face; add mystery on the camera side."],["High-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/high-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-key-064-high-key-brightness-mini.webp","Comedy, heaven, hospital, or candy."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"宽面光"},"butterfly-lighting":{"t":"Butterfly Lighting","c":"lighting","g":"Paramount lighting","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/butterfly-lighting","d":["Butterfly lighting, also called Paramount lighting, places the key high and on the camera axis so a small butterfly-shaped shadow falls under the nose on the philtrum. Both cheeks stay open; both eyes take light.","蝴蝶光，也称派拉蒙光，把主光放在较高且位于摄影机轴线的位置，因此鼻下人中处会落下一小块蝴蝶形阴影。两颊保持受光；双眼都受光。"],"pi":["Keep the key on center and high. \" Forbid a shadow cheek. Mention both eyes taking light.","让主光保持居中且位置偏高。禁止出现阴影脸颊。提及双眼都受光。"],"cp":["Key light high and centered on [Subject]'s face, a small shadow under the nose on the philtrum, both eyes open, glamour portrait.","主光高而居中地打在[主体]的脸上，鼻下人中处有一小块阴影，双眼睁开，魅力人像。"],"hp":["Key light high and centered on [Subject]'s face, a small shadow under the nose on the philtrum, both eyes open, glamour portrait.","主光高而居中地打在[主体]的脸上，鼻下人中处有一小块阴影，双眼睁开，魅力人像。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/butterfly-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Loop Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/loop-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/loop-lighting.webp","Natural portrait that is still shaped."],["High-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/high-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-key-064-high-key-brightness-mini.webp","Comedy, heaven, hospital, or candy."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"蝴蝶光"},"cameo-lighting":{"t":"Cameo Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/cameo-lighting","d":["Cameo lighting isolates a lit subject against a predominantly dark environment, so the figure sits in a pool and the world falls to black. The person remains modeled; the set is withheld.","浮雕光把受光主体从以黑暗为主的环境中孤立出来，因此人物坐在一束光池里，周围世界沉入黑色。人物仍保留立体塑形；布景被隐去。"],"pi":["Kill the room. \" Keep the face modeled. Forbid a readable set and a bright sky.","压暗整个房间。保持面部有立体塑形。禁止可辨识的布景和明亮天空。"],"cp":["Cameo lighting on [Subject], figure isolated in a pool against a black void, theatrical spotlight, no environment.","浮雕光打在[主体]上，人物孤立于黑色虚空中的光池里，剧场式聚光灯，没有环境。"],"hp":["Cameo lighting on [Subject], figure isolated in a pool against a black void, theatrical isolation, no environment.","浮雕光打在[主体]上，人物孤立于黑色虚空中的光池里，剧场式孤立，没有环境。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cameo-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["High-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/high-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-key-064-high-key-brightness-mini.webp","Comedy, heaven, hospital, or candy."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"浮雕光"},"candlelight":{"t":"Candlelight","c":"lighting","g":"Low-light period interior","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/candlelight","d":["Candlelight in candlelight cinematography is a small warm practical or a simulated flame with rapid falloff, often around 1800K, that carves faces near the flame and lets the rest of the room die. Flicker is part of the source, not a grade.","烛光摄影中的烛光是一种小型暖色实景光源，或模拟火焰，衰减很快，通常约1800K，它把靠近火焰的面部雕刻出来，让房间其余部分沉入黑暗。闪烁是光源本身的一部分，不是调色。"],"pi":["Keep the flame small and close. \" Cluster the candles, kill electric fill, and let corners go dark. No orange wash on a bright room.","让火焰小而近。把蜡烛聚在一起，关掉电灯补光，让角落沉入黑暗。不要在明亮的房间里铺一层橙色滤镜。"],"cp":["An eighteenth-century card game lit as if only by clustered candles on the table. Faces fade quickly into darkness with distance from the flames, warm uneven illumination, believable flame detail and subdued room corners. A slow restrained gesture, no bright modern fill or electric orange wash.","一场十八世纪的牌局，光照仿佛只来自桌上聚拢的蜡烛。人脸随着离烛火的远近迅速没入黑暗，暖光不均匀，火焰细节真实，房间角落压暗。动作缓慢克制，不要明亮的现代补光，也不要电灯般的橙色调。"],"hp":["Candlelight on [Subject], warm 1800K flicker, faces carved by flame, deep falloff.","烛光打在[主体]上，暖色1800K闪烁，面部被火焰雕刻，深度衰减。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/066-candlelit-naturalism-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/candlelight-066-candlelit-naturalism-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/candlelight.jpg","r":[["Practical Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/practical-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/practical-lighting-065-practical-source-motivation-mini.webp","Let the set light the face."],["Underlighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/under-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/under-light.webp","The source is fire, a screen on the floor, or a monster."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"烛光"},"chiaroscuro":{"t":"Chiaroscuro","c":"lighting","g":"Selective darkness","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/chiaroscuro","d":["Chiaroscuro lighting uses strong light-dark contrast to model volume and to create moral, psychological, or dramatic tension. Darkness withholds; the lit plane is what the scene will admit.","明暗对照法照明使用强烈的明暗对比来塑造体积，并制造道德、心理或戏剧张力。黑暗有所保留；受光的明暗面才是场景愿意透露的东西。"],"pi":["One source, fast falloff, modeled planes. \" Name the lamp. Forbid extra fill and even ambient.","一个光源，快速衰减，塑造明暗面。说明灯具。禁止额外辅光和均匀环境光。"],"cp":["A tailor listens to an uneasy visitor in a dim back room. One high window shapes half the tailor’s face; the rest falls into deep but readable shadow. Warm desk practical in the distance, no even beauty fill, no crushed featureless blacks.","一位裁缝在昏暗的后室里听一位不安的访客说话。一扇高窗塑造裁缝的半张脸；其余部分落入深但可读的阴影。远处有暖色书桌实景光源，没有均匀的美颜辅光，没有压死而无细节的黑。"],"hp":["Chiaroscuro lighting on [Subject], Caravaggio tenebrism, a single warm source, everything beyond arm's reach falling into black.","明暗对照法照明打在[主体]上，卡拉瓦乔式暗黑主义，单一暖色光源，一臂之外的一切都沉入黑色。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/063-low-key-chiaroscuro-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/chiaroscuro-063-low-key-chiaroscuro-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/chiaroscuro.jpg","r":[["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["Rembrandt Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rembrandt","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rembrandt.webp","Classic dramatic portrait."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"明暗对照法"},"cross-lighting":{"t":"Cross Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/cross-lighting","d":["Cross lighting keys subjects from opposite side directions, so each person or each side of a body gets a key and a far rim. It is common in dialogue coverage , stage, and concert work.","交叉光从相反的侧向给主体打主光，因此每个人或身体的每一侧都会得到一个主光和远处的轮廓光。它常见于对话分镜覆盖、舞台和演唱会拍摄。"],"pi":["Name two opposing keys. \" Specify colors if they differ. Forbid a single-side split.","说明两个相对的主光。如果颜色不同，说明颜色。禁止单侧分割光。"],"cp":["Cross lighting on [Subject] from two opposing keys, dual rims, theatrical or concert energy, edges on both sides.","交叉光从两个相对的主光打在[主体]上，双重轮廓光，剧场或演唱会能量，两侧都有边缘光。"],"hp":["Cross lighting on [Subject] from two opposing keys, dual rims, theatrical or concert edges on both sides.","交叉光从两个相对的主光打在[主体]上，双重轮廓光，剧场或演唱会式的两侧边缘光。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/cross-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Rim Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rim-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rim-light.webp","Graphic silhouette with just enough flesh."],["Side Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/side-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/side-lighting.webp","Carve a face like sculpture."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"交叉光"},"dappled-light":{"t":"Dappled Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/dappled-light","d":["Dappled light is broken patches of brightness and shadow caused by foliage, water, blinds, or another irregular obstruction in a hard beam. The pattern is organic and often moving.","斑驳光是由树叶、水面、百叶窗或其他不规则遮挡物置于硬光光束中造成的破碎亮斑与阴影。图案是有机的，而且常常在移动。"],"pi":["Name the obstruction. Use: \"Sun through leaves on [Subject], irregular patches of brightness and leaf-shaped shadows on coat and horse, a real tree overhead.\" Forbid a clean unpatterned key and a venetian-bar prison graphic unless blinds are the story.","说明遮挡物。使用：“阳光穿过树叶打在[主体]上，外套和马身上有不规则亮斑和叶形阴影，头顶有一棵真实的树。”禁止干净无图案的主光，以及威尼斯百叶窗条形的监狱图案，除非百叶窗就是故事本身。"],"cp":["Sun through leaves on [Subject], irregular patches of brightness and leaf-shaped shadows on coat and horse, a real tree overhead.","阳光穿过树叶打在[主体]上，外套和马身上有不规则亮斑和叶形阴影，头顶有一棵真实的树。"],"hp":["Sun through leaves on [Subject], irregular patches of brightness and leaf-shaped shadows on coat and horse, a real tree overhead.","阳光穿过树叶打在[主体]上，外套和马身上有不规则亮斑和叶形阴影，头顶有一棵真实的树。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/dappled-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Gobo Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/gobo-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/gobo-lighting.webp","The room writes on the person."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"斑驳光"},"epiphany":{"t":"Epiphany","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/epiphany","d":["Epiphany lighting is a change of illumination that makes a face or figure suddenly the brightest readable fact in the room as a realization lands. The light finds the person; it is timed to understanding, not left as a static setup.","顿悟光是一种照明变化，当领悟降临时，它让一张脸或一个人物突然成为房间里最明亮的可读事实。光找到那个人；它配合理解发生的时机，而不是留作静态布光。"],"pi":["Write the before and after. Still: \"Epiphany light on [Subject], a sudden intelligible brightness, as if the thought itself switched a lamp.\" Video: \"Light finds [Subject] as a realization lands, the face becoming the brightest fact in the room.\" Name what caused the change (sun, door, lamp).","写出变化前后。静帧：“顿悟光打在[主体]上，一种突然可被理解的明亮，仿佛念头本身打开了一盏灯。”视频：“当领悟降临，光找到[主体]，脸部成为房间里最明亮的可读事实。”说明是什么造成了变化（太阳、门、灯）。"],"cp":["Light finds [Subject] as a realization lands, the face becoming the brightest fact in the room.","当领悟降临，光找到[主体]，脸部成为房间里最明亮的可读事实。"],"hp":["Epiphany light on [Subject], a sudden intelligible brightness, as if the thought itself switched a lamp. Motion: Light finds [Subject] as a realization lands, the face becoming the brightest fact in the room.","顿悟光打在[主体]上，一种突然可被理解的明亮，仿佛念头本身打开了一盏灯。运动：当领悟降临，光找到[主体]，脸部成为房间里最明亮的可读事实。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/epiphany-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/epiphany-epiphany-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/epiphany.jpg","r":[["Cameo Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/cameo-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cameo-lighting.webp","Erase the world. Keep the person."],["Volumetric Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/volumetric-light.webp","Air has to be photographed, not just the subject."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"顿悟光"},"eye-light":{"t":"Eye Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/eye-light","d":["An eye light in eye light cinematography is a small frontal source used to put a catchlight in the irises or to lift the eyes a fraction without becoming a fill. The face can stay in shadow; the eyes remain human, not lamps.","眼部光（eye light）在眼部光摄影中是一种小型正面光源，用来在虹膜中制造眼神光，或把眼睛稍微提亮一点，但不会变成辅光。面部可以留在阴影中；眼睛仍然像人的眼睛，而不是灯。"],"pi":["Specify a reflection, not a glow. Use: \"A dark portrait of [Subject], face mostly in shadow, a tiny white reflection of a lamp sitting in each human iris. \" Keep the key off-axis so the rest of the face stays dark.","指定反射，而不是发光。使用：“[主体]的暗调肖像，面部大部分处于阴影中，每只人眼虹膜里有一小点灯的白色反射。”让主光偏离轴线，好让面部其余部分保持暗部。"],"cp":["A dark portrait of [Subject], face mostly in shadow, a tiny white reflection of a lamp sitting in each human iris. Eyes stay brown or grey, not glowing.","[主体]的暗调肖像，面部大部分处于阴影中，每只人眼虹膜里有一小点灯的白色反射。眼睛保持棕色或灰色，不发光。"],"hp":["A dark portrait of [Subject], face mostly in shadow, a tiny white reflection of a lamp sitting in each human iris. Eyes stay brown or grey, not glowing.","[主体]的暗调肖像，面部大部分处于阴影中，每只人眼虹膜里有一小点灯的白色反射。眼睛保持棕色或灰色，不发光。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/eye-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["Key Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/key-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/key-light.webp","Decide where the world is lit from. Everything else follows."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"眼神光"},"fill-light":{"t":"Fill Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/fill-light","d":["Fill light reduces contrast or adds detail in areas the key does not reach, usually from the opposite side and at a lower level. It is a ratio tool, not a second sun.","辅光降低反差，或在主光无法覆盖的区域增加细节，通常来自相反一侧且强度更低。它是控制光比的工具，不是第二个太阳。"],"pi":["Say which cheek opens and how little. \" Add 2:1 or 4:1 if you need a number. Do not ask for bright even light if you still want a key.","说明哪边脸颊打开以及打开多少。如果需要数字，加上 2:1 或 4:1。如果你仍然想要主光，就不要要求明亮均匀的光。"],"cp":["Soft fill light opening the shadow side of [Subject] without flattening, a low ratio that keeps eyes alive.","柔和的辅光打开[主体]的阴影侧而不压平，低光比让眼睛仍有神。"],"hp":["Soft fill light opening the shadow side of [Subject] without flattening, a low ratio that keeps eyes alive.","柔和的辅光打开[主体]的阴影侧而不压平，低光比让眼睛仍有神。"],"fq":["Name the shadow side and a low ratio. Example: soft fill on camera right, two stops under the key, eyes still visible, cheeks not even.","说明阴影侧和低光比。例如：柔光辅光在摄影机右侧，比主光低两档，眼睛仍可见，脸颊不过度均匀。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/fill-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Key Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/key-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/key-light.webp","Decide where the world is lit from. Everything else follows."],["High-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/high-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-key-064-high-key-brightness-mini.webp","Comedy, heaven, hospital, or candy."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"辅光"},"glam":{"t":"Glam","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/glam","d":["Glam lighting, in glam lighting terms, is a large beauty key with catchlights in the eyes and a little diffusion on skin, built to sell the face. It is a package of size, frontal or near-frontal placement, and skin treatment, not a single nose-shadow pattern.","魅力光（glam lighting）在魅力光术语中，是一种大号美颜主光，眼睛里有眼神光，皮肤稍加柔化，用来让脸部出彩。它是一套组合：大尺寸、正面或接近正面的位置，以及皮肤处理，而不是单一鼻影图案。"],"pi":["Sell the face with physics, not a mood word. Use: \"Soft beauty key on [Subject], large source, catchlights inside the eyes, a little diffusion on skin. \" Keep the key near camera. Forbid hard splits and overhead skulls.","用物理描述来让脸部出彩，而不是用情绪词。使用：“[主体]上的柔美主光，大光源，眼睛里有眼神光，皮肤上有一点柔化。”让主光靠近摄影机。禁止硬性阴阳脸和头顶骷髅光。"],"cp":["Soft beauty key on [Subject], large source, catchlights inside the eyes, a little diffusion on skin. No projected squares or grids on the face.","[主体]上的柔美主光，大光源，眼睛内有眼神光，皮肤稍加柔化。脸上不要有投影的方块或网格。"],"hp":["Soft beauty key on [Subject], large source, catchlights inside the eyes, a little diffusion on skin. No projected squares or grids on the face.","[主体]上的柔美主光，大光源，眼睛内有眼神光，皮肤稍加柔化。脸上不要有投影的方块或网格。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/glam/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Butterfly Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/butterfly-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/butterfly-lighting.webp","Beauty lighting with structure."],["Soft Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/soft-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/soft-light.webp","Beauty, memory, or kindness."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"魅力光"},"gobo-lighting":{"t":"Gobo Lighting","c":"lighting","g":"cucoloris","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/gobo-lighting","d":["Gobo lighting places a pattern or object in a light beam (a gobo or cucoloris) so the source throws graphic shadows across face, body, and wall. The room writes on the person.","遮光图案照明把图案或物体放进光束中（遮光图案或遮光板），让光源把图形化阴影投在脸、身体和墙上。房间在人物身上书写。"],"pi":["Name the object in the beam. \" Specify a hard source. Keep the pattern sharp enough to read.","说明光束中的物体。指定硬光源。让图案清晰到可以辨认。"],"cp":["Gobo-patterned light on [Subject], venetian blinds, bars, or branches throwing graphic shadows across face and wall.","[主体]上的遮光图案光，百叶窗、栏杆或树枝把图形化阴影投在脸和墙上。"],"hp":["Gobo-patterned light on [Subject], venetian blinds, bars, or branches throwing graphic shadows across face and wall.","[主体]上的遮光图案光，百叶窗、栏杆或树枝把图形化阴影投在脸和墙上。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/gobo-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Dappled Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/dappled-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dappled-light.webp","Nature or blinds as gobo."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"图案投影光"},"golden-hour":{"t":"Golden Hour","c":"lighting","g":"Twilight photography","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/golden-hour","d":["Golden hour in golden hour cinematography is low-angle warm sunlight shortly after sunrise or before sunset, when the sun is near the horizon. Shadows go long; the light is directional, warm, and brief.","黄金时刻（golden hour）在黄金时刻摄影中，是日出后不久或日落前不久的低角度暖色阳光，此时太阳接近地平线。阴影拉长；光线有方向、温暖且短暂。"],"pi":["Keep the sun low and real. \" Say the sun is just above the horizon. Forbid midday height and a full blue sky with no rake.","让太阳低而真实。写明太阳刚在地平线之上。禁止正午的高度，也禁止没有斜射角度的整片蓝天。"],"cp":["Two farm workers walk beside a wheat field just after sunset. Soft luminous sky, low contrast on their faces, warm remnants on the horizon, no direct overhead sun. Gentle wind and patient lateral movement, natural exposure, no exaggerated orange filter.","日落刚过，两名农工走在麦田边。天空柔和透亮，他们脸上对比很低，地平线上还留着暖色，没有头顶直射的太阳。轻风与克制的横向移动，曝光自然，不要夸张的橙色滤镜。"],"hp":["Golden hour backlight on [Subject], warm amber raking sun, long shadows, horizontal flare.","黄金时刻逆光照在[主体]上，暖琥珀色斜射阳光，长阴影，水平眩光。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/golden-hour/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Blue Hour","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/blue-hour","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/blue-hour.webp","Day is gone but the sky still works."],["Available Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/available-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/available-light.webp","Commit to the hour you have."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"黄金时刻"},"hair-light":{"t":"Hair Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hair-light","d":["A hair light is a small source behind and above the subject that lights only the top of the hair as a rim so texture separates from the background. The face stays on the key or in cooler shadow.","发丝光是一盏位于主体后方上方的小光源，只把头发顶部照成轮廓边，让发丝质感与背景分离。面部仍由主光照明，或留在更冷的阴影中。"],"pi":["Aim at the crown, not the nose. Use: \"A small lamp behind and above [Subject], lighting only the top of the hair as a rim. \" Name hair color so the model does not bleach the scalp.","对准头顶，而不是鼻子。使用：“[主体]后方上方的一盏小灯，只把头发顶部照成轮廓边。”说明发色，免得模型把头皮漂白。"],"cp":["A small lamp behind and above [Subject], lighting only the top of the hair as a rim. The face stays in cooler shadow.","[主体]后方上方的一盏小灯，只把头发顶部照成轮廓边。面部留在更冷的阴影中。"],"hp":["A small lamp behind and above [Subject], lighting only the top of the hair as a rim. The face stays in cooler shadow.","[主体]后方上方的一盏小灯，只把头发顶部照成轮廓边。面部留在更冷的阴影中。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/hair-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Backlight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/backlight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/backlight-067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.webp","Separate a dark figure from a dark world."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."],["Key Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/key-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/key-light.webp","Decide where the world is lit from. Everything else follows."]],"z":"发丝光"},"hard-light":{"t":"Hard Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","d":["Hard light in hard light cinematography comes from a small apparent source and produces crisp shadow edges and specular definition on skin, metal, and walls. Texture is amplified; falloff can still be steep or long depending on distance.","硬光（hard light）在硬光摄影中来自表观尺寸小的光源，产生清晰的阴影边缘，并在皮肤、金属和墙上形成高光细节。质感被放大；衰减仍可陡峭或绵长，取决于距离。"],"pi":["Name a small distant source and razor edges. Use: \"Hard light on [Subject] from a small distant source, razor shadow edges, texture amplified, noir graphic.\" Forbid silks, wrap, and cloudy softness unless weather is the point.","写明一个又小又远的光源和刀锋般的阴影边缘。用这句：「[主体] 上的硬光，来自小而远的光源，阴影边缘锐利，质感被放大，黑色电影式的图形感。」除非天气本身就是重点，否则禁止柔光布、包裹光和云一样的柔和。"],"cp":["Hard light on [Subject] from a small distant source, razor shadow edges, texture amplified, noir graphic.","[主体] 上的硬光，来自小而远的光源，阴影边缘锐利，质感被放大，黑色电影式的图形感。"],"hp":["Hard light on [Subject] from a small distant source, razor shadow edges, texture amplified, noir graphic.","硬光照在[主体]上，来自远处的小光源，刀锋般锐利的阴影边缘，质感被放大，黑色电影图形感。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/hard-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Soft Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/soft-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/soft-light.webp","Beauty, memory, or kindness."],["Gobo Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/gobo-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/gobo-lighting.webp","The room writes on the person."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"硬光"},"high-key":{"t":"High-Key Lighting","c":"lighting","g":"Low-contrast luminous lighting","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/high-key","d":["High-key lighting, or high key lighting, uses relatively low contrast, bright exposure, and limited deep shadow so the frame stays open and readable. It is a contrast ratio, not a command to overexpose.","高调照明（high-key lighting，或称 high key lighting）使用相对低的反差、明亮曝光和有限的深阴影，让画面保持开放、易读。它是一种光比，不是过曝的命令。"],"pi":["Ask for low contrast and protected whites, not a flash. \" Add large sources and say highlights hold texture. Avoid calling it low-key just because the genre is serious.","要求低对比与「高光不死白」，而不是闪光灯感。补上大面积光源，并写明高光仍有质感。不要因为题材严肃就把它写成低调。"],"cp":["A meticulously cheerful pastry shop at midday, soft broad light, luminous pastel walls and gentle shadows. The owner stands motionless while everyone else smiles. High-key image with preserved white icing texture, no blown highlights or glossy skin.","正午时分一间刻意欢快的糕点店，柔和宽广的光，透亮的柔粉墙面与轻柔阴影。店主一动不动，其他人都在微笑。高调画面，白色糖霜的质感保留，高光不过曝，皮肤不油腻。"],"hp":["High-key lighting on [Subject], bright even illumination, minimal shadows, airy overexposure by a third, optimism or sterile future.","高调照明照在[主体]上，明亮均匀的照明，最少阴影，通透地过曝三分之一档，乐观或无菌的未来感。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/064-high-key-brightness-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/high-key-064-high-key-brightness-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/high-key.jpg","r":[["Soft Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/soft-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/soft-light.webp","Beauty, memory, or kindness."],["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"高调布光"},"key-light":{"t":"Key Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/key-light","d":["A key light in key light cinematography is the principal source that sets the subject's dominant direction, shape, and exposure. Shadows fall away from it; every other light is measured against it.","主光（key light）在主光摄影中，是决定主体主导方向、形状和曝光的主要光源。阴影从它反方向落下；其他每一盏灯都以它为基准衡量。"],"pi":["Name the source and the side before any style word. \" Add height (high, eye, table), hardness, and Kelvin. If you only write dramatic lighting, the model invents two keys.","先说光源和方位，再说任何风格词。加上高度（高、眼平、桌面）、硬度和开尔文色温。如果你只写戏剧性照明，模型会凭空造出两个主光。"],"cp":["Strong directional key light on [Subject] from a single defined source, the brightest storyteller in the frame, shadows as composition.","强方向性主光照在[主体]上，来自单一明确光源，是画面中最亮的叙事者，阴影作为构图。"],"hp":["Strong directional key light on [Subject] from a single defined source, the brightest light in the frame, shadows placed as composition.","强方向性主光照在[主体]上，来自单一明确光源，是画面中最亮的光，阴影被安排成构图。"],"fq":["State one source, one side, hardness, and color. Example: hard tungsten key from camera left, 45 degrees off axis, no second key.","说明一个光源、一个方位、硬度和颜色。例如：摄影机左侧的硬钨丝主光，偏离轴线45度，没有第二主光。"],"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/key-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Fill Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/fill-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fill-light.webp","Control how much of the dark you can still read."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"主光"},"kicker":{"t":"Kicker","c":"lighting","g":"Kicker light","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/kicker","d":["A kicker light is a relatively hard side-back accent on cheek, jaw, shoulder, or an object edge, placed behind and to one side of the subject. It is a slice, not a full wrap and not a hair-only rim.","踢光（kicker light）是一种相对硬的侧后方强调光，打在脸颊、下颌、肩部或物体边缘，位于主体后方偏一侧。它是一道切片，不是完整包边，也不是只照发丝的发丝光。"],"pi":["Localize the highlight. Use: \"A small warm lamp behind and to the side of [Subject], a thin highlight on the far jaw and coat shoulder only. \" Name left or right. Keep the key on the other side.","把高光限定在局部。使用：“[主体]后方偏侧的一盏小暖灯，只在远侧下颌和大衣肩部有一道细高光。”说明左侧或右侧。主光保持在另一侧。"],"cp":["A small warm lamp behind and to the side of [Subject], a thin highlight on the far jaw and coat shoulder only. No beam shooting out of the body.","[主体]后方偏侧的一盏小暖灯，只在远侧下颌和大衣肩部有一道细高光。没有光束从身体里射出。"],"hp":["A small warm lamp behind and to the side of [Subject], a thin highlight on the far jaw and coat shoulder only. No beam shooting out of the body.","[主体]后方偏侧的一盏小暖灯，只在远侧下颌和大衣肩部有一道细高光。没有光束从身体里射出。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/kicker/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Rim Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rim-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rim-light.webp","Graphic silhouette with just enough flesh."],["Backlight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/backlight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/backlight-067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.webp","Separate a dark figure from a dark world."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"侧逆光"},"loop-lighting":{"t":"Loop Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/loop-lighting","d":["Loop lighting creates a small nose shadow that loops toward the corner of the mouth and does not connect to the cheek shadow. The key sits slightly off axis and a little high, a middle step between butterfly and Rembrandt.","环形光制造一小道鼻影，向嘴角方向弯成环形，且不与面颊阴影相连。主光略微偏离轴线、位置稍高，是蝴蝶光与伦勃朗光之间的中间档。"],"pi":["Name the loop and forbid the triangle. Use: \"Loop lighting on [Subject], key slightly off-axis, a small loop shadow from the nose toward the corner of the mouth.\" Add that the loop does not touch the cheek shadow.","点明环形光，并禁止三角光。使用：“[主体]上的环形光，主光略微偏离轴线，鼻影形成一道朝向嘴角的小环形阴影。”补充说明环形阴影不接触面颊阴影。"],"cp":["Loop lighting on [Subject], key slightly off-axis, a small loop shadow from the nose toward the corner of the mouth.","[主体]上的环形光，主光略微偏离轴线，鼻影形成一道朝向嘴角的小环形阴影。"],"hp":["Loop lighting on [Subject], key slightly off-axis, a small loop shadow from the nose toward the corner of the mouth.","[主体]上的环形光，主光略微偏离轴线，鼻影形成一道朝向嘴角的小环形阴影。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/loop-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Rembrandt Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rembrandt","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rembrandt.webp","Classic dramatic portrait."],["Butterfly Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/butterfly-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/butterfly-lighting.webp","Beauty lighting with structure."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"环形光"},"low-key":{"t":"Low-Key Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","d":["Low-key lighting, or low key lighting, uses high contrast, selective illumination, and substantial shadow so most of the frame can sit near black. One pool of light is often enough; the dark is designed, not an accident of underexposure.","低调光（low-key lighting）使用高反差、选择性照明和大量阴影，让画面大部分区域可以接近全黑。通常一束光就够；黑暗是设计出来的，而不是曝光不足的意外。"],"pi":["Name the pool and the black. \" Name the single source and forbid extra fill. Do not write moody if you have not placed the lamp.","写明那一小片光和黑。写明唯一的光源，禁止额外补光。如果你还没安排灯位，就不要写「阴郁」。"],"cp":["Low-key lighting on [Subject], most of the frame in deep shadow, one pool of light, 8:1 contrast, noir darkness as a character.","[主体] 的低调布光，画面大部分沉在深阴影中，只有一小片光，8:1 的光比，黑暗本身成为黑色电影里的一个角色。"],"hp":["Low-key lighting on [Subject], most of the frame in deep shadow, one pool of light, 8:1 contrast, darkness as a designed space.","[主体]上的低调光，画面大部分处于深阴影中，一束光，8:1 反差，黑暗作为被设计的空间。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/low-key/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Chiaroscuro","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/chiaroscuro","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/chiaroscuro-063-low-key-chiaroscuro-mini.webp","Light is moral. Darkness hides or judges."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"低调布光"},"motivated-lighting":{"t":"Motivated Lighting","c":"lighting","g":"Music source reveal","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/motivated-lighting","d":["Motivated lighting is designed to appear consistent with a visible or plausible story-world source: a window, a lamp, a sign, the sky. Hidden units may exist, but they match that source in direction, hardness, and color.","动机光的设计看上去与故事世界中可见或合理存在的光源一致：窗户、灯具、招牌、天空。可以有隐藏灯位，但它们要在方向、软硬和颜色上与该光源匹配。"],"pi":["Justify every beam. \" Name the story source, its side, hardness, and Kelvin. Forbid an unexplained frontal beauty key.","为每一束光找到依据。“说明故事中的光源、它在哪一侧、软硬和色温。禁止来路不明的正面美颜主光。”"],"cp":["A solemn traveler crosses an empty plaza accompanied by an original elegant string theme. Pan slowly to reveal a small string quartet following him on a wheeled platform, still playing the exact phrase. Their presence is treated matter-of-factly. Generate the visual reveal and synchronize an original performance in the edit.","一位神情庄重的旅人穿过空荡的广场，伴随一段原创的优雅弦乐主题。镜头缓缓摇开，露出一个坐在带轮平台上、跟随他行进的小型弦乐四重奏，仍在演奏同一乐句。他们的存在被当作理所当然。生成这一视觉揭示，并在剪辑中把原创演奏同步对齐。"],"hp":["Motivated lighting on [Subject], every source justified by a window, lamp, or sign that could exist in the room.","[主体]上的动机光，每一处光源都能由房间里可能存在的窗户、灯具或招牌解释。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/motivated-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Practical Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/practical-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/practical-lighting-065-practical-source-motivation-mini.webp","Let the set light the face."],["Available Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/available-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/available-light.webp","Commit to the hour you have."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"动机光"},"naturalistic-ambient":{"t":"Naturalistic Ambient","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/naturalistic-ambient","d":["Naturalistic ambient lighting wraps the subject in soft, directionally plausible room or sky tone so the craft reads as unstyled even when units are added. Shadows stay believable; nothing announces a movie lamp.","自然主义环境光用柔和、方向合理的室内或天光氛围包裹主体，即便加了灯，看上去也像未经打光。阴影保持可信；没有任何东西会让你看出这是电影灯。"],"pi":["Ask for room tone, not a named portrait pattern. \" Name a window side. Forbid hair lights and hard kickers.","要求环境光氛围，而不是点名某种人像光型。“指定窗户在哪一侧。禁止发丝光和硬轮廓光。”"],"cp":["Naturalistic ambient wrap on [Subject], soft room tone, believable shadow, window-motivated without theatricality.","[主体]上的自然主义环境包裹光，柔和的环境光氛围，可信的阴影，以窗户为动机而不带戏剧化处理。"],"hp":["Naturalistic ambient wrap on [Subject], soft room tone, believable shadow, window-motivated without theatricality.","[主体]上的自然主义环境包裹光，柔和的环境光氛围，可信的阴影，以窗户为动机而不带戏剧化处理。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/naturalistic-ambient/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Soft Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/soft-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/soft-light.webp","Beauty, memory, or kindness."],["Available Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/available-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/available-light.webp","Commit to the hour you have."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"自然环境光"},"neon-practical":{"t":"Neon Practicals","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","d":["Neon practicals are visible neon or similar sign tubes used as actual keys or strong accents, coloring the subject with magenta, cyan, or other tube hues instead of a hidden white source. The city fixture is the lamp.","霓虹实景光源是把画面中可见的霓虹灯或类似灯管用作真正的主光或强烈点缀，用洋红、青色或其他灯管色给主体上色，而不是靠隐藏的白光光源。城市里的灯箱本身就是灯。"],"pi":["Make the signs the keys. \" Name which tube hits which cheek. Forbid a white beauty key.","让招牌本身成为主光。写明哪根灯管打在谁的哪边脸颊上。禁止白色的美颜主光。"],"cp":["Neon practicals coloring [Subject], magenta and cyan signs as real keys, wet bounce, mixed gels, night-city chromatics.","霓虹实景光染在 [主体] 上，品红与青色招牌作为真实主光，湿地反光，混合色纸，夜城的色彩学。"],"hp":["Neon practicals coloring [Subject], magenta and cyan signs as real keys, wet bounce, mixed gels, night-city chromatics.","霓虹实景光源为[主体]上色，洋红与青色招牌作为真正的主光，湿地面反射，混合色纸，夜城市的色彩关系。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/neon-practical/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Practical Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/practical-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/practical-lighting-065-practical-source-motivation-mini.webp","Let the set light the face."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."],["Key Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/key-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/key-light.webp","Decide where the world is lit from. Everything else follows."]],"z":"霓虹实景光"},"practical-lighting":{"t":"Practical Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/practical-lighting","d":["Practical lighting uses a visible or logically present light source within the set as a real contributor: lamps, neon, candles, screens. You see the fixture, and it (or a unit matching it) actually lights the face.","实景光源照明把场景中可见或逻辑上存在的光源当作真正的照明贡献者：灯具、霓虹、蜡烛、屏幕。你看到那件灯具，而它（或与之匹配的灯位）确实在给脸打光。"],"pi":["Show the lamp and let it work. Use: \"Practical lighting on [Subject] from visible lamps, neon, candles, or screens in frame, mixed color temperatures, no hidden movie lights.\" Name which fixture is the key and its color.","把灯拍进画面，让它发挥作用。使用：“[主体]上的实景光源照明，来自画面中可见的灯具、霓虹、蜡烛或屏幕，混合色温，没有隐藏的电影灯。”指明哪件灯具是主光以及它的颜色。"],"cp":["Practical lighting on [Subject] from visible lamps, neon, candles, or screens in frame, mixed color temperatures, no hidden movie lights.","[主体]上的实景光源照明，来自画面中可见的灯具、霓虹、蜡烛或屏幕，混合色温，没有隐藏的电影灯。"],"hp":["Practical lighting on [Subject] from visible lamps, neon, candles, or screens in frame, mixed color temperatures, no hidden movie lights.","[主体]上的实景光源照明，来自画面中可见的灯具、霓虹、蜡烛或屏幕，混合色温，没有隐藏的电影灯。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/065-practical-source-motivation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/practical-lighting-065-practical-source-motivation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/practical-lighting.jpg","r":[["Motivated Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/motivated-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/motivated-lighting.webp","Realism with control. Light like a world, not a studio."],["Candlelight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/candlelight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/candlelight-066-candlelit-naturalism-mini.webp","Period night or ritual."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"实景光源"},"rembrandt":{"t":"Rembrandt Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rembrandt","d":["Rembrandt lighting, in rembrandt lighting terms, is a portrait pattern in which the key sits high and about 45 degrees off axis so the nose shadow joins the shadow cheek, leaving a small triangle of light under the shadow-side eye. The rest of that cheek stays dark.","伦勃朗光是一种人像光型：主光位置偏高，约偏离轴线 45 度，使鼻影与暗侧脸颊的阴影连成一片，在暗侧眼睛下方留下一小块三角形光斑。该脸颊的其余部分保持暗部。"],"pi":["Demand the triangle by name. \" Say the nose shadow connects to the cheek shadow. Forbid a half-and-half split.","直接点名要求三角光。“说明鼻影与面颊阴影相连。禁止对半分的明暗分割。”"],"cp":["Key light high and 45 degrees on [Subject], the near cheek in light, a small triangle of light on the shadow-side cheek, the rest of that cheek dark.","[主体]上主光偏高、45 度，近侧脸颊受光，暗侧脸颊上有一小块三角形光斑，该脸颊其余部分处于暗部。"],"hp":["Key light high and 45 degrees on [Subject], the near cheek in light, a small triangle of light on the shadow-side cheek, the rest of that cheek dark.","[主体]上主光偏高、45 度，近侧脸颊受光，暗侧脸颊上有一小块三角形光斑，该脸颊其余部分处于暗部。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/rembrandt/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Loop Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/loop-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/loop-lighting.webp","Natural portrait that is still shaped."],["Chiaroscuro","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/chiaroscuro","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/chiaroscuro-063-low-key-chiaroscuro-mini.webp","Light is moral. Darkness hides or judges."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"伦勃朗光"},"rim-light":{"t":"Rim Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rim-light","d":["Rim lighting is a narrow edge of light, usually from a flagged backlight, that separates a subject from the background without opening the face. The highlight sits on brim, hair, and coat; flesh stays mostly dark.","轮廓光是一道狭窄的边缘光，通常来自加了遮光板的逆光，把主体与背景分开，而不把脸部照亮。高光落在帽檐、头发和大衣上；皮肤大部分保持暗部。"],"pi":["Forbid the cartoon stroke. Use: \"Photographic backlight on [Subject] from behind, a thin natural highlight on hat brim, hair, and coat edge, faces staying dark. \" Name one rear lamp. Keep skin exposure low.","禁止卡通式的描边。使用：“从后方给[主体]打的摄影感逆光，帽檐、头发和大衣边缘有一道纤细自然的高光，脸部保持暗部。”指定一盏后方灯。让皮肤曝光保持偏低。"],"cp":["Photographic backlight on [Subject] from behind, a thin natural highlight on hat brim, hair, and coat edge, faces staying dark. Not a neon outline.","从后方给[主体]打的摄影感逆光，帽檐、头发和大衣边缘有一道纤细自然的高光，脸部保持暗部。不是霓虹描边。"],"hp":["Photographic backlight on [Subject] from behind, a thin natural highlight on hat brim, hair, and coat edge, faces staying dark. Not a neon outline.","从后方给[主体]打的摄影感逆光，帽檐、头发和大衣边缘有一道纤细自然的高光，脸部保持暗部。不是霓虹描边。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/rim-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Backlight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/backlight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/backlight-067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.webp","Separate a dark figure from a dark world."],["Kicker","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/kicker","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/kicker.webp","Add a slice of glamour or menace on the far side."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"轮廓光"},"short-lighting":{"t":"Short Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/short-lighting","d":["Short lighting in short lighting terms keys the side of the face turned away from camera, so the camera sees more shadow than light. The head looks slimmer and more dimensional because the near cheek falls off.","窄面光（short lighting）把主光打在背向镜头的那侧脸上，因此镜头看到的阴影多于亮部。由于靠近镜头的脸颊落入暗部，头部显得更瘦、更有立体感。"],"pi":["Name which cheek is near. Use: \"Short lighting on [Subject], the side turned away from camera is keyed, the near side falls toward shadow, slimming and dramatic.\" Add that the camera-facing cheek is the darker one.","指明哪侧脸颊靠近镜头。使用：“[主体]上的窄面光，背向镜头的一侧受主光，靠近镜头的一侧落向阴影，显瘦而具戏剧性。”补充说明朝向镜头的那侧脸颊是较暗的一侧。"],"cp":["Short lighting on [Subject], the side turned away from camera is keyed, the near side falls toward shadow, slimming and dramatic.","[主体]上的窄面光，背向镜头的一侧受主光，靠近镜头的一侧落向阴影，显瘦而具戏剧性。"],"hp":["Short lighting on [Subject], the side turned away from camera is keyed, the near side falls toward shadow, slimming and dramatic.","[主体]上的窄面光，背向镜头的一侧受主光，靠近镜头的一侧落向阴影，显瘦而具戏剧性。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/short-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Broad Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/broad-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/broad-lighting.webp","Open, readable, less mystery."],["Rembrandt Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rembrandt","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rembrandt.webp","Classic dramatic portrait."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"窄面光"},"side-lighting":{"t":"Side Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/side-lighting","d":["Side lighting keys primarily from one side, around 90 degrees to the camera-subject line, so shape and texture are emphasized. Half the form goes toward light, half toward shadow.","侧光主要从一侧打主光，约与摄影机—主体连线成 90 度，从而强调形状与质感。形体一半向光、一半向影。"],"pi":["Put the lamp at 90 degrees. \" Name hardness. Say whether the body or only the face is raked.","把灯放在 90 度位置。写明软硬程度。说明是身体还是只有脸被侧光照到。"],"cp":["Pure side light at 90 degrees on [Subject], half the face brilliant, half gone, texture and duality.","[主体] 上 90 度的纯侧光，半张脸明亮，半张脸隐没，质感与双重性。"],"hp":["Pure side light at 90 degrees on [Subject], half the face brilliant, half gone, texture and duality.","[主体]上 90 度的纯侧光，脸一半明亮、一半隐没，质感与二元性。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/side-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Split Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/split-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-lighting.webp","Duality made literal."],["Cross Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/cross-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-lighting.webp","Stage, sweat, or two moral sources."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"侧光"},"silhouette":{"t":"Silhouette","c":"lighting","g":"Shape-led composition","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/silhouette","d":["A silhouette shot places the subject dark against a brighter background so the figure reads as shape, not as a modeled face. Gesture and contour do the work; surface detail is gone.","剪影镜头让主体以暗部呈现在更亮的背景前，使人物读作形状，而不是有立体塑形的脸。手势和轮廓承担表达；表面细节消失。"],"pi":["Expose the ground, starve the body. \" Name a readable outline (limbs separated). Forbid facial detail and neon rims.","让地面正常曝光，让身体欠曝。“指定清晰可读的轮廓（四肢分开）。禁止面部细节和霓虹轮廓光。”"],"cp":["A parent and child carry a small telescope up a ridge at dusk, rendered as clean dark silhouettes against a luminous pale sky. Keep their limbs and the telescope distinct. Locked wide view, gentle wind, no visible facial detail or artificial rim halo.","黄昏时分，一位家长和一个孩子带着小望远镜走上山脊，在明亮苍白的天空前呈现为干净深色的剪影。保持他们的四肢和望远镜轮廓分明。固定广角镜头，微风，无可见面部细节或人工轮廓光晕。"],"hp":["Silhouette of [Subject] as a dark shape against a bright ground, surface detail gone, mythic outline only.","[主体] 在明亮背景前呈暗色形状的剪影，表面细节消失，仅保留神话般轮廓。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/049-silhouette-as-graphic-storytelling-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/silhouette-049-silhouette-as-graphic-storytelling-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/silhouette.jpg","r":[["Backlight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/backlight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/backlight-067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.webp","Separate a dark figure from a dark world."],["Rim Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rim-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rim-light.webp","Graphic silhouette with just enough flesh."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"剪影"},"soft-light":{"t":"Soft Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/soft-light","d":["Soft light in soft light cinematography comes from a large apparent source and produces gradual shadow transitions and wrap around the face or body. Speculars get larger and dimmer; texture is reduced.","柔光摄影中的柔光来自一个看起来很大的光源，产生渐变的阴影过渡，并包裹脸部或身体。高光反射更大、更暗；纹理被削弱。"],"pi":["Name a large source and gentle edges. \" Keep a key side. Forbid razor nose shadows.","写明大面积光源和柔和的边缘。保持一个主光方向。禁止鼻子投下刀锋般的影子。"],"cp":["Soft wrapping light on [Subject] from a large source, gentle shadow transitions, luminous skin, Vermeer daylight.","[主体] 上柔和包裹的光，来自大面积光源，阴影过渡平缓，皮肤透亮，维米尔式的日光。"],"hp":["Soft wrapping light on [Subject] from a large source, gentle shadow transitions, luminous skin, north-window daylight.","来自大光源的柔光包裹 [主体]，阴影过渡柔和，皮肤通透，北窗日光。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/soft-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Bounce Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/bounce-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bounce-light.webp","Soften without losing direction."],["Window Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/window-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/window-light.webp","Day interiors without looking lit."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"柔光"},"split-lighting":{"t":"Split Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/split-lighting","d":["Split lighting divides the face into a lit half and a shadow half by placing the key at about 90 degrees to the nose, a vertical cut down the center line. There is no Rembrandt triangle and no loop; the far plane is largely gone.","分割光把脸分成亮的一半和阴影的一半：将主光放在与鼻子约 90 度的位置，沿中线形成垂直切分。没有伦勃朗三角光，也没有环形光；远侧平面基本消失。"],"pi":["Demand the vertical cut. Use: \"Split lighting on [Subject], one half of the face in light, the other in shadow, a vertical moral cut.\" Add key at 90 degrees, almost no fill, no triangle on the dark cheek.","要求垂直切分。使用：“[主体] 上的分割光，脸的一半在光中，另一半在阴影中，一道垂直的道德切口。”在 90 度位置加主光，几乎不加辅光，暗侧脸颊没有三角形光斑。"],"cp":["Split lighting on [Subject], one half of the face in light, the other in shadow, a vertical moral cut.","[主体] 上的分割光，脸的一半在光中，另一半在阴影中，一道垂直的道德切口。"],"hp":["Split lighting on [Subject], one half of the face in light, the other in shadow, a vertical moral cut.","[主体] 上的分割光，脸的一半在光中，另一半在阴影中，一道垂直的道德切口。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/split-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Side Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/side-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/side-lighting.webp","Carve a face like sculpture."],["Short Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/short-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/short-lighting.webp","Sculpt a face; add mystery on the camera side."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"分割光"},"spotlight":{"t":"Spotlight","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/spotlight","d":["A spotlight in spotlight cinematography is a focused, hard-edged pool from a theatrical or similar instrument, with darkness around the circle. The person is treated as an act inside that pool.","聚光灯摄影中的聚光灯是一束来自剧场灯具或类似设备的聚焦、硬边光池，圆形光斑周围是黑暗。人物被当作光池内的一场表演来处理。"],"pi":["Demand a hard pool and a dark surround. \" Mention a visible circle or shuttered edge. Forbid a large soft wrap.","要求硬质光池和四周黑暗。“提到可见的圆形或带遮光切边的边缘。禁止大面积柔光包裹。”"],"cp":["Spotlight on [Subject], a hard pool, theater darkness around, the person as an act.","[主体] 上的聚光灯，硬质光池，四周剧场式黑暗，人物像一场表演。"],"hp":["Spotlight on [Subject], a hard pool, theater darkness around, the person as an act.","[主体] 上的聚光灯，硬质光池，四周剧场式黑暗，人物像一场表演。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/spotlight/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Cameo Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/cameo-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cameo-lighting.webp","Erase the world. Keep the person."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"聚光灯"},"three-point-lighting":{"t":"Three-Point Lighting","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","d":["Three-point lighting, the basic three point lighting setup, places a key, a fill, and a backlight so a face is modeled from one dominant side, opened in the shadows, and separated from the background. The key is brightest and sets direction; fill and back exist only as ratios against it.","三点布光，即基本的三点布光设置，放置主光、辅光和逆光，使脸部由一个主导方向塑形、阴影被打开，并与背景分离。主光最亮并设定方向；辅光和逆光只作为相对于主光的比例存在。"],"pi":["Name all three jobs, not the word portrait. \" Add key side (left or right), fill ratio, and backlight color. Do not write a mood word in place of the three positions.","把三个灯位各自的职能写全，而不是只写「人像」这个词。补上主光在左还是右、辅光比例、轮廓光的颜色。不要用情绪词代替这三个位置。"],"cp":["Classic three-point lighting on [Subject]: key at 45 degrees, soft fill opening shadows, warm backlight rim, sculpted dimensionality.","[主体] 上的经典三点布光：主光 45 度，柔和辅光打开阴影，暖色轮廓光勾边，立体感被塑造出来。"],"hp":["Classic three-point lighting on [Subject]: key at 45 degrees, soft fill opening shadows, warm backlight rim, modeled volume.","经典三点布光打在 [主体] 上：主光在 45 度，柔辅光打开阴影，暖逆光勾边，塑造体积。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/three-point-lighting/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Key Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/key-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/key-light.webp","Decide where the world is lit from. Everything else follows."],["Fill Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/fill-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fill-light.webp","Control how much of the dark you can still read."],["Backlight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/backlight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/backlight-067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.webp","Separate a dark figure from a dark world."]],"z":"三点布光"},"top-light":{"t":"Top Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/top-light","d":["Top lighting is illumination from directly above the subject, falling on forehead, nose bridge, and shoulders while the eye sockets and the underside of the chin go into shadow. The source is a ceiling, a rig, or a high practical, not a frontal beauty key.","顶光是从主体正上方来的照明，落在额头、鼻梁和肩膀上，而眼窝和下巴下方进入阴影。光源来自天花板、灯架或高处实景光源，而不是正面美颜主光。"],"pi":["Put the lamp on the ceiling axis. Use: \"A lamp directly above [Subject], light falling on forehead and shoulders, eye sockets in shadow, human eyes, no light emitting from the pupils.\" Forbid frontal beauty fill.","把灯放在天花板轴线上。使用：“一盏灯直接在 [主体] 上方，光照在额头和肩膀上，眼窝落在阴影中，人类眼睛，瞳孔不发光。”禁止正面美颜辅光。"],"cp":["A lamp directly above [Subject], light falling on forehead and shoulders, eye sockets in shadow, human eyes, no light emitting from the pupils.","一盏灯直接在 [主体] 上方，光照在额头和肩膀上，眼窝落在阴影中，人类眼睛，瞳孔不发光。"],"hp":["A lamp directly above [Subject], light falling on forehead and shoulders, eye sockets in shadow, human eyes, no light emitting from the pupils.","一盏灯直接在 [主体] 上方，光照在额头和肩膀上，眼窝落在阴影中，人类眼睛，瞳孔不发光。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/top-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["Underlighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/under-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/under-light.webp","The source is fire, a screen on the floor, or a monster."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"顶光"},"under-light":{"t":"Underlighting","c":"lighting","g":"uplighting","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/under-light","d":["Underlighting, also called uplighting, lights from below the face so shadows climb the cheekbones and the tops of the eye sockets. The modeling is the reverse of daylight and often reads as uncanny.","底光，也叫下打光，从脸下方照明，因此阴影爬上颧骨和眼窝上部。塑形方向与日光相反，常显得诡异不安。"],"pi":["Put the source under the chin. Use: \"A lamp on the table below [Subject]'s chin, pointing up. Shadows climb the cheekbones and eye sockets. \" Name fire, screen, or bulb.","把光源放到下巴下方。使用：“桌上一盏灯在 [主体] 下巴下方，向上照。阴影爬上颧骨和眼窝。”指明是火光、屏幕光还是灯泡。"],"cp":["A lamp on the table below [Subject]'s chin, pointing up. Shadows climb the cheekbones and eye sockets. The source is under the face, not beside it.","桌上一盏灯在 [主体] 下巴下方，向上照。阴影爬上颧骨和眼窝。光源在脸下方，而不是旁边。"],"hp":["A lamp on the table below [Subject]'s chin, pointing up. Shadows climb the cheekbones and eye sockets.","桌上一盏灯在 [主体] 下巴下方，向上照。阴影爬上颧骨和眼窝。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/under-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Top Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/top-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/top-light.webp","Power sitting in a chair, or guilt."],["Candlelight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/candlelight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/candlelight-066-candlelit-naturalism-mini.webp","Period night or ritual."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"底光"},"volumetric-light":{"t":"Volumetric Light","c":"lighting","g":"god rays","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/volumetric-light","d":["Volumetric lighting makes beams visible through haze, fog, dust, smoke, or other particles, so the air photographs as well as the subject. Also called god rays or crepuscular rays when the shafts are distinct.","体积光让光束通过雾霭、雾、尘埃、烟或其他颗粒变得可见，因此空气和主体一样被拍下来。当光柱分明时，也叫耶稣光或曙暮辉光。"],"pi":["Name source plus medium. \" Attach every beam to a window, sun, or searchlight. Forbid disconnected glowing stripes.","指明光源加介质。“让每道光束都附着于窗户、太阳或探照灯。禁止无来由的发光条纹。”"],"cp":["Volumetric god rays through haze around [Subject], visible beams, dust in the shaft, cathedral or forest light as architecture.","[主体] 周围穿过雾霭的体积耶稣光，可见光束，光柱中有尘埃，教堂或森林光线如建筑。"],"hp":["Volumetric rays through haze around [Subject], visible beams, dust in the shaft, cathedral or forest light as architecture.","穿过 [主体] 周围雾霭的体积光束，可见光束，光柱中有尘埃，教堂或森林光线如建筑。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/volumetric-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Atmospheric Haze","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/haze","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/haze.webp","Show kilometers, not just meters."],["Backlight","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/backlight","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/backlight-067-hard-backlight-through-atmosphere-mini.webp","Separate a dark figure from a dark world."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"体积光"},"window-light":{"t":"Window Light","c":"lighting","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/window-light","d":["Window light in window light cinematography is illumination shaped to appear as light entering through a window: a large, directional source with falloff into the room. The architecture is the modifier.","窗户光摄影中的窗户光是塑造成像从窗户照进来的照明：一个大而柔的方向性光源，向室内衰减。建筑结构就是修饰器。"],"pi":["Make the window the only key. Use: \"Window light as the only key on [Subject], large soft directional source, falloff into the room, painterly interior.\" Name which wall holds the glass and whether the sky is overcast or late sun.","让窗户成为唯一主光。使用：“窗户光作为 [主体] 的唯一主光，大而柔的方向性光源，向室内衰减，绘画感室内。”说明哪面墙有玻璃，以及天空是阴天还是夕阳。"],"cp":["Window light as the only key on [Subject], large soft directional source, falloff into the room, painterly interior.","窗户光作为 [主体] 的唯一主光，大而柔的方向性光源，向室内衰减，绘画感室内。"],"hp":["Window light as the only key on [Subject], large soft directional source, falloff into the room, painterly interior.","窗户光作为 [主体] 的唯一主光，大而柔的方向性光源，向室内衰减，绘画感室内。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/window-light/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Soft Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/soft-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/soft-light.webp","Beauty, memory, or kindness."],["Motivated Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/motivated-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/motivated-lighting.webp","Realism with control. Light like a world, not a studio."],["Three-Point Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/three-point-lighting","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/three-point-lighting.webp","Teachable portrait. Start here, then break it."]],"z":"窗光"},"boomerang":{"t":"Boomerang","c":"time-and-motion","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/boomerang","d":["A boomerang video effect plays a short action forward, then snaps it backward along the same samples, often looping. The gesture comes and goes on one path: reversed playback used as a round trip rather than a one-way undo.","回旋镖视频效果把一段短动作正向播放，然后沿同一批样本反向弹回，通常会循环。手势在同一条路径上来回：反向播放被用作往返，而不是单向撤销。"],"pi":["Write the round trip. Still: the mid-gesture peak, because a still cannot boomerang. Video: [Subject] plays forward then reverses along the same motion, a seamless boomerang loop. Same path, no new action on the way back, no one-way reverse.","写出往返过程。静帧：动作中段的峰值，因为静帧不能回旋镖。视频：[主体] 沿同一动作正向播放再反向播放，形成无缝回旋镖循环。同一路径，返回时没有新动作，不是单向倒放。"],"cp":["[Subject] plays forward then reverses along the same motion, a seamless boomerang loop.","[主体] 沿同一动作正向播放再反向播放，形成无缝回旋镖循环。"],"hp":["Boomerang of [Subject], action running forward then snapping backward on the same path, a loop of coming and going.","[主体] 的回旋镖，动作沿同一路径正向播放再反向弹回，来来去去的循环。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/02-boomerang-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/boomerang-02-boomerang-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/boomerang.jpg","r":[["Infinite Loop","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/infinite-loop","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/infinite-loop-126-time-loop-with-evolving-behavior-mini.webp","Duration without progress."],["Reverse Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/reverse-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reverse-motion-085-reverse-motion-image-mini.webp","Magic, grief, or a world with inverted physics."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"回旋镖"},"bullet-time":{"t":"Bullet Time","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Time-slice orbit","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/bullet-time","d":["Bullet time freezes or radically slows action while the viewpoint travels around it, decoupling camera speed from subject time. The instant becomes inspectable space: a time-slice orbit around a sculpture of speed, not ordinary slow motion with a handheld camera.","子弹时间会冻结或极度减慢动作，同时视点环绕它移动，使摄影机速度与主体时间解耦。瞬间变成可检视的空间：环绕速度雕塑的时间切片轨道，而不是手持摄影机的普通慢动作。"],"pi":["Write two clocks: action stopped or crushed, camera continuing on a path. Still: one instant seen as if from a step along an orbit, hanging debris, consistent anatomy. Video: Time freezes around [Subject] while the camera orbits, a bullet-time array move. No handheld slow-mo, no lock-off freeze.","写两个时钟：动作停止或被极度压缩，摄影机继续沿一条路径运动。静帧：一个瞬间，仿佛从环绕轨道上的某一步看去，悬停的碎片，解剖结构一致。视频：时间在[主体]周围冻结，而摄影机环绕，一次子弹时间阵列运动。不要手持慢动作，不要固定机位冻结。"],"cp":["A dancer is suspended at the peak of a leap while loose paper hangs around her. The camera moves smoothly through a 90-degree arc at normal viewing speed while the leap advances only slightly. Consistent anatomy, rigid paper shapes, coherent shadows, no repeated body limbs. Build with multi-view keyframes or 3D for control.","一名舞者在跳跃的最高点悬停，散落的纸张环绕她悬停。摄影机以正常观看速度平滑穿过 90 度弧线，而跳跃只略微推进。解剖结构一致，纸张形状刚性，阴影连贯，没有重复的肢体。用多视角关键帧或 3D 构建以控制。"],"hp":["Bullet time around [Subject], the moment frozen while the camera orbits, a slice of time as a sculpture.","环绕[主体]的子弹时间，瞬间冻结而摄影机环绕，一片时间如雕塑。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/080-bullet-time-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bullet-time-080-bullet-time-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/bullet-time.jpg","r":[["360-Degree Orbit","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/orbit-360","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbit-360-007-orbit-around-a-subject-mini.webp","Time collapses around one person: kiss, threat, or product hero."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."]],"z":"子弹时间"},"fast-motion":{"t":"Fast Motion","c":"time-and-motion","g":"undercranking","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","d":["Fast motion cinematography compresses screen duration so action plays faster than it occurred, by undercranking the camera or by retiming a normal-rate take. Crowds smear, clouds race, and labor can look absurdly efficient because too many events occupy too little time.","快动作摄影压缩银幕时长，使动作播放得比实际发生更快，通过降格拍摄摄影机或对正常速率镜头重新定时实现。人群拖影，云朵飞奔，劳动可以显得荒谬地高效，因为太多事件占据了太少时间。"],"pi":["State that time is compressed and what races. Still: a pose that implies acceleration (smeared extras, streaked traffic) while the subject, if they must stay readable, holds. Video: Fast-motion view of [Subject] and the environment, time compressed, crowds and weather racing, coherent hands and footsteps, not a motionless sun over a smoking crowd.","说明时间被压缩，以及什么在飞奔。静帧：一个暗示加速的姿势（拖影的群众演员、拖成光条的交通），而主体，如果必须保持可读，则保持清晰。视频：[主体]与环境的快动作视角，时间被压缩，人群与天气飞奔，手部和脚步连贯，不是静止的太阳悬在冒烟的人群上方。"],"cp":["A harried mailroom worker sorts envelopes in slightly accelerated motion while maintaining physically coherent hand actions. Fixed medium-wide view, increasingly comic efficiency, no teleporting objects or time-lapse crowd trails. Retime a clean base shot if exact cadence is required.","一名焦头烂额的邮件室员工以略微加速的动作分拣信封，同时保持物理上连贯的手部动作。固定中远景，越来越滑稽的高效，没有瞬移物体或延时人群拖影。如果要求精确节奏，对干净的基础镜头重新定时。"],"hp":["Undercranked fast motion of [Subject], crowds smearing, clouds racing, planned speed ratio, coherent contacts.","[主体]的降格快动作，人群拖影，云朵飞奔，计划好的速度比，接触连贯。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/078-accelerated-action-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/fast-motion.jpg","r":[["Time-Lapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/time-lapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/time-lapse-084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.webp","Show weather, construction, or a night becoming morning."],["Hyperlapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/hyperlapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hyperlapse-hyperlapse-mini.webp","Show duration as velocity."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"快动作"},"freeze-frame":{"t":"Freeze Frame","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Pre-existing song placement","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/freeze-frame","d":["A freeze frame holds one image so narrative time stops while camera, subject, and world all cease to generate new samples. The hold can end a story, land a joke, or present a face as evidence.","定格帧保持一个画面，使叙事时间停止，同时摄影机、主体和世界都停止生成新样本。这次定格可以结束一个故事、落下一个笑话，或把一张脸作为证据呈现。"],"pi":["Write a hold, not a slow pose. Still: the chosen frame as a photograph with grain, a decisive expression or body shape, no implied smear. Video: Action around [Subject] freezes into a still frame and holds. Camera stops. No orbit, no hanging debris that later falls.","写一次定格，而不是慢姿势。静帧：所选画面如一张带颗粒的照片，决定性表情或身体形态，没有暗示的拖影。视频：[主体]周围的动作冻结为静帧并保持。摄影机停止。不要环绕，不要之后掉落的悬停碎片。"],"cp":["Edit a group of exhausted friends leaving an all-night diner at sunrise to an original energetic rock cue. Let the first strong beat land on the door opening, then allow the song to continue over several distinct street moments. Use a newly composed track, not a replica of an existing film song.","把一群筋疲力尽的朋友在日出时离开通宵餐厅的画面剪辑到一首原创有活力的摇滚提示音乐上。让第一个强拍落在开门上，然后让歌曲继续贯穿几个不同的街头时刻。使用新创作的曲目，而不是现有电影歌曲的复制品。"],"hp":["Freeze frame on [Subject], the world stopping on a decisive pose, grain holding, a still torn out of time.","在[主体]上定格，世界停在一个决定性姿势上，颗粒保持，一张从时间中撕下的静帧。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/082-freeze-frame-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/freeze-frame-082-freeze-frame-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/freeze-frame.jpg","r":[["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Tableau","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/tableau","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/tableau.webp","Hold the arrangement."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."]],"z":"定格画面"},"frozen-in-motion":{"t":"Frozen in Motion","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Time-stop environment","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/frozen-in-motion","d":["Frozen in motion stops the environment and most people while a chosen character, the viewpoint, or both continue to move. Particles, extras, and pigeons hang, and the rule of who may move is the entire effect.","运动中冻结会停止环境和大多数人，而选定角色、视点或两者继续移动。粒子、群众演员和鸽子悬停，而谁可以移动的规则就是整个效果。"],"pi":["Name who moves. Still: one active subject in a square of frozen pedestrians and hanging debris. Video: Action around [Subject] freezes mid-move while [Subject] and/or the camera may still travel. Coherent suspended poses, no breathing crowds, no racing extras, no array orbit unless you actually want bullet time.","指明谁在移动。静帧：一个活跃主体处于冻结行人和悬停碎片构成的方阵中。视频：[主体]周围的动作在运动中冻结，而[主体]和/或摄影机仍可移动。悬停姿势连贯，不要呼吸的人群，不要飞奔的群众演员，不要阵列环绕，除非你确实想要子弹时间。"],"cp":["A woman walks through a city square where all other people are motionless mid-gesture and pigeons hang in the air. Only she, her clothing and the following camera move. Coherent suspended poses, no breathing crowds, no melting birds, quiet suspended mood.","一名女子走过城市广场，那里所有其他人都定格在动作中途，鸽子悬在空中。只有她、她的衣物和跟随摄影机在移动。悬停姿势连贯，不要呼吸的人群，不要融化的鸟，安静悬停的氛围。"],"hp":["Frozen-in-motion of [Subject], the world stopped mid-gesture, particles hanging, [Subject] or the camera still allowed to move.","[主体]的运动中冻结，世界停在动作中途，粒子悬停，[主体]或摄影机仍可移动。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/081-frozen-world-with-a-moving-viewpoint-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frozen-in-motion-081-frozen-world-with-a-moving-viewpoint-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/frozen-in-motion.jpg","r":[["Bullet Time","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/bullet-time","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/bullet-time-080-bullet-time-mini.webp","A moment is so important it becomes architecture."],["Freeze Frame","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/freeze-frame","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/freeze-frame-082-freeze-frame-mini.webp","End, joke, or evidence."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"动态冻结"},"infinite-loop":{"t":"Infinite Loop","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Repeated day","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/infinite-loop","d":["An infinite loop video sews the last frame to the first so motion never arrives at an ending. The cycle can be a seamless visual join, or, in narrative use, a repeated day whose variables change.","无限循环视频把最后一帧缝到第一帧，使运动永远不抵达结局。循环可以是无缝视觉衔接，或者在叙事用法中，是变量改变的同一天重复。"],"pi":["Say whether you want a seamless visual sew or a repeated-day story. Still: a pose that could be both start and end. Video: A seamless loop of [Subject], end matching start, no cut visible. Forward motion unless you explicitly want a boomerang.","说明你想要无缝视觉缝合，还是重复一天的故事。静帧：一个既可以作开始也可以作结束的姿势。视频：[主体]的无缝循环，结尾与开始匹配，看不到剪切。除非明确想要回旋镖效果，否则用正向运动。"],"cp":["Design three repetitions of a commuter’s morning: the same alarm, dropped coin and departing bus. In each cycle she changes one decision, producing a different encounter. Reuse matched camera positions and reset sounds. Generate the baseline once, then controlled variations with stable people and geography.","设计通勤者早晨的三次重复：同样的闹钟、掉落的硬币和驶离的公交车。在每个循环中，她改变一个决定，产生不同的相遇。复用匹配的摄影机位置和重置声音。生成一次基准，然后用稳定的人物和地理做受控变化。"],"hp":["Infinite loop of [Subject], the last frame sewing to the first, a motion that never arrives.","[主体]的无限循环，最后一帧缝到第一帧，一种永远不抵达的运动。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/126-time-loop-with-evolving-behavior-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/infinite-loop-126-time-loop-with-evolving-behavior-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/infinite-loop.jpg","r":[["Boomerang","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/boomerang","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/boomerang-02-boomerang-mini.webp","Turn a gesture into a toy."],["Cinemagraph","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/cinemagraph","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cinemagraph-cinemagraph-mini.webp","A photograph that refuses to die."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"无限循环"},"long-take":{"t":"Long Take","c":"time-and-motion","g":"plan sequence","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/long-take","d":["Long take cinematography is an unusually extended shot that preserves continuous performance, space, action, or duration without an overt cut. Blocking and camera share one sentence so the audience cannot leave the room.","长镜头摄影是一个异常延长的镜头，在没有明显剪辑的情况下保持连续的表演、空间、动作或时长。调度与摄影机共享一个句子，使观众无法离开房间。"],"pi":["Write unbroken duration and what happens in depth. Still: a wide ensemble with a readable route, not proof of a take. Video: An unbroken long take following [Subject] through the space with no cut. Name foreground, midground, and background actions on one timeline.","写出不间断的时长和纵深里发生的事。静帧：一个路线可读的宽幅群像，而不是「长镜头」的证明。视频：一个不间断的长镜头跟随 [主体] 穿过空间，不切。写明前景、中景、后景在一条时间线上各自发生的动作。"],"cp":["Follow a harbor nurse through an improvised waiting area after a storm. In one flowing shot, pass people playing cards, repairing a radio, tending injuries and staring silently at the sea. No disaster spectacle; distinct actions continue independently in depth. Keep the nurse as a loose visual anchor.","风暴之后，跟随一名港口护士穿过临时安置区。用一个流动的长镜头经过打牌的人、修收音机的人、处理伤口的人和沉默望着海的人。不要灾难奇观；各个动作在纵深里各自独立地继续。让护士作为一条松散的视觉锚线。"],"hp":["Long take covering [Subject] without a cut, duration as tension, blocking and camera choreographed as one sentence.","长镜头覆盖[主体]而不剪切，时长作为张力，调度与摄影机编排成一句话。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/031-genuine-feature-length-continuous-take-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/long-take-031-genuine-feature-length-continuous-take-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/long-take.jpg","r":[["Oner","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/one-er","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-er-026-social-access-tracking-oner-mini.webp","The scene is a ride."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"长镜头"},"low-shutter":{"t":"Low Shutter","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Crisp motion cadence","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/low-shutter","d":["Low shutter cinematography uses a short shutter angle or short exposure so moving edges stay sharp inside each frame. Normal-rate action then feels abrupt and staccato because this is reduced motion blur, not a long-exposure smear.","低快门摄影使用短快门角度或短曝光，使每帧内运动边缘保持锐利。正常速率的动作因此显得突兀、断续，因为这是减少运动模糊，而不是长曝光拖影。"],"pi":["Adapt the catalog line toward the physics: short shutter, not long smear. Still: crisp droplets and defined moving limbs in a tense handheld frame. Video: Handheld close action of [Subject], normal playback speed, short-exposure droplets, sharply segmented body movement, no smooth slow motion, no artificial frame skipping.","把目录式描述调整为物理：短快门，而不是长拖影。静帧：紧张手持画面中清晰的水滴和轮廓分明的运动肢体。视频：[主体]的手持近景动作，正常播放速度，短曝光水滴，身体运动被清晰切分，不要平滑慢动作，不要人工跳帧。"],"cp":["Handheld close action of a rescue crew running through heavy rain, normal playback speed but crisp short-exposure droplets and sharply segmented body movement. Readable geography, restrained shake, no smooth slow motion, no artificial frame skipping.","救援队在大雨中奔跑的手持近景动作，正常播放速度，但水滴是清晰的短曝光，身体运动被清晰切分。地理可读，晃动克制，不要平滑慢动作，不要人工跳帧。"],"hp":["Low-shutter (short shutter angle) of [Subject], reduced motion blur, crisp rain and limb edges, staccato cadence.","[主体]的低快门（短快门角度），减少运动模糊，清晰的雨水和肢体边缘，断续节奏。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/03-low-shutter-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-shutter-03-low-shutter-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/low-shutter.jpg","r":[["Motion Blur","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/motion-blur","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/motion-blur-01-motion-blur-mini.webp","Speed or trauma. Clarity would be false."],["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"低快门"},"moonwalk":{"t":"Moonwalk","c":"time-and-motion","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/moonwalk","d":["A moonwalk effect is a backward glide that reads as a forward myth: the torso stays upright, one foot slides, the other pushes, and the heel does not lift like a walk. It is a locomotion lie in living time, not reversed footage.","月球漫步效果是一种向后滑行，却被读成前进的神话：躯干保持挺直，一只脚滑动，另一只脚推动，脚跟不像走路那样抬起。它是在真实时间里运动方式的谎言，而不是倒放素材。"],"pi":["Write the slide, not a reverse clip. Still: mid-glide, one foot flat, torso upright, coat trailing. Video: [Subject] glides backward as if the floor were ice, a moonwalk path. Heel does not lift like a walk. No spin, no float off the ground, no world rewind.","写滑行，而不是倒放片段。静帧：滑行中途，一只脚平放，躯干挺直，外套拖曳。视频：[主体]向后滑行，仿佛地板是冰面，一条月球漫步路径。脚跟不像走路那样抬起。不要旋转，不要飘离地面，不要世界倒带。"],"cp":["[Subject] glides backward as if the floor were ice, a moonwalk path.","[主体]向后滑行，仿佛地板是冰面，一条月球漫步路径。"],"hp":["Moonwalk of [Subject], backward glide that reads as forward myth, slide as dance grammar.","[主体]的月球漫步，向后滑行却被读成前进神话，滑行作为舞蹈语法。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/07-moonwalk-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/moonwalk-07-moonwalk-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/moonwalk.jpg","r":[["Double Dolly","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/double-dolly","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/double-dolly-019-double-dolly-floating-shot-mini.webp","Interior state made external: the person is carried by an idea."],["Boomerang","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/boomerang","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/boomerang-02-boomerang-mini.webp","Turn a gesture into a toy."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"太空步"},"motion-blur":{"t":"Motion Blur","c":"time-and-motion","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/motion-blur","d":["Motion blur cinematography is the streaking or softness caused by subject or camera movement during exposure. The longer the gate stays open relative to the motion, the more the image paints, so edges fail on purpose.","运动模糊摄影是曝光期间主体或摄影机运动造成的拖影或柔化。片门保持打开相对于运动的时间越长，画面就涂抹得越多，因此边缘是有意失效的。"],"pi":["Commit to streaks. Still: lamps as ribbons, bodies smearing, a subject sharp only if they held still. Video: Heavy motion blur as [Subject] or the camera moves, light streaking, shutter dragged. If every raindrop is crisp, the shutter was too short.","全力呈现拖影。静帧：灯变成光带，身体拖影，主体只有在保持静止时才清晰。视频：当[主体]或摄影机移动时产生重度运动模糊，光线拖成条，快门被拖长。如果每一滴雨都清晰，快门就太短了。"],"cp":["Heavy motion blur as [Subject] or the camera moves, light streaking, shutter dragged.","当[主体]或摄影机移动时产生重度运动模糊，光线拖成条，快门被拖长。"],"hp":["Long-shutter motion blur on [Subject] or the world, streaks of light, bodies smearing.","对[主体]或世界使用长快门运动模糊，光带，身体拖影。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/01-motion-blur-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/motion-blur-01-motion-blur-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/motion-blur.jpg","r":[["Whip Pan","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/whip-pan","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/whip-pan-013-whip-pan-mini.webp","Transition, punchline, or sudden attention shift."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."]],"z":"运动模糊"},"one-er":{"t":"Oner","c":"time-and-motion","g":"true oner","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/one-er","d":["A oner shot is designed to play as if the scene were one take, with no visible edits. It may be a true single take or a stitched oner whose joins hide in whips, darkness, or crossing bodies.","一镜到底镜头被设计成仿佛整场戏是一个镜头，没有可见剪辑。它可以是真正的单次拍摄，也可以是缝合式一镜到底，其接缝藏在甩镜、黑暗或穿过画面的人体中。"],"pi":["Write a whole scene as one take. Still: a frame from the path, not proof. Video: A continuous oner following [Subject] through connected actions without a visible cut. Name rooms, turns, and the human anchor. Hidden cuts only if they would not read.","把整个场景写成一个镜头。静帧：来自路径中的一帧，而不是证明。视频：一个连续一镜到底镜头跟随[主体]穿过相连动作而没有可见剪切。命名房间、转弯和人物锚点。只有在不会被看出的情况下才用隐藏剪切。"],"cp":["A continuous oner following [Subject] through connected actions without a visible cut.","一个连续一镜到底镜头跟随[主体]穿过相连动作而没有可见剪切。"],"hp":["Apparent oner of [Subject], a whole scene as one take, hidden cuts allowed only if invisible.","[主体]的表面一镜到底，整个场景作为一个镜头，只有在不可见时才允许隐藏剪切。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/026-social-access-tracking-oner-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/one-er-026-social-access-tracking-oner-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/one-er.jpg","r":[["Long Take","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/long-take","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/long-take-031-genuine-feature-length-continuous-take-mini.webp","Do not let the audience leave the room."],["Steadicam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/steadicam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/steadicam-steadicam-mini.webp","Long connecting moves through architecture. Neither handheld nor dolly."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"一镜到底"},"reverse-motion":{"t":"Reverse Motion","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Consequences before causes","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/reverse-motion","d":["Reverse motion plays recorded action backward so causes arrive after their effects inside the shot: rain rises, smoke inhales, a shattered object reassembles. This is reversed playback, not a story told in reverse scene order.","倒放让已录制的动作反向播放，因此镜头内的结果先于原因出现：雨上升、烟往回吸、破碎的物体重新组装。这是倒放播放，而不是按倒序场景讲述的故事。"],"pi":["Name inverted physics, not a shuffled outline. Still: a tell such as rain hanging upward, glass mid-reassembly, smoke drawing in. Video: The action around [Subject] plays in reverse: rain rising, smoke inhaling, motion undone. Ordinary-speed scenes in reverse order is a different brief.","写明倒置的物理，而不是打乱的故事大纲。静帧：一个迹象，比如雨向上悬停、玻璃正在重组、烟往回吸入。视频：围绕[主体]的动作倒放：雨上升、烟回吸、运动被撤销。常速场景按倒序排列是另一个需求。"],"cp":["Create four ordinary-speed scenes about a broken friendship: an unopened apology, a public argument, a misunderstood message and an earlier act of trust. Present them in reverse chronological order. At each transition, reveal a cause that changes the previous scene’s meaning. Do not run the footage backward.","创作四个关于一段破裂友谊的常速场景：一封未拆开的道歉信、一场公开争吵、一条被误解的信息，以及更早的一次信任之举。按时间倒序呈现。在每个转场处，揭示一个改变前一场戏含义的原因。不要让画面倒放。"],"hp":["Reverse motion of [Subject], time running backward, rain rising, a broken thing assembling.","[主体]的倒放，时间倒流，雨上升，破碎之物重新组装。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/085-reverse-motion-image-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reverse-motion-085-reverse-motion-image-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/reverse-motion.jpg","r":[["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."],["Speed Ramp","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/speed-ramp","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/speed-ramp-079-speed-ramp-mini.webp","Mark one instant inside a fight or a look."]],"z":"倒放"},"slow-motion":{"t":"Slow Motion","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Overcranking","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","d":["Slow motion cinematography plays action over more screen time than the event occupied during capture, usually by overcranking (recording 120 to 240 fps and playing at 24). The extra samples reveal fabric delay, particle hang, and impact mechanics that a 24 fps shutter would compress into a few smeared frames.","慢动作摄影让动作在银幕上占用的时间多于拍摄时事件实际占用的时间，通常通过升格（以 120 到 240 fps 拍摄并以 24 fps 播放）实现。额外样本揭示布料延迟、粒子悬停和撞击机制，而 24 fps 快门本会把它们压缩成几个拖影帧。"],"pi":["Name the fps feel and what the extra time reveals. Still: a physically plausible mid-action pose with hanging dust, delayed fabric, and readable contacts, not a statue. Video: Slow-motion 6-second shot of [Subject], time stretched, particles hanging in light, 120fps feel, locked or simple camera, no frozen background orbit.","写明帧率感，以及多出来的时间揭示了什么。静帧：一个物理上成立的动作中段姿态，尘埃悬停，布料滞后，接触关系可读，而不是一尊雕像。视频：[主体] 的六秒慢动作，时间被拉长，粒子悬在光里，120fps 感，固定或简单运镜，不要冻结背景的环绕。"],"cp":["A glass slips from a waiter’s hand and falls in elegant slow motion. Fingers release naturally, the glass rotates coherently and fabric moves with plausible inertia. Locked close shot, smooth temporal detail, no frozen background or bullet-time orbit.","一只杯子从服务员手中滑落，以优雅的慢动作坠落。手指自然松开，杯子连贯地旋转，布料带着可信的惯性摆动。固定近景，时间细节流畅，不要冻结背景，也不要子弹时间式环绕。"],"hp":["Slow motion of [Subject] at 120 to 240 fps playback, dust hanging, fabric delayed, continuous gravity.","[主体]的慢动作，以 120 到 240 fps 播放，尘埃悬停，布料延迟，重力持续作用。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/077-slow-motion-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/slow-motion.jpg","r":[["Speed Ramp","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/speed-ramp","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/speed-ramp-079-speed-ramp-mini.webp","Mark one instant inside a fight or a look."],["Step Printing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/step-printing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/step-printing-083-step-printing-and-smeared-motion-mini.webp","Longing that cannot move at normal speed."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."]],"z":"慢动作"},"speed-ramp":{"t":"Speed Ramp","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Variable-speed action","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/speed-ramp","d":["Speed ramping changes playback or capture speed inside a single shot rather than holding one retiming ratio. Approach and recovery stay energetic while one motivated instant (impact, glance, turn) stretches, then the clock returns.","速度渐变在单个镜头内改变播放或拍摄速度，而不是保持一个变速比率。进入段和恢复段保持有冲劲，而一个有动机的瞬间（撞击、瞥视、转身）被拉长，随后时钟回归。"],"pi":["Name the real-time approach, the stretched beat, and the recovery. Still: three readable phases implied in one pose is weaker than a video ramp. Video: Speed ramp: real-time movement of [Subject] suddenly stretches into slow motion at the key beat, then recovers. One coherent action, readable contacts, natural gravity.","写明实时部分、被拉长的那一拍，以及回到正常速度的过程。静帧：用一个姿态暗示三个阶段，效果弱于视频里的变速。视频：速度变化——[主体] 的实时动作在关键一拍突然拉成慢动作，然后恢复。动作连贯，接触关系可读，重力自然。"],"cp":["A skateboarder approaches a small ramp at normal speed, slows smoothly to reveal the board rotating beneath their feet, then returns to normal speed on landing. One coherent action, readable foot placement, natural gravity, no impossible extra spin. Specify and refine the ramp in editing.","滑板者以正常速度接近一个小坡道，平滑减速以露出板在脚下翻转，落地时恢复正常速度。一个连贯动作，脚位可读，重力自然，不要不可能的额外空转。速度曲线在剪辑里指定并微调。"],"hp":["Speed ramp on [Subject], real time slamming into slow motion at the impact or glance, then releasing.","[主体]的速度渐变，实时速度在撞击或瞥视处猛切入慢动作，然后释放。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/079-speed-ramp-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/speed-ramp-079-speed-ramp-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/speed-ramp.jpg","r":[["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Crash Zoom In","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/crash-zoom-in","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/crash-zoom-in-014-crash-zoom-mini.webp","Punctuate a hit, a realization, or a comic sting."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."]],"z":"变速"},"step-printing":{"t":"Step Printing","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Repeated-frame motion","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/step-printing","d":["Step printing repeats or omits frames optically or digitally so motion advances in visible temporal steps. Combined with low-rate capture and long exposures, each frame smears internally while the sequence stutters forward, a texture of delay rather than clean high-frame-rate slow motion.","抽帧印制通过光学或数字方式重复或省略帧，使运动以可见的时间步进推进。结合低帧率拍摄和长曝光，每一帧在内部产生拖影，而序列卡顿地向前推进，这是一种延迟质感，而非干净的高帧率慢动作。"],"pi":["Ask for duplicated frames and in-frame smear, not 120 fps. Still: a readable figure with strongly smeared passersby, long-exposure street texture. Video: Step-printed slow motion of [Subject], stuttering duplicated frames, lyrical delay rather than smooth slow-mo. No generic glitch, no interpolated in-betweens.","要求重复帧和帧内拖影，而不是 120 fps。静帧：一个清晰可读的人物，路人被强烈拖成模糊，长曝光街道质感。视频：[主体]的抽帧慢动作，重复帧卡顿，诗意的延迟，而非平滑慢动作。不要普通故障，不要插值中间帧。"],"cp":["A lonely man stands at a night food counter while pedestrians stream past as smeared, stuttering shapes. His small movements remain readable. Long-exposure motion texture with deliberate repeated-frame cadence, saturated practical lights, no clean high-frame-rate slow motion. Apply the cadence in post from a controlled base clip.","一个孤独的男人站在夜间小吃摊前，行人以拖影、卡顿的形状流过。他的细微动作仍清晰可读。长曝光运动质感，带有刻意的重复帧节奏，饱和的实景光源，不要干净的高帧率慢动作。在后期从一段受控的基础素材应用这种节奏。"],"hp":["Step-printed motion of [Subject], frames duplicated, stuttering lyric delay, long-exposure smear inside each frame.","[主体]的抽帧运动，帧被重复，卡顿的诗意延迟，每一帧内部的长曝光拖影。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/083-step-printing-and-smeared-motion-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/step-printing-083-step-printing-and-smeared-motion-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/step-printing.jpg","r":[["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."],["Stutter / Stop-Stutter","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/stutter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stutter-086-short-shutter-staccato-action-mini.webp","The mind skips."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."]],"z":"抽帧印片"},"stop-motion":{"t":"Stop Motion","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Frame-by-frame object animation","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/stop-motion","d":["Stop motion cinematography photographs physical objects incrementally, adjusting them between exposures so successive poses create apparent movement. The cadence is pose to pose and slightly staccato, with tactile materials in the light.","定格动画摄影以增量方式拍摄实体物体，在每次曝光之间调整它们，使连续的姿势产生明显运动。节奏是逐姿势且略微顿挫，光线中有可触摸的材料。"],"pi":["Write materials and increments, not a filter. Still: a puppet or object mid-pose, visible construction, coherent joints. Video: Stop-motion cadence of [Subject], pose to pose, slightly staccato. Stable lights and set, readable hand-object contact, no fluid live-action fur.","写明材料和增量，而不是滤镜。静帧：一个处于姿势中途的偶人或物体，可见的构造，连贯的关节。视频：[主体]的定格动画节奏，逐姿势，略微顿挫。稳定的灯光和布景，清晰可读的手与物体接触，不要流畅的实拍毛发。"],"cp":["An articulated paper-and-wire fox carefully folds a paper boat on a miniature desk. Tactile materials, consistent joint construction, deliberate frame-by-frame posing and small controlled increments. Stable lighting and set, readable hand-object contact, no fluid live-action fur or continuously melting paper.","一只由纸和铁丝制成的可活动狐狸在微型书桌上仔细折一只纸船。可触摸的材料，一致的关节构造，刻意的逐帧摆姿和小幅受控增量。稳定的灯光和布景，清晰可读的手与物体接触，不要流畅的实拍毛发，也不要持续融化的纸。"],"hp":["Stop-motion of [Subject], stepped poses, tactile increment, time built by hand.","[主体]的定格动画，阶梯式姿势，可触摸的增量，用手搭建的时间。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/150-stop-motion-animation-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stop-motion-150-stop-motion-animation-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/stop-motion.jpg","r":[["Step Printing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/step-printing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/step-printing-083-step-printing-and-smeared-motion-mini.webp","Longing that cannot move at normal speed."],["Animation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/animation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/animation.webp","The world is constructed, not captured."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"定格动画"},"stutter":{"t":"Stutter / Stop-Stutter","c":"time-and-motion","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/stutter","d":["Stutter editing drops or repeats frames so playback skips and the world's clock hitches. It is an anxious rhythm, not the lyric smear of step printing and not a jump cut's spatial jump.","卡顿剪辑丢掉或重复帧，使播放跳变，世界的时钟卡住。它是一种焦虑的节奏，不是抽帧印制的诗意拖影，也不是跳切的空间跳跃。"],"pi":["Write frames dropping or repeating, not smear and not a jump in angle. Still: a face or gesture that looks temporally sampled, slight after-images only if they come from repeats. Video: Stuttering playback of [Subject], frames repeating and skipping, anxious rhythm. Same setup, no lyric blur, no datamosh.","写明掉帧或重复帧，而不是拖影，也不是角度跳变。静帧：一张脸或一个手势，看起来像被时间采样过，只有来自重复帧时才带轻微残影。视频：[主体]的卡顿播放，帧重复和跳帧，焦虑的节奏。同一机位设置，不要诗意模糊，不要数据故障。"],"cp":["Stuttering playback of [Subject], frames repeating and skipping, anxious rhythm.","[主体]的卡顿播放，帧重复和跳帧，焦虑的节奏。"],"hp":["Stuttered motion of [Subject], frames dropping or repeating, a glitch in time, anxiety as rhythm.","[主体]的卡顿运动，帧掉落或重复，时间中的故障，焦虑即节奏。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/086-short-shutter-staccato-action-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/stutter-086-short-shutter-staccato-action-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/stutter.jpg","r":[["Step Printing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/step-printing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/step-printing-083-step-printing-and-smeared-motion-mini.webp","Longing that cannot move at normal speed."],["Jump Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/jump-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/jump-cut-119-jump-cut-mini.webp","Do not soothe. Show the skip."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"卡顿抽帧"},"time-lapse":{"t":"Time-Lapse","c":"time-and-motion","g":"Interval photography","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/time-lapse","d":["Time-lapse cinematography captures frames at long intervals so slow change plays as continuous motion, hours becoming seconds as shadows sweep and crowds become flow. It is interval photography, not a sped-up ordinary take.","延时摄影以长时间间隔捕捉帧，使缓慢变化作为连续运动播放，小时变成秒，影子扫过，人群变成流动。它是间隔摄影，而不是加速的普通镜头。"],"pi":["Name the interval collapse and what must move. Still: matched architecture at one implied phase, or a composite of sun angles only if you label it a study. Video: Time-lapse around [Subject], light and crowds moving at accelerated speed while the camera stays or moves slowly. Shadows must travel. Buildings stay solid.","写明被压缩的时间间隔，以及什么必须移动。静帧：同一建筑在某个暗示的时间阶段，或只标注为「研究稿」的太阳角度合成。视频：[主体] 周围的延时，光线与人群以加速后的速度移动，摄影机保持不动或缓慢移动。影子必须移动。建筑保持稳固。"],"cp":["Locked high view of a public square from early morning to night, compressed into ten seconds. Shadows move continuously, crowds form and dissolve, windows light up gradually. Stable buildings and weather logic, no morphing architecture. Generate controlled day-phase keyframes and assemble a time-lapse progression.","从高处固定视角拍摄一个公共广场，从清晨到夜晚压缩进十秒。影子连续移动，人群聚散，窗户逐一亮起。建筑稳定，天气逻辑成立，不要变形的建筑。生成可控的日间阶段关键帧，再组装成延时推进。"],"hp":["Time-lapse of [Subject] or the world around them, hours in seconds, shadows sweeping, crowds as smoke.","[主体]或其周围世界的延时，小时在秒中，影子扫过，人群如烟。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/time-lapse-084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/time-lapse.jpg","r":[["Hyperlapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/hyperlapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hyperlapse-hyperlapse-mini.webp","Show duration as velocity."],["Fast Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/fast-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fast-motion-078-accelerated-action-mini.webp","Too much life for real time."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"延时摄影"},"timelapse-glam":{"t":"Timelapse Glam","c":"time-and-motion","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/timelapse-glam","d":["Timelapse glam is interval photography of a styling process in which clothes, hair, and makeup change at high speed while the face holds. The person is a still axis and wardrobe is the changing weather.","延时美妆是造型过程的间隔摄影，其中衣服、头发和妆容高速变化，而面孔保持不变。人是静止的轴心，服装是变化的天气。"],"pi":["Lock the face, accelerate the styling. Still: one held identity with evidence of process (hands, garments in mid-swap). Video: Time-lapse around a still [Subject] as stylists and wardrobe change at high speed. Same skull, same eyeline, clothes as weather, no identity morph.","锁定面孔，加速造型。静帧：一个保持不变的身份，并带有过程的证据（手、正在换到一半的服装）。视频：围绕静止的[主体]延时拍摄，造型师和服装高速更换。同一脸型骨架，同一条视线，衣服如天气，不要身份变形。"],"cp":["Time-lapse around a still [Subject] as stylists and wardrobe change at high speed.","围绕静止的[主体]延时拍摄，造型师和服装高速更换。"],"hp":["Timelapse glam of [Subject], styling swarm, clothes and hair changing while the face holds.","[主体]的延时美妆，造型团队蜂拥，衣服和头发变化而面孔保持不变。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/04-timelapse-glam-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/timelapse-glam-04-timelapse-glam-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/timelapse-glam.jpg","r":[["Time-Lapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/time-lapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/time-lapse-084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.webp","Show weather, construction, or a night becoming morning."],["Glam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/glam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/glam.webp","Sell the face."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"延时化妆"},"timelapse-human":{"t":"Timelapse Human","c":"time-and-motion","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/timelapse-human","d":["Timelapse human holds one person in living time while the crowd is interval-sampled into smoke, so one still will stands in a rushing system. It is the opposite clock of a frozen world with a moving hero.","延时人物让一个人保持在活生生的时间里，而人群被间隔采样成烟雾，因此一个静止的意志站在飞驰的系统中。它是冻结世界与移动主角的相反时钟。"],"pi":["Hold the person, lapse the crowd. Still: one sharp figure, pedestrians as flow, stable sun unless you want a day. Video: Crowds time-lapse around a still [Subject], the city racing, the person holding. No frozen pigeons, no orbit, no hero sprinting through stopped extras.","保持人物，延时人群。静帧：一个清晰的人物，行人如流，太阳稳定，除非你想表现一整天。视频：人群围绕静止的[主体]延时，城市飞驰，人物不动。不要冻结的鸽子，不要环绕，不要主角在静止的群演中冲刺。"],"cp":["Crowds time-lapse around a still [Subject], the city racing, the person holding.","人群围绕静止的[主体]延时，城市飞驰，人物不动。"],"hp":["Timelapse human of [Subject] frozen in a rushing crowd, people as smoke, one still will.","[主体]的延时人物，冻结在飞驰的人群中，人如烟雾，一个静止的意志。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/05-timelapse-human-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/timelapse-human-05-timelapse-human-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/timelapse-human.jpg","r":[["Time-Lapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/time-lapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/time-lapse-084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.webp","Show weather, construction, or a night becoming morning."],["Frozen in Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/frozen-in-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/frozen-in-motion-081-frozen-world-with-a-moving-viewpoint-mini.webp","Stop the world, keep the pose."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"延时人像"},"timelapse-landscape":{"t":"Timelapse Landscape","c":"time-and-motion","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/timelapse-landscape","d":["Timelapse landscape interval-samples light and weather over a place so hours play in seconds as clouds and shadows sweep. Geography is the actor, and a person, if present, is a scale mark rather than a racing extra.","延时景观对一个地点的光和天气进行间隔采样，使小时在秒中播放，云和影子扫过。地理是演员，而一个人如果出现，是比例标记，而不是飞驰的群演。"],"pi":["Write light and weather as the motion. Still: one honest sun angle on stable geology. Video: Time-lapse of light and weather over the landscape of [Subject]. Shadows sweep, clouds race, architecture holds. No morphing cliffs, no crowd-only acceleration.","把光和天气写成运动。静帧：一个真实可信的太阳角度落在稳定的地貌上。视频：[主体]的景观上光和天气的延时。影子扫过，云飞奔，建筑不动。不要变形的悬崖，不要只有人群加速。"],"cp":["Time-lapse of light and weather over the landscape of [Subject].","[主体]的景观上光和天气的延时。"],"hp":["Timelapse landscape around [Subject] or their place, clouds and shadows sweeping, hours in seconds.","围绕[主体]或其所在地的延时景观，云和影子扫过，小时在秒中。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/06-timelapse-landscape-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/timelapse-landscape-06-timelapse-landscape-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/timelapse-landscape.jpg","r":[["Time-Lapse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/time-lapse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/time-lapse-084-time-lapse-and-accelerated-systems-mini.webp","Show weather, construction, or a night becoming morning."],["Aerial","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-012-aerial-pursuit-and-landscape-mini.webp","Open a world. Make the place bigger than the person."],["Slow Motion","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/time-and-motion/slow-motion","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/slow-motion-077-slow-motion-mini.webp","A second contains a scene."]],"z":"延时风光"},"3d-render":{"t":"3D Render","c":"viral-looks","g":"Motion capture","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/3d-render","d":["3D render, the 3d render look, is a person as product visualization: clean global illumination, shader skin slightly too perfect, infinite cyc, contact shadows that never dirty. They should look computed, and photochemical grain is a joke if you add it.","3D 渲染，也就是 3D 渲染质感，是把人物当作产品可视化：干净的全局光照，着色器皮肤略显过于完美，无限弧形背景，永远不会弄脏的接触阴影。他们看起来应当是被计算出来的，而如果你加入光化学颗粒，那就是个笑话。"],"pi":["Kill the grain, wrap the light. 3D-render look of [Subject], CG shader, clean GI, a person as a product visualization. Add studio HDRI, infinite cyc, too-perfect subsurface, turntable still, no film grain, no dirty flare.","消除颗粒，包裹光线。[主体] 的 3D 渲染质感，CG 着色器，干净 GI，把人物当作产品可视化。加入影棚 HDRI，无限弧形背景，过于完美的次表面散射，转台静帧，无胶片颗粒，无脏污耀斑。"],"cp":["A small fictional creature receives a repaired toy from a human friend. Preserve a specific performance: guarded gaze, delayed recognition, relaxed shoulders and a tentative reach. Stable character model, precise finger contact and matched eye level. Use performance reference and animation rather than relying on a generic happy expression.","一个小型虚构生物从人类朋友那里收到一个修好的玩具。保留具体表演：戒备的目光、延迟的认出、放松的肩膀和试探性的伸手。稳定角色模型，精确的手指接触和匹配的视线高度。使用表演参考和动画，而不是依赖泛泛的开心表情。"],"hp":["3D-render look of [Subject], CG shader, clean GI, a person as a product visualization.","[主体] 的 3D 渲染质感，CG 着色器，干净 GI，把人物当作产品可视化。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/3d-render/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Photogrammetry","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/photogrammetry","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/photogrammetry-photogrammetry-mini.webp","Reality, captured as geometry."],["Product","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/framing/product","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/product.webp","Sell the thing by lighting it like a face."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"3D渲染风"},"2000s-paparazzi":{"t":"2000s Paparazzi","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/2000s-paparazzi","d":["2000s paparazzi, the 2000s paparazzi look, is on-camera flash from a compact digital: greenish white balance, hard wall-shadow, sidewalk glare, a face not ready. Fame as a strobe: the theft is the lighting.","2000 年代狗仔，也就是 2000 年代狗仔风，是来自紧凑型数码相机的机顶闪光：偏绿白平衡，硬墙影，路边眩光，一张没准备好的脸。名声如频闪：偷窃感就在于灯光。"],"pi":["Direct flash, not ready, sidewalk. 2000s paparazzi of [Subject], on-camera flash, compact digital, sidewalk fame, a decade of glare. Add hard wall-shadow, greenish compact white balance, motion smear allowed, no beauty key, no masthead type.","直闪，没准备好，人行道。[主体] 的 2000 年代狗仔风，机顶闪光灯，紧凑型数码相机，路边名声，十年的眩光。加入硬墙影，偏绿紧凑型白平衡，允许运动拖影，无美颜主光，无报头字体。"],"cp":["2000s paparazzi of [Subject], on-camera flash, compact digital, sidewalk fame, a decade of glare.","[主体] 的 2000 年代狗仔风，机顶闪光灯，紧凑型数码相机，路边名声，十年的眩光。"],"hp":["2000s paparazzi of [Subject], on-camera flash, compact digital, sidewalk fame, a decade of glare.","[主体] 的 2000 年代狗仔风，机顶闪光灯，紧凑型数码相机，路边名声，十年的眩光。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/2000s-paparazzi-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/2000s-paparazzi-2000s-paparazzi-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/2000s-paparazzi.jpg","r":[["Superstar","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/superstar","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/superstar-superstar-mini.webp","They are already famous in the frame."],["Flash Cut","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/flash-cut","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/flash-cut-03-flash-cut-mini.webp","A thought that lasts three frames."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"千禧狗仔风"},"acid":{"t":"Acid","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/acid","d":["Acid, the acid visual look, is a ruined print: burned chroma, melting edges, silver that shifted, dyes left in the sun too long. The dyes should misbehave, and a festive rainbow LUT is not damage.","Acid，也就是 Acid 视觉风，是一张毁掉的印片：烧焦色度，融化边缘，偏移的银盐，在太阳下放太久的染料。染料应当不听话，而节庆彩虹 LUT 不是损坏。"],"pi":["Damage, not a party. Acid look on [Subject], burned chroma, melting edges, a print left in the sun too long. Add lock-off, held face, melted edges, overcooked magenta and yellow, no trails. Pick acid or LSD, not both.","损坏，不是派对。[主体] 的 Acid 风，烧焦色度，融化边缘，一张在太阳下放太久的印片。加入固定机位，保持住的脸，融化边缘，过熟的洋红和黄色，无拖尾。选 Acid 或 LSD，不要两者都选。"],"cp":["Acid look on [Subject], burned chroma, melting edges, a print left in the sun too long.","[主体] 的 Acid 风，烧焦色度，融化边缘，一张在太阳下放太久的印片。"],"hp":["Acid look on [Subject], burned chroma, melting edges, a print left in the sun too long.","[主体] 的 Acid 风，烧焦色度，融化边缘，一张在太阳下放太久的印片。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/acid-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/acid-acid-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/acid.jpg","r":[["LSD","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/lsd","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lsd-lsd-mini.webp","Perception is the set."],["Cross Process","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cross-process","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cross-process.webp","Wrong chemistry on purpose."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"酸性美学"},"action-figure":{"t":"Action Figure","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/action-figure","d":["Action figure, the action figure look, turns a person into merchandise: plastic joints, painted-on costume, blister-card studio lighting, a toy of a hero. Scale and material are the look, and a real actor in a costume is not enough.","可动人偶，也就是可动人偶风，把人物变成商品：塑料关节，涂装的服装，吸塑卡影棚灯光，一个英雄玩具。比例和材质才是这种风，而一个穿戏服的真演员还不够。"],"pi":["Plastic, joints, toy light. Action-figure of [Subject], plastic joints, blister-card lighting, a toy of a person. Add studio keys, visible rivets, diorama base, no packaging type, polymer skin. Not a costumed actor.","塑料，关节，玩具光。[主体] 的可动人偶，塑料关节，吸塑卡灯光，把人物做成玩具。加入影棚主光，可见铆钉，场景底座，无包装字体，聚合物皮肤。不是穿戏服的演员。"],"cp":["Action-figure of [Subject], plastic joints, blister-card lighting, a toy of a person.","[主体] 的可动人偶，塑料关节，吸塑卡灯光，把人物做成玩具。"],"hp":["Action-figure of [Subject], plastic joints, blister-card lighting, a toy of a person.","[主体] 的可动人偶，塑料关节，吸塑卡灯光，把人物做成玩具。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/action-figure/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Mighty Fighter","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/mighty-fighter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mighty-fighter-mighty-fighter-mini.webp","They should look like a sprite that won."],["Diorama","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/diorama","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/diorama-diorama-mini.webp","Shrink the epic until it fits a shelf."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"手办风"},"agamemnon":{"t":"Agamemnon","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","d":["Agamemnon, the agamemnon look, is a named grade of hard sun, bronze bounce, and a dusk sky the color of a bruise, so a living body reads as antique metal. The name is not a shot: you still lock a height, pick a lens, and place a figure who can hold that weather.","Agamemnon，也就是 Agamemnon 风，是一种具名调色：硬阳光、青铜反弹光，以及瘀伤色的黄昏天空，让活人的身体看起来像古旧金属。这个名字不是镜头：你仍要锁定高度，选择镜头，并放一个能撑住那种天气的人物。"],"pi":["Lead with the person and the stand, then the grade. Example: Agamemnon look on [Subject], bronze, blood-dusk, tragic scale, a king under a bad sky, antique epic as grade. Add hard sun camera-left, opaque shadows, 35mm, eye height, no neon. Do not write mood words in place of the key.","先写人物和站位，再写调色。示例：[主体] 的 Agamemnon 风，青铜，血暮，悲剧尺度，坏天空下的国王，古史诗作为调色。加入相机左侧硬阳光，不透明阴影，35mm，视线高度，无霓虹。不要用情绪词代替主光。"],"cp":["Agamemnon look on [Subject], bronze, blood-dusk, tragic scale, a king under a bad sky, antique epic as grade.","[主体] 的 Agamemnon 风，青铜，血暮，悲剧尺度，坏天空下的国王，古史诗作为调色。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/agamemnon/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Spaghetti Western","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/spaghetti-western","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/spaghetti-western.webp","Myth in dirt."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Ink Riot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/ink-riot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ink-riot-ink-riot-mini.webp","The image should spill."]],"z":"阿伽门农风"},"akrill":{"t":"Akrill","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/akrill","d":["Akrill, the acrylic paint look, is pigment as a plastic skin on the world: thick ridges, poster edges, high chroma, paint that still looks wet. Color sits on top: if it soaked in, you shot a wash.","Akrill，也就是丙烯颜料风，是颜料作为世界的一层塑料皮肤：厚脊纹，海报边缘，高色度，看起来仍然湿的颜料。颜色坐在表面：如果它渗进去了，你拍的就是一层薄涂。"],"pi":["Pigment on top, wet ridges. Acrylic look on [Subject], thick plastic color, poster edges, paint that still looks wet. Add hard key, high chroma, modeled face, wet highlights on the paint, no thin wash.","颜料浮在表面，湿润脊纹。[主体] 的丙烯风，厚塑料色，海报边缘，看起来仍然湿的颜料。加入硬主光，高色度，塑形脸，颜料上的湿润高光，无薄涂。"],"cp":["Acrylic look on [Subject], thick plastic color, poster edges, paint that still looks wet.","[主体] 的丙烯风，厚塑料色，海报边缘，看起来仍然湿的颜料。"],"hp":["Acrylic look on [Subject], thick plastic color, poster edges, paint that still looks wet.","[主体] 的丙烯风，厚塑料色，海报边缘，看起来仍然湿的颜料。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/akrill/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Canvas","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/canvas","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/canvas.webp","The stock is paint."],["Ink Riot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/ink-riot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ink-riot-ink-riot-mini.webp","The image should spill."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"丙烯画风"},"blue-depth":{"t":"Blue Depth","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/blue-depth","d":["Blue depth, the blue depth look, stacks cyan planes so distance is a blue gradient: underwater, night glass, or air thick enough that the far plane goes deeper than the near. Depth is a color, not a cool white-balance wash.","蓝深度，也就是蓝深度风，堆叠青色平面，让距离成为蓝色渐变：水下、夜晚玻璃，或浓到让远景比近景更深的空气。深度是一种颜色，不是冷白平衡的冲刷。"],"pi":["Name near and far as different blues. Blue-depth world of [Subject], stacked cyan planes, underwater or night glass, distance as a blue gradient. Add a scale subject, haze, telephoto or underwater wide, near plane paler or warmer than the far.","把近处和远处命名为不同的蓝。[主体] 的蓝深度世界，堆叠的青色平面，水下或夜晚玻璃，距离作为蓝色渐变。加入尺度参照主体，雾霭，长焦或水下广角，近景平面比远景更淡或更暖。"],"cp":["Blue-depth world of [Subject], stacked cyan planes, underwater or night glass, distance as a blue gradient.","[主体] 的蓝深度世界，堆叠的青色平面，水下或夜晚玻璃，距离作为蓝色渐变。"],"hp":["Blue-depth world of [Subject], stacked cyan planes, underwater or night glass, distance as a blue gradient.","[主体] 的蓝深度世界，堆叠的青色平面，水下或夜晚玻璃，距离作为蓝色渐变。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/blue-depth-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/blue-depth-blue-depth-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/blue-depth.jpg","r":[["Cool Blue","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cool-blue","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cool-blue.webp","Cold institutions, night, or alienation."],["Underwater","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/underwater","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/underwater-underwater-mini.webp","Leave air."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"蓝色纵深风"},"broken-mirror":{"t":"Broken Mirror","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/broken-mirror","d":["Broken mirror, the broken mirror look, shards a person across cracked silver: one face that does not agree with itself, each shard a slightly different angle or time. Identity as a pile of cuts, and a crack overlay on a single face is not enough.","碎镜，也就是碎镜风，把一个人碎散在裂开的银面上：一张和自己不一致的脸，每块碎片都是略有不同的角度或时间。身份是一堆切口，而在一张脸上叠裂纹并不够。"],"pi":["Cracked silver, different slices. Broken-mirror of [Subject], silver shards, one face that does not agree with itself. Add bathroom practical, shards holding different bits of room, same person, no kaleidoscope pack.","裂开的银面，不同的切片。[主体] 的碎镜，银色碎片，一张和自己不一致的脸。加入浴室实景光源，碎片映出房间的不同部分，同一个人，无万花筒套装。"],"cp":["Broken-mirror of [Subject], silver shards, one face that does not agree with itself.","[主体] 的碎镜，银色碎片，一张和自己不一致的脸。"],"hp":["Broken-mirror of [Subject], silver shards, one face that does not agree with itself.","[主体] 的碎镜，银色碎片，一张和自己不一致的脸。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/broken-mirror-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/broken-mirror-broken-mirror-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/broken-mirror.jpg","r":[["Fragments","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/fragments","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fragments-176-fragmented-action-and-implied-impact-mini.webp","Do not give the whole."],["Reflections","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/reflections","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/reflections.webp","Show looking and the looked-at together."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"碎镜风"},"canvas":{"t":"Canvas","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/canvas","d":["Canvas, the canvas painting look, is a photographic subject wearing oil: visible bristle, canvas tooth, thicker paint in the lights, eyes that still look. It is not a slider named oil: brushwork has direction and weight.","帆布，也就是帆布画风，是一个摄影主体披着油画：可见的鬃毛笔触，帆布纹理，亮部更厚的颜料，仍然会看的眼睛。它不是名为油画的滑块：笔触有方向和重量。"],"pi":["Keep the portrait structure, then the oil. Canvas treatment of [Subject], visible brush, oil tooth, a painting that still has a face. Add 85mm lock-off, window key, bristle direction, eyes sharp. No smooth plastic painterly.","保留肖像结构，再上油画。[主体] 的帆布处理，可见笔触，油画纹理，一幅仍然有脸的画。加入 85mm 固定机位，窗户主光，鬃毛方向，眼睛锐利。无光滑塑料绘画感。"],"cp":["Canvas treatment of [Subject], visible brush, oil tooth, a painting that still has a face.","[主体] 的帆布处理，可见笔触，油画纹理，一幅仍然有脸的画。"],"hp":["Canvas treatment of [Subject], visible brush, oil tooth, a painting that still has a face.","[主体] 的帆布处理，可见笔触，油画纹理，一幅仍然有脸的画。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/canvas/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Monet Muse","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/monet-muse","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/monet-muse.webp","Light is the subject."],["Sketch","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/sketch","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/sketch.webp","Stop before the paint."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"油画布风"},"casual-monster-slayer":{"t":"Casual Monster Slayer","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/casual-monster-slayer","d":["Casual monster slayer is deadpan heroism in ordinary clothes: supermarket wardrobe, impossible creature work, the same naturalistic light on both. The joke is register clash, and the camera should look like coverage of a commute, not a poster.","休闲怪物杀手是穿普通衣服的冷面英雄主义：超市衣橱，不可能的怪物特效，两者用同一种自然光。笑点在于语域冲突，而摄影机应当看起来像一趟通勤的分镜覆盖，不是海报。"],"pi":["Specify boring clothes, then the creature, then plain coverage. Casual monster-slayer of [Subject], everyday clothes, impossible creature work, deadpan heroism, a commute that includes a dragon. Add eye-height 35mm, handheld or lock-off, same key on person and monster. No hero rim.","先指定无聊的衣服，再写生物，再写平实分镜覆盖。[主体] 的休闲怪物杀手，日常衣服，不可能的怪物特效，冷面英雄主义，一趟包含龙的日常通勤。加入视线高度 35mm，手持或固定机位，人物和怪物用同一主光。无英雄轮廓光。"],"cp":["Casual monster-slayer of [Subject], everyday clothes, impossible creature work, deadpan heroism, a commute that includes a dragon.","[主体] 的休闲怪物杀手，日常衣服，不可能的怪物特效，冷面英雄主义，一趟包含龙的日常通勤。"],"hp":["Casual monster-slayer of [Subject], everyday clothes, impossible creature work, deadpan heroism, a commute that includes a dragon.","[主体] 的休闲怪物杀手，日常衣服，不可能的怪物特效，冷面英雄主义，一趟包含龙的日常通勤。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/casual-monster-slayer-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/casual-monster-slayer-casual-monster-slayer-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/casual-monster-slayer.jpg","r":[["Mighty Fighter","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/mighty-fighter","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mighty-fighter-mighty-fighter-mini.webp","They should look like a sprite that won."],["Action Figure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/action-figure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/action-figure.webp","Sell them in a box."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"日常屠魔"},"cold-vision":{"t":"Cold Vision","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/cold-vision","d":["Cold vision, the cold vision look, reads the world as temperature: either an arctic photochemical grade with breath and ice, or a thermal false-color overlay with heat edges. Empathy is not in the palette, so pick one sensor and keep it.","冷视觉，即冷视觉风格，把世界读成温度：要么是带呼吸和冰的极地光化学调色，要么是带热边缘的热成像假彩色叠加。共情不在调色板里，所以选一种传感器并坚持用它。"],"pi":["Name the sensor, then the body. Cold vision of [Subject], arctic grade, thermal edges, a world seen as temperature and threat. Add either breath and ice with a winter key, or false-color heat with a readable face. One logic. No night-vision green unless you mean that tube.","先命名传感器，再命名身体。冷视觉 [主体]，北极级调色，热边缘，一个以温度和威胁被看见的世界。要么加呼吸和冰配冬日主光，要么加假彩色热量配可读面部。一种逻辑。不要夜视绿，除非你指的就是那种显像管。"],"cp":["Cold vision of [Subject], arctic grade, thermal edges, a world seen as temperature and threat.","冷视觉 [主体]，北极级调色，热边缘，一个以温度和威胁被看见的世界。"],"hp":["Cold vision of [Subject], arctic grade, thermal edges, a world seen as temperature and threat.","冷视觉 [主体]，北极级调色，热边缘，一个以温度和威胁被看见的世界。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/cold-vision-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cold-vision-cold-vision-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/cold-vision.jpg","r":[["Thermal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/thermal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/thermal.webp","See temperature, not light."],["Night Vision","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/night-vision","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/night-vision.webp","Someone is hunting in the dark."],["Cool Blue","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/cool-blue","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/cool-blue.webp","Cold institutions, night, or alienation."]],"z":"冷色视觉"},"comic":{"t":"Comic","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/comic","d":["Comic, in comic book cinematography, inks a live-action frame: hard edges, halftone in the shadows, limited spots of color, a page that still has a photographed body in it. The camera still has a lens and one sun, and it is not a screenshot of a book.","漫画，在漫画书电影摄影中，是给实拍画面着墨：硬边缘，阴影中的半色调，有限的色彩点缀，一页里仍有被拍摄的身体。摄影机仍有镜头和一个太阳，它不是一本书的截图。"],"pi":["Keep the lens and the sun, then the print. Comic-book treatment of [Subject], inked edges, halftone, panel energy, a page that moves. Add one key direction, photographic face, no balloons, no extra media. Motion: one action, print holding.","保留镜头和阳光，再处理印刷感。对[主体]做漫画书处理，墨线边缘，半色调，分格能量，一页会动的画面。加上一个主光方向，摄影感面部，不要对话气泡，不要额外媒介。运动：一个动作，印刷质感保持。"],"cp":["Comic-book treatment of [Subject], inked edges, halftone, panel energy, a page that moves.","对[主体]做漫画书处理，墨线边缘，半色调，分格能量，一页会动的画面。"],"hp":["Comic-book treatment of [Subject], inked edges, halftone, panel energy, a page that moves.","对[主体]做漫画书处理，墨线边缘，半色调，分格能量，一页会动的画面。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/comic-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/comic-comic-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/comic.jpg","r":[["Animation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/animation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/animation.webp","The world is constructed, not captured."],["Typography","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/typography","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/typography-typography-mini.webp","The sentence is in the shot."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"漫画风"},"dolphin-ride":{"t":"Dolphin Ride","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/dolphin-ride","d":["Dolphin ride, as a dolphin ride preset, is impossible tourism played straight: a body mounted on a sea creature, bright water, honest horizon, splash readable. The gag is the vehicle, and swimming near a dolphin is not the sentence.","海豚骑乘，作为海豚骑乘预设，是严肃拍出的不可能旅游：身体骑在海洋生物上，明亮水面，诚实的地平线，飞溅可读。笑点是交通工具，在海豚旁边游泳不是这句话要拍的。"],"pi":["Mounted, moving, horizon honest. Dolphin-ride of [Subject], a body carried by a sea creature, impossible tourism, joy as a gag. Add wide lens, bright water, splash, face committed. Video: [Subject] rides a dolphin through bright water, a tourist miracle. No logos. Not swimming nearby.","骑乘，移动，地平线诚实。海豚骑乘 [主体]，身体被海洋生物承载，不可能的旅游，欢乐当笑点。加广角镜头，明亮水面，飞溅，面部投入。视频：[主体]骑着海豚穿过明亮水面，一个游客奇迹。不要商标。不是在旁边游泳。"],"cp":["[Subject] rides a dolphin through bright water, a tourist miracle.","海豚骑乘 [主体]，身体被海洋生物承载，不可能的旅游，欢乐当笑点。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/dolphin-ride-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolphin-ride-dolphin-ride-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/dolphin-ride.jpg","r":[["Penguin Ride","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/penguin-ride","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/penguin-ride-penguin-ride-mini.webp","The vehicle is the joke."],["Underwater","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/underwater","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/underwater-underwater-mini.webp","Leave air."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"骑海豚"},"fairytale-castle":{"t":"Fairytale Castle","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/fairytale-castle","d":["Fairytale castle, the fairytale castle look, puts storybook stone and impossible turrets around a small figure, with dusk treated as illustration. Place first, person second: the name is a location law, not a camera move.","童话城堡，即童话城堡风格，把故事书石头和不可能的塔楼放在小人物周围，并把黄昏处理成插画。先场景，后人物：这个名字是场景法则，不是运镜。"],"pi":["Start with the building, then the small person. Fairytale-castle world around [Subject], storybook stone, impossible turrets, dusk as illustration. Add causeway, window grids, indigo-gold hour, 24mm lock-off, figure small, photochemical air. No plastic battlements.","先拍建筑，再拍小人物。围绕[主体]的童话城堡世界，故事书石头，不可能的塔楼，黄昏如插画。加堤道，窗格，靛蓝-金色时刻，24mm 固定机位，人物很小，光化学空气。不要塑料城垛。"],"cp":["Fairytale-castle world around [Subject], storybook stone, impossible turrets, dusk as illustration.","围绕[主体]的童话城堡世界，故事书石头，不可能的塔楼，黄昏如插画。"],"hp":["Fairytale-castle world around [Subject], storybook stone, impossible turrets, dusk as illustration.","围绕[主体]的童话城堡世界，故事书石头，不可能的塔楼，黄昏如插画。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/fairytale-castle/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Magical Realism","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/magical-realism","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/magical-realism.webp","Miracle without spectacle."],["Diorama","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/diorama","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/diorama-diorama-mini.webp","Shrink the epic until it fits a shelf."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"童话城堡"},"fallen-angel":{"t":"Fallen Angel","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/fallen-angel","d":["Fallen angel, the fallen angel look, is holy light after the drop: a shaft of dirty church air, low-key flesh, wrecked wings implied by cloth, shadow, or light. The face is the altar, and costume is optional.","堕落天使，即堕落天使风格，是坠落之后的神圣光：一束穿过脏教堂空气的光，低调光下的肌肤，残破翅膀由布料、阴影或光线暗示。脸就是祭坛，服装可选。"],"pi":["Place the body, the shaft, and the dark. Fallen-angel image of [Subject], wrecked wings implied, church light, a holy fall, beauty after the drop. Add nave or cliff, high dirty window camera-left, low-key, no superhero sheen, feathers optional and wrecked. Lock the camera.","安排身体、光束和黑暗。堕落天使影像 [主体]，暗示残破翅膀，教堂光，神圣坠落，坠落后的美。加中殿或悬崖，高处的脏窗在画面左侧，低调光，不要超级英雄光泽，羽毛可选且残破。锁定摄影机。"],"cp":["Fallen-angel image of [Subject], wrecked wings implied, church light, a holy fall, beauty after the drop.","堕落天使影像 [主体]，暗示残破翅膀，教堂光，神圣坠落，坠落后的美。"],"hp":["Fallen-angel image of [Subject], wrecked wings implied, church light, a holy fall, beauty after the drop.","堕落天使影像 [主体]，暗示残破翅膀，教堂光，神圣坠落，坠落后的美。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/fallen-angel/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Epiphany","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/epiphany","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/epiphany-epiphany-mini.webp","Understanding should be visible."],["Low-Key Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/low-key","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/low-key.webp","Mystery, crime, or moral night."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"堕天使"},"flash-comic":{"t":"Flash Comic","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/flash-comic","d":["Flash comic, the flash comic look, is comic ink plus a strobe bang: inked edges, halftone, and a hard white burst, print and paparazzi in one hit. A panel that detonates: quiet comic ink without the flash is the cousin, not this.","闪光漫画，即闪光漫画风格，是漫画墨迹加闪光灯爆闪：墨线边缘、半色调，以及一道硬白爆光，印刷感和狗仔感一击同时出现。一个会引爆的分格：没有闪光的安静漫画墨迹是近亲，不是这个。"],"pi":["Ink plus bang, mid-gesture. Flash-comic of [Subject], inked edges plus a strobe bang, print and paparazzi in one hit. Add halftone, one color spot, on-camera flash, no balloons, photographic structure under the ink.","墨迹加闪光，动作中段。闪光漫画 [主体]，墨线边缘加闪光灯爆发，印刷感和狗仔感一击同时出现。加半色调，一个色彩点缀，机顶闪光，不要对话气泡，墨迹之下是摄影结构。"],"cp":["Flash-comic of [Subject], inked edges plus a strobe bang, print and paparazzi in one hit.","闪光漫画 [主体]，墨线边缘加闪光灯爆发，印刷感和狗仔感一击同时出现。"],"hp":["Flash-comic of [Subject], inked edges plus a strobe bang, print and paparazzi in one hit.","闪光漫画 [主体]，墨线边缘加闪光灯爆发，印刷感和狗仔感一击同时出现。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/flash-comic-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/flash-comic-flash-comic-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/flash-comic.jpg","r":[["Comic","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/comic","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/comic-comic-mini.webp","Print is the world."],["2000s Paparazzi","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/2000s-paparazzi","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/2000s-paparazzi-2000s-paparazzi-mini.webp","Fame as a strobe."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"闪光漫画"},"hand-paint":{"t":"Hand Paint","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/hand-paint","d":["Hand paint, the hand paint look, is wet strokes laid over a living picture, a painter's wrist still in the shot or at least a stroke that just happened. Canvas is finished oil; this is paint as a verb.","手绘，即手绘风格，是覆盖在活画面上的湿笔触，画家的手腕仍在镜头里，或者至少有一笔刚刚发生。画布是完成态油画；这是把绘画当动词。"],"pi":["Wet, directional, face kept. Hand-paint over [Subject], wet strokes still moving, a painter's wrist in the picture. Add photographic underlayer, wet edges, optional brush in frame, eyes readable. Not dry varnish.","湿润，有方向，保留面部。在[主体]上手绘，湿笔触仍在移动，画家的手腕在画面里。加摄影底层，湿边缘，可选画笔入画，眼睛可读。不要干清漆。"],"cp":["Hand-paint over [Subject], wet strokes still moving, a painter's wrist in the picture.","在[主体]上手绘，湿笔触仍在移动，画家的手腕在画面里。"],"hp":["Hand-paint over [Subject], wet strokes still moving, a painter's wrist in the picture.","在[主体]上手绘，湿笔触仍在移动，画家的手腕在画面里。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/hand-paint/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Canvas","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/canvas","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/canvas.webp","The stock is paint."],["Akrill","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/akrill","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/akrill.webp","The pigment should sit on top."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"手绘风"},"ink-riot":{"t":"Ink Riot","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/ink-riot","d":["Ink riot, the ink riot effect, is liquid calligraphy occupying the air around a still-photographic subject: black and color blooming, dripping, exploding off a brush. The camera still needs a stand and a readable face, because the ink is weather, not a texture pack.","墨水暴动，即墨水暴动效果，是液体书法占据静帧摄影主体周围的空气：黑色与色彩绽放、滴落、从笔刷上炸开。摄影机仍需要支架和可读的面部，因为墨水是天气，不是纹理包。"],"pi":["Hold a readable subject, then the liquid. Ink riot around [Subject], black and color blooming in liquid, calligraphy as explosion, a page that fights. Add lock-off, key side, and which features must stay dry. For motion, ink blooms and settles. The person does not dissolve.","先保住可读主体，再处理液体。围绕[主体]的墨水暴动，黑色与色彩在液体中绽放，书法如爆炸，一页在抗争。加固定机位，主光侧，以及哪些特征必须保持干燥。动态上，墨水绽开并沉降。人物不会溶解。"],"cp":["Ink riot around [Subject], black and color blooming in liquid, calligraphy as explosion, a page that fights.","围绕[主体]的墨水暴动，黑色与色彩在液体中绽放，书法如爆炸，一页在抗争。"],"hp":["Ink riot around [Subject], black and color blooming in liquid, calligraphy as explosion, a page that fights.","围绕[主体]的墨水暴动，黑色与色彩在液体中绽放，书法如爆炸，一页在抗争。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/ink-riot-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ink-riot-ink-riot-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/ink-riot.jpg","r":[["Collage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/collage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/collage.webp","One image is not enough; stack them."],["Mixed Media","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/mixed-media","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mixed-media-mixed-media-mini.webp","No single medium owns the truth."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"泼墨特效"},"knights-diary":{"t":"Knight's Diary","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/knights-diary","d":["Knight's diary, the medieval diary look, treats the frame as an illuminated page that still has mud on it: gold leaf as light, iron texture, dirt on cloth, a tired face like a saint who has been outside. It is period matter, not a plastic castle fair.","骑士日记，即中世纪日记风格，把画面当成一页仍沾着泥的泥金手抄本：金箔作为光，铁质纹理，布上的污垢，一张疲惫的脸像在外风餐露宿的圣徒。它是时代物质，不是塑料城堡集市。"],"pi":["Gold, iron, mud, one tired face. Knight's-diary image of [Subject], illuminated-manuscript gold, iron, mud, a page from a crusade. Add 35mm lock-off, hard daylight, dirty cloth, gold as highlight, no clean LARP steel.","金、铁、泥，一张疲惫的脸。骑士日记影像 [主体]，泥金手抄本的金，铁，泥，一页来自十字军东征。加 35mm 固定机位，硬日光，脏布，金色作为高光，不要干净的真人角色扮演钢甲。"],"cp":["Knight's-diary image of [Subject], illuminated-manuscript gold, iron, mud, a page from a crusade.","骑士日记影像 [主体]，泥金手抄本的金，铁，泥，一页来自十字军东征。"],"hp":["Knight's-diary image of [Subject], illuminated-manuscript gold, iron, mud, a page from a crusade.","骑士日记影像 [主体]，泥金手抄本的金，铁，泥，一页来自十字军东征。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/knights-diary/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."],["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Ink Riot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/ink-riot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ink-riot-ink-riot-mini.webp","The image should spill."]],"z":"骑士日记"},"lava":{"t":"Lava","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/lava","d":["Lava, in lava look cinematography, is molten light: black crust, orange wounds, heat as the key from below, air that shimmers. The ground is still deciding, and an orange grade on a normal street is not geology.","熔岩，在熔岩风格电影摄影中，是熔融的光：黑色地壳，橙色伤口，热量作为来自下方的主光，空气闪烁。地面仍在决定形态，而普通街道上的橙色调色不是地质。"],"pi":["Key from below, crust, shimmer. Lava light on [Subject], black crust, orange wounds, heat as the key from below. Add night, small figure, heat warp, black rock, no park signs. Not an orange street LUT.","主光从下方来，地壳，闪烁。熔岩光照 [主体]，黑色地壳，橙色伤口，热量作为来自下方的主光。加夜晚，小人物，热浪扭曲，黑色岩石，不要公园标志。不是橙色街景 LUT。"],"cp":["Lava light on [Subject], black crust, orange wounds, heat as the key from below.","熔岩光照 [主体]，黑色地壳，橙色伤口，热量作为来自下方的主光。"],"hp":["Lava light on [Subject], black crust, orange wounds, heat as the key from below.","熔岩光照 [主体]，黑色地壳，橙色伤口，热量作为来自下方的主光。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/lava-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lava-lava-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/lava.jpg","r":[["Hard Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/hard-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hard-light.webp","Grit, noon sun, or interrogation."],["Underlighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/under-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/under-light.webp","The source is fire, a screen on the floor, or a monster."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"熔岩风"},"lost-in-a-book":{"t":"Lost in a Book","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/lost-in-a-book","d":["Lost in a book, the lost in a book effect, uses an open volume as a door: near-plane paper, a gutter as threshold, illustration or weather coming out of the page, a reader looking in or falling in. A person reading on a couch is not the recipe.","迷失书中（lost in a book）效果把一本打开的书当作门：近景层面的纸张，书页中缝作为门槛，插画或天气从书页中出来，一位读者向内看或坠入其中。一个人坐在沙发上看书不是这个配方。"],"pi":["Book near, world leaving the gutter. Lost-in-a-book of [Subject], a reader falling into illustration, pages becoming rooms. Add open book in foreground, unreadable type as texture, light or weather from the page, one world on the other side. Not a couch with a closed book.","书在近处，世界正离开书页中缝。迷失书中的[主体]，一位读者坠入插画，书页变成房间。在前景加入打开的书，不可读的文字作为质感，光或天气从书页中溢出，一个世界在另一侧。不要沙发和一本合上的书。"],"cp":["Lost-in-a-book of [Subject], a reader falling into illustration, pages becoming rooms.","迷失书中的[主体]，一位读者坠入插画，书页变成房间。"],"hp":["Lost-in-a-book of [Subject], a reader falling into illustration, pages becoming rooms.","迷失书中的[主体]，一位读者坠入插画，书页变成房间。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/lost-in-a-book-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lost-in-a-book-lost-in-a-book-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/lost-in-a-book.jpg","r":[["Object Portal","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/object-portal","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/object-portal-object-portal-mini.webp","A prop is a wormhole."],["Fairytale Castle","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/fairytale-castle","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fairytale-castle.webp","The location is a tale."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"书中奇遇"},"lsd":{"t":"LSD","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/lsd","d":["LSD, the lsd visual look, is an optical state: light trails, slight double edges, oversaturated practicals, walls on a slow inhale. Perception is the set, not a scene of drug use and not a rainbow LUT.","LSD，LSD 视觉效果，是一种光学状态：光轨拖尾、轻微双重边缘、过饱和的实景光源、墙壁缓慢吸气。感知就是布景，不是吸毒场景，也不是彩虹 LUT。"],"pi":["One room, a readable human, then the optics. LSD look on [Subject], trails, breathing walls, too much chroma, a room that will not stay put. Add lock-off or slow drift, practicals that trail, no paraphernalia. Motion: walls inhale, trails persist, identity holds.","一个房间，一个可辨认的人，然后是光学效果。LSD 效果作用于[主体]，拖尾，呼吸的墙壁，过量的色度，一个不肯待在原处的房间。加入固定机位或缓慢漂移，会拖尾的实景光源，不要吸毒用具。运动：墙壁吸气，拖尾持续，身份保持。"],"cp":["LSD look on [Subject], trails, breathing walls, too much chroma, a room that will not stay put.","LSD 效果作用于[主体]，拖尾，呼吸的墙壁，过量的色度，一个不肯待在原处的房间。"],"hp":["LSD look on [Subject], trails, breathing walls, too much chroma, a room that will not stay put.","LSD 效果作用于[主体]，拖尾，呼吸的墙壁，过量的色度，一个不肯待在原处的房间。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/lsd-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/lsd-lsd-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/lsd.jpg","r":[["Acid","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/acid","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/acid-acid-mini.webp","The dyes should misbehave."],["Altered State","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/altered-state","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/altered-state-altered-state-mini.webp","The mind is the location."],["Color Shift","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/color-shift","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/color-shift-075-monochrome-to-color-revelation-mini.webp","Color is the event."]],"z":"迷幻风"},"magazine":{"t":"Magazine","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/magazine","d":["Magazine, in magazine cover cinematography, is a designed portrait with air for a masthead you will not render: fashion lighting, thumbnail-readable wardrobe, a page that knows it will be sold. Layout first, person second, and fake headlines will garble.","杂志，在杂志封面摄影中，是一种设计过的肖像，为你不渲染的刊头留出空气：时尚布光、缩略图可辨的服装、一个知道自己会被售卖的页面。先版式，后人，假标题会乱码。"],"pi":["Design the air, then the face. Magazine cover of [Subject], masthead space, fashion lighting, a page that knows it will be sold. Add 85mm, beauty key, negative space at top or side, thumbnail wardrobe, no letters, no sidewalk flash.","先设计空气，再设计脸。杂志封面的[主体]，刊头空间，时尚布光，一个知道自己会被售卖的页面。加入 85mm、美颜主光、顶部或侧面的负空间、缩略图可辨的服装、不要文字、不要人行道闪光灯。"],"cp":["Magazine cover of [Subject], masthead space, fashion lighting, a page that knows it will be sold.","杂志封面的[主体]，刊头空间，时尚布光，一个知道自己会被售卖的页面。"],"hp":["Magazine cover of [Subject], masthead space, fashion lighting, a page that knows it will be sold.","杂志封面的[主体]，刊头空间，时尚布光，一个知道自己会被售卖的页面。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/magazine/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Glam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/glam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/glam.webp","Sell the face."],["Superstar","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/superstar","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/superstar-superstar-mini.webp","They are already famous in the frame."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"杂志封面"},"marble":{"t":"Marble","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/marble","d":["Marble, in marble look cinematography, is stone as flesh: veined whites, cold polish, a statue that still breathes. They should look quarried: pale beauty skin without veins is not mineral.","大理石，在大理石效果摄影中，是石头作为肉身：带纹理的白色、冷抛光、一座仍在呼吸的雕像。他们应该看起来像采石场出来的：没有纹理的苍白美妆皮肤不是矿物。"],"pi":["Veins, polish, cold skylight. Marble look on [Subject], veined stone as flesh, cold polish, a statue that still breathes. Add gallery north light, mineral flesh, no shader cyc, no graffiti type.","纹理，抛光，冷天光。大理石效果作用于[主体]，带纹理的石头作为肉身，冷抛光，一座仍在呼吸的雕像。加入画廊北光、矿物肉身、不要着色器天幕、不要涂鸦字体。"],"cp":["Marble look on [Subject], veined stone as flesh, cold polish, a statue that still breathes.","大理石效果作用于[主体]，带纹理的石头作为肉身，冷抛光，一座仍在呼吸的雕像。"],"hp":["Marble look on [Subject], veined stone as flesh, cold polish, a statue that still breathes.","大理石效果作用于[主体]，带纹理的石头作为肉身，冷抛光，一座仍在呼吸的雕像。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/marble/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["3D Render","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/3d-render","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/3d-render.webp","They should look computed."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."],["Ink Riot","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/ink-riot","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ink-riot-ink-riot-mini.webp","The image should spill."]],"z":"大理石雕像"},"mighty-fighter":{"t":"Mighty Fighter","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/mighty-fighter","d":["Mighty fighter, the mighty fighter look, is a living champion posed like cabinet art: oversized stance, hard rim, toy-box color, the city small behind them. It is a lock-off win pose, not a camera move and not motion blur.","强力斗士，强力斗士效果，是一位活生生的冠军像街机柜艺术那样摆姿：夸张站姿、硬轮廓光、玩具盒色彩、城市在他们身后变小。这是固定机位的胜利姿势，不是摄影机运动，也不是运动模糊。"],"pi":["Lock a low three-quarter, then the pose. Mighty-fighter frame of [Subject], toy-box combat, oversized stance, a champion posed for a cabinet art. Add hard rim, saturated sharp color, one figure, stage background, no motion blur.","锁定低角度四分之三，然后摆姿势。强力斗士画面的[主体]，玩具盒式战斗，夸张站姿，一位为街机柜艺术摆姿的冠军。加入硬轮廓光、饱和锐利的颜色、一个人物、舞台背景、不要运动模糊。"],"cp":["Mighty-fighter frame of [Subject], toy-box combat, oversized stance, a champion posed for a cabinet art.","强力斗士画面的[主体]，玩具盒式战斗，夸张站姿，一位为街机柜艺术摆姿的冠军。"],"hp":["Mighty-fighter frame of [Subject], toy-box combat, oversized stance, a champion posed for a cabinet art.","强力斗士画面的[主体]，玩具盒式战斗，夸张站姿，一位为街机柜艺术摆姿的冠军。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/mighty-fighter-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/mighty-fighter-mighty-fighter-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/mighty-fighter.jpg","r":[["Hero Cam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/hero-cam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/hero-cam-hero-cam-mini.webp","They should look inevitable."],["Action Figure","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/action-figure","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/action-figure.webp","Sell them in a box."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"超能战士"},"modern":{"t":"Modern","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/modern","d":["Modern, in modern architecture cinematography, makes the room the thesis: glass planes, a designed void, a person small in Mies-or-Ando geometry. Production design first, and a loft with string lights is not this.","现代，在现代建筑摄影中，让房间成为论点：玻璃平面、被设计过的虚空、一个人物在密斯或安藤式的几何中显得渺小。先做美术设计，一个挂着串灯的 Loft 不是这个。"],"pi":["Planes, glass, one figure, few objects. Modern architecture around [Subject], glass planes, a designed void, the room as the thesis. Add 35mm lock-off, daylight as a blade, two greys, count the objects and delete extras.","平面，玻璃，一个人物，少量物体。现代建筑环绕[主体]，玻璃平面，被设计过的虚空，房间作为论点。加入 35mm 固定机位，日光如刀锋，两种灰色，数一数物体并删掉多余的。"],"cp":["Modern architecture around [Subject], glass planes, a designed void, the room as the thesis.","现代建筑环绕[主体]，玻璃平面，被设计过的虚空，房间作为论点。"],"hp":["Modern architecture around [Subject], glass planes, a designed void, the room as the thesis.","现代建筑环绕[主体]，玻璃平面，被设计过的虚空，房间作为论点。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/modern/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Negative Space","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/negative-space","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/negative-space-042-negative-space-v2-mini.webp","Loneliness needs room."],["Symmetry","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/composition/symmetry","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/symmetry.webp","The world is designed. Or pretending to be."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"现代建筑风"},"monet-muse":{"t":"Monet Muse","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/monet-muse","d":["Monet muse, the monet look, dissolves a photographic scene into broken color: garden dabs, water as strokes, optical mix in the eye. Light is the subject, and defocus is not the same thing.","莫奈缪斯，莫奈效果，将摄影场景溶入破碎色彩：花园点触、水作为笔触、在眼睛里光学混合。光是主体，而散焦不是同一回事。"],"pi":["Dabs, not blur. Monet-muse image of [Subject], broken color, garden light, water as dabs, impression as grade. Add garden or water, high sun, optical mix, enough drawing to keep a person. No hard ink edges. No defocus-as-paint.","点触，不是模糊。莫奈缪斯画面的[主体]，破碎色彩，花园光，水作为点触，印象作为调色。加入花园或水，高日照，光学混合，足够的人物造型让人物保持可辨。不要硬墨边。不要用散焦当颜料。"],"cp":["Monet-muse image of [Subject], broken color, garden light, water as dabs, impression as grade.","莫奈缪斯画面的[主体]，破碎色彩，花园光，水作为点触，印象作为调色。"],"hp":["Monet-muse image of [Subject], broken color, garden light, water as dabs, impression as grade.","莫奈缪斯画面的[主体]，破碎色彩，花园光，水作为点触，印象作为调色。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/monet-muse/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Canvas","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/canvas","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/canvas.webp","The stock is paint."],["Golden Hour","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/golden-hour","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/golden-hour.webp","You have twenty minutes of truth."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"莫奈画风"},"multiverse":{"t":"Multiverse","c":"viral-looks","g":"Dream within a dream","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/multiverse","d":["Multiverse, the multiverse look, puts the same person in parallel rooms, grades, and costumes at once, so one life is not the inventory. Versions must be separable: a double-exposure mush is not the recipe.","多元宇宙，多元宇宙效果，把同一个人同时放进平行房间、调色和服装中，因此一种人生不是全部清单。各个版本必须可区分：双重曝光的糊成一团不是这个配方。"],"pi":["Same person, separable worlds. Multiverse split of [Subject], many versions, many grades, the same person in parallel rooms. Add two or three wardrobes, two or three grades, architecture repeating with variations, identity locked. No mush.","同一个人，可分离的世界。[主体] 的多重宇宙分割：许多版本、许多调色，同一个人身处平行的房间。补上两三套造型、两三种调色，建筑在重复中变化，身份锁定。不要一团糊。"],"cp":["Plan three connected worlds: a real hospital room, a dreamed railway station and a deeper childhood kitchen. Give each one distinct sound, light and a recurring object. A falling cup in the hospital creates a distant rumble in the station and a tremor in the kitchen. Generate and edit the levels separately with a consistent causal map.","规划三个互相连通的世界：真实的病房、梦中的火车站、更深层的童年厨房。给每一个世界独立的声音、光线和一个反复出现的物件。病房里掉落的杯子，在车站引起一声远处的闷响，在厨房引起一次震动。各层分别生成与剪辑，但要有一张一致的因果图。"],"hp":["Multiverse split of [Subject], many versions, many grades, the same person in parallel rooms.","多元宇宙分割的[主体]，许多版本，许多调色，同一个人在不同平行房间中。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/multiverse-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/multiverse-multiverse-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/multiverse.jpg","r":[["Duplication","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/duplication","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/duplication-duplication-mini.webp","One person is not a single self."],["Split Screen","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/editing/split-screen","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/split-screen-120-simultaneous-split-screen-mini.webp","Two rooms, one moment."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"多元宇宙"},"noir":{"t":"Noir","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/noir","d":["Noir, the noir preset look, is wet streets, venetian gobos, and a crime already in the lighting: a motivated hard key, black pools, a face half-deleted. Night is moral, and a dark photo with teal is not this.","黑色电影，黑色电影预设效果，是湿街道、百叶窗遮光图案，以及已经在灯光里的罪行：有动机的硬主光、黑色阴影池、脸被抹掉一半。夜晚具有道德性，一张带青绿色的暗照片不是这个。"],"pi":["Hard key, gobo, wet ground. Noir look on [Subject], wet streets, venetian gobos, a crime already in the lighting. Add 35mm lock-off, motivated hard key, slashes, face half-deleted, one deep practical. No teal mush.","硬主光，遮光图案，湿地面。黑色电影效果作用于[主体]，湿街道，百叶窗遮光图案，罪行已经在灯光里。加入 35mm 固定机位、有动机的硬主光、光刃、脸被抹掉一半、一个深色实景光源。不要青绿色糊成一团。"],"cp":["Noir look on [Subject], wet streets, venetian gobos, a crime already in the lighting.","黑色电影效果作用于[主体]，湿街道，百叶窗遮光图案，罪行已经在灯光里。"],"hp":["Noir look on [Subject], wet streets, venetian gobos, a crime already in the lighting.","黑色电影效果作用于[主体]，湿街道，百叶窗遮光图案，罪行已经在灯光里。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/noir/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Film Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/film-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/film-noir.webp","Crime, guilt, and streetlamps."],["Neo-Noir","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/neo-noir","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neo-noir.webp","Noir after color was invented."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"黑白侦探风"},"orbital-presence":{"t":"Orbital Presence","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/orbital-presence","d":["Orbital presence hangs a body in vacuum over a planet: hard unfiltered sun, no air fill, a sharp planetary limb, the person as a satellite. Put them in orbit: a studio globe behind an actor is not the recipe.","轨道存在感把一具身体悬挂在行星上方的真空中：未经过滤的硬太阳、没有空气补光、锐利的行星边缘，人作为卫星。把他们放进轨道：演员身后的摄影棚地球仪不是这个配方。"],"pi":["Vacuum, limb, small body. Orbital presence of [Subject], a body hanging over a planet, scale of prayer or threat, the person as a satellite. Add hard sun, no atmosphere on the figure, sharp planet, 24-35mm lock-off, no HUD text.","真空，星球边缘，小身体。轨道存在感的[主体]，一具身体悬挂在行星上方，祈祷或威胁的尺度，人作为卫星。加入硬太阳，人物上没有大气，锐利的行星，24-35mm 固定机位，不要 HUD 文字。"],"cp":["Orbital presence of [Subject], a body hanging over a planet, scale of prayer or threat, the person as a satellite.","轨道存在感的[主体]，一具身体悬挂在行星上方，祈祷或威胁的尺度，人作为卫星。"],"hp":["Orbital presence of [Subject], a body hanging over a planet, scale of prayer or threat, the person as a satellite.","轨道存在感的[主体]，一具身体悬挂在行星上方，祈祷或威胁的尺度，人作为卫星。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/orbital-presence-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/orbital-presence-orbital-presence-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/orbital-presence.jpg","r":[["Earth Zoom","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/earth-zoom","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/earth-zoom-earth-zoom-mini.webp","Start from the planet."],["Aerial","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/aerial","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/aerial-012-aerial-pursuit-and-landscape-mini.webp","Open a world. Make the place bigger than the person."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"太空漂浮"},"origami":{"t":"Origami","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/origami","d":["Origami, in origami look cinematography, is paper as lawful sculpture: creases, planar color, a person or city becoming a fold. The world folds, and torn pulp without crease law is paper, not this.","折纸，在折纸感的电影摄影中，是纸作为合乎规则的雕塑：折痕、平面色彩，人或城市变成一道折痕。世界在折叠，而没有折痕规则的撕裂纸浆是纸张，不是这个。"],"pi":["Creases, planes, sharp edges. Origami world of [Subject], lawful creases, planar color, a person or city becoming a fold. Add hard light, no torn-fiber paper look, no letters, the world folding, not a prop crane.","折痕、平面、锐利边缘。折纸世界：[主体]，合乎规则的折痕，平面色彩，人或城市变成一道折痕。加入硬光，不要撕裂纤维的纸张质感，不要文字，世界在折叠，不是道具纸鹤。"],"cp":["Origami world of [Subject], lawful creases, planar color, a person or city becoming a fold.","折纸世界：[主体]，合乎规则的折痕，平面色彩，人或城市变成一道折痕。"],"hp":["Origami world of [Subject], lawful creases, planar color, a person or city becoming a fold.","折纸世界：[主体]，合乎规则的折痕，平面色彩，人或城市变成一道折痕。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/origami/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Paper","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/paper","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/paper.webp","The world is pulp."],["Diorama","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/diorama","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/diorama-diorama-mini.webp","Shrink the epic until it fits a shelf."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"折纸风"},"paper":{"t":"Paper","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/paper","d":["Paper, in paper look cinematography, is the world as pulp: torn stock, visible fibers, a person as a cut-out on a page. The world is pulp, and creased lawful sculpture is origami, not this.","纸，在纸感的电影摄影中，是世界作为纸浆：撕裂的纸料，可见纤维，人物像页面上的剪贴。世界是纸浆，而带折痕的规则化雕塑是折纸，不是这个。"],"pi":["Pulp, tear, cut-out. Paper world of [Subject], torn stock, visible fibers, a person as a cut-out on pulp. Add raking light on fibers, torn edges, no lawful origami creases, no readable type.","纸浆、撕痕、剪贴。纸的世界：[主体]，撕裂的纸料，可见纤维，人物像纸浆上的剪贴。加入侧掠光打在纤维上，撕裂边缘，不要有规则的折纸折痕，不要可读文字。"],"cp":["Paper world of [Subject], torn stock, visible fibers, a person as a cut-out on pulp.","纸的世界：[主体]，撕裂的纸料，可见纤维，人物像纸浆上的剪贴。"],"hp":["Paper world of [Subject], torn stock, visible fibers, a person as a cut-out on pulp.","纸的世界：[主体]，撕裂的纸料，可见纤维，人物像纸浆上的剪贴。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/paper/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Origami","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/origami","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/origami.webp","The world folds."],["Collage","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/collage","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/collage.webp","One image is not enough; stack them."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"纸艺风"},"pearl-earring":{"t":"Pearl Earring","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/pearl-earring","d":["Pearl earring, the pearl earring look, is a Dutch interior as grade: one north window, dark earth ground, skin like painted light, a small specular on a jewel. One window, one jewel, one look, and it is not a replica of a copyrighted painting.","珍珠耳环，珍珠耳环感，是以荷兰室内作为调色：一扇北窗，深色土质地面，皮肤像被画出的光，珠宝上有一点高光。一扇窗、一件珠宝、一种感觉，而且它不是对受版权保护画作的复制。"],"pi":["One window, then the face. Pearl-earring portrait of [Subject], Vermeer window, turban implied, a quiet Dutch interior as grade. Add 85mm lock-off, cool daylight camera-left, dark earth ground, small specular on the jewel, no beauty dish. New person, not a replica pose.","一扇窗，然后是面孔。珍珠耳环肖像：[主体]，维米尔式窗户，暗示头巾，安静的荷兰室内作为调色。加入85mm固定机位，冷日光从摄影机左侧来，深色土质地面，珠宝上有一点高光，不要美人碟。新人物，不是复制姿势。"],"cp":["Pearl-earring portrait of [Subject], Vermeer window, turban implied, a quiet Dutch interior as grade.","珍珠耳环肖像：[主体]，维米尔式窗户，暗示头巾，安静的荷兰室内作为调色。"],"hp":["Pearl-earring portrait of [Subject], Vermeer window, turban implied, a quiet Dutch interior as grade.","珍珠耳环肖像：[主体]，维米尔式窗户，暗示头巾，安静的荷兰室内作为调色。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/pearl-earring/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Window Light","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/window-light","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/window-light.webp","Day interiors without looking lit."],["Rembrandt Lighting","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/rembrandt","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/rembrandt.webp","Classic dramatic portrait."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"珍珠耳环少女"},"penguin-ride":{"t":"Penguin Ride","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/penguin-ride","d":["Penguin ride, as a penguin ride preset, is an absurd mount played straight: a person on a penguin through ice, slush, or the wrong city. The vehicle is the joke, and a penguin standing next to a person is not the sentence.","企鹅骑行，作为企鹅骑行预设，是一本正经地处理荒诞坐骑：一个人骑着企鹅穿过冰原、雪泥或错误的城市。交通工具就是笑点，而企鹅站在人旁边不是这个表达。"],"pi":["Mounted, ice, no wink. Penguin-ride of [Subject], an absurd mount, ice gag, tourism of the wrong animal. Add wide lens, readable penguin, slush in air, face committed. Video: [Subject] rides a penguin through ice or city, a straight-faced gag.","骑乘、冰、不要眨眼示意。企鹅骑行：[主体]，荒诞坐骑，冰上笑点，错误动物的观光。加入广角镜头，企鹅清晰可辨，空中雪泥，表情认真。视频：[主体]骑着企鹅穿过冰原或城市，一个一本正经的笑点。"],"cp":["[Subject] rides a penguin through ice or city, a straight-faced gag.","[主体]骑着企鹅穿过冰原或城市，一个一本正经的笑点。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/penguin-ride-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/penguin-ride-penguin-ride-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/penguin-ride.jpg","r":[["Dolphin Ride","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/dolphin-ride","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolphin-ride-dolphin-ride-mini.webp","The gag is the vehicle."],["Skatedog","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/skatedog","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/skatedog-skatedog-mini.webp","Keep it stupid and low."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"骑企鹅"},"pigeons":{"t":"Pigeons","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/pigeons","d":["Pigeons, as a pigeons video preset, is a city takeoff: a stable person and a flock bursting as confetti, wings filling the air, then settling. The flock is the move, and the person is the hold.","鸽子，作为鸽子视频预设，是城市起飞：稳定的人物和像彩纸屑一样爆开的鸽群，翅膀充满空气，然后落定。鸽群是动作，人物是保持不动。"],"pi":["Hold the person, explode the flock. Pigeons bursting around [Subject], a city takeoff, wings as confetti, the square exploding into birds. Add plaza, 24mm, sun or stone bounce, face visible through wings. Video: A flock explodes around [Subject], wings filling the air, then settling.","稳住人物，炸开鸽群。鸽子在[主体]周围爆散，城市起飞，翅膀如彩纸屑，广场炸成鸟群。加入广场，24mm，阳光或石材反光，面孔透过翅膀可见。视频：一群鸽子在[主体]周围炸开，翅膀充满空气，然后落定。"],"cp":["A flock explodes around [Subject], wings filling the air, then settling.","一群鸽子在[主体]周围炸开，翅膀充满空气，然后落定。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/pigeons-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/pigeons-pigeons-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/pigeons.jpg","r":[["Particles","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/particles","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/particles-particles-mini.webp","The air should be countable."],["Handheld","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/handheld","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/handheld-017-handheld-witness-camera-mini.webp","Urgency, documentary truth, or a mind that cannot sit still."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"鸽群"},"puffin-ride":{"t":"Puffin Ride","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/puffin-ride","d":["Puffin ride, as a puffin ride preset, is a commute on the wrong bird: a person mounted on a puffin against cliffs and spray, orange beak readable, played straight. A puffin next to a hiker is not the gag.","海鹦骑行，作为海鹦骑行预设，是骑错鸟的通勤：一个人骑着海鹦冲向悬崖和浪花，橙色喙清晰可辨，一本正经地演。海鹦站在徒步者旁边不是这个笑点。"],"pi":["Cliffs, spray, mounted seabird. Puffin-ride of [Subject], an absurd seabird mount, cliffs and spray, a commute on the wrong bird. Add readable puffin, orange beak, face committed, no logos. Video: [Subject] rides a puffin against cliffs or surf, a straight-faced gag.","悬崖、浪花、骑上海鸟。海鹦骑行：[主体]，荒诞的海鸟坐骑，悬崖与浪花，骑错鸟的通勤。加入清晰可辨的海鹦，橙色喙，表情认真，不要标志。视频：[主体]骑着海鹦冲向悬崖或海浪，一个一本正经的笑点。"],"cp":["[Subject] rides a puffin against cliffs or surf, a straight-faced gag.","[主体]骑着海鹦冲向悬崖或海浪，一个一本正经的笑点。"],"hp":0,"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/puffin-ride-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/puffin-ride-puffin-ride-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/puffin-ride.jpg","r":[["Penguin Ride","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/penguin-ride","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/penguin-ride-penguin-ride-mini.webp","The vehicle is the joke."],["Dolphin Ride","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/dolphin-ride","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/dolphin-ride-dolphin-ride-mini.webp","The gag is the vehicle."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"骑海鹦"},"race-track":{"t":"Race Track","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/race-track","d":["Race track, the race track look, pins a body or a machine to circuit geometry: oval, painted curbs, catch fencing, grandstands, speed as a closed loop. The oval is the set, and a car on a generic highway is not the recipe.","赛道，赛道感，把身体或机器钉在环形赛道几何上：椭圆、涂漆路缘、防护网、看台，速度作为闭环。椭圆是片场，而一辆普通公路上的车不是这个配方。"],"pi":["Show the oval, then the person or car. Race-track world of [Subject], oval geometry, painted curbs, grandstands, speed as a closed loop. Add curbs, catch fence, stands, heat haze, no sponsor letters. Highway is illegal.","先展示椭圆，再展示人或车。赛道世界：[主体]，椭圆几何，涂漆路缘，看台，速度作为闭环。加入路缘、防护网、看台、热浪，不要赞助商文字。高速公路不可用。"],"cp":["Race-track world of [Subject], oval geometry, painted curbs, grandstands, speed as a closed loop.","[主体]的赛道世界，椭圆几何，涂漆路缘，看台，速度作为闭环。"],"hp":["Race-track world of [Subject], oval geometry, painted curbs, grandstands, speed as a closed loop.","[主体]的赛道世界，椭圆几何，涂漆路缘，看台，速度作为闭环。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/race-track-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/race-track-race-track-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/race-track.jpg","r":[["Road Rush","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/road-rush","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/road-rush-road-rush-mini.webp","The road is the subject."],["Car Chasing","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/car-chasing","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/car-chasing-car-chasing-mini.webp","Two machines, one argument."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"赛道"},"random-glow":{"t":"Random Glow","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/random-glow","d":["Random glow, the random glow look, is unmotivated orbs and analog leaks: a frame haunted by lamps that will not sit still. Optical accidents as style: even diffusion is the failure.","随机泛光，随机泛光感，是无来源光球和模拟漏光：被无法静止的灯光萦绕的画面。把光学意外当作风格：均匀柔光是失败。"],"pi":["Uneven orbs, face clear. Random glow on [Subject], unmotivated orbs and analog leaks, a frame haunted by lamps. Add lock-off, some clean skin, irregular blooms, analog leak. Not even diffusion. Not a full wash.","不均匀光球，面孔清晰。[主体]上的随机泛光，无来源光球和模拟漏光，被灯光萦绕的画面。加入固定机位，一些干净皮肤，不规则光晕，模拟漏光。不是均匀柔光。不是全面色光铺满。"],"cp":["Random glow on [Subject], unmotivated orbs and analog leaks, a frame haunted by lamps.","[主体]上的随机泛光，无来源光球和模拟漏光，被灯光萦绕的画面。"],"hp":["Random glow on [Subject], unmotivated orbs and analog leaks, a frame haunted by lamps.","[主体]上的随机泛光，无来源光球和模拟漏光，被灯光萦绕的画面。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/random-glow-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/random-glow-random-glow-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/random-glow.jpg","r":[["Light Leak","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/light-leak","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/light-leak.webp","Memory, damaged time, or analog accident."],["Halation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/halation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/halation-061-diffusion-and-halation-mini.webp","Highlights should bleed like film, not clip like video."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"随机辉光"},"skatedog":{"t":"Skatedog","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/skatedog","d":["Skatedog, as a skatedog preset, is pavement grammar: camera near the deck or the paws, wide lens, asphalt in the foreground, a creature or rider in street sport as a joke. Keep it stupid and low, because standing height is the failure.","滑板狗，作为滑板狗预设，是路面语法：摄影机靠近板面或爪子，广角镜头，沥青在前景，一个生物或滑手以街头运动作为玩笑。让它蠢一点、低一点，因为站立高度就是失败。"],"pi":["Get on the ground. Skatedog energy around [Subject], low wide, pavement, a creature or rider in street grammar, joke as sport. Add 14-24mm, camera near deck or paws, hard sun or sodium, dirty wheels or paws, no hero rim.","贴到地面。[主体]周围的滑板狗能量，低机位广角，路面，街头语法中的生物或滑手，笑点即运动。加入14-24mm，摄影机靠近板面或爪子，硬阳光或钠灯，脏轮子或脏爪子，不要英雄轮廓光。"],"cp":["Skatedog energy around [Subject], low wide, pavement, a creature or rider in street grammar, joke as sport.","[主体]周围的滑板狗能量，低机位广角，路面，街头语法中的生物或滑手，笑点即运动。"],"hp":["Skatedog energy around [Subject], low wide, pavement, a creature or rider in street grammar, joke as sport.","[主体]周围的滑板狗能量，低机位广角，路面，街头语法中的生物或滑手，笑点即运动。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/skatedog-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/skatedog-skatedog-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/skatedog.jpg","r":[["Ground Level","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-angles/ground-level","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ground-level.webp","Start from the dirt."],["FPV Drone","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/camera-movement/fpv-drone","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fpv-drone-fpv-drone-mini.webp","Impossible proximity and speed. Not a cinematic crane; a missile with a lens."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"滑板狗"},"sketch":{"t":"Sketch","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/sketch","d":["Sketch, in sketch cinematography, is line on paper before paint: searching contours, hatching in the shadows, reserved paper in the lights, a drawing that still looks. Unfinished is the look, and a clean vector portrait is not.","素描，在素描感的电影摄影中，是上色前纸上的线条：试探性的轮廓，阴影中的排线，亮部保留纸白，一幅仍然能看的画。未完成就是这种感觉，而干净矢量肖像不是。"],"pi":["Stop before the paint. Sketch treatment of [Subject], line, paper tooth, unfinished hatching, a drawing that still looks. Add paper white in the lights, hatching in shadow, searching lines, eyes tighter than the room. No clean vector.","在上色前停下。[主体]的素描处理，线条，纸张纹理，未完成的排线，一幅仍然能看的画。加入亮部纸白，阴影排线，试探性线条，眼睛比房间刻画更紧。不要干净矢量。"],"cp":["Sketch treatment of [Subject], line, paper tooth, unfinished hatching, a drawing that still looks.","[主体]的素描处理，线条，纸张纹理，未完成的排线，一幅仍然能看的画。"],"hp":["Sketch treatment of [Subject], line, paper tooth, unfinished hatching, a drawing that still looks.","[主体]的素描处理，线条，纸张纹理，未完成的排线，一幅仍然能看的画。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/sketch/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Canvas","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/canvas","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/canvas.webp","The stock is paint."],["Animation","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/genre-looks/animation","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/animation.webp","The world is constructed, not captured."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"素描风"},"superstar":{"t":"Superstar","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/superstar","d":["Superstar, the superstar look, is a face built for covers: beauty key, catchlights, a flash wall or crowd implied, wardrobe that photographs as money. Fame is a fact in the lighting, and the room is already looking.","巨星（superstar look，巨星感）就是一张为封面而生的脸：美颜主光、眼神光、暗示有闪光灯墙或人群在场、拍出来尽显身价的服装。名气是打光里的事实，而整个房间早已在注视。"],"pi":["Beauty key, eyeline, implied public. Superstar treatment of [Subject], paparazzi bloom, flash wall, a face built for covers. Add 85mm, catchlights, clean frame, wardrobe that photographs as money. No compact-digital accident.","美颜主光、视线、暗示公众在场。对[主体]施以巨星待遇，狗仔泛光、闪光灯墙、一张为封面而生的脸。加上 85mm、眼神光、干净的画面、拍出来尽显身价的服装。不要卡片数码相机的意外直闪感。"],"cp":["Superstar treatment of [Subject], paparazzi bloom, flash wall, a face built for covers.","对[主体]施以巨星待遇，狗仔泛光、闪光灯墙，一张为封面而生的脸。"],"hp":["Superstar treatment of [Subject], paparazzi bloom, flash wall, a face built for covers.","对[主体]施以巨星待遇，狗仔泛光、闪光灯墙，一张为封面而生的脸。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/superstar-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/superstar-superstar-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/superstar.jpg","r":[["Glam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/glam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/glam.webp","Sell the face."],["2000s Paparazzi","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/2000s-paparazzi","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/2000s-paparazzi-2000s-paparazzi-mini.webp","Fame as a strobe."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"巨星光环"},"toxic":{"t":"Toxic","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/toxic","d":["Toxic, in toxic look cinematography, is air as contamination: sick greens, yellow haze, fumes you can backlight. The air is a hazard, and a teal grade with no particles is not poison.","毒气（toxic look，毒气感）在电影摄影里是作为污染物的空气：病态的绿色、黄色雾霾、可以打逆光的烟气。空气本身就是危险，而没有颗粒的青绿调色算不上毒。"],"pi":["Backlight the fumes. Toxic air around [Subject], sick greens, yellow haze, poison you can see. Add wet industrial ground, a figure, particles in air, no biohazard type. Not a teal wash.","给烟雾打逆光。[主体]周围的毒气，病态的绿色、黄色雾霾、看得见的毒。加上潮湿的工业地面、一个人影、空气中的颗粒，不要生物危险标识字样。不是青绿一片。"],"cp":["Toxic air around [Subject], sick greens, yellow haze, poison you can see.","[主体]周围的毒气，病态的绿色、黄色雾霾、看得见的毒。"],"hp":["Toxic air around [Subject], sick greens, yellow haze, poison you can see.","[主体]周围的毒气，病态的绿色、黄色雾霾、看得见的毒。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/toxic-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/toxic-toxic-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/toxic.jpg","r":[["Fog","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/atmosphere/fog","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/fog.webp","Hide geography. Delay the reveal."],["Particles","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/effects/particles","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/particles-particles-mini.webp","The air should be countable."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"毒气风"},"two-color":{"t":"Two Color","c":"viral-looks","g":"Color isolation","u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/two-color","d":["Two color, in two color cinematography, is a duotone law: a pair of hues doing all the drawing, print as cinematography. Two inks, no extras: teal-and-orange with a thousand leftovers is not this.","双色（two color cinematography，双色摄影）是一条双色调法则：一对色相承担全部造型，像印刷一样的摄影。两种油墨，没有多余的：带着一千种杂色的青橙不是这一回事。"],"pi":["Name the two hues and assign them. Two-color law on [Subject], a pair of hues doing all the drawing, print as cinematography. Add wardrobe planned for the split, lock-off, no leftover inks, stable through motion. Not teal-orange.","说清是哪两种色相，并分配好。对[主体]施以双色法则，一对色相承担全部造型，像印刷一样的摄影。加上为这种分离预先规划的服装、固定机位、没有多余的油墨、运动中保持稳定。不是青橙。"],"cp":["A crowded monochrome railway platform, with only one small yellow suitcase retaining its natural color. Track the suitcase as it changes hands; all other objects stay black and white. Stable object identity, clean edge tracking, no random patches of color.","拥挤的黑白火车站台，只有一只黄色小手提箱保留原本的颜色。跟拍这只手提箱在人与人之间转手；其他所有物体保持黑白。物体身份稳定、边缘跟踪干净、没有随机的色块。"],"hp":["Two-color law on [Subject], a pair of hues doing all the drawing, print as cinematography. Name the two hues.","对[主体]施以双色法则，一对色相承担全部造型，像印刷一样的摄影。说清是哪两种色相。"],"fq":0,"m":[0,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/still/two-color/hero.jpg",0],"st":0,"r":[["Palette","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/palette","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/palette.webp","Too many colors would be noise."],["Monochrome","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/color/monochrome","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/monochrome-073-selective-color-in-monochrome-mini.webp","Strip to drawing."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"双色调"},"ultraviolet":{"t":"Ultraviolet","c":"viral-looks","g":null,"u":"https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/ultraviolet","d":["Ultraviolet, the ultraviolet lighting look, is black-light cinema: a UV lamp as author, whites that scream, colors that only exist under that tube. The unseen made loud: a purple LUT on daylight is not a black light.","紫外线（ultraviolet lighting look，紫外光照明）就是黑光灯电影：紫外灯才是作者，白得刺眼，只在那种灯管下才存在的颜色。把看不见的东西放大：在日光素材上套紫色 LUT 不等于黑光灯。"],"pi":["Name the black light, then the blazing whites. Ultraviolet light on [Subject], black-light cinema, whites that scream, colors that only exist under that lamp. Add UV source, teeth and cotton radioactive, surroundings void, no daylight purple wash, no sign letters.","先说清黑光灯，再说刺眼的白。对[主体]施以紫外线光，黑光灯电影，白得刺眼，只在那种灯下才存在的颜色。加上紫外光源、牙齿和棉布亮到带放射性、周围环境一片空无，不要日光的紫色滤镜、不要招牌字母。"],"cp":["Ultraviolet light on [Subject], black-light cinema, whites that scream, colors that only exist under that lamp.","对[主体]施以紫外线光，黑光灯电影，白得刺眼，只在那种灯下才存在的颜色。"],"hp":["Ultraviolet light on [Subject], black-light cinema, whites that scream, colors that only exist under that lamp.","对[主体]施以紫外线光，黑光灯电影，白得刺眼，只在那种灯下才存在的颜色。"],"fq":0,"m":[1,"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/mini/ultraviolet-mini.mp4","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/ultraviolet-ultraviolet-mini.webp"],"st":"https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/strips/ultraviolet.jpg","r":[["Glam","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/glam","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/glam.webp","Sell the face."],["Neon Practicals","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/lighting/neon-practical","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/neon-practical.webp","The city is the lighting department."],["Agamemnon","https://melies.co/cinematic-techniques/viral-looks/agamemnon","https://asset.melies.co/cinematic-techniques/thumb/agamemnon.webp","Make them ancient and doomed."]],"z":"紫外光风"}};
